:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">It is also respectfully prayed that&nbsp; the respondent be&nbsp; directed to pay an amount of Rs.&nbsp; 500000 &nbsp;&nbsp;(Rupees five lakh) as compensation&nbsp; to the applicants on account of deficiency in\r\nservice and for violation of the provisions of the PAPRA and the RERA Act &nbsp;due to which the applicants have suffered huge\r\nmental shock&nbsp; tension&nbsp; stress agony and harassment.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right:-13.95pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">It is also respectfully prayed that the respondent\r\nbe directed to pay an amount of Rs. 50000 &nbsp;to the applicants towards&nbsp; litigation expenses incurred by them.<o:p></o:p></span></p>',3120000.00,2996489.00,'2012-12-30 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2010-07-30 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','924 Ground Floor','','',2,0,0,0,'amitgupta123','2018-07-31 12:59:01.000','amitgupta123','2018-07-31 12:59:01.000'),(18,1004,'1004',1003,'2e48d207-9453-4c35-b23a-b91dfb241ff9','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','my name demo','anumusic5@gmail.com',1212121212,0,0,'wawdq','',28,507,'121121','1','wawdq','',28,507,'121121','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-ASR02-PR0239','asdas','asdas','',0,0,'adfasdf','',28,507,'121212','1','adfasdf','',28,507,'121212','1','<span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">It\r\nis therefore requested to get an inspection done and then an enquiry be\r\nconducted and the registration be cancelled and other suitabl