<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">The Real\r\nEstate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 was passed by the Rajya Sabha on\r\n10 March 2016 and by the Lok Sabha on 15 March 2016. Subsequently, the Act came\r\ninto force from 1 May 2016. Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016\r\nprovides for the establishment of the Real Estate Regulatory Authority (RERA)\r\nfor regulation and promotion of real estate sector and to ensure sale of plots,\r\napartments or buildings, as the case may be, in an efficient and transparent\r\nmanner and to protect the interest of consumers in real estate sector and\r\nestablish the Real Estate Appellate Tribunal to hear appeals from the decisions,\r\ndirections or orders of the Authority and the adjudicating officer.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">The Central\r\nand State Governments were liable to notify the Rules under the Act within a\r\nstatutory period of six months i.e. by 30th October, 2016. This Act will ensure\r\ngreater accountability towards consumers, and significantly reduce frauds,\r\narrest delays and the current high transaction costs. Under this Act, it is\r\nstipulated that all Regulatory Authorities would have their dedicated portals\r\nas well. This Act makes it mandatory for all residential and commercial real\r\nestate projects to register with the Real Estate Regulatory Authority for\r\nlaunching a project, in order to provide greater transparency in\r\nproject-marketing and execution. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Every State/UT\r\nis supposed to formulate their own set of rules in accordance with the\r\nprovisions of the centrally notified Act. Respective RERAs and their portals\r\nare also the responsibility of respective State/UTs. Hence, as a first step\r\ntowards successful implementation, State of Assam came out with rules on 6<sup>th</sup>\r\nMay, 2017 and accordingly now intends to establish a dedicated PMU for this\r\nproject. To enable it, Ministry proposes to engage a professional consulting\r\nfirm as Program Management Consultants to monitor &amp; manage the progress and\r\nimplementation of RERA. The services of PMU shall be procured through NICSI\r\nfrom among the agencies empanelled with them.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">The Real\r\nEstate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 was passed by the Rajya Sabha on\r\n10 March 2016 and by the Lok Sabha on 15 March 2016. Subsequently, the Act came\r\ninto force from 1 May 2016. Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016\r\nprovides for the establishment of the Real Estate Regulatory Authority (RERA)\r\nfor regulation and promotion of real estate sector and to ensure sale of plots,\r\napartments or buildings, as the case may be, in an efficient and transparent\r\nmanner and to protect the interest of consumers in real estate sector and\r\nestablish the Real Estate Appellate Tribunal to hear appeals from the decisions,\r\ndirections or orders of the Authority and the adjudicating officer.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">The Central\r\nand State Governments were liable to notify the Rules under the Act within a\r\nstatutory period of six months i.e. by 30th October, 2016. This Act will ensure\r\ngreater accountability towards consumers, and significantly reduce frauds,\r\narrest delays and the current high transaction costs. Under this Act, it is\r\nstipulated that all Regulatory Authorities would have their dedicated portals\r\nas well. This Act makes it mandatory for all residential and commercial real\r\nestate projects to register with the Real Estate Regulatory Authority for\r\nlaunching a project, in order to provide greater transparency in\r\nproject-marketing and execution. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Every State/UT\r\nis supposed to formulate their own set of rules in accordance with the\r\nprovisions of the centrally notified Act. Respective RERAs and their portals\r\nare also the responsibility of respective State/UTs. Hence, as a first step\r\ntowards successful implementation, State of Assam came out with rules on 6<sup>th</sup>\r\nMay, 2017 and accordingly now intends to establish a dedicated PMU for this\r\nproject. To enable it, Ministry proposes to engage a professional consulting\r\nfirm as Program Management Consultants to monitor &amp; manage the progress and\r\nimplementation of RERA. The services of PMU shall be procured through NICSI\r\nfrom among the agencies empanelled with them.<o:p></o:p></span></p>',121212.00,121212.00,'2018-08-03 00:00:00.000','2018-08-09 00:00:00.000','','1','','2018-08-03 00:00:00','2018-08-05 00:00:00','house no 324','','',1,0,0,0,'demo3','2018-08-07 11:47:14.000','demo3','2018-08-07 11:47:14.000'),(29,1010,'1010',1021,'77c5894b-cc37-45eb-acb4-cdc273b1fd89','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-08-07 12:11:01.000','surinder mittal','bigdaychd@gmail.com',9915141555,9915141555,0,'house no 724','sector 7, panchkula',13,15,'134109','1','house no 724','sector 7, panchkula',13,15,'134109','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0119','EMAAR INDIA','EMAAR  INDIA','feedback@emaarmgf.com',1723314800,1723314800,'UNIT NO 40','Central Plaza, Sector 105, Mohali',28,507,'160062','1','UNIT NO 40','Central Plaza, Sector 105, Mohali',28,507,'160062','1','<p>The Unit was Sold in 2006 and the lst date for handing over of possession was May 2011 but no possession has been offered till date. please intervene as you are the governing body.</p>','<p>1. principal refund along with interest of 15%</p><p>2. compensation at rs 5/ sq ft per month for the period of delay</p><p>3. compensation for mental harassment</p>',5352000.00,2850000.00,'2011-05-20 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2006-08-16 00:00:00','2008-08-08 00:00:00','TVM-L1-F12-1203\r\nTHE VIEWS','','',1,1,0,0,'surindermittal','2018-08-07 12:02:59.000','surindermittal','2018-08-07 12:02:59.000'),(30,1011,'1011',1038,'22fcbe23-e0a4-4755-9ab6-4ad928d16843','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Tarun Arora','imemyself.arora@gmail.com',8557011367,0,0,'H n 17 Street No 1','OLD BISHAN NAGAR',28,454,'147001','1','H n 102 Guru Nanak Enclave st no 7','End of Street No 7 Guru Nanak Nagar',28,454,'141401','Tarun Arora','',0,0,'Promoter','PBEERA-PTL63-PM0068','puda','Tarun Arora','',0,0,'shree ganesh complex G T Road','Bank Of India',28,454,'147001','1','shree ganesh complex G T Road','Bank Of India',28,454,'147001','0','<p>dsbdsbb</p>','<p>vsdbgsbdb</p>',5578560.00,5578560.00,'2018-06-06 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2016-12-06 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','shree ganesh complex G T Road\r\nBank Of India','','',2,0,0,0,'Sbala60','2018-08-12 22:06:10.000','Sbala60','2018-08-12 22:06:10.000'),(31,1011,'1011',1038,'22fcbe23-e0a4-4755-9ab6-4ad928d16843','FormTypeN',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Tarun Arora','imemyself.arora@gmail.com',8557011367,0,0,'H n 17 Street No 1','OLD BISHAN NAGAR',28,454,'147001','0','H n 102 Guru Nanak Enclave','End of Street No 7 Guru Nanak Nagar',28,454,'147001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBEERA-PTL63-PM0068','PUDA,Patiala','Ms.Anuprita Johal (Estate Officer)','',0,0,'PUDA Complex Urban Estate Phase 2','',28,454,'147001','1','PUDA Complex Urban Estate Phase 2','',28,454,'147001','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Respected Sir,</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">I\r\nam allottee of Plot no.113 at PUDA Enclave -2&nbsp;&nbsp;Rajpura colony\r\n,Patiala (Punjab) <b>&nbsp;RERA&nbsp;&nbsp;Regn No:\r\nPBRERA-PTL63-PM0068&nbsp;</b>.PUDA Patiala had issued allotment letter of plot no.113 bearing Memo No.:P.U.D.A.-\r\nE.O./2016/14582 dated 06.12.2016 vide their Memo No. /PDA/2017/1520 dated\r\n01.03.2017&nbsp;The&nbsp;&nbsp;10 % of the total cost of the\r\nplot i.e. Rs.550000/- was paid as vide My application No.\r\n130 dated 15.10.2016&nbsp;<b>(Attached)</b>&nbsp;,15 % of the price of the\r\nplot i.e.9,74,560/- dated 27.12.2016<b>(Attached)</b>&nbsp;,remaining&nbsp;&nbsp;75% payment i.e. Rs.40,54,500/- was made&nbsp; &nbsp;vide DD No.\r\n28068 to 28071 dated 06.06.2017 (Copy of DDs totaling Rs.40,54,000/- dated\r\n06.06.2017 No dues certificate&nbsp;&nbsp;in this regard dated 20.12.2017 (A<b>ttached\r\n</b>).<b>Henceforth, total full price of plot&nbsp;&nbsp;Rs.5578560/- was\r\npaid by me on 06.06.2017&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</b></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">As\r\nper detailed Brochure and allotment letter dated 16.12.2016, the possession of\r\nplot was to be given by 18 months from the date of allotment letter i.e.\r\n16.06.2018 or completion of Development activities as per sanctioned plan\r\nwhichever is earlier.&nbsp;<i><u><span style=\"background:yellow\">The possesion\r\nof the plot&nbsp; was delayed and not given by cut date i.e. 30.06.2018</span></u></i></span></b><i><u><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: yellow;\">.</span></u></i><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Meanwhile,PUDA\r\npublished a public notice dated 31.07.2018&nbsp;&nbsp;in regional newspapers (E\r\n6 Attached) for allottees of PUDA Enclave -2 Rajpura Colony to take possession\r\nof the plot (E5 Attached) within 30 days from the date\r\nof&nbsp;&nbsp;publication of the notice i.e. by 30.08.2018 without completion\r\nof the site/project as per sanctioned plan.</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">On\r\nphysically verifying the site I found that the project is loaded with\r\nencumbrances i..e. Illegal establishments /Jhuggis of Slum Dwellers adjacent\r\nadjacent to my plot .Presence of such Illegal structures /Establishments was never\r\npublished in the advertisements or brochure published by PUDA</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">. (Photographs of Slum\r\nDweelers and their establishment attached<b>&nbsp;E7 Attached)</b></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><b><i><u><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">This is a very grave situation as the slum dwellers\r\nhouse a number of criminals and thieves which poses a serious threat to my\r\nsafety and that of costly construction materials at my plot. Moreover the road\r\nthat leads to my plot is filled with faecal matters, dirt, garbage of the slum\r\ndwellers causing stink that could cause health related ailments.</span></u></i></b><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><b><i><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: rgb(247, 247, 247);\">&nbsp;<u>It also raises a question mark on integrity\r\nof developer (PUDA) since presence of such illegal structures was never\r\nrevealed (probably deliberately) anywhere in the layout plan published in\r\nscheme brochure or advertisements.</u></span></i></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><b><i><u><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Under current circumstances, it is not feasible for me\r\nto take possession of the plot and start construction work at site since there\r\nis no safety /security owing to threat posed by the slum dwellers with such an\r\nunhygienic environment that can cause serious health ailments due to presence\r\nof unbearable stink of faecal matters/garbage(Site Images of the plot No.113\r\nadjoining Jhuggis of Slum Dwellers E7 attached).</span></u></i></b><b><i><u><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: rgb(247, 247, 247);\">The said plot no. 113 allotted to\r\nme by PUDA is not habitable.</span></u></i></b></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: rgb(247, 247, 247);\">&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Henceforth I seek relief under:-</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><b><i><u><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">(i)Sub\r\nsection18 (1) of Section 1 of Real Estate (Regulation and Development Act) 2016\r\nand&nbsp;Section 18(1) 19(4)19(7) and 84(2)(i)(j) (k) of Punjab State Real\r\nEstate (Regulation and Development) Rules, 2017.&nbsp;to withdraw my allotment\r\nunder this project and seek full refund of the money already paid as full cost\r\nof the plot i.e. Rs.5578560/- along with interest at 12 % p.a. (The same\r\ninterest which PUDA charges from allottees) from 06.06.2017 (dates of full\r\npayment) on this amount&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></u></i></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><b><i><u><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">(ii)Rule\r\n15 of&nbsp;Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Rules,\r\n2017&nbsp;I also request to provide me with compensation on account of delay in possession and - on\r\naccount of Mental agony suffered by me.</span></u></i></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>',5578560.00,5578560.00,'2018-06-06 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2016-12-06 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Plot No 113 PUDA Enclave 2 Rajpura Colony Patiala','','',2,0,0,0,'Sbala60','2018-08-12 22:20:39.000','Sbala60','2018-08-12 22:20:39.000'),(32,1011,'1011',1038,'22fcbe23-e0a4-4755-9ab6-4ad928d16843','FormTypeN',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Tarun Arora','imemyself.arora@gmail.com',8557011367,0,0,'H n 17 Street No 1','OLD BISHAN NAGAR',28,454,'147001','0','H n 102 Guru Nanak Enclave','End of Street No 7 Guru Nanak Nagar',28,454,'147001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBEERA-PTL63-PM0068','PUDA,Patiala','Ms.Anuprita Johal (Estate Officer)','',0,0,'PUDA Complex Urban Estate Phase 2','',28,454,'147001','1','PUDA Complex Urban Estate Phase 2','',28,454,'147001','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Respected Sir,</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">I\r\nam allottee of Plot no.113 at PUDA Enclave -2&nbsp;&nbsp;Rajpura colony\r\n,Patiala (Punjab) <b>&nbsp;RERA&nbsp;&nbsp;Regn No:\r\nPBRERA-PTL63-PM0068&nbsp;</b>.PUDA Patiala had issued allotment letter of plot no.113 bearing Memo No.:P.U.D.A.-\r\nE.O./2016/14582 dated 06.12.2016 vide their Memo No. /PDA/2017/1520 dated\r\n01.03.2017 .The&nbsp;&nbsp;10 % of the total cost of the\r\nplot i.e. Rs.550000/- was paid as vide My application No.\r\n130 from PNB account dated 15.10.2016&nbsp;<b>(Attached)</b>&nbsp;,15 % of the price of the\r\nplot i.e.9,74,560/- dated 27.12.2016<b>(Attached)</b>&nbsp;,remaining&nbsp;&nbsp;75% payment i.e. Rs.40,54,500/- was made&nbsp; &nbsp;vide DD No.\r\n28068 to 28071 dated 06.06.2017 ( No dues certificate&nbsp;&nbsp;in this regard dated 20.12.2017 (A<b>ttached\r\n</b>).<b>Henceforth, total full price of plot&nbsp;&nbsp;Rs.5578560/- was\r\npaid by me on 06.06.2017&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</b></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">As\r\nper detailed Brochure the possesion was to given by 15 months from date of allotment i.e. by 06.03.2018 and as per allotment letter dated 06.12.2016&nbsp; that possession of\r\nplot was to be given by 18 months from the date of allotment letter i.e.\r\n16.06.2018 or completion of Development activities as per sanctioned plan\r\nwhichever is earlier.&nbsp;<i><u><span style=\"background:yellow\">The possesion\r\nof the plot&nbsp; was delayed and not given by any cut off date i.e.06 .03.2018</span></u></i></span></b><i><u><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: yellow;\">.(As per Brochure ) or by 06.06.2018(As per Allotment letter)</span></u></i></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Meanwhile,PUDA\r\npublished a public notice dated 31.07.2018&nbsp;&nbsp;in regional newspapers&nbsp; ( Attached) for allottees of PUDA Enclave -2 Rajpura Colony&nbsp; and sent me letter offering possesion dated 03.08.2018 asking me to take possession even when the project site has not been developed as per sanctioned plan .</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">On\r\nphysically verifying the site I found that the project is loaded with\r\nencumbrances i..e. Illegal establishments /Jhuggis of Slum Dwellers adjacent\r\nadjacent to my plot .Presence of such Illegal structures /Establishments was never\r\npublished in the advertisements or brochure published by PUDA</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">. (Photographs of Slum\r\nDweelers and their establishment attached<b>&nbsp;Attached)</b></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><b><i><u><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">This is a very grave situation as the slum dwellers\r\nhouse a number of criminals and thieves which poses a serious threat to my\r\nsafety and that of costly construction materials at my plot. Moreover the road\r\nthat leads to my plot is filled with faecal matters, dirt, garbage of the slum\r\ndwellers causing stink that could cause health related ailments.</span></u></i></b><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><b><i><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: rgb(247, 247, 247);\">&nbsp;<u>It also raises a question mark on integrity\r\nof developer (PUDA) since presence of such illegal structures was never\r\nrevealed (probably deliberately) anywhere in the layout plan published in\r\nscheme brochure or advertisements.</u></span></i></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><b><i><u><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Under current circumstances, it is not feasible for me\r\nto take possession of the plot and start construction work at site since there\r\nis no safety /security owing to threat posed by the slum dwellers with such an\r\nunhygienic environment that can cause serious health ailments due to presence\r\nof unbearable stink of faecal matters/garbage(Site Images of the plot No.113\r\nadjoining Jhuggis of Slum Dwellers E7 attached).</span></u></i></b><b><i><u><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: rgb(247, 247, 247);\">The said plot no. 113 allotted to\r\nme by PUDA is not habitable.</span></u></i></b></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: rgb(247, 247, 247);\">&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Henceforth I seek relief under:-</span></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><b><i><u><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">(i)Sub\r\nsection18 (1) of Section 1 of Real Estate (Regulation and Development Act) 2016\r\nand&nbsp;Section 18(1) 19(4)19(7) and 84(2)(i)(j) (k) of Punjab State Real\r\nEstate (Regulation and Development) Rules, 2017.&nbsp;to withdraw my allotment\r\nunder this project and seek full refund of the money already paid as full cost\r\nof the plot i.e. Rs.5578560/- along with interest at 12 % p.a. (The same\r\ninterest which PUDA charges from allottees) from 06.06.2017 (dates of full\r\npayment) on this amount&nbsp; &nbsp;as developer PUDA misled and cheated me by not revealing presence of such slums /Jhuggis anywhere in Advertisements/Brochures and not completing the site as per sanctioned plan</span></u></i></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><b><i><u><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">(ii)Rule\r\n15 of&nbsp;Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Rules,\r\n2017&nbsp;I also request to provide me with compensation on account of delay in possession and - on\r\naccount of Mental agony suffered by me.</span></u></i></b><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>',5578560.00,5578560.00,'2018-06-06 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2016-12-06 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Plot No 113 PUDA Enclave 2 Rajpura Colony Patiala','','',1,0,0,0,'Sbala60','2018-08-13 00:35:26.000','Sbala60','2018-08-13 00:35:26.000'),(33,1012,'1012',1038,'22fcbe23-e0a4-4755-9ab6-4ad928d16843','FormTypeN',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Tarun Arora','imemyself.arora@gmail.com',8557011367,0,0,'H n 17 Street No 1','OLD BISHAN NAGAR',28,454,'147001','0','H n 102 Guru Nanak Enclave','End of Street no 7 Guru Nanak Nagar',28,454,'147001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-PTL63-PM0068','PUDA,Patiala','Smt.Anuprita Johal(Estate Officer)','',0,0,'PUDA Complex,Phase 2 Main Road,Urban Estate Ph 2','',28,454,'147001','1','PUDA Complex,Phase 2 Main Road,Urban Estate Ph 2','',28,454,'147001','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">I am allottee\r\nof Plot no.113 at PUDA Enclave -2 Rajpura colony ,Patiala (Punjab)registered <b>under RERA&nbsp;\r\nRegn No: PBRERA-PTL63-PM0068 </b>.PUDA,Patiala had issued allotment\r\nletter of plot no.113 bearing Memo No.:P.U.D.A.- E.O./2016/14582 dated\r\n06.12.2016 vide their Memo No. /PDA/2017/1520 dated 01.03.2017 (Attached) The 10\r\n% of the total cost of the plot i.e. Rs.550000/- was paid vide My application\r\nNo. 130 dated 15.10.2016 (Attached) .15 % of the price of the plot\r\ni.e.9,74,560/- paid dated 27.12.2016 (Attached) ,remaining 75% payment of the\r\nsaid plot i.e. Rs.40,54,500/- was made &nbsp;by me vide DD No. 28068 to 28071 dated\r\n06.06.2017 (Copy of DDs totaling Rs.40,54,000/- dated 06.06.2017 No dues\r\ncertificate &nbsp;in this regard dated\r\n20.12.2017 <b>attached </b>).<b>Henceforth, total full price of plot&nbsp; Rs.5578560/- was paid by me on 06.06.2017 &nbsp;&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">As per\r\ndetailed Brochure possession was to be given by 15 Months from allotment date\r\ni.e. 06.03.2018 and as per allotment letter dated 16.12.2016, the possession of\r\nplot was to be given by 18 months from the date of allotment letter i.e. 06.06.2018\r\nor completion of Development activities as per sanctioned plan whichever is\r\nearlier. <b><i><u><span style=\"background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">The possesion\r\nof the plot was delayed and not given by cutoff date either by 06.03.2018.(As\r\nper Brochure) or by 06.06.2018(As per Allotment Letter)</span><o:p></o:p></u></i></b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Meanwhile,PUDA published a public notice dated 31.07.2018 &nbsp;in regional newspapers &nbsp;(Attached) for allottees of PUDA Enclave -2\r\nRajpura Colony and sent Offer letter &nbsp;to\r\ntake possession of the plot ( Attached) within 30 days from the date of&nbsp; publication of the notice i.e. by 30.08.2018\r\nwithout completion of the site/project as per sanctioned plan</span></i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">On physically verifying the site I found that the project\r\nis loaded with encumbrances i.e. Illegal establishments /Jhuggis of Slum\r\nDwellers adjacent to my plot .Presence of such Illegal structures\r\n/Establishments was never published in the advertisements or brochure published\r\nby PUDA. (Photographs of Slum Dwellers and their establishments attached)<o:p></o:p></span></i></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><i><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nbackground:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">This is a very grave situation as the\r\nslum dwellers house a number of criminals and thieves which poses a serious\r\nthreat to my safety and that of costly construction materials at my plot.\r\nMoreover the road that leads to my plot is filled with faecal matters, dirt,\r\ngarbage of the slum dwellers causing stink that could cause health related\r\nailments.</span></u></i></b><b><i><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></u></i></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><i><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nbackground:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">Under current circumstances, it is not\r\nfeasible for me to take possession of the plot and start construction work at\r\nsite since there is no safety /security owing to threat posed by the slum\r\ndwellers with such an unhygienic environment that can cause serious health\r\nailments due to presence of unbearable stink of faecal matters/garbage</span></u></i></b></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:130%\"><b><i><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:130%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nbackground:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">The said plot no. 113 allotted being offered withdelayed possession without completion of development works as\r\nper sanctioned Layout&nbsp;</span></u></i></b><b><i><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:130%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;background:yellow;mso-highlight:\r\nyellow\">loaded with encumbrances i.e. Illegal establishments /Jhuggis of Slum Dwellers\r\nadjacent to my plot</span></u></i></b><b><i><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:130%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nbackground:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow\"> and not revealed (probably deliberately)\r\nby PUDA at any stage ether in layout plan of the brochure or in advertisement\r\nis not habitable.</span></u></i></b><b><i><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:130%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">\r\n<o:p></o:p></span></u></i></b></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">(i)Sub section18 (1) of Section 1 of Real Estate\r\n(Regulation and Development Act) 2016 and&nbsp;Section 18(1) 19(4)19(7) and\r\n84(2)(i)(j) (k) of Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Rules,\r\n2017.&nbsp;<b>to withdraw my allotment under this project and seek full refund\r\nof the money already paid as full cost of the plot i.e. Rs.5578560/- along with\r\ninterest at 12 % p.a. (The same interest which PUDA charges from allottees)\r\nfrom 06.06.2017 (dates of full payment) on this amount</b> &nbsp;as Developer\r\nPUDA has cheated me by not disclosing presence of such jhuggis anywhere in the\r\nbrochure or advertisement adjacent to my plot making the site not fit and safe\r\nfor habitation</span></i><i><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></i></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;</span></i><i><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></i></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><i><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;</span></i><i><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></i></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">(ii)Rule 15 of&nbsp;Punjab State Real Estate\r\n(Regulation and Development) Rules, 2017&nbsp;<b>I also request to provide me\r\nwith compensation on account of delay in possession and on account of Mental\r\nagony suffered by me</b>.</span></i><i><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></i></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify\"><br></p>',5578560.00,5578560.00,'2018-06-06 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2016-12-06 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Plot No 113 ,PUDA Enclave 2 ,Rajura Colony,Patiala','','',2,0,0,0,'Sbala60','2018-08-13 11:14:58.000','Sbala60','2018-08-13 11:14:58.000'),(34,1012,'1012',1038,'22fcbe23-e0a4-4755-9ab6-4ad928d16843','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-08-23 08:50:12.000','Tarun Arora','imemyself.arora@gmail.com',8557011367,0,0,'H n 17 Street No 1','OLD BISHAN NAGAR',28,454,'147001','0','H n 102 Guru Nanak Enclave','End of Street no 7 Guru Nanak Nagar',28,454,'147001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-PTL63-PM0068','PUDA,Patiala','Smt.Anuprita Johal(Estate Officer)','',0,0,'PUDA Complex,Phase 2 Main Road,Urban Estate Ph 2','',28,454,'147001','1','PUDA Complex,Phase 2 Main Road,Urban Estate Ph 2','',28,454,'147001','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">I am allottee\r\nof Plot no.113 at PUDA Enclave -2 Rajpura colony ,Patiala (Punjab)registered <b>under RERA&nbsp;\r\nRegn No: PBRERA-PTL63-PM0068 </b>.PUDA,Patiala had issued allotment\r\nletter of plot no.113 bearing Memo No.:P.U.D.A.- E.O./2016/14582 dated\r\n06.12.2016 vide their Memo No. /PDA/2017/1520 dated 01.03.2017 (Attached) The 10\r\n% of the total cost of the plot i.e. Rs.550000/- was paid vide My application\r\nNo. 130 dated 15.10.2016 (Attached) .15 % of the price of the plot\r\ni.e.9,74,560/- paid dated 27.12.2016 (Attached) ,remaining 75% payment of the\r\nsaid plot i.e. Rs.40,54,500/- was made &nbsp;by me vide DD No. 28068 to 28071 dated\r\n06.06.2017 (Copy of DDs totaling Rs.40,54,000/- dated 06.06.2017 No dues\r\ncertificate &nbsp;in this regard dated\r\n20.12.2017 <b>attached </b>).<b>Henceforth, total full price of plot&nbsp; Rs.5578560/- was paid by me on 06.06.2017 &nbsp;&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">As per\r\ndetailed Brochure possession was to be given by 15 Months from allotment date\r\ni.e. 06.03.2018 and as per allotment letter dated 16.12.2016, the possession of\r\nplot was to be given by 18 months from the date of allotment letter i.e. 06.06.2018\r\nor completion of Development activities as per sanctioned plan whichever is\r\nearlier. <b><i><u><span style=\"background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">The possesion\r\nof the plot was delayed and not given by cutoff date either by 06.03.2018.(As\r\nper Brochure) or by 06.06.2018(As per Allotment Letter)</span><o:p></o:p></u></i></b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Meanwhile,PUDA published a public notice dated 31.07.2018 &nbsp;in regional newspapers &nbsp;(Attached) for allottees of PUDA Enclave -2\r\nRajpura Colony and sent Offer letter &nbsp;to\r\ntake possession of the plot ( Attached) within 30 days from the date of&nbsp; publication of the notice i.e. by 30.08.2018\r\nwithout completion of the site/project as per sanctioned plan</span></i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">On physically verifying the site I found that the project\r\nis loaded with encumbrances i.e. Illegal establishments /Jhuggis of Slum\r\nDwellers adjacent to my plot .Presence of such Illegal structures\r\n/Establishments was never published in the advertisements or brochure published\r\nby PUDA. (Photographs of Slum Dwellers and their establishments attached)<o:p></o:p></span></i></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><i><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nbackground:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">This is a very grave situation as the\r\nslum dwellers house a number of criminals and thieves which poses a serious\r\nthreat to my safety and that of costly construction materials at my plot.\r\nMoreover the road that leads to my plot is filled with faecal matters, dirt,\r\ngarbage of the slum dwellers causing stink that could cause health related\r\nailments.</span></u></i></b><b><i><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></u></i></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><i><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nbackground:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">Under current circumstances, it is not\r\nfeasible for me to take possession of the plot and start construction work at\r\nsite since there is no safety /security owing to threat posed by the slum\r\ndwellers with such an unhygienic environment that can cause serious health\r\nailments due to presence of unbearable stink of faecal matters/garbage</span></u></i></b></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:130%\"><b><i><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:130%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nbackground:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">The said plot no. 113 allotted being offered withdelayed possession without completion of development works as\r\nper sanctioned Layout&nbsp;</span></u></i></b><b><i><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:130%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;background:yellow;mso-highlight:\r\nyellow\">loaded with encumbrances i.e. Illegal establishments /Jhuggis of Slum Dwellers\r\nadjacent to my plot</span></u></i></b><b><i><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:130%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nbackground:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow\"> and not revealed (probably deliberately)\r\nby PUDA at any stage ether in layout plan of the brochure or in advertisement\r\nis not habitable.</span></u></i></b><b><i><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:130%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">\r\n<o:p></o:p></span></u></i></b></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">(i)Sub section18 (1) of Section 1 of Real Estate\r\n(Regulation and Development Act) 2016 and&nbsp;Section 18(1) 19(4)19(7) and\r\n84(2)(i)(j) (k) of Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Rules,\r\n2017.&nbsp;<b>to withdraw my allotment under this project and seek full refund\r\nof the money already paid as full cost of the plot i.e. Rs.5578560/- along with\r\ninterest at 12 % p.a. (The same interest which PUDA charges from allottees)\r\nfrom 06.06.2017 (dates of full payment) on this amount</b> &nbsp;as Developer\r\nPUDA has cheated me by not disclosing presence of such jhuggis anywhere in the\r\nbrochure or advertisement adjacent to my plot making the site not fit and safe\r\nfor habitation</span></i><i><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></i></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;</span></i><i><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></i></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><i><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;</span></i><i><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></i></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:13.65pt\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">(ii)Rule 15 of&nbsp;Punjab State Real Estate\r\n(Regulation and Development) Rules, 2017&nbsp;<b>I also request to provide me\r\nwith compensation on account of delay in possession and on account of Mental\r\nagony suffered by me</b>.</span></i><i><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></i></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify\"><br></p>',5578560.00,5578560.00,'2018-06-06 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2016-12-06 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Plot No 113 ,PUDA Enclave 2 ,Rajura Colony,Patiala','','',1,1,0,0,'Sbala60','2018-08-13 12:51:40.000','Sbala60','2018-08-13 12:51:40.000'),(35,1013,'1013',1041,'096eee2a-089a-4edc-b9bc-175467695b4a','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','RAZNEE DEWAN','varinderkamboj@yahoo.com',9814028866,0,0,'2027 GURU NANAK VIHAR','SECTOR 48 C',6,128,'160047','1','2027 GURU NANAK VIHAR','SECTOR 48 C',6,128,'160047','RAJESH DEWAN','',9814028866,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0004','FALCON VIEW APARTMENTS','JANTA LAND PROMOTERS PVT. LTD.','',0,0,'SCO 39-42,SECTOR 82','SAS NAGAR MOHALI',28,507,'140306','1','SCO 39-42,SECTOR 82','SAS NAGAR MOHALI',28,507,'140306','1','<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b>Briefly the facts are&nbsp; submitted\r\nbelow:<o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">1)I intended to buy “Construction\r\nLinked Plan” Apartment D-502 in the Project Falcon View, Sector 66 A Mohali.The\r\nTotal Cost of Apartment(3007 sq. feet) was <b>1,12,50725</b>(excluding service tax).I had paid the Booking Amount <b>Rs 27,51,175(including Service Tax)&nbsp; dated Dec. 8,2012.</b>It was agreed that the\r\ninstallments would be made in consonance with the progress of the Apartment in\r\nthe Project.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">2)I received Allotment Letter\r\non <b>Mar 8,2013</b>.As per clause 2.24 of <b>the allotment letter(Mar 8,2013),</b>the\r\npossession of Apartment was to be given within 30 months from the date of issue\r\nof Allotment letter meaning&nbsp; the\r\npossession was to be delivered upto <b>Sep\r\n7,2015.The conditions imposed in the &nbsp;Allotment\r\nLetter were unilateral and favourable to the Builder/JLPL. <o:p></o:p></b></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">3)Till Sep. 7,2015 ie\r\npossession date ,<b>I had paid the\r\nTotal&nbsp; Amount 80,13,769(including tax,Paid\r\nupto Aug 20,2015)</b> and <b>till Feb\r\n26,2018</b> ,Total Amount paid is <b>RS\r\n1,08,14,248</b>&nbsp; . I have attached the\r\ndetails&nbsp; with Dates Payment Amount was\r\npaid.<o:p></o:p></p>','<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b>&nbsp;I &nbsp;<span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;prays for the following compensation(s)&nbsp;</span>-</b></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">1)<b>Interest on all &nbsp;Payments made by\r\nme &nbsp;as prescribed by the Punjab RERA Act &nbsp;&nbsp;from the date of receipt of 1<sup>st</sup>\r\nPayment(Dec 8,2012) .</b>I&nbsp;&nbsp; would also&nbsp;\r\nlike&nbsp; to mention that JLPL started\r\npaying Rs 27,063 per month(almost) as <b>unilaterly\r\nimposed </b>&nbsp;in the agreement(Rs 10 per\r\nsquare feet) from Oct.-Nov. 2015 for the delayed period.</p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b>&nbsp;I pray to the &nbsp;Honourable Judge &nbsp;to&nbsp;\r\ncompensate me as per the Punjab RERA act,the rate of interest under\r\nrules is 10.1% .<o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b>&nbsp;Similar compensation has been\r\nawarded&nbsp; in the previous Judgements.</b><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b>2)A compensation of RS 10,00000(10 Lakh) for harassment,mental and\r\nphysical agony and inconvenience.<o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">3)<b>Waiving of GST applicable</b> on the outstanding amount as GST being\r\npaid on account of late possession.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">4)<b>No further Payment be demanded until possession is given</b>.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">5)<b>A correct date of possession of the Apartment&nbsp; be provided and if possession not handed over\r\nby that date,then Additional Compensation amount&nbsp; be decided</b>. Whenever we ask JLPL about\r\npossession,most of the time they donot respond,If they respond they provide\r\npossession date Jul(if asked&nbsp; in the\r\nbeginning of Year) and If asked in the middle of Year then date of possession\r\nis given Dec ie end of year.This is happening since almost last 3&nbsp; Years. All my money is hard earned Money,I\r\nhave suffered lot of mental&nbsp; and physical\r\nagony as I have invested my whole Savings in the Apartment.<o:p></o:p></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>',11250725.00,10814248.00,'2015-09-07 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2013-03-08 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','D-502,FALCON VIEW SECTOR 66A MOHALI','','',2,0,0,0,'VARINDER7','2018-08-14 20:10:13.000','VARINDER7','2018-08-14 20:10:13.000'),(36,1013,'1013',1041,'096eee2a-089a-4edc-b9bc-175467695b4a','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','RAZNEE DEWAN','varinderkamboj@yahoo.com',9814028866,0,0,'2027 GURU NANAK VIHAR','SECTOR 48 C',6,128,'160047','1','2027 GURU NANAK VIHAR','SECTOR 48 C',6,128,'160047','RAJESH DEWAN','',9814028866,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0004','FALCON VIEW APARTMENTS','JANTA LAND PROMOTERS PVT. LTD.','',0,0,'SCO 39-42,SECTOR 82','SAS NAGAR MOHALI',28,507,'140306','1','SCO 39-42,SECTOR 82','SAS NAGAR MOHALI',28,507,'140306','1','<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b>Briefly the facts are&nbsp; submitted\r\nbelow:<o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">1)I intended to buy “Construction\r\nLinked Plan” Apartment D-502 in the Project Falcon View, Sector 66 A Mohali.The\r\nTotal Cost of Apartment(3007 sq. feet) was <b>1,12,50725</b>(excluding service tax).I had paid the Booking Amount <b>Rs 27,51,175(including Service Tax)&nbsp; dated Dec. 8,2012.</b>It was agreed that the\r\ninstallments would be made in consonance with the progress of the Apartment in\r\nthe Project.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">2)I received Allotment Letter\r\non <b>Mar 8,2013</b>.As per clause 2.24 of <b>the allotment letter(Mar 8,2013),</b>the\r\npossession of Apartment was to be given within 30 months from the date of issue\r\nof Allotment letter meaning&nbsp; the\r\npossession was to be delivered upto <b>Sep\r\n7,2015.The conditions imposed in the &nbsp;Allotment\r\nLetter were unilateral and favourable to the Builder/JLPL. <o:p></o:p></b></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">3)Till Sep. 7,2015 ie\r\npossession date ,<b>I had paid the\r\nTotal&nbsp; Amount 80,13,769(including tax,Paid\r\nupto Aug 20,2015)</b> and <b>till Feb\r\n26,2018</b> ,Total Amount paid is <b>RS\r\n1,08,14,248</b>&nbsp; . I have attached the\r\ndetails&nbsp; with Dates Payment Amount was\r\npaid.<o:p></o:p></p>','<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b>&nbsp;I &nbsp;<span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;prays for the following compensation(s)&nbsp;</span>-</b></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">1)<b>Interest on all &nbsp;Payments made by\r\nme &nbsp;as prescribed by the Punjab RERA Act &nbsp;&nbsp;from the date of receipt of 1<sup>st</sup>\r\nPayment(Dec 8,2012) .</b>I&nbsp;&nbsp; would also&nbsp;\r\nlike&nbsp; to mention that JLPL started\r\npaying Rs 27,063 per month(almost) as <b>unilaterly\r\nimposed </b>&nbsp;in the agreement(Rs 10 per\r\nsquare feet) from Oct.-Nov. 2015 for the delayed period.</p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b>&nbsp;I pray to the &nbsp;Honourable Judge &nbsp;to&nbsp;\r\ncompensate me as per the Punjab RERA act,the rate of interest under\r\nrules is 10.1% .<o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b>&nbsp;Similar compensation has been\r\nawarded&nbsp; in the previous Judgements.</b><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b>2)A compensation of RS 10,00000(10 Lakh) for harassment,mental and\r\nphysical agony and inconvenience.<o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">3)<b>Waiving of GST applicable</b> on the outstanding amount as GST being\r\npaid on account of late possession.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">4)<b>No further Payment be demanded until possession is given</b>.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">5)<b>A correct date of possession of the Apartment&nbsp; be provided and if possession not handed over\r\nby that date,then Additional Compensation amount&nbsp; be decided</b>. Whenever we ask JLPL about\r\npossession,most of the time they donot respond,If they respond they provide\r\npossession date Jul(if asked&nbsp; in the\r\nbeginning of Year) and If asked in the middle of Year then date of possession\r\nis given Dec ie end of year.This is happening since almost last 3&nbsp; Years. All my money is hard earned Money,I\r\nhave suffered lot of mental&nbsp; and physical\r\nagony as I have invested my whole Savings in the Apartment.<o:p></o:p></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>',11250725.00,10814248.00,'2015-09-07 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2013-03-08 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','D-502,FALCON VIEW SECTOR 66A MOHALI','','',1,0,0,0,'VARINDER7','2018-08-14 20:20:05.000','VARINDER7','2018-08-14 20:20:05.000'),(37,1014,'1014',1041,'096eee2a-089a-4edc-b9bc-175467695b4a','FormType