6,2018</span></b><span style=\"background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow\"> ,Total Amount paid is <b>RS 1,08,14,248</b></span>&nbsp; . I have attached the details&nbsp; with Dates Payment Amount was paid.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>','<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b>I &nbsp;<span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;prays for the\r\nfollowing compensation(s)&nbsp;</span>-<o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">1)<b><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Interest on all &nbsp;Payments made by\r\nme &nbsp;as prescribed by the Punjab RERA Act &nbsp;from the date of receipt of 1<sup>st</sup>\r\nPayment(Dec 8,2012) .</span><o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">I&nbsp;&nbsp; would also&nbsp;\r\nlike&nbsp; to mention that JLPL started\r\npaying Rs 27,063 per month(almost) as <b>unilaterly\r\nimposed </b>&nbsp;in the agreement(Rs 10 per\r\nsquare feet) from Oct.-Nov. 2015 for the delayed period. <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;I pray to the &nbsp;Honourable Judge &nbsp;to&nbsp;\r\ncompensate me as per the Punjab RERA act,the rate of interest under\r\nrules is 10.1% .</span><o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b>&nbsp;Similar compensation has been\r\nawarded&nbsp; in the previous Judgements.</b><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b>2)<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">A compensation of RS 10,00000(10 Lakh) for harassment,mental and\r\nphysical agony and inconvenience.</span><o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">3)<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\"><b>Waiving of GST applicable</b> on the outstanding amount as GST being\r\npaid on account of late possession.</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">4)<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\"><b>No further Payment be demanded until possession is given</b>.</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">5)<b>A correct date of possession of the Apartment&nbsp; be provided and if possession not handed over\r\nby that date,then Additional Compensation amount&nbsp; be decided</b>. Whenever we ask JLPL about\r\npossession,most of the time they donot respond,If they respond they provide\r\npossession date Jul(if asked&nbsp; in the\r\nbeginning of Year) and If asked in the middle of Year then date of possession\r\nis given Dec ie end of year.This is happening since last almost &nbsp;3&nbsp;\r\nYears. <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">All my money is hard earned Money,I have suffered lot of\r\nmental&nbsp; and physical agony as I have\r\ninvested my whole Savings in the Apartment.</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>',11250725.00,10814248.00,'2015-09-07 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2013-03-08 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','D-502','','',1,0,0,0,'VARINDER7','2018-08-14 23:21:34.000','VARINDER7','2018-08-14 23:21:34.000'),(38,1015,'1015',1041,'096eee2a-089a-4edc-b9bc-175467695b4a','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','RAZNEE DEWAN'