)</span></b> and <b><span style=\"background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">till Feb 26,2018</span></b><span style=\"background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow\"> ,Total Amount paid is <b>RS 1,08,14,248</b></span>&nbsp; . I have attached the details&nbsp; with Dates Payment Amount was paid.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>','<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><o:p>&nbsp;I</o:p><b>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;prays for the\r\nfollowing compensation(s)&nbsp;</span>-</b></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">1<span style=\"background:yellow;\r\nmso-highlight:yellow\">)<b>Interest on all &nbsp;Payments made by me &nbsp;as prescribed by the Punjab RERA Act &nbsp;from the date of receipt of 1<sup>st</sup>\r\nPayment(Dec 8,2012) .</b></span><b><o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">I&nbsp;&nbsp; would also&nbsp;\r\nlike&nbsp; to mention that JLPL started\r\npaying Rs 27,063 per month(almost) as <b>unilaterly\r\nimposed </b>&nbsp;in the agreement(Rs 10 per\r\nsquare feet) from Oct.-Nov. 2015 for the delayed period. <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b>&nbsp;I pray to the &nbsp;Honourable Judge &nbsp;to&nbsp;\r\ncompensate me as per the Punjab RERA act,the rate of interest under\r\nrules is 10.1% .<o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b>&nbsp;Similar compensation has been\r\nawarded&nbsp; in the previous Judgements.</b><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b>2)<span style=\"background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">A compensation\r\nof RS 10,00000(10 Lakh) for harassment,mental and physical agony and\r\ninconvenience.</span><o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">3)<b><span style=\"background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">Waiving of GST\r\napplicable</span></b> on the outstanding amount as GST being paid on account of\r\nlate possession.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">4)<b><span style=\"background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">No further Payment\r\nbe demanded until possession is given</span></b><span style=\"background:yellow;\r\nmso-highlight:yellow\">.</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">5)<b>A correct date of possession of the Apartment&nbsp; be provided and if possession not handed over\r\nby that date,then Additional Compensation amount&nbsp; be decided</b>. Whenever we ask JLPL about\r\npossession,most of the time they donot respond,If they respond they provide\r\npossession date Jul(if asked&nbsp; in the\r\nbeginning of Year) and If asked in the middle of Year then date of possession\r\nis given Dec ie end of year.This is happening since last almost &nbsp;3&nbsp;\r\nYears. <span style=\"background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">All my money\r\nis hard earned Money,I have suffered lot of mental &nbsp;and physical agony as I have invested my whole\r\nSavings in the Apartment.</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>',11250725.00,10814248.00,'2015-09-07 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2013-03-08 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','D-502,FALCON VIEW APARTMENTS,\r\nSECTOR 66 A,MOHALI','','',1,0,0,0,'VARINDER7','2018-08-15 02:08:22.000','VARINDER7','2018-08-15 02:08:22.000'),(40,1017,'1017',1052,'431fa145-0d87-4135-8675-676d71d47e05','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Shefali  Joshi','csvedparkash@gmail.com',7680044078,0,0,'House No 337, First Floor, Sector 8, Panchkula','',13,15,'134109','1','House No 337, First Floor, Sector 8, Panchkula','',13,15,'134109','Ved Parkash','csvedparkash@gmail.com',7837223098,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-JAL34-PR0372','Shourya Greens','M/s Shourya Towers Private Limited','varun.sharma2021@gmail.com',7065300094,0,'Adjoining Surya Enclave, H.B. No. 307/2, Near Trinity College,','Amritsar Bypass Road, Jalandhar',28,261,'144001','0','Regd. Office 78B, Sector D-2, Group II,','DDA Flat, Kondli Gharoli, Mayur Vihar, Phase III, Delhi 96',10,120,'110096','1','<p><br></p>','<p><br></p>',2151875.00,2151875.00,'2012-03-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2006-04-03 00:00:00','2006-04-03 00:00:00','E 1-101 Shourya Greens','','',1,0,0,0,'shefalijoshi','2018-08-16 13:28:08.000','shefalijoshi','2018-08-16 13:28:08.000'),(41,1018,'1018',1052,'431fa145-0d87-4135-8675-676d71d47e05','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-08-16 14:24:38.000','Shefali  Joshi','csvedparkash@gmail.com',7680044078,0,533766521359,'House No 337, First Floor, Sector 8, Panchkula','',13,15,'134109','1','House No 337, First Floor, Sector 8, Panchkula','',13,15,'134109','Ved Parkash','csvedparkash@gmail.com',7837223098,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-JAL34-PR0372','Shourya Greens','M/s Shourya Towers Private Limited','varun.sharma2021@gmail.com',7065300094,0,'Adjoining Surya Enclave, H.B. No. 307/2, Near Trinity College,','Amritsar Bypass Road, Jalandhar',28,261,'144001','0','Regd. Office 78B, Sector D-2, Group II,','DDA Flat, Kondli Gharoli, Mayur Vihar, Phase III, Delhi 96',10,120,'110096','1','<p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.25pt;margin-left:&#10;0cm\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; color: black; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 9pt;\">The\r\nrespondent being promoters and developers are engaged in construction and sales\r\nof residential units/flats. One such project is Shourya Greens which is an\r\nongoing project and is registered with the authority as per regn number above.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.25pt;margin-left:&#10;0cm;box-sizing: border-box;orphans: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;&#10;word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; color: black; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 9pt;\">Initially,\r\nShri Devinder Singh s/o Sh. Tika Ram &amp; Mr. Ashok Joshi booking the\r\napartment nno E-101 in the aforesaid project of the respondent. A provisional\r\nallotment letter dated 03.04.2006 was issued to the allottees at a total&nbsp;\r\nconsideration of Rs. 21,91, 000/-(Annexure I).</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.25pt;margin-left:&#10;0cm;box-sizing: border-box;orphans: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;&#10;word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; color: black; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 9pt;\">Later\r\non, the apartment was changed in the name of&nbsp; Saumya Joshi d/o Mr. Ashok\r\nJoshi in place of Devinder Singh and Mr. Ashok Joshi remained co-allottee on\r\n20.11.2007.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.25pt;margin-left:&#10;0cm;box-sizing: border-box;orphans: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;&#10;word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; color: black; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 9pt;\">Therefore,\r\nthe said apartment was changed in the name of Shefali Joshi D/o Ashok Joshi in\r\nplace of Saumya Joshi and Ashok Joshi on the basis of application dated\r\n10.06.2013. (Annexure II).</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.25pt;margin-left:&#10;0cm;box-sizing: border-box;orphans: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;&#10;word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; color: black; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 9pt;\">The\r\nrespondent issued a letter dated 22.07.2011 confirmation the possession date as\r\nMarch 12 and also incorporated a clause that in case of delay in handing over\r\nthe possession the respondent would pay penaly @ Rs. 5/- sq.ft per month.\r\n(Annexure III).</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.25pt;margin-left:&#10;0cm;box-sizing: border-box;orphans: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;&#10;word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; color: black; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 9pt;\">The\r\nrespondent did not enter into a separate agreement to sell. Both the allotment\r\nletter and subsequent letter as per annexure III constitute agreement to sell.\r\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.25pt;margin-left:&#10;0cm;box-sizing: border-box;orphans: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;&#10;word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; color: black; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 9pt;\">The\r\nrespondent has issued a statement of account confirmation receipt of various\r\npayments from the allottee/s. (Annexure IV).</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.25pt;margin-left:&#10;0cm;box-sizing: border-box;orphans: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;&#10;word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; color: black; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 9pt;\">The\r\nrespondent has also issued a No Dues Certificate dated 2.08.2013 confirming\r\nreceipt of all payments towards consideration of the allotted unit by the\r\nallottee. (Annexure V).</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.25pt;margin-left:&#10;0cm;box-sizing: border-box;orphans: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;&#10;word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; color: black; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 9pt;\">Despite\r\nrepeated reminders and visits to the project site, the respondent has not been\r\nable to offer the exact date of handing over of the possession till date.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.25pt;margin-left:&#10;0cm;box-sizing: border-box;orphans: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;&#10;word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; color: black; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 9pt;\">The\r\nrespondent has now taken a plea that revised timelines submitted with RERA,\r\nPunjab is 10.10.2022 and therefore the allottee is not entitled for early\r\npossession.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.25pt;margin-left:&#10;0cm;box-sizing: border-box;orphans: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;&#10;word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; color: black; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 9pt;\">In\r\nview of the above, it is submitted that the complainant has lost faith in the\r\nsaid project and promoter and has decided to withdraw from the project.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n<b></b><i></i><u></u><sub></sub><sup></sup><strike></strike><font size=\"3\"></font><font face=\"Times New Roman\"></font><br></p>','<p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.25pt;margin-left:&#10;0cm\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; color: black; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 9pt;\">In view of\r\nthe above,</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.25pt;margin-left:&#10;0cm;box-sizing: border-box;orphans: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;&#10;word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; color: black; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 9pt;\">it\r\nis submitted that the respondent has violated the provisions of Section 18 of\r\nthe Act and prays for</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.25pt;margin-left:&#10;0cm;box-sizing: border-box;orphans: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;&#10;word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; color: black; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 9pt;\">Refund\r\nof the amount of 21,28,896/-, along with interest as per RERA&nbsp; Provisions\r\nfrom the respective dates of payments made to the respondent.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.25pt;margin-left:&#10;0cm;box-sizing: border-box;orphans: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;&#10;word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; color: black; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 9pt;\">It\r\nis further prayed that the complainant may be compensated by the respondent for\r\nan amount of Rs. 2,00,000/- on account of mental and economic sufferings to the\r\ncomplainant on account of delay in handing over of the possession.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.25pt;margin-left:&#10;0cm;box-sizing: border-box;orphans: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;&#10;word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; color: black; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 9pt;\">Thanking\r\nYou,</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.25pt;margin-left:&#10;0cm;box-sizing: border-box;orphans: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;&#10;word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; color: black; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 9pt;\">Shefali\r\nJoshi</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.25pt;margin-left:&#10;0cm;box-sizing: border-box;orphans: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;&#10;word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; color: black; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 9pt;\">Complainant</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.25pt;margin-left:&#10;0cm;box-sizing: border-box;orphans: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;&#10;word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; color: black; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 9pt;\">Through</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.25pt;margin-left:&#10;0cm;box-sizing: border-box;orphans: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;&#10;word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; color: black; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 9pt;\">Ved\r\nParkash</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.25pt;margin-left:&#10;0cm;box-sizing: border-box;orphans: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;&#10;word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; color: black; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 9pt;\">CS\r\nin Practice</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.25pt;margin-left:&#10;0cm;box-sizing: border-box;orphans: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;&#10;word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; color: black; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 9pt;\">Authorized\r\nRepresentative</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13.33px;\"><font face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">&nbsp;</font></p><p>\r\n\r\n<b></b><i></i><u></u><sub></sub><sup></sup><strike></strike><font face=\"Calibri\"></font><font size=\"3\"></font><font face=\"Times New Roman\"></font><br></p>',2151875.00,2151875.00,'2012-03-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2006-04-03 00:00:00','2006-04-03 00:00:00','E1-101 Shourya Greens','','',1,1,0,0,'shefalijoshi','2018-08-16 14:06:43.000','shefalijoshi','2018-08-16 14:06:43.000'),(42,1019,'1019',1041,'096eee2a-089a-4edc-b9bc-175467695b4a','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','RAZNEE DEWAN','varinderkamboj@yahoo.com',9814028866,0,0,'2027 GURU NANAK VIHAR','SECTOR 48 C',6,128,'160047','1','2027 GURU NANAK VIHAR','SECTOR 48 C',6,128,'160047','RAJESH DEWAN','varinderkamboj@yahoo.com',9814028866,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0004','FALCON VIEW APARTMENTS,SECTOR 66A ,MOHALI','JANTA LAND PROMOTERS PVT. LTD.','janta@jantahousing.com',0,0,'SCO 39-42','SECTOR 82',28,507,'140306','1','SCO 39-42','SECTOR 82',28,507,'140306','1','<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b>Briefly the facts are&nbsp; submitted\r\nbelow:<o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">1)<span style=\"background:\r\nyellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">I intended to buy “Construction Linked Plan” Apartment\r\nD-502 in the Project Falcon View, Sector 66 A Mohali.</span>The Total Cost of\r\nApartment(3007 sq. feet) was <b>1,12,50725</b>(excluding service tax).I had paid the Booking Amount <b>Rs 27,51,175(including Service Tax)&nbsp; dated Dec. 8,2012.</b>It was agreed that the\r\ninstallments would be made in consonance with the progress of the Apartment in\r\nthe Project.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">2)I received <span style=\"background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">Allotment Letter on <b>Mar 8,2013</b></span>.As per clause 2.24 of\r\n<b><span style=\"background:yellow;\r\nmso-highlight:yellow\">the allotment letter(Mar 8,2013),</span></b>the\r\npossession of Apartment was to be given within 30 months from the date of issue\r\nof Allotment letter meaning&nbsp; <span style=\"background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">the possession</span> was to be\r\ndelivered upto <b><span style=\"background:\r\nyellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">Sep 7,2015(Date Of Possession).The conditions\r\nimposed in the &nbsp;Allotment Letter were\r\nunilateral and favourable to the Builder/JLPL.</span> <o:p></o:p></b></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">3<span style=\"background:yellow;\r\nmso-highlight:yellow\">)Till Sep. 7,2015 ie possession date</span> ,<b><span style=\"background:yellow;mso-highlight:\r\nyellow\">I had paid the Total&nbsp; Amount\r\n80,13,769(including tax,Paid upto Aug 20,2015)</span></b> and <b><span style=\"background:yellow;mso-highlight:\r\nyellow\">till Feb 26,2018</span></b><span style=\"background:yellow;mso-highlight:\r\nyellow\"> ,Total Amount paid is <b>RS\r\n1,08,14,248</b></span> . I have attached the details&nbsp; with Dates Payment Amount was paid.<o:p></o:p></p>','<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p><b>I &nbsp;<span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;pray for the following\r\ncompensation(s)&nbsp;</span>-</b></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">1<span style=\"background:yellow;\r\nmso-highlight:yellow\">)<b>Interest on all &nbsp;Payments made by me &nbsp;as prescribed by the Punjab RERA Act </b></span><b>&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">from\r\nthe Date of Receipt of 1<sup>st</sup> Payment.</span><o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">I&nbsp;&nbsp; would also&nbsp;\r\nlike&nbsp; to mention that JLPL started\r\npaying Rs 27,063 per month(almost) as <b>unilaterly\r\nimposed </b>&nbsp;in the agreement(Rs 10 per\r\nsquare feet) from Oct.-Nov. 2015 for the delayed period. <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b>&nbsp;I pray to the &nbsp;Honourable Judge &nbsp;to&nbsp;\r\ncompensate me as per the Punjab RERA act,<span style=\"background:yellow;\r\nmso-highlight:yellow\">the rate of interest under rules is 10.1% .</span><o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b>&nbsp;Similar compensation has been\r\nawarded&nbsp; in the previous Judgements.</b><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b>2)<span style=\"background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">A compensation\r\nof RS 10,00000(10 Lakh) for harassment,mental and physical agony and\r\ninconvenience.</span><o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">3)<b><span style=\"background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">Waiving of GST\r\napplicable</span></b> on the outstanding amount as GST being paid on account of\r\nlate possession.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">4)<b><span style=\"background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">No further Payment\r\nbe demanded until possession is given</span></b><span style=\"background:yellow;\r\nmso-highlight:yellow\">.</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">5)<b>A correct date of possession of the Apartment&nbsp; be provided and if possession not handed over\r\nby that date,then Additional Compensation amount&nbsp; be decided</b>. Whenever we ask JLPL about\r\npossession,most of the time they donot respond,If they respond they provide\r\npossession date Jul(if asked&nbsp; in the\r\nbeginning of Year) and If asked in the middle of Year then date of possession\r\nis given Dec ie end of year.This is happening since last almost &nbsp;3&nbsp;\r\nYears. <span style=\"background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">All my money\r\nis hard earned Money,I have suffered lot of mental &nbsp;and physical agony as I have invested my whole\r\nSavings in the Apartment.</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>',11250725.00,10814248.00,'2015-09-07 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2013-03-08 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','D-502,Building No D,Falcon View Apartments,Sector 66 A ,Mohali','','',1,0,0,0,'VARINDER7','2018-08-16 20:27:40.000','VARINDER7','2018-08-16 20:27:40.000'),(43,1020,'1020',1041,'096eee2a-089a-4edc-b9bc-175467695b4a','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-08-17 19:32:36.000','RAZNEE DEWAN','varinderkamboj@yahoo.com',9814028866,0,0,'2027 GURU NANAK VIHAR','SECTOR 48 C',6,128,'160047','1','2027 GURU NANAK VIHAR','SECTOR 48 C',6,128,'160047','RAJESH DEWAN','varinderkamboj@yahoo.com',9814028866,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0004','FALCON VIEW APARTMENTS','JANTA LAND PROMOTERS PVT. LTD.','janta@jantahousing.com',0,0,'SCO 39-42','SECTOR 82',28,507,'140306','1','SCO 39-42','SECTOR 82',28,507,'140306','1','<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b>Briefly the facts are&nbsp; submitted\r\nbelow:<o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">1)<span style=\"background:\r\nyellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">I intended to buy “Construction Linked Plan” Apartment\r\nD-502 in the Project Falcon View, Sector 66 A Mohali.</span>The Total Cost of\r\nApartment(3007 sq. feet) <span style=\"background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">was\r\n</span><b><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nArial;background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">1,12,50725</span></b><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">(excluding\r\nservice tax).</span>I had paid the Booking Amount <b><span style=\"background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">Rs 27,51,175(including\r\nService Tax)&nbsp; dated Dec. 8,2012.</span></b><span style=\"background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">It</span> was agreed that the\r\ninstallments would be made in consonance with the progress of the Apartment in\r\nthe Project.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">2)I received <span style=\"background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">Allotment Letter on <b>Mar 8,2013</b></span>.As per clause 2.24 of\r\n<b><span style=\"background:yellow;\r\nmso-highlight:yellow\">the allotment letter(Mar 8,2013),</span></b>the\r\npossession of Apartment was to be given within 30 months from the date of issue\r\nof Allotment letter meaning&nbsp; <span style=\"background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">the possession</span> was to be\r\ndelivered upto <b><span style=\"background:\r\nyellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">Sep 7,2015(Date Of Possession).The conditions\r\nimposed in the &nbsp;Allotment Letter were\r\nunilateral and favourable to the Builder/JLPL.</span> <o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">3<span style=\"background:yellow;\r\nmso-highlight:yellow\">)Till Sep. 7,2015 ie possession date</span> ,<b><span style=\"background:yellow;mso-highlight:\r\nyellow\">I had paid the Total&nbsp; Amount\r\n80,13,676(including tax,Paid upto Aug 20,2015)</span></b> and <b><span style=\"background:yellow;mso-highlight:\r\nyellow\">till Feb 26,2018</span></b><span style=\"background:yellow;mso-highlight:\r\nyellow\"> ,Total Amount paid is <b>RS\r\n1,08,14,247</b></span> . I have attached the details&nbsp; with Dates Payment Amount was paid.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>','<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p><b>I &nbsp;<span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;pray for the following\r\ncompensation(s)&nbsp;</span>-</b></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">1<span style=\"background:yellow;\r\nmso-highlight:yellow\">)<b>Interest on all &nbsp;Payments made by me &nbsp;as prescribed by the Punjab RERA Act &nbsp;from the Date of Receipt of 1<sup>st</sup>\r\nPayment.</b></span><b><o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">I&nbsp;&nbsp; would also&nbsp;\r\nlike&nbsp; to mention that JLPL started\r\npaying Rs 27,063 per month(almost) as <b>unilaterly\r\nimposed </b>&nbsp;in the agreement(Rs 10 per\r\nsquare feet) from Oct.-Nov. 2015 for the delayed period. <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b>&nbsp;I pray to the &nbsp;Honourable Judge &nbsp;to&nbsp;\r\ncompensate me as per the Punjab RERA act,<span style=\"background:yellow;\r\nmso-highlight:yellow\">the rate of interest under rules is 10.1% .</span><o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b>&nbsp;Similar compensation has been\r\nawarded&nbsp; in the previous Judgements.</b><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b>2)<span style=\"background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">A compensation\r\nof RS 10,00000(10 Lakh) for harassment,mental and physical agony and\r\ninconvenience.</span><o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">3)<b><span style=\"background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">Waiving of GST\r\napplicable</span></b> on the outstanding amount as GST being paid on account of\r\nlate possession.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">4)<b><span style=\"background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">No further Payment\r\nbe demanded until possession is given</span></b><span style=\"background:yellow;\r\nmso-highlight:yellow\">.</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\">5)<b>A correct date of possession of the Apartment&nbsp; be provided and if possession not handed over\r\nby that date,then Additional Compensation amount&nbsp; be decided</b>. Whenever we ask JLPL about\r\npossession,most of the time they donot respond,If they respond they provide\r\npossession date Jul(if asked&nbsp; in the\r\nbeginning of Year) and If asked in the middle of Year then date of possession\r\nis given Dec ie end of year.This is happening since last almost &nbsp;3&nbsp;\r\nYears. <span style=\"background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">All my money\r\nis hard earned Money,I have suffered lot of mental &nbsp;and physical agony as I have invested my whole\r\nSavings in the Apartment.</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>',11250725.00,10814247.00,'2015-09-07 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2013-03-08 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','D-502,FALCON VIEW APARTMENTS,SECTOR 66 A MOHALI','','',1,1,0,0,'VARINDER7','2018-08-16 21:05:11.000','VARINDER7','2018-08-16 21:05:11.000'),(44,1021,'1021',1061,'feb522a9-b591-42ad-b827-d1fac41495ae','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-08-22 14:22:17.000','SUDESH KUMAR  DHAWAN','vikas3dhawan@gmail.com',9785325611,0,0,'#3B-51, JAWAHAR NAGAR','',29,213,'335001','1','#3B-51, JAWAHAR NAGAR','',29,213,'335001','NEERAJ PURI','CSPURIDHILLON@GMAIL.COM',9888938266,1724185266,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PC0001','ROYAL BUSINESS PARK','MOTIA DEVELOPERS PRIVATE LIMITED','INFO@MOTIAGROUP.COM',8558844525,0,'Royal Citi ','Chandigarh-Ambala Highway ',28,507,'140603','1','Royal Citi ','Chandigarh-Ambala Highway ',28,507,'140603','1','<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-align:justify\">The\r\nApplicant&nbsp; has Applied for office space\r\nat commercial project name “Royal Business Park” situated at Chandigarh- Ambala\r\nHighway, Zirakpur (PB) which is managed by Motia Developers Private Limited. </p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:54.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><b>A.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></b><!--[endif]--><b>THAT </b>the Applicant has deposited a\r\nconsideration of Rs 5,00,000/- as Booking Fee on 20/10/2014. Furthermore the\r\napplicant has paid another advance amount of Rs 14,00,000/- on different dates\r\nbefore receiving the allotment letter. </p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:54.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><b>B.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></b><!--[endif]--><b>THAT</b> the applicant received the\r\nallotment letter on 04/11/2014&nbsp; for the\r\noffice No 6 at Ground Floor measuring (approx) 620.454 sq.ft. ( super area)\r\nwith Basic sale Price Rs 4963632/- on the same day the Buyer agreement was\r\nexecuted between Buyer and M/s Motia Developers Private Limited.</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:54.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><b>C.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></b><!--[endif]--><b>&nbsp;THAT\r\n</b>the applicant has paid the further amount of Rs 3,50,000/-, Rs 4,00,000/-,\r\nand Rs 5,00,000/- on 05/11/2014, 07/11/2014 and 11/14/2014 respectively.</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:54.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><b>D.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></b><!--[endif]--><b>THAT </b>the total amount paid&nbsp; by&nbsp;\r\nApplicant i.e, Rs 35,00,000,&nbsp; is\r\napprox&nbsp; 70%&nbsp; of the total purchase price and this amount\r\nhas been paid with in Two months from the allotment letter.</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:54.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><b>E.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></b><!--[endif]--><b>THAT </b>&nbsp;the applicant was willing to pay the rest of\r\nthe money but due to discontinue of construction work of “Royal Business Park\r\n“around one and half year the applicant&nbsp;\r\nhas stopped&nbsp; paying&nbsp; the&nbsp;\r\nremaining balance amount. The completion&nbsp;\r\nof the shop was due in November 2017 as per the terms of Buyer agreement\r\nbut the project is still not completed.</p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left:54.0pt;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><b>F.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></b><!--[endif]--><b>THAT </b>&nbsp;M/s&nbsp;\r\nMotia Developers Private Limited now demanded as interest at the rate\r\n24% P.A&nbsp; on delayed payment i.e. 1641518.</p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">In the above mentioned facts and\r\ncircumstances it is most respectfully prayed that the Adjudicating Officer may\r\nbe pleased to:</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin-left:54.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->A.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><!--[endif]-->As per section 13(1) of The Real Estate (\r\nRegulation and Development) Act, 2016 the Promoter shall not accept a sum more\r\nthan ten per cent of the cost of the apartment, plot and building as the case\r\nmay be,as an advance payment of an application fee, from a person without first\r\nentering into a written agreement of&nbsp;\r\nsale&nbsp; with such person and\r\nregister the said agreement for sale, under any law for the time being in force</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:54.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->B.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><!--[endif]-->In this matter according to the fact of the case\r\nthe M/s&nbsp; Motia Developers Private Limited\r\nwas not entered into agreement of sale with applicant in spite of getting 70%\r\nof cost of shop&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; after enforcement of\r\nthis act i.e 1<sup>st</sup> May 2017. Therefore M/s Motia Developers Private\r\nLimited violate the&nbsp; provision of section\r\n13(1) of The Real Estate ( Regulation and Development) Act, 2016.</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:54.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->C.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><!--[endif]-->In section 13(2) of Real Estate ( Regulation and\r\nDevelopment) Act, 2016 empowered the allotees&nbsp;\r\nnot to construed the right and interest as per the RERA act due to\r\nexecution of any application letter, allotment letter of any other document\r\nsigned by the allotees, in respect of the apartment, plot or building, prior to\r\nthe execution and registration of agreement for sale.</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:54.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->D.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><!--[endif]-->In above matter M/s Motia Developers Private\r\nLimited demanding interest&nbsp; at the rate\r\n24% of balance amount i.e.&nbsp; 1641518 which\r\ncontravenes&nbsp; the section 18(1),\r\n19(4)19(7) and 84(2)(i)(j)(K) the rate of interest payable by the promoter to the\r\nallotee or by the allottee to the promoter, as the case may be, shall be the\r\nState Bank of India highest Marginal Cost of Lending Rate plus two percent. The\r\nexisting highest marginal cost of lending is 8.25 % P.A therefore the demand of\r\ninterest at the rate of 24% is not maintainable due to Enforcement of RERA Act,\r\n2016.</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:54.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->E.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><!--[endif]-->The applicant is entitled to get the interest\r\nfrom the M/s Motia Developers Private Limited&nbsp;\r\nfrom the date of default of not completing the project by December 2017.</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left:54.0pt;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->F.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><!--[endif]-->The applicant is ready to pay the remaining\r\namount to M/s Motia Developers Private Limited without any interest because of\r\nthe default for delay in completion of project i.e. “Royal Business Park”.</p>',4963632.00,3500000.00,'2017-12-18 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2014-04-11 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Shop No 6, Ground Floor, Royal Business Park, Zirakpur (PB)','','',1,1,0,0,'SUDESHKUMARDHAWAN','2018-08-21 13:12:18.000','SUDESHKUMARDHAWAN','2018-08-21 13:12:18.000'),(45,1022,'1022',1063,'5e186167-21be-4e97-98d6-a300c1a9ee84','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-08-30 17:22:48.000','VINOD KHULLAR','vskhullar54@gmail.com',8699212120,0,0,'215, Eldeco Greens','Opposite Khambra Gate, Jalandhar ',28,261,'140026','1','215, Eldeco Greens','Opposite Khambra Gate, Jalandhar ',28,261,'140026','','',0,0,'Allottee','PBRERA-JAL34-PR0023','Eldeco Greens Properties Pvt.Ltd. Jalandhar','Mr. Vijay Luthar','',9888085858,0,'Marketing Office, Eldeco Greens','Opposite Khambra Gate, Jalandhar',28,261,'140026','1','Marketing Office, Eldeco Greens','Opposite Khambra Gate, Jalandhar',28,261,'140026','1','<p>All the wooden floors of the three bedrooms provided at the time of allotment has been broken/damaged and uneven at many places. This has made the surface area unusable and unsafe.&nbsp;</p><p>The floor tiles of the Kitchen are also uneven and thus hurting the feet while working.&nbsp;</p><p>All the walls of the house are facing dampness. The paint has been eroded at many places.</p>','<p>We are not aware about the compensation rules but the total cost of the repairs for the above mentioned facts comes about Rs. 2 Lacs.</p><p><br></p><p>Requested you to please take an earlier action against the same.</p>',9000000.00,9000000.00,'2014-04-16 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2014-04-16 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','215, Eldeco Greens, Opposite Khambra Gate, Jalandhar, Punjab-140026','','',2,0,0,0,'VKKHULLAR','2018-08-21 15:42:19.000','VKKHULLAR','2018-08-21 15:42:19.000'),(46,1023,'1023',1066,'3568b05d-bd51-44d0-b387-09a3505b7441','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-08-24 12:13:26.000','G.v. Star LLP','ramsingh.dil@gmail.com',8699904514,0,0,'House no 726, Sector 2 Panchkula','',13,15,'134102','1','House no 2322 sector 66 mohali','',28,507,'160062','Neeraj Sobti','advocatesobti@yahoo.co.in',9872279500,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0004','Falcon View','Ms. JANTA LAND PROMOTERS LTD','janta@jantahousing.com',8427100082,0,'SCO 39-42, Sector 82','',28,507,'160062','1','SCO 39-42, Sector 82','',28,507,'160062','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.05pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:\r\n9.75pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: Arial;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; The applicant vide their application dated 02.04.2013 applied for an apartment and\r\naccordingly 4 BHK Apartment i.e. No. E-401, 4</span><sup><span style=\"font-size: 6.5pt; font-family: Arial;\">th</span></sup><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">&nbsp;Floor,\r\nwing E, Facing Green, Falcon View, Phase-II, (wrongly mentioned as Phase-I, in\r\nallotment letter dated 02.08.2013, Annexure C-1) Sector 66-A, Mohali, Punjab,\r\nmeasuring 3007 sq. ft., @Rs.3,600/- per sq. ft., was allotted in favor of the\r\napplicant vide Allotment Letter dated 02.08.2013, alongwith details of plot and\r\nthe total sale consideration amount was fixed as Rs.1,08,25,200/-. Copy of\r\nallotment letter is&nbsp;</span><b><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">Annexure C-1.</span></b></span></p><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">\r\n\r\n</span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.05pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">That as\r\nper the demands raised by the respondents, the applicant kept on making payment\r\nto the respondents and the applicant paid the following amount to the\r\nrespondents copies of all the receipts are&nbsp;</span><b><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">Annexure C-2 to C-11</span></b></span></p><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">\r\n\r\n</span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.05pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">That as\r\nper Clause no.2.24 of the allotment letter dated 02.08.2013 (annexure C-1) the\r\npossession of the said apartment complete in all respects shall be delivered to\r\nthe applicant by 01.02.2016, i.e. 30 months from the date of allotment letter\r\ni.e. 02.08.2013.</span></span></p><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">\r\n\r\n</span><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 8.5pt;\">That\r\nin-spite of the receipt of substantial amount against the said apartment the\r\nrespondents have failed to complete the said apartment and further failed to\r\noffer the possession of the said apartment upto 01.02.2016. The applicant in\r\nMay, 2016, approached the respondents and inquired about the dated of the\r\ndelivery of possession but the respondents have failed to give\r\nany&nbsp;satisfactory&nbsp;response and started lingered-on, the matter on one\r\npretext or the other. However the applicant was assured that the possession of\r\nthe said apartment shall be delivered upto July, 2016, positively and\r\nshockingly the possession of the apartment was not offered by the respondents\r\nto the applicant in July, 2016, as promised by the respondents.</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">&nbsp;</span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: -18pt; line-height: 16.1px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 18.4px; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">o<o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 16.1px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 18.4px; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">In&nbsp;&nbsp;view&nbsp;&nbsp;of&nbsp;&nbsp;the&nbsp;&nbsp;facts&nbsp;&nbsp;mentioned&nbsp;&nbsp;in&nbsp;&nbsp;paragraph&nbsp;&nbsp;4&nbsp;&nbsp;above,&nbsp;&nbsp;the&nbsp;&nbsp;applicant prays&nbsp;&nbsp;for&nbsp;&nbsp;the following compensation(s)<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">That as the respondents have failed to comply with the terms and conditions of the allotment letter dated 02.08.2013 (Annexure C-1) and have failed to deliver the possession of the apartment/flat within the stipulated time. Therefore, the applicant as per section 18 of the RERA Act. 2016, is entitled for<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -22.5pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">i)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Refund principal amount of Rs.</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">10,580,830/-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">of the applicant&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">along</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;with interest @ 18% P.a. from the date of actual payment till realization.<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -22.5pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">ii)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Pay compensation of Rs.5,00,000/- to the applicant for mental harassment, mental agony<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -22.5pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">iii)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Any other relief which this Hon’ble authority deems fit may also be passed in favor of the applicant.</span></p>',10825200.00,10580830.00,'2016-02-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2013-08-02 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Flat no E401','','',2,0,0,0,'GVstarLLP','2018-08-23 15:16:36.000','GVstarLLP','2018-08-23 15:16:36.000'),(47,1024,'1024',1069,'7476da42-3c0e-44cb-8722-aa75205c4e12','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-08-26 11:02:54.000','Rajnish Sood','advocate_varunl@hotmail.com',9501120034,0,0,'H. No. 2','Aman City, Kharar',28,507,'140301','1','H. No. 2','Aman City, Kharar',28,507,'140301','Advocate Varun Luthra','advocate_varunl@hotmail.com',9815998858,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PM0021','Bajwa Developers through Managing Director Jarnail Singh Bajwa son of Sh. Bishan Singh','Bajwa Developers through Managing Director Sh. Jarnail Singh Bajwa son of Sh. Bishan Singh','bajwadeveloperltd@gmail.com',0,0,'Bajwa Developers through Sh. Jarnail Singh Bajwa, Sunny Business Center, ','5th Floor, above Gopal Sweets, Sector - 125, Kharar,',28,507,'140301','1','Bajwa Developers, Sunny Business Center, 5th Floor, Gopal Sweets','Sector - 125, Kharar,',28,507,'140301','1','<ol><li>That the respondent floated a scheme to sell&nbsp; 1 BHK and 2 BHK flats in sector - 74 A, 117, Mohali and assured the respondent to give possessions of the said flats within a period of two years. The complainant purchased the unit measure 450 sq. ft. in&nbsp; BR No. (1454) : 1654 , Aparments No. F - 21, Sector - 74&nbsp; A, sector - 117, Mohali, for a consideration amount of Rs. 1250000/- to be paid to the respondent. The complainant paid&nbsp; Rs. 200,000/- on 22.04.2011, Rs. 100,000/- on 03.05.11, Rs. 180,000/- in cash on 10.11.2011. An agreement to sell was reduced to writing on 04.05.2011 which depicted the payment schedule. Thus a total amount of Rs. 480,000/- was paid to the respondent.&nbsp;</li><li>That despite of approaching the respondent for many times to know about the date of possession, the Managing Director himself and his staff had not disclosed the date&nbsp; and they tried to resile from the situation for the reasons best known to them. It is pertinent to mention that dat has been extended for number of times by the respondent and been mentioned the same on the agreement.(Annexed). Now the complainant has come to know that the project land in sector - 74 A, Sector - 117 has been sold by the respondent to some third party and project is not coming up there. In order to avoid any compensation, the respondent has issued a letter to the complainant saying that said flat can not be allotted as the scheme is meant for EWS people as per Punjab government notification. The respondent is making offers to adjust the amount paid by complainant, in some other lucrative schemes that are not acceptable to the complainant and therefore respondent is withholding money without any reason. the respondent is in process to unsurp the hard earned money of the public at large.</li><li>That the Respondent has been served with notice on 13.06.2018 by the counsel of the complainant, but respondent neither replied to it nor made any refunds to the complainant. Hence this complainant</li></ol>','<ol><li>In view of the above said facts, complainant prays that the respondent be directed to refund the deposited amount along with interest @18% p.a from the date of deposit till realization and penalized compensation of Rs. 500,000/- for mental agony and harassment and any other relief which this Hon\'ble Authority deems fit be passed in favour of complainant.</li><li>That since the company has played a fraud and misrepresented the applicant for the plot they have sold on the land which is under litigation and have been withholding the money of the applicant without any reasonable cause nor have informed the applicant the present status of the said plot or litigation. The applicant prays for a compensation of Rs. 500,000/- in addition to the amount prayed for to be refunded with interest @18% p.a. from the date of deposit till realization and compensation of Rs. 500,000/- for mental agony and harassment and any other relief which this Hon\'ble Authority deems fit be passed in favour of the applicant.</li></ol>',1250150.00,480000.00,'2012-11-04 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2011-05-04 00:00:00','2011-05-04 00:00:00','F-21, Sector - 74A, 117, SAS Nagar, Mohali. (Pb.)\r\n','','',2,0,0,0,'SoodrajnishVarunluthra','2018-08-26 10:01:20.000','SoodrajnishVarunluthra','2018-08-26 10:01:20.000'),(48,1025,'1025',1074,'173c8217-5ec2-4b34-b6c8-f76219a18b97','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','gurkirat bajwa','gbajwa9@rediffmail.com',9814031105,1612455111,762822836892,'220 -A','sarabha nagar',28,366,'141001','1','220 -A','sarabha nagar',28,366,'141001','M/S ireo waterfront ltd.','iwp@ireo.in',9810237279,1613040290,'Promoter','PBRERA-LDH45-PR0004','Ireo Waterfront ludhiana','M/S ireo Waterfront Ludhiana','iwp@ireo.in',9810237279,1613040290,'5, Dhanraj Chambers,','satbari',10,557,'110074','1','5, Dhanraj Chambers,','satbari',10,557,'110074','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; margin: 0cm 0cm 10pt 36pt; padding: 10px 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: 22px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">1.        That you had entered into contract dated 27/06/2014 with us (gurkirat singh bajwa &amp; navjot kaur) for the sale of House/Villa No.L-550 of Type-L, having built up area of 1600 Sq. Ft. over the plot measuring 249.96 Sq. Yds. after construction&nbsp; and furnishing as per specifications mentioned in the contract in 24 months.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; margin: 0cm 0cm 10pt 36pt; padding: 10px 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: 22px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">2.        That the total sale consideration of the villa was Rs.1,06,84,207/-. Out of which 25% was to be paid as earnest money and remaining amount was to be paid at the time of delivery of possession. WE&nbsp; have deposited with you Rs.33,56,212/- and Rs.1,23,596/- as club membership charges against receipts.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; margin: 0cm 0cm 10pt 36pt; padding: 10px 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: 22px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">3.        That it was agreed by you in the contract that the construction shall be completed and possession will be given within 24 months from the date of execution of the contract. Therefore, you had promised to complete the construction and furnish the villa within 24 months. It was also agreed by you that after completion of the villa you will serve the completion notice on us within this period. In the contract it was also provided that you could avail six months more to complete the construction as a grace period if the delay was beyond the control of the company. Therefore, the company was bound to complete the construction and deliver possession to us before 27/12/2017 by all means.\r\n</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; margin: 0cm 0cm 10pt 36pt; padding: 10px 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: 22px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">4.        That it was agreed by you in the contract that in case you fail to deliver possession&nbsp; within the period mentioned above the company will pay compensation @ Rs.7.50 per sq. Ft. of built up area. It was also agreed therein that my clients shall be entitled to terminate the contract and get refund in case of failure on your part to perform the contract in specified time.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; margin: 0cm 0cm 10pt 36pt; padding: 10px 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: 22px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">5.        That we already have apprised you many times our necessity for the house/villa and requested you to complete the construction and deliver possession in time as agreed. But you have not completed the construction till date.</span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; margin: 0cm 0cm 10pt 36pt; padding: 10px 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: 22px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 28px;\">You</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">had also agreed to furnish and develop parks and club etc. in the colony and provide all amenities in and for the use of villa within agreed time. </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; margin: 0cm 0cm 10pt 36pt; padding: 10px 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: 22px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Now that we have exhausted all efforts to get the villa completed and to get possession from the company within given time, there is no other option </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; margin: 0cm 0cm 10pt 36pt; padding: 10px 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: 22px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">1)except to terminate the contract and </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; margin: 0cm 0cm 10pt 36pt; padding: 10px 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: 22px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">2)get back the refund with interest.&nbsp; Refund of money paid to you with interest @ 12 PA from the date of payment.</span></p>',10684207.00,3489808.00,'2016-06-26 00:00:00.000','2016-06-26 00:00:00.000','','1','','2014-06-27 00:00:00','2014-06-27 00:00:00','L-550 of Type-L,','','',2,0,0,0,'gurkirasinghbajwanavjotkaurbajwa','2018-08-27 16:48:24.000','gurkirasinghbajwanavjotkaurbajwa','2018-08-27 16:48:24.000'),(49,1023,'1023',1066,'3568b05d-bd51-44d0-b387-09a3505b7441','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-08-24 12:13:26.000','G.v. Star Estsates LLP','ramsingh.dil@gmail.com',8699904514,0,0,'House no 726, Sector 2 Panchkula','',13,15,'134102','1','House no 2322 sector 66 mohali','',28,507,'160062','Neeraj Sobti','advocatesobti@yahoo.co.in',9872279500,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0004','Falcon View','Ms. JANTA LAND PROMOTERS LTD','janta@jantahousing.com',8427100082,0,'SCO 39-42, Sector 82','',28,507,'160062','1','SCO 39-42, Sector 82','',28,507,'160062','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.05pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:\r\n9.75pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: Arial;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; The applicant vide their application dated 02.04.2013 applied for an apartment and\r\naccordingly 4 BHK Apartment i.e. No. E-401, 4</span><sup><span style=\"font-size: 6.5pt; font-family: Arial;\">th</span></sup><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">&nbsp;Floor,\r\nwing E, Facing Green, Falcon View, Phase-II, (wrongly mentioned as Phase-I, in\r\nallotment letter dated 02.08.2013, Annexure C-1) Sector 66-A, Mohali, Punjab,\r\nmeasuring 3007 sq. ft., @Rs.3,600/- per sq. ft., was allotted in favor of the\r\napplicant vide Allotment Letter dated 02.08.2013, alongwith details of plot and\r\nthe total sale consideration amount was fixed as Rs.1,08,25,200/-. Copy of\r\nallotment letter is&nbsp;</span><b><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">Annexure C-1.</span></b></span></p><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">\r\n\r\n</span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.05pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">That as\r\nper the demands raised by the respondents, the applicant kept on making payment\r\nto the respondents and the applicant paid the following amount to the\r\nrespondents copies of all the receipts are&nbsp;</span><b><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">Annexure C-2 to C-11</span></b></span></p><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">\r\n\r\n</span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.05pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">That as\r\nper Clause no.2.24 of the allotment letter dated 02.08.2013 (annexure C-1) the\r\npossession of the said apartment complete in all respects shall be delivered to\r\nthe applicant by 01.02.2016, i.e. 30 months from the date of allotment letter\r\ni.e. 02.08.2013.</span></span></p><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">\r\n\r\n</span><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 8.5pt;\">That\r\nin-spite of the receipt of substantial amount against the said apartment the\r\nrespondents have failed to complete the said apartment and further failed to\r\noffer the possession of the said apartment upto 01.02.2016. The applicant in\r\nMay, 2016, approached the respondents and inquired about the dated of the\r\ndelivery of possession but the respondents have failed to give\r\nany&nbsp;satisfactory&nbsp;response and started lingered-on, the matter on one\r\npretext or the other. However the applicant was assured that the possession of\r\nthe said apartment shall be delivered upto July, 2016, positively and\r\nshockingly the possession of the apartment was not offered by the respondents\r\nto the applicant in July, 2016, as promised by the respondents.</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">&nbsp;</span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: -18pt; line-height: 16.1px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 18.4px; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">o<o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 16.1px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 18.4px; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">In&nbsp;&nbsp;view&nbsp;&nbsp;of&nbsp;&nbsp;the&nbsp;&nbsp;facts&nbsp;&nbsp;mentioned&nbsp;&nbsp;in&nbsp;&nbsp;paragraph&nbsp;&nbsp;4&nbsp;&nbsp;above,&nbsp;&nbsp;the&nbsp;&nbsp;applicant prays&nbsp;&nbsp;for&nbsp;&nbsp;the following compensation(s)<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">That as the respondents have failed to comply with the terms and conditions of the allotment letter dated 02.08.2013 (Annexure C-1) and have failed to deliver the possession of the apartment/flat within the stipulated time. Therefore, the applicant as per section 18 of the RERA Act. 2016, is entitled for<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -22.5pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">i)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Refund principal amount of Rs.</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">10,580,830/-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">of the applicant&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">along</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;with interest @ 18% P.a. from the date of actual payment till realization.<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -22.5pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">ii)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Pay compensation of Rs.5,00,000/- to the applicant for mental harassment, mental agony<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -22.5pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">iii)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Any other relief which this Hon’ble authority deems fit may also be passed in favor of the applicant.</span></p>',10825200.00,10580830.00,'2016-02-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2013-08-02 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Flat no E401','','',2,0,0,0,'GVstarLLP','2018-08-28 09:01:45.000','GVstarLLP','2018-08-28 09:01:45.000'),(50,1023,'1023',1066,'3568b05d-bd51-44d0-b387-09a3505b7441','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-08-24 12:13:26.000','G.v. Star Estsates LLP','ramsingh.dil@gmail.com',8699904514,0,0,'House no 726, Sector 2 Panchkula','',13,15,'134102','1','House no 2322 sector 66 mohali','',28,507,'160062','Neeraj Sobti','advocatesobti@yahoo.co.in',9872279500,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0004','Falcon View, M/s Janta land promoters LTD, Sector 66A mohali','Ms. JANTA LAND PROMOTERS LTD','janta@jantahousing.com',8427100082,0,'SCO 39-42, Sector 82','',28,507,'160062','1','SCO 39-42, Sector 82','',28,507,'160062','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.05pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:\r\n9.75pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: Arial;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; The applicant vide their application dated 02.04.2013 applied for an apartment and\r\naccordingly 4 BHK Apartment i.e. No. E-401, 4</span><sup><span style=\"font-size: 6.5pt; font-family: Arial;\">th</span></sup><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">&nbsp;Floor,\r\nwing E, Facing Green, Falcon View, Phase-II, (wrongly mentioned as Phase-I, in\r\nallotment letter dated 02.08.2013, Annexure C-1) Sector 66-A, Mohali, Punjab,\r\nmeasuring 3007 sq. ft., @Rs.3,600/- per sq. ft., was allotted in favor of the\r\napplicant vide Allotment Letter dated 02.08.2013, alongwith details of plot and\r\nthe total sale consideration amount was fixed as Rs.1,08,25,200/-. Copy of\r\nallotment letter is&nbsp;</span><b><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">Annexure C-1.</span></b></span></p><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">\r\n\r\n</span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.05pt;line-height:normal\"><span s