span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 18.4px; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">o<o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 16.1px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 18.4px; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">In&nbsp;&nbsp;view&nbsp;&nbsp;of&nbsp;&nbsp;the&nbsp;&nbsp;facts&nbsp;&nbsp;mentioned&nbsp;&nbsp;in&nbsp;&nbsp;paragraph&nbsp;&nbsp;4&nbsp;&nbsp;above,&nbsp;&nbsp;the&nbsp;&nbsp;applicant prays&nbsp;&nbsp;for&nbsp;&nbsp;the following compensation(s)<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">That as the respondents have failed to comply with the terms and conditions of the allotment letter dated 02.08.2013 (Annexure C-1) and have failed to deliver the possession of the apartment/flat within the stipulated time. Therefore, the applicant as per section 18 of the RERA Act. 2016, is entitled for<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -22.5pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">i)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Refund principal amount of Rs.</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">10,580,830/-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">of the applicant&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">along</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;with interest @ 18% P.a. from the date of actual payment till realization.<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -22.5pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">ii)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Pay compensation of Rs.5,00,000/- to the applicant for mental harassment, mental agony<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -22.5pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">iii)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Any other relief which this Hon’ble authority deems fit may also be passed in favor of the applicant.</span></p>',10825200.00,10580830.00,'2016-02-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2013-08-02 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Flat no E401,Falcon View, sector 66A, Mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'GVstarLLP','2018-08-28 09:04:39.000','GVstarLLP','2018-08-28 09:04:39.000'),(51,1026,'1026',1076,'4f2d5283-329d-4971-b292-88cf4017407c','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Sapna kant  Shishir Kant','advocate_varunl@hotmail.com',8077517457,0,0,'Flat No. R-201','Maya Garden Ph. II, VIP ROAD, Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','Flat No. R-201','Maya Garden Ph. II, VIP ROAD,  Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','Varun Luthra','advocate_varunl@hotmail.com',9815998858,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0083','JOYNEST MOH.1,  MOHALI M/S AMAZING REAL ESTATE PVT. LTD.','M/S AMAZING REAL ESTATE PVT. LTD C/O SUSHMA INITIATIVE THROUGH MD PRATIK MITTAL','customercare@sushmabuildtech.com',9876360018,0,'SCO-02, Urban Plaza, Sushma Square, ','Ghazipur,, Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','SCO-02, Urban Plaza, Sushma Square, ','Ghazipur, Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','<ol><li>That the complainant purchased the flat mentioned above in the month of July, 2018 and paid an amount of Rs. 150000/- on 01-07-2018 through cheque, Rs. 208100/- through cheque on 11-07-2018 and 50000/- through cheque on 20-07-2018.&nbsp; </li><li>That at the time of finalising the unit the complainants were introduced with one sales person namely Ms.Neha Gupta , who assured that an area of 850 sq. ft. (Carpet area) would be delivered to you by next year.&nbsp; </li><li>That thereafter an agreement (buyer\'s agreement) was received by the complainant in which the carpet area is mentioned as 645.14 sq. ft, and the date of possession was mentioned as 17-01-2021, which was against the oral commitment made at the time of finalising the unit. To, this act the complainant raised hue and cry with the company officials. Soon thereafter, but all the time the officials were making excuses on one context or the other. No, phone calls/mails of the complainants were responded by the respondents and at the outset completely refused to refund the amount paid for the unit, finally the complainant some how had a telephonic conversation (dated 28-07-2018) with the MD Sh. Pratik Mittal, who assured that cancellation process will be done and sent a cancellation notice dated 10-08-2018 was received by the complainants..&nbsp;</li><li>That this entire process of the company towards its customer not only in the nature of deficiency in service but also a malpractice against wrong assurances.&nbsp;</li><li>That the project owner and his employees not only harassed the complainant but they have opted a wrong practice to forfeit the amount for the best reasons known to them.</li></ol>','<ol><li>That the complainant is not interested in buying the said unit and want to withdraw from the said project and is seeking refund through this complaint with interest @18% from the date of deposit till realization along with penalised compensation of Rs. 100000/- for mental agony and harassment, along with any other relief that this Hon\'ble Authority deems fit be passed in favour of complainant.</li><li>The since the company through its officials had played a fraud and misrepresented the complainant not only for the area but possession also, so the company may be directed to pay to the applicant not only the earnest money as they are not willing to move ahead in this project, but also compensation of Rs. 100000/- in addition to the amount prayed to be refunded along with interest @18% from the date of deposit till the date of realiazation.</li></ol>',4579400.00,408100.00,'2021-01-17 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2018-07-18 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','C-105, Joy Nest, Mohali, PR-7, Airport Ring Road, Near Aero City, Vill. Chhat, SAS Nagar Mohali.\r\n','','',2,0,0,0,'kantsapnavarunluthra','2018-08-28 12:24:52.000','kantsapnavarunluthra','2018-08-28 12:24:52.000'),(52,1026,'1026',1076,'4f2d5283-329d-4971-b292-88cf4017407c','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-08-29 20:30:17.000','Sapna kant  Shishir Kant','advocate_varunl@hotmail.com',8077517457,0,0,'Flat No. R-201','Maya Garden Ph. II, VIP ROAD, Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','Flat No. R-201','Maya Garden Ph. II, VIP ROAD,  Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','Varun Luthra','advocate_varunl@hotmail.com',9815998858,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0083','JOYNEST MOH.1,  MOHALI M/S AMAZING REAL ESTATE PVT. LTD.','M/S AMAZING REAL ESTATE PVT. LTD C/O SUSHMA INITIATIVE THROUGH MD PRATIK MITTAL','customercare@sushmabuildtech.com',9876360018,0,'SCO-02, Urban Plaza, Sushma Square, ','Ghazipur,, Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','SCO-02, Urban Plaza, Sushma Square, ','Ghazipur, Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','<ol><li>That the complainant purchased the flat mentioned above in the month of July, 2018 and paid an amount of Rs. 150000/- on 01-07-2018 through cheque, Rs. 208100/- through cheque on 11-07-2018 and 50000/- through cheque on 20-07-2018.&nbsp; </li><li>That at the time of finalising the unit the complainants were introduced with one sales person namely Ms.Neha Gupta , who assured that an area of 850 sq. ft. (Carpet area) would be delivered to you by next year.&nbsp; </li><li>That thereafter an agreement (buyer\'s agreement) was received by the complainant in which the carpet area is mentioned as 645.14 sq. ft, and the date of possession was mentioned as 17-01-2021, which was against the oral commitment made at the time of finalising the unit. To, this act the complainant raised hue and cry with the company officials. Soon thereafter, but all the time the officials were making excuses on one context or the other. No, phone calls/mails of the complainants were responded by the respondents and at the outset completely refused to refund the amount paid for the unit, finally the complainant some how had a telephonic conversation (dated 28-07-2018) with the MD Sh. Pratik Mittal, who assured that cancellation process will be done and sent a cancellation notice dated 10-08-2018 was received by the complainants..&nbsp;</li><li>That this entire process of the company towards its customer not only in the nature of deficiency in service but also a malpractice against wrong assurances.&nbsp;</li><li>That the project owner and his employees not only harassed the complainant but they have opted a wrong practice to forfeit the amount for the best reasons known to them.</li></ol>','<ol><li>That the complainant is not interested in buying the said unit and want to withdraw from the said project and is seeking refund through this complaint with interest @18% from the date of deposit till realization along with penalised compensation of Rs. 100000/- for mental agony and harassment, along with any other relief that this Hon\'ble Authority deems fit be passed in favour of complainant.</li><li>The since the company through its officials had played a fraud and misrepresented the complainant not only for the area but possession also, so the company may be directed to pay to the applicant not only the earnest money as they are not willing to move ahead in this project, but also compensation of Rs. 100000/- in addition to the amount prayed to be refunded along with interest @18% from the date of deposit till the date of realiazation.</li></ol>',4579400.00,408100.00,'2021-01-17 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2018-07-18 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','C-105, Joy Nest, Mohali, PR-7, Airport Ring Road, Near Aero City, Vill. Chhat, SAS Nagar Mohali.\r\n','','',1,1,0,0,'kantsapnavarunluthra','2018-08-28 14:23:54.000','kantsapnavarunluthra','2018-08-28 14:23:54.000'),(53,1023,'1023',1066,'3568b05d-bd51-44d0-b387-09a3505b7441','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-08-24 12:13:26.000','G.v. Star Estates LLP','ramsingh.dil@gmail.com',8699904514,0,0,'House no 726, Sector 2 Panchkula','',13,15,'134102','1','House no 2322 sector 66 mohali','',28,507,'160062','Neeraj Sobti','advocatesobti@yahoo.co.in',9872279500,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0004','Falcon View, M/s Janta land promoters LTD, Sector 66A mohali','Ms. JANTA LAND PROMOTERS LTD','janta@jantahousing.com',8427100082,0,'SCO 39-42, Sector 82','',28,507,'160062','1','SCO 39-42, Sector 82','',28,507,'160062','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.05pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:\r\n9.75pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: Arial;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; The applicant vide their application dated 02.04.2013 applied for an apartment and\r\naccordingly 4 BHK Apartment i.e. No. E-401, 4</span><sup><span style=\"font-size: 6.5pt; font-family: Arial;\">th</span></sup><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">&nbsp;Floor,\r\nwing E, Facing Green, Falcon View, Phase-II, (wrongly mentioned as Phase-I, in\r\nallotment letter dated 02.08.2013, Annexure C-1) Sector 66-A, Mohali, Punjab,\r\nmeasuring 3007 sq. ft., @Rs.3,600/- per sq. ft., was allotted in favor of the\r\napplicant vide Allotment Letter dated 02.08.2013, alongwith details of plot and\r\nthe total sale consideration amount was fixed as Rs.1,08,25,200/-. Copy of\r\nallotment letter is&nbsp;</span><b><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">Annexure C-1.</span></b></span></p><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">\r\n\r\n</span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.05pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">That as\r\nper the demands raised by the respondents, the applicant kept on making payment\r\nto the respondents and the applicant paid the following amount to the\r\nrespondents copies of all the receipts are&nbsp;</span><b><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">Annexure C-2 to C-11</span></b></span></p><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">\r\n\r\n</span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.05pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">That as\r\nper Clause no.2.24 of the allotment letter dated 02.08.2013 (annexure C-1) the\r\npossession of the said apartment complete in all respects shall be delivered to\r\nthe applicant by 01.02.2016, i.e. 30 months from the date of allotment letter\r\ni.e. 02.08.2013.</span></span></p><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">\r\n\r\n</span><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 8.5pt;\">That\r\nin-spite of the receipt of substantial amount against the said apartment the\r\nrespondents have failed to complete the said apartment and further failed to\r\noffer the possession of the said apartment upto 01.02.2016. The applicant in\r\nMay, 2016, approached the respondents and inquired about the dated of the\r\ndelivery of possession but the respondents have failed to give\r\nany&nbsp;satisfactory&nbsp;response and started lingered-on, the matter on one\r\npretext or the other. However the applicant was assured that the possession of\r\nthe said apartment shall be delivered upto July, 2016, positively and\r\nshockingly the possession of the apartment was not offered by the respondents\r\nto the applicant in July, 2016, as promised by the respondents.</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">&nbsp;</span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: -18pt; line-height: 16.1px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 18.4px; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">o<o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 16.1px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 18.4px; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">In&nbsp;&nbsp;view&nbsp;&nbsp;of&nbsp;&nbsp;the&nbsp;&nbsp;facts&nbsp;&nbsp;mentioned&nbsp;&nbsp;in&nbsp;&nbsp;paragraph&nbsp;&nbsp;4&nbsp;&nbsp;above,&nbsp;&nbsp;the&nbsp;&nbsp;applicant prays&nbsp;&nbsp;for&nbsp;&nbsp;the following compensation(s)<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">That as the respondents have failed to comply with the terms and conditions of the allotment letter dated 02.08.2013 (Annexure C-1) and have failed to deliver the possession of the apartment/flat within the stipulated time. Therefore, the applicant as per section 18 of the RERA Act. 2016, is entitled for<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -22.5pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">i)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Refund principal amount of Rs.</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">10,580,830/-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">of the applicant&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">along</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;with interest @ 18% P.a. from the date of actual payment till realization.<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -22.5pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">ii)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Pay compensation of Rs.5,00,000/- to the applicant for mental harassment, mental agony<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -22.5pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">iii)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Any other relief which this Hon’ble authority deems fit may also be passed in favor of the applicant.</span></p>',10825200.00,10580830.00,'2016-02-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1',''