. </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; margin: 0cm 0cm 10pt 36pt; padding: 10px 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: 22px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Now that we have exhausted all efforts to get the villa completed and to get possession from the company within given time, there is no other option </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; margin: 0cm 0cm 10pt 36pt; padding: 10px 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: 22px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">1)except to terminate the contract and </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; margin: 0cm 0cm 10pt 36pt; padding: 10px 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: 22px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">2)get back the refund with interest.&nbsp; Refund of money paid to you with interest @ 12 PA from the date of payment.</span></p>',10684207.00,3489808.00,'2016-06-26 00:00:00.000','2016-06-26 00:00:00.000','','1','','2014-06-27 00:00:00','2014-06-27 00:00:00','L-550 of Type-L,','','',2,0,0,0,'gurkirasinghbajwanavjotkaurbajwa','2018-09-07 17:34:30.000','gurkirasinghbajwanavjotkaurbajwa','2018-09-07 17:34:30.000'),(77,1025,'1025',1074,'173c8217-5ec2-4b34-b6c8-f76219a18b97','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-09-07 17:48:26.000','gurkirat bajwa','gbajwa9@rediffmail.com',9814031105,1612455111,762822836892,'220 -A','sarabha nagar',28,366,'141001','1','220 -A','sarabha nagar',28,366,'141001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-LDH45-PR0004','IREO Water\r\nFront, Pocket-2\r\n(Phase-I)','M/S ireo Waterfront Ludhiana','iwp@ireo.in',9810237279,1613040290,'5, Dhanraj Chambers,','satbari',10,557,'110074','1','5, Dhanraj Chambers,','satbari',10,557,'110074','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; margin: 0cm 0cm 10pt 36pt; padding: 10px 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: 22px; font-fam