 up area. It was also agreed therein that we shall be entitled to terminate the contract and get refund in case of failure on your part to perform the contract in specified time.\r\n</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; margin: 0cm 0cm 10pt 36pt; padding: 10px 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: 22px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">5.	That we  already had apprised ireo waterfront many times, our necessity for the villa and requested you to deliver possession in time as agreed. But both the construction and the amenities are incomplete till date. Now we  have exhausted all efforts to get the villa completed and get possession within given time, there is  no other option except to terminate the contract&nbsp;</span><b style=\"font-family: roboto;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">and\r\nget&nbsp; the refund of amount paid with\r\ninterest</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 115%;\">.&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; margin: 0cm 0cm 10pt 36pt; padding: 10px 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: 22px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; line-height: 13.3pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">As&nbsp; M/S\r\nireo waterfront ltd had also agreed to give possession of the vailla L-550 ,\r\nwhich they failed to do with in promised period. Even&nbsp; there was never any reason beyond control of\r\nthe company which constrained it not to complete the construction within 24\r\nmonths and deliver its possession&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; line-height: 13.3pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">Even they had to furnish and develop parks\r\nand club etc. in the colony and provide all amenities in and for the use of\r\nvilla within agreed time. But they have failed in doing so till date.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; line-height: 13.3pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">a) &nbsp;We have no other option except to terminate\r\nthe contract</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"> dated 27.06.2014</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">.\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;b)&nbsp; Refund of the total amount paid to M/S ireo\r\nwaterfront ltd&nbsp; with interest at 12\r\nPA&nbsp; &nbsp;from the date of payment to the ireo\r\nwaterfront ltd.&nbsp;&nbsp; Including the payment\r\nmade to &nbsp;<u>ANGSANA club and SPA ireo\r\nwaterfront </u>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>',10684207.00,3489808.00,'2016-06-26 00:00:00.000','2016-06-26 00:00:00.000','','1','','2014-06-27 00:00:00','2014-06-27 00:00:00','L-550 of Type-L,','','',1,1,0,0,'gurkirasinghbajwanavjotkaurbajwa','2018-09-07 17:36:21.000','gurkirasinghbajwanavjotkaurbajwa','2018-09-07 17:36:21.000'),(78,1040,'1040',1094,'5307214d-513f-428e-a103-9ead98ac25bf','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-09-24 19:14:58.000','Karnail Singh Brar through Tejwant Singh','londonksreracomplainant@gmail.com',9815998858,0,0,'Village Jawahar Singh Wala','Teh. Nihal Singh Wala',28,393,'142055','1','Tejwant Singh, R/o H.No. 2619, Sector 70,','Sector 70, SAS Nagar Mohali',28,507,'160071','ADv. Varun Luthra','advocate_varunl@hotmail.com',9815998858,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0231','The Views, Mohali Hills, Sector 105, SAS Nagar Mohali.','M/s Emaar MGF Land Ltd through MD/Director/representative Sh. Rajesh Gupta ','',0,0,'Emaar MGF Land Limited, ECE House, ','28, Kasturba Gandhi Marg, New Delhi.',10,429,'110001','0','Emaar MGF Land Limited,','SCO 120-122, Sector 17 C, Chandigarh.',6,128,'160017','1','<ol><li>That the complainant/applicant had purchased unit no. H2-GF-GF02,&nbsp; \"THE VIEWS\", Mohali Hills, SAS Nagar Mohaliin the year March, 2008 and had paid a sum of Rs. 4005708/- in advance as an earnest money out of the total consideration amount of rs 4447059/-.</li><li>that M/s Emaar MGF had assured the complainant/applicant to deliver the possession of the said property on or before March,2011.</li><li>that in the agreement executed between the complainant/applicant and the defendant/respondent itself shows that the possession was to be delivered within 36 months of the date of agreement/allottment of the unit purchased.</li><li>that the defendant/respondent had failed to honor its commitment of giving possession to the purchaser till date, despite of the fact that the applicant/complainant purchaser had paid the agreed amount well in advance. Therefore&nbsp; the defendant/respondent developer has failed to honor his side of commitment.</li></ol>','<ol><li>That the defendant/respondent shall be ordered to pay the refund of the amount paid by the complainant/applicant to the defendant/respondent with penal interest @18% from the date of amounts paid respectively.</li><li>That the defendant/respondent be ordered to pay an amount of Rs. 1000000/- as compensation for the harassment caused to complainant/applicant, and any other appropriate relief that this Honorable Court deems fit to be paid by the defendant/respondent to the complainant/applicant.</li></ol>',4579400.00,4005706.00,'2011-05-30 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2008-04-01 00:00:00','2008-05-29 00:00:00','H2-GF-GF02, The Views. Mohali Hills, Sector 105, SAS Nagar Mohali.\r\n','','',2,0,0,0,'london.ksrera','2018-09-09 12:01:34.000','london.ksrera','2018-09-09 12:01:34.000'),(79,1036,'1036',1092,'506ad359-88c1-4045-ba35-1eef15c3e32e','FormTypeN',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Darshan  Singh','advbswalia@gmail.com',9814685406,1722625103,497110579868,'5405, Sector 38 West ','',6,128,'160014','1','5405, Sector 38 West ','',6,128,'160014','B.S. Walia','advbswalia@gmail.com',9417374450,1722625384,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0022','Punjab Urban Planning and Development authority','PUDA','',0,0,'PUDA  Bhawan , Sector 62 , S.A.S Nagar , Mohali ','',28,507,'160062','1','PUDA  Bhawan , Sector 62 , S.A.S Nagar , Mohali ','',28,507,'160062','1','<p>That the respondent issued allotment Letter of intent (LOI) to applicant for residential plot  no. 94 measuring 545 Sq. Yard, Sector 118-119, Gateway City, S.A.S Nagar, Mohali- 160055 dated 14.1.2016  in reference to application form no. 832. That in furtherance  of letter of Intent , allotment letter&nbsp; dated 9-8-2016 was issued to applicant . The tentative price of the plot is Rs. 11445000/- at the rate of Rs. 21,000/- Rs/Sq. Yard. In pursuance to Allotment Letter, Applicant paid full and final lump sum payment of Rs.1,14,45,000/- .</p><p>Thus, till date Rs. 11445000/- has been paid by Applicant to the respondent as per statement of account. As per the Allotment Letter dated 9.8.2016, the possession of the said plot in question was to be given within 18 months from the date of issuance of allotment which is already over i.e. 8.2.2018 Thus, the respondent has failed to handover possession within the stipulated time as written in the allotment letter agreed between the parties. The respondent has yet to give reply to Applicant whether they have got the Occupancy Certificate/Completion Certificate for the said plot or not? Respondent has been avoiding this question for too long since the Allotment letter was issued. That the said project promoted by respondent lacks basic infrastructure like roads, poor connectivity, drains, electricity, water supply, green cover and parks, street lights missing, roads without berm, no provision of security nor any existence of police post. All these factors further make plot unfit for habitation and construction.&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif; font-size: 14px;\">Applicant has given a letter on 30-11-2017\r\nregarding possession of plot no. 94 , Sector 118-119 , Gateway City Mohali. Even today</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">, <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">the development works at the said ‘Gateway\r\nCity’ are not complete, which means the possession of plot is no sooner\r\nexpected than 2019 from respondent. Thus, there is a clear delay on the part of\r\nrespondent.</span></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:200%\"><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">In\r\nview of the facts mentioned in paragraph 4 above, the applicant</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> </span><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">prays\r\nfor the following compensation(s):- </span><o:p></o:p></span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">1 </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; letter-spacing: 1pt;\">Grant\r\npay 12% interest on the deposited amount of Rs.</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 11445000</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;letter-spacing:1.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">/-</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">from date of possession .</span></span><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> </span><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">2 Compensation for inability/failure to discharge obligations\r\nas per Allotment Letter and RERA Act under </span></span><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><b><i><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">Section\r\n18 (3)</span></i></b></span><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> lacking in basic\r\nservices which was initially promised and no disclosure about status of Completion\r\nCertificate/Occupancy Certificate before handing over the possession.</span><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">3\r\nCompensation on account of mental agony, pain and litigation expenses upto Rs.\r\n2 lakh as illustrated in the Section 72 of the RERA Act. </span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">4 Any other appropriate remedy or relief which this court may deem\r\nfit in the present circumstances may also be awarded in the favour of\r\nApplicant.&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>',11445000.00,11445000.00,'2018-02-08 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2016-08-09 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','#94, Sector 118-119, Gateway City, S.A.S Nagar, Mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'bswalia','2018-09-10 19:24:42.000','bswalia','2018-09-10 19:24:42.000'),(80,1036,'1036',1092,'506ad359-88c1-4045-ba35-1eef15c3e32e','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-09-14 17:37:51.000','Darshan  Singh','advbswalia@gmail.com',9814685406,1722625103,497110579868,'5405, Sector 38 West ','',6,128,'160014','1','5405, Sector 38 West ','',6,128,'160014','B.S. Walia','advbswalia@gmail.com',9417374450,1722625384,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0022','Punjab Urban Planning and Development authority','PUDA','',0,0,'PUDA  Bhawan , Sector 62 , S.A.S Nagar , Mohali ','',28,507,'160062','1','PUDA  Bhawan , Sector 62 , S.A.S Nagar , Mohali ','',28,507,'160062','1','<p>That the respondent issued allotment Letter of intent (LOI) to applicant for residential plot  no. 94 measuring 545 Sq. Yard, Sector 118-119, Gateway City, S.A.S Nagar, Mohali- 160055 dated 14.1.2016  in reference to application form no. 832. That in furtherance  of letter of Intent , allotment letter&nbsp; dated 9-8-2016 was issued to applicant . The tentative price of the plot is Rs. 11445000/- at the rate of Rs. 21,000/- Rs/Sq. Yard. In pursuance to Allotment Letter, Applicant paid full and final lump sum payment of Rs.1,14,45,000/- .</p><p>Thus, till date Rs. 11445000/- has been paid by Applicant to the respondent as per statement of account. As per the Allotment Letter dated 9.8.2016, the possession of the said plot in question was to be given within 18 months from the date of issuance of allotment which is already over i.e. 8.2.2018 Thus, the respondent has failed to handover possession within the stipulated time as written in the allotment letter agreed between the parties. The respondent has yet to give reply to Applicant whether they have got the Occupancy Certificate/Completion Certificate for the said plot or not? Respondent has been avoiding this question for too long since the Allotment letter was issued. That the said project promoted by respondent lacks basic infrastructure like roads, poor connectivity, drains, electricity, water supply, green cover and parks, street lights missing, roads without berm, no provision of security nor any existence of police post. All these factors further make plot unfit for habitation and construction.&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif; font-size: 14px;\">Applicant has given a letter on 30-11-2017\r\nregarding possession of plot no. 94 , Sector 118-119 , Gateway City Mohali. Even today</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">, <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">the development works at the said ‘Gateway\r\nCity’ are not complete, which means the possession of plot is no sooner\r\nexpected than 2019 from respondent. Thus, there is a clear delay on the part of\r\nrespondent.</span></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:200%\"><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">In\r\nview of the facts mentioned in paragraph 4 above, the applicant</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> </span><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">prays\r\nfor the following compensation(s):- </span><o:p></o:p></span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">1 </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; letter-spacing: 1pt;\">Grant\r\npay 12% interest on the deposited amount of Rs.</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 11445000</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;letter-spacing:1.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">/-</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">from date of possession .</span></span><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> </span><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">2 Compensation for inability/failure to discharge obligations\r\nas per Allotment Letter and RERA Act under </span></span><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><b><i><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\">Section\r\n18 (3)</span></i></b></span><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> lacking in basic\r\nservices which was initially promised and no disclosure about status of Completion\r\nCertificate/Occupancy Certificate before handing over the possession.</span><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">3\r\nCompensation on account of mental agony, pain and litigation expenses upto Rs.\r\n2 lakh as illustrated in the Section 72 of the RERA Act. </span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\r\n\r\n</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">4 Any other appropriate remedy or relief which this court may deem\r\nfit in the present circumstances may also be awarded in the favour of\r\nApplicant.&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>',11445000.00,11445000.00,'2018-02-08 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2016-08-09 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','#94, Sector 118-119, Gateway City, S.A.S Nagar, Mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'bswalia','2018-09-10 19:57:22.000','bswalia','2018-09-10 19:57:22.000'),(81,1022,'1022',1063,'5e186167-21be-4e97-98d6-a300c1a9ee84','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-09-11 17:08:58.000','VINOD KHULLAR','vskhullar54@gmail.com',8699212120,0,0,'215, Eldeco Greens','Opposite Khambra Gate, Jalandhar ',28,261,'140026','1','215, Eldeco Greens','Opposite Khambra Gate, Jalandhar ',28,261,'140026','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-JAL34-PR0023','Eldeco Greens Properties Pvt.Ltd. Jalandhar','Mr. Vijay Luthar','',9888085858,0,'Marketing Office, Eldeco Greens','Opposite Khambra Gate, Jalandhar',28,261,'140026','1','Marketing Office, Eldeco Greens','Opposite Khambra Gate, Jalandhar',28,261,'140026','1','<p>All the wooden floors of the three bedrooms provided at the time of allotment has been broken/damaged and uneven at many places. This has made the surface area unusable and unsafe.&nbsp;</p><p>The floor tiles of the Kitchen are also uneven and thus hurting the feet while working.&nbsp;</p><p>All the walls of the house are facing dampness. The paint has been eroded at many places.</p>','<p>We are not aware about the compensation rules but the total cost of the repairs for the above mentioned facts comes about Rs. 2 Lacs.</p><p><br></p><p>Requested you to please take an earlier action against the same.</p>',9000000.00,9000000.00,'2014-02-04 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2014-02-04 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','215, Eldeco Greens, Opposite Khambra Gate, Jalandhar, Punjab-140026','','',1,1,0,0,'VKKHULLAR','2018-09-11 17:08:44.000','VKKHULLAR','2018-09-11 17:08:44.000'),(82,1041,'1041',1098,'81775a1c-ad46-40a6-b51a-c95cca91809d','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-09-17 10:06:47.000','Abhimanyu Singh Vinayak','abhi.vinayak@yahoo.co.in',9992015557,0,832756086566,'44-45 SHIVAJI PARK','MODEL TOWN',13,21,'135001','1','T-1, 301, BESTECH PARK VIEW RESIDENCES','SECTOR 66',28,507,'160059','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0004','Falcon View Apartments,\r\nPhase-2, Tower C to H,\r\nSector 66, Mohali - Punjab\r\n','JANTA LAND PROMOTERS PVT LTD','janta@jantahousing.com',8427100082,0,'Regd. Office and Corporate Office : SCO 39-42, Sector 82, ','SAS Nagar, Mohali, Punjab',28,507,'140306','1','Regd. Office and Corporate Office : SCO 39-42, Sector 82, ','SAS Nagar, Mohali, Punjab',28,507,'140306','1','<p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">I am an\r\nadvocate practicing at the Hon\'ble Punjab and Haryana High Court at Chandigarh.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">In\r\nmy capacity as KARTA of Abhimanyu Singh Vinayak HUF, I, purchased an apartment\r\nfrom M/s. Janta Land Promoters Pvt Ltd.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">The\r\napartment size is 3122 sq ft, situated on first floor of Tower D &amp; the Unit\r\nNo. is D-101, Falcon View.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">The\r\ntotal cost of the property was fixed at Rs.96,17,477/- Plus Service Tax(Now\r\nGST).<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">I\r\npaid Rs.96,43,228/- to the company.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">I\r\npaid Rs.84,35,750/- vide Receipt No. 6518 dated 13/8/2016,&nbsp;\r\n&nbsp;Rs.11,12,000/- vide Receipt No. 3104 dated 13/8/2016&nbsp; &nbsp;and\r\nRs.95,478/- vide Receipt No. 6826 dated 28/9/2016.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Thus\r\nI\'ve paid 96% of the Total consideration amount.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">The\r\nCompany, both verbally as well as in writing in the Allotment Letter dated\r\n13/08/2016, promised to complete construction &amp; handover the apartment in\r\n12 months. Thus the effective date of possession was 13/08/2017.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Unfortunately,\r\ndespite having paid 96% of the total amount, the company has failed to deliver\r\nthe possession of the flat.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Thus\r\nour joint family is compelled to live separately. My parents live in\r\nYamunanagar whereas I, along with my wife and son live in Mohali in a small\r\naccommodation. We have been compelled to compromise with our comfort &amp; our\r\nfuture plannings.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">I\'ve\r\nbeen running from pillar to post to get the true status of the construction\r\n&amp; the date of actual possession, but to no avail. The office bearers of the\r\ncompany refuse to entertain my requests &amp; divulge any relevant information.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">I\'ve\r\nsent dozens of e-mails to the company &amp; its top officials, for confirming\r\nthe date of possession &amp; for seeking compensation for inordinate delay.\r\nI\'ve visited the company office score of times but all my pleadings fall on\r\ndeaf ears.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">During\r\nall this period, after having paid Rs.96,43,228/- to the company,&nbsp;I\'ve\r\nreceived merely one cheque for Rs.44,413/- on dated 12-2-2018 from the\r\nCompany/Builder.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>','<p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">That as per\r\nthe allotment letter cum agreement, the company is charging penal interest from\r\nthe buyers @10% for delay of first month, @12% for delay of second month &amp;\r\n@15% for delay thereafter.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Thus\r\nI seek parity &amp; equity of the penal interest paid by the buyer &amp; the\r\npenal interest paid by the builder company. The penal interest that the\r\nbuilder/company ought to pay should be at par with what they charge from the\r\nhelpless buyers.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Here\r\nit also worth mentioning that during this entire period of inordinate delay,\r\nthere has not been any force majure or circumstances beyond the control of the\r\ndevelopers, behind which the company might try to hide and try to wriggle out\r\nfrom discharge of their lawful liability.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">HERE,\r\nI ALSO WISH TO BRING TO YOUR KIND NOTICE, TWO ANOTHER VERY IMPORTANT FACTORS,\r\nREGARDING WHICH THE CAUSE OF ACTION HAS NOT YET ARISEN, BUT IF THE\r\nCOMPANY/BUILDER DELAYS FURTHER, I MAY SUFFER HUGE LOSSES IN THE FUTURE.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">1.\r\nThat I sold my industrial unit on 12 August 2016 &amp; purchased this apartment\r\non 13 August 2016.Thus I saved Long Term Capitals Gain Tax . As per I.T. Act,\r\nif I do not get possession of new residential property in 36 months from date\r\nof sale of industrial unit, I shall have to return, entire LTCG Tax Rebate\r\navailed, with interest, which in my case may be about Rs.15 Lac Loss. All for\r\nno fault of mine.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">2.&nbsp;\r\nThat Punjab Government has given a rebate of 3% on stamp duty for registrations\r\ntill 31-3-2019. If the company delays in possession, I may suffer another Rs.3\r\nLac Loss.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">However,\r\nI reserve my right to approach appropriate legal forums to recover these\r\nlosses, if &amp; when they occur.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">RELIEF\r\nSOUGHT IN THE PRESENT COMPLAINT&nbsp; :&nbsp; &nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">1.\r\nI seek interest as per the relevant provisions of RERA, for inordinate delay in\r\npossession &amp; after having paid 96% of the total amount i.e.Rs.96,43,228/-.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">2.\r\nI seek compensation of Rs.3,00,000/- for delay in possession which has caused\r\nimmense harassment, inconvenience &amp; uncertainty to me and my family.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:0cm\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>',9617477.00,9643228.00,'2017-08-13 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2016-08-13 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Flat No.101, Tower-D, Falcon View, Sector 66-A, Mohali','','',1,1,0,0,'rachnabhi','2018-09-14 16:02:45.000','rachnabhi','2018-09-14 16:02:45.000'),(83,1024,'1024',1069,'7476da42-3c0e-44cb-8722-aa75205c4e12','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-08-26 11:02:54.000','Rajnish Sood','advocate_varunl@hotmail.com',9501120034,0,0,'H. No. 2','Aman City, Kharar',28,507,'140301','1','H. No. 2','Aman City, Kharar',28,507,'140301','Advocate Varun Luthra','advocate_varunl@hotmail.com',9815998858,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PM0021','Bajwa Developers through Managing Director Jarnail Singh Bajwa son of Sh. Bishan Singh','Bajwa Developers through Managing Director Sh. Jarnail Singh Bajwa son of Sh. Bishan Singh','bajwadeveloperltd@gmail.com',0,0,'Bajwa Developers through Sh. Jarnail Singh Bajwa, Sunny Business Center, ','5th Floor, above Gopal Sweets, Sector - 125, Kharar,',28,507,'140301','1','Bajwa Developers, Sunny Business Center, 5th Floor, Gopal Sweets','Sector - 125, Kharar,',28,507,'140301','1','<ol><li>That the respondent floated a scheme to sell&nbsp; 1 BHK and 2 BHK flats in sector - 74 A, 117, Mohali and assured the respondent to give possessions of the said flats within a period of two years. The complainant purchased the unit measure 450 sq. ft. in&nbsp; BR No. (1454) : 1654 , Aparments No. F - 21, Sector - 74&nbsp; A, sector - 117, Mohali, for a consideration amount of Rs. 1250000/- to be paid to the respondent. The complainant paid&nbsp; Rs. 200,000/- on 22.04.2011, Rs. 100,000/- on 03.05.11, Rs. 180,000/- in cash on 10.11.2011. An agreement to sell was reduced to writing on 04.05.2011 which depicted the payment schedule. Thus a total amount of Rs. 480,000/- was paid to the respondent.&nbsp;</li><li>That despite of approaching the respondent for many times to know about the date of possession, the Managing Director himself and his staff had not disclosed the date&nbsp; and they tried to resile from the situation for the reasons best known to them. It is pertinent to mention that dat has been extended for number of times by the respondent and been mentioned the same on the agreement.(Annexed). Now the complainant has come to know that the project land in sector - 74 A, Sector - 117 has been sold by the respondent to some third party and project is not coming up there. In order to avoid any compensation, the respondent has issued a letter to the complainant saying that said flat can not be allotted as the scheme is meant for EWS people as per Punjab government notification. The respondent is making offers to adjust the amount paid by complainant, in some other lucrative schemes that are not acceptable to the complainant and therefore respondent is withholding money without any reason. the respondent is in process to unsurp the hard earned money of the public at large.</li><li>That the Respondent has been served with notice on 13.06.2018 by the counsel of the complainant, but respondent neither replied to it nor made any refunds to the complainant. Hence this complainant</li></ol>','<ol><li>In view of the above said facts, complainant prays that the respondent be directed to refund the deposited amount along with interest @18% p.a from the date of deposit till realization and penalized compensation of Rs. 500,000/- for mental agony and harassment and any other relief which this Hon\'ble Authority deems fit be passed in favour of complainant.</li><li>That since the company has played a fraud and misrepresented the applicant for the plot they have sold on the land which is under litigation and have been withholding the money of the applicant without any reasonable cause nor have informed the applicant the present status of the said plot or litigation. The applicant prays for a compensation of Rs. 500,000/- in addition to the amount prayed for to be refunded with interest @18% p.a. from the date of deposit till realization and compensation of Rs. 500,000/- for mental agony and harassment and any other relief which this Hon\'ble Authority deems fit be passed in favour of the applicant.</li></ol>',1250150.00,480000.00,'2012-11-04 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2011-05-04 00:00:00','2011-05-04 00:00:00','F-21, Sector - 74A, 117, SAS Nagar, Mohali. (Pb.)\r\n','','',2,0,0,0,'SoodrajnishVarunluthra','2018-09-15 11:05:18.000','SoodrajnishVarunluthra','2018-09-15 11:05:18.000'),(84,1024,'1024',1069,'7476da42-3c0e-44cb-8722-aa75205c4e12','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-09-15 11:56:03.000','Rajnish Sood','advocate_varunl@hotmail.com',9501120034,0,0,'H. No. 2','Aman City, Kharar',28,507,'140301','1','H. No. 2','Aman City, Kharar',28,507,'140301','Advocate Varun Luthra','advocate_varunl@hotmail.com',9815998858,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PM0021','Bajwa Developers through Managing Director Jarnail Singh Bajwa son of Sh. Bishan Singh','Bajwa Developers through Managing Director Sh. Jarnail Singh Bajwa son of Sh. Bishan Singh','bajwadeveloperltd@gmail.com',0,0,'Bajwa Developers through Sh. Jarnail Singh Bajwa, Sunny Business Center, ','5th Floor, above Gopal Sweets, Sector - 125, Kharar,',28,507,'140301','1','Bajwa Developers, Sunny Business Center, 5th Floor, Gopal Sweets','