nor made any refunds to the complainant. Hence this complainant</li></ol>','<ol><li>In view of the above said facts, complainant prays that the respondent be directed to refund the deposited amount along with interest @18% p.a from the date of deposit till realization and penalized compensation of Rs. 500,000/- for mental agony and harassment and any other relief which this Hon\'ble Authority deems fit be passed in favour of complainant.</li><li>That since the company has played a fraud and misrepresented the applicant for the plot they have sold on the land which is under litigation and have been withholding the money of the applicant without any reasonable cause nor have informed the applicant the present status of the said plot or litigation. The applicant prays for a compensation of Rs. 500,000/- in addition to the amount prayed for to be refunded with interest @18% p.a. from the date of deposit till realization and compensation of Rs. 500,000/- for mental agony and harassment and any other relief which this Hon\'ble Authority deems fit be passed in favour of the applicant.</li></ol>',1250150.00,480000.00,'2012-11-04 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2011-05-04 00:00:00','2011-05-04 00:00:00','F-21, Sector - 74A, 117, SAS Nagar, Mohali. (Pb.)\r\n','','',1,1,0,0,'SoodrajnishVarunluthra','2018-09-15 11:55:49.000','SoodrajnishVarunluthra','2018-09-15 11:55:49.000'),(85,1042,'1042',1108,'bf5a9f59-eaa5-435c-93e6-da29c1986f5d','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','AMAN DEEP  JASWAL','amanjaswal@rediffmail.com',9811227230,0,0,'G-149 ','PREET VIHAR',10,189,'110092','1','G-149 ','PREET VIHAR',10,189,'110092','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0046','Imperial Heights /\r\nWWICS Estates Pvt. Ltd','Col BS Sandhu (Retd.)','info@wwicsestates.com',9357993579,1726663600,'WWICS Estates Pvt. Ltd.','A12, Industrial Area, PhaseVI, Mohali,',28,507,'160055','1','WWICS Estates Pvt. Ltd.','A12, Industrial Area, PhaseVI, Mohali,',28,507,'160055','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">I had received letter of\r\noffer of possession dated : 31/10/2017 against which all due&nbsp;payment to\r\nbuilder was made on 14/01/2018 (after receipt of payment calculation by\r\nbuilder) but&nbsp;&nbsp;inspite of assurance of handing over the possession and\r\nregistry of the said unit within 30&nbsp;days of full and final payment,\r\nregistry of flat is not done till date.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br>\r\n<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n<!--[endif]--></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Since builder was\r\ndelaying the registry of flat I had personally visited builder\'s office\r\non&nbsp;26/03/2018 to get the registry done at my own but i was&nbsp;denied to\r\ndo so and i was told that registry will be done by builder only. Inspite of my\r\nregular followups builder has not confirmed me registry amount and finally in\r\nMay \'2018 i was told to pay registry amount after adjusting delayed penalty\r\ntill May \'2018 ( as&nbsp;builder knew that flat is not ready\r\nor&nbsp;relevant&nbsp;approvals were not taken hence paid\r\ndelayed&nbsp;penalty&nbsp;till May\'2018)&nbsp;and cheque No.002306 dated\r\n27/05/2018 was paid to builder on 24/05/2018.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br>\r\n<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n<!--[endif]--></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Regret to inform you\r\nthat inspite of my regular followups with builder since Jan \'2018,&nbsp; i am\r\nalways been given next month\'s date for registry which makes me feel that\r\nbuilder is either&nbsp;unnecessarily&nbsp;harassing me or he does not\r\nhave&nbsp; relevant&nbsp;approvals due to which registry of property is not\r\nbeing done till today. Needless to say that&nbsp;government&nbsp;is also loosing\r\nrevenue due to non registry of flats inspite of taking full and final payments\r\nby builder from customers around 9 months back.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br>\r\n<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n<!--[endif]--></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Further It is\r\nmore&nbsp;painful&nbsp;that builder has already charged one year advance\r\nmaintenance&nbsp;charges from me without getting the registry done till\r\ndate&nbsp;due to which i am getting&nbsp;mentally harassed and&nbsp;incurring\r\nfinancial loss as i am not able to rent out my property.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Builder\r\nshould clarify how and on what basis letter for offer of possession was issued\r\nto me in Oct \'2017 when relevant approvals were not taken by builder.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br>\r\n<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n<!--[endif]--></span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Since\r\nbuilder has already charged me full payment of flat i.e. Rs. 3121004 in Jan\r\n\'2018 and i have already paid registry amount to&nbsp; builder in May \'2018 for\r\nregistry moreover builder has charged me one year advance\r\nmaintenance&nbsp;charges i.e Rs. 29520/- in JULY \'2018 but builder has failed\r\nto get the registry done till date due to which i am getting mentally harassed\r\n&amp; incurring financial loss as i am not able to rent out my property hence\r\nbuilder should&nbsp;pay penalty equivalent to monthly rent i.e.12000/- per month\r\nfrom June \'2018 till the time registry of my flat is not done and interest @\r\n24% on Rs.2,66,873/- amount charged from me which was actually payable at the\r\ntime of actual possession of flat.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>',3121004.00,3121004.00,'2015-03-29 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2012-03-29 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','UNIT NO.704, TOWER - H, SEVENTH FLOOR, IMPERIAL HEIGHTS, SECTOR-115, MOHALI, PUNJAB','','',1,0,0,0,'AMANDEEPJASWAL','2018-09-18 11:06:45.000','AMANDEEPJASWAL','2018-09-18 11:06:45.000'),(86,1043,'1043',1108,'bf5a9f59-eaa5-435c-93e6-da29c1986f5d','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','AMAN DEEP  JASWAL','amanjaswal@rediffmail.com',9811227230,0,0,'G-149 ','PREET VIHAR',10,189,'110092','1','G-149 ','PREET VIHAR',10,189,'110092','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0046','Imperial Heights /\r\nWWICS Estates Pvt. Ltd','Col BS Sandhu (Retd.)','info@wwicsestates.com',9357993579,1726663600,'WWICS Estates Pvt. Ltd.','A12, Industrial Area, PhaseVI, Mohali,',28,507,'160055','1','WWICS Estates Pvt. Ltd.','A12, Industrial Area, PhaseVI, Mohali,',28,507,'160055','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">I had received letter of\r\noffer of possession dated : 31/10/2017 against which all due&nbsp;payment to\r\nbuilder was made on 14/01/2018 (after receipt of payment calculation by\r\nbuilder) but&nbsp;&nbsp;inspite of assurance of handing over the possession and\r\nregistry of the said unit within 30&nbsp;days of full and final payment,\r\nregistry of flat is not done till date.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br>\r\n<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n<!--[endif]--></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Since builder was\r\ndelaying the registry of flat I had personally visited builder\'s office\r\non&nbsp;26/03/2018 to get the registry done at my own but i was&nbsp;denied to\r\ndo so and i was told that registry will be done by builder only. Inspite of my\r\nregular followups builder has not confirmed me registry amount and finally in\r\nMay \'2018 i was told to pay registry amount after adjusting delayed penalty\r\ntill May \'2018 ( as&nbsp;builder knew that flat is not ready\r\nor&nbsp;relevant&nbsp;approvals were not taken hence paid\r\ndelayed&nbsp;penalty&nbsp;till May\'2018)&nbsp;and cheque No.002306 dated\r\n27/05/2018 was paid to builder on 24/05/2018.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br>\r\n<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n<!--[endif]--></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Regret to inform you\r\nthat inspite of my regular followups with builder since Jan \'2018,&nbsp; i am\r\nalways been given next month\'s date for registry which makes me feel that\r\nbuilder is either&nbsp;unnecessarily&nbsp;harassing me or he does not\r\nhave&nbsp; relevant&nbsp;approvals due to which registry of property is not\r\nbeing done till today. Needless to say that&nbsp;government&nbsp;is also\r\nloosing revenue due to non registry of flats inspite of taking full and final\r\npayments by builder from customers around 9 months back.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\