\r\nbuilder should&nbsp;pay penalty equivalent to monthly rent i.e.12000/- per\r\nmonth from June \'2018 till the time registry of my flat is not done and\r\ninterest @ 24% on Rs.2,66,873/- amount charged from me which was actually\r\npayable at the time of actual possession of flat.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>',3121004.00,3121004.00,'2015-03-29 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2012-03-29 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','UNIT NO.704, TOWER - H, SEVENTH FLOOR, IMPERIAL HEIGHTS, SECTOR-115, MOHALI, PUNJAB','','',1,0,0,0,'AMANDEEPJASWAL','2018-09-18 13:01:15.000','AMANDEEPJASWAL','2018-09-18 13:01:15.000'),(89,1045,'1045',1108,'bf5a9f59-eaa5-435c-93e6-da29c1986f5d','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','AMAN DEEP  JASWAL','amanjaswal@rediffmail.com',9811227230,0,0,'G-149 ','PREET VIHAR',10,189,'110092','1','G-149 ','PREET VIHAR',10,189,'110092','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0046','Imperial Heights /\r\nWWICS Estates Pvt. Ltd\r\n','Col BS Sandhu (Retd.)','info@wwicsestates.com',9357993579,1726663600,'WWICS Estates Pvt. Ltd.','A12, Industrial Area, PhaseVI, Mohali,',28,507,'160055','1','WWICS Estates Pvt. Ltd.','A12, Industrial Area, PhaseVI, Mohali,',28,507,'160055','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">I had received letter of\r\noffer of possession dated : 31/10/2017 against which all due&nbsp;payment to\r\nbuilder was made on 14/01/2018 (after receipt of payment calculation by\r\nbuilder) but&nbsp;&nbsp;inspite of assurance of handing over the possession and\r\nregistry of the said unit within 30&nbsp;days of full and final payment, registry\r\nof flat is not done till date.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br>\r\n<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n<!--[endif]--></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Since builder was\r\ndelaying the registry of flat I had personally visited builder\'s office\r\non&nbsp;26/03/2018 to get the registry done at my own but i was&nbsp;denied to\r\ndo so and i was told that registry will be done by builder only. Inspite of my\r\nregular followups builder has not confirmed me registry amount and finally in\r\nMay \'2018 i was told to pay registry amount after adjusting delayed penalty\r\ntill May \'2018 ( as&nbsp;builder knew that flat is not ready or&nbsp;relevant&nbsp;approvals\r\nwere not taken hence paid delayed&nbsp;penalty&nbsp;till May\'2018)&nbsp;and\r\ncheque No.002306 dated 27/05/2018 was paid to builder on 24/05/2018.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br>\r\n<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n<!--[endif]--></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Regret to inform you\r\nthat inspite of my regular followups with builder since Jan \'2018,&nbsp; i am\r\nalways been given next month\'s date for registry which makes me feel that\r\nbuilder is either&nbsp;unnecessarily&nbsp;harassing me or he does not\r\nhave&nbsp; relevant&nbsp;approvals due to which registry of property is not\r\nbeing done till today. Needless to say that&nbsp;government&nbsp;is also\r\nloosing revenue due to non registry of flats inspite of taking full and final\r\npayments by builder from customers around 9 months back.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br>\r\n<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n<!--[endif]--></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Further It is\r\nmore&nbsp;painful&nbsp;that builder has already charged one year advance\r\nmaintenance&nbsp;charges from me without getting the registry done till\r\ndate&nbsp;due to which i am getting&nbsp;mentally harassed and&nbsp;incurring\r\nfinancial loss as i am not able to rent out my property.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Builder\r\nshould clarify how and on what basis letter for offer of possession was issued\r\nto me in Oct \'2017 when relevant approvals were not taken by builder.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br>\r\n<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n<!--[endif]--></span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Since\r\nbuilder has already charged me full payment of flat i.e. Rs. 3121004 in Jan\r\n\'2018 and i have already paid registry amount to&nbsp; builder in May \'2018 for\r\nregistry moreover builder has charged me one year advance\r\nmaintenance&nbsp;charges i.e Rs. 29520/- in JULY \'2018 but builder has failed\r\nto get the registry done till date due to which i am getting mentally harassed\r\n&amp; incurring financial loss as i am not able to rent out my property hence\r\nbuilder should&nbsp;pay penalty equivalent to monthly rent i.e.12000/- per\r\nmonth from June \'2018 till the time registry of my flat is not done and\r\ninterest @ 24% on Rs.2,66,873/- amount charged from me which was actually\r\npayable at the time of actual possession of flat.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>',3121004.00,3121004.00,'2015-03-29 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2012-03-29 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','UNIT NO.704, TOWER - H, SEVENTH FLOOR, IMPERIAL HEIGHTS, SECTOR-115, MOHALI, PUNJAB','','',1,0,0,0,'AMANDEEPJASWAL','2018-09-18 14:29:56.000','AMANDEEPJASWAL','2018-09-18 14:29:56.000'),(90,1046,'1046',1119,'dae2bb68-2fa2-473d-a49d-c15de93bd3da','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-09-27 07:47:23.000','RAVINDERPAL SINGH','advravinder@gmail.com',9815700280,0,0,'D-711, Ravindra Apartments, Ravindra Enclave, Baltana','ZIrakpur',28,507,'140604','1','D-711, Ravindra Apartments, Ravindra Enclave, Baltana','ZIrakpur',28,507,'140604','RAVINDER PAL SINGH & MANOJ VASHISHTHA','advravinder@gmail.com',9815700280,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PC0076','ANSAL LOTUS MELANGE PROJECTS PVT. LTD.','ANSAL LOTUS MELANGE PROJECTS PVT. LTD.','',0,0,'SCO NO. 183-184, SECTOR 9-C, CHANDIGARH','',6,128,'160009','1','SCO NO. 183-184, SECTOR 9-C, CHANDIGARH','',6,128,'160009','1','COMPLAINANT IS CLAIMING THE ASSURED RETURN FROM THE PROMOTER WHICH WAS STOPPED W.E.F. 01.07.2016 AND POSSESSION OF THE COMERCIAL SPACE/ UNIT/ SHOWROOM.&nbsp;','<p>SEEKING ASSURED RETURN AMOUNTING TO RS.9,23,546/- DUE W.E.F. 01.07.2016 TILL 31.08.2018 AND FUTURE ASSURED RETURNS TILL ACTUAL POSSESSION OF SHOWROOM. ALSO SEEKING COMPENSATION OF RS.15,00,000/- AND RS,1,10,000/- AS COST OF LITIGATION.&nbsp;</p>',2500000.00,2430890.00,'2015-06-08 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2012-06-08 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','03 SF, CITY CENTRE, SECTOR 115 MOHALI, ANSAL LOTUS MELANGE PROJECTS PVT LTD','','',2,0,0,0,'advravinder','2018-09-20 20:54:23.000','advravinder','2018-09-20 20:54:23.000'),(91,1047,'1047',1119,'dae2bb68-2fa2-473d-a49d-c15de93bd3da','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-09-27 07:45:41.000','RAVINDERPAL SINGH','advravinder@gmail.com',9815700280,0,0,'D-711, Ravindra Apartments, Ravindra Enclave, Baltana','ZIrakpur',28,507,'140604','1','D-711, Ravindra Apartments, Ravindra Enclave, Baltana','ZIrakpur',28,507,'160009','Ravinderpal Singh','advravinder@gmail.com',9815700280,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PC0076','CITY CENTRE ','ANSAL LOTUS MELANGE PROJECTS PVT. LTD.','',0,0,'SCO 183-184, SECTOR 9-C CHANDIGARH','',6,128,'160009','1','SCO 183-184, SECTOR 9-C CHANDIGARH','',6,128,'160009','1','<p>CLAIMING ASSURED RETURN AS PROMISED UNDER THE AGREEMENT AMOUNTING TO RS.923546 DUE W.E.F. 01.07.2016 TILL 31.08.2018.</p>','<p>RS.15,00,000/- FOR HARRASSMENT AND RS.1,10,000/- FOR LITIGATION EXPENSES.</p>',2500000.00,2430890.00,'2015-06-08 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2012-06-08 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','SF-03, CITY CENTRE SECTOR 115 MOHALI','','',2,0,0,0,'advravinder','2018-09-21 08:59:44.000','advravinder','2018-09-21 08:59:44.000'),(92,1048,'1048',1106,'0fa4919e-f07b-4736-b6c4-5b115fc41a37','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Hardeep Singh','hardeep.licdo@gmail.com',8146320007,1765250553,606394546303,'VPO.Sohana, Sector.77','Mohali',28,507,'140308','1','Asst. Branch Manager','LIC of India, Mandi Gobindgarh, Distt- FatehGarh Sahib',28,204,'147301','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0091','BABA BANDA SINGH BAHADUR ENTERPRISES','Sukhchain Singh and Hoshiar Singh','bbsbikpmohali@gmail.com',9888033671,0,'M/S Baba Banda Singh Bahadur Enterprises','Vill.Chapparchiri Kalan( H.B.No.195), Sector.92, Distt.SAS Nagar Mohali',28,507,'140308','1','M/S Baba Banda Singh Bahadur Enterprises','Vill.Chapparchiri Kalan( H.B.No.195), Sector.92, Distt.SAS Nagar Mohali',28,507,'140308','1','<p>With due respect I want to explain each fact as given below;</p><p><br></p><p>1. That I have been harrassed by them very much since I booked two plots at POSH city of the above promoter on date 3.7.2017 as per the advertisement given by them on facebook and also at location before allotment of RERA No. Which falls under PB RERA Act 2016( as no promoter can advertise before RERA Approval)</p><p><br></p><p>2. That the two plots having No.158 on my wife name and No.124 on myself Name were alloted to me by them through the payment of Rs 100000 via cheque No. 971350 dt 3.7.17 and Rs 375000 via cheque No. 023730 dated 3.7.17 on the name of Baba Banda Singh Bahadur Enterprises which got cleared.</p><p><br></p><p>3. That both of them explain me that the project is RERA approved and got No very soon and you will got possession within 1 year upto 30.6.2018 but they got totally failed in doing so.</p><p><br></p><p>4. That they again demanded from me Rs 844360 via cheque No. 023731 dt 13.9.17 which also got cleared as to complete25% of Amount without doing any progress of the project and till this date also were unable to get RERA No.</p><p><br></p><p>5.That I have paid Total Amount of Rs. 13,19,360 &nbsp;till 13.9.2017 to them through all my cheques.</p><p><br></p><p>6. That they totally misleaded , misguided and also harrassed and tortured me mentally, when I visited there many times for getting LOI and Agreement documents since 1 year and 3 months.</p><p><br></p><p>7. That they have changed the maps of project many times and now they have started constructing Independent Floors (S+4) on the location of my booked plot No.124 and givent the contract to ACHME Ltd. &nbsp;without any intimation to me.</p><p><br></p><p>8. That the time of 1 year got passed and they totally failed even in refunding my Amount of Rs 1319360 with interest@18% plus harrassement Amount of Rs 200000 also, as I have requested to refund the amount through my mail send to them on 15.8.18.</p><p><br></p><p>9. I request yourself to help me in refunding my Amount with interest @18%plus harrassement Charge equal to 18 lakh.</p><p><br></p><p>Thanks</p><p><br></p><p>Regards</p><p><br></p><p>Hardeep Singh</p>','<p>I want to explain that;</p><p><br></p><p>1.In view of my above explaination the Promoter totally failed in providing Service to Customers and also unable to refund the amount after the notice of 15days which very well falls under National Consumer Act 1986.</p><p><br></p><p>2.And also they have given advertisements for promotion of the project before 1 year without RERA Approval. Which very well falls under PB RERA Act 2016.</p><p><br></p><p>3. That they have been harrassed me very much by giving false statements and also tortured me mentally by saying that you can do anything and God will teach me lesson. I dont know what I have done wrong by paying them Rs 1319360. And I got problem of high BP and hypertension due to their mentally torture to me. I am now taking medicines due to them. So kindly fine them Rs 200000 for &nbsp;harrassement and mentally torture to me.</p><p><br></p><p>4. That the Amount with interest @18% rounded to Rs 16 lakh plus Rs 2lakh as harrassement and mentally torture Charges is equal to Rs 18 lakh.</p><p><br></p><p>5. Please help me in refunding my this Amount ov Rs 18 lakh from them.</p><p><br></p><p>I shall be thankful to you.</p><p>Please help me in refunding my whole amount of Rs 1319360 with interest @18% Plus harrassement and mentally torture charge of Rs 2 lakh.</p><p><br></p><p>Total Amount Rs 18 lakh.</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you</p><p><br></p><p>Regards</p><p><br></p><p>Hardeep Singh</p>',4750000.00,1319360.00,'2018-07-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2017-07-03 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','124 and 158','','',1,0,0,0,'HSToor','2018-09-23 20:46:24.000','HSToor','2018-09-23 20:46:24.000'),(93,1031,'1031',1022,'33a0ed60-04ed-4ddd-b47a-6c6e5113bf37','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Nikhil Juneja','nikhil_sp1@yahoo.com',8699499940,0,0,'128, Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','1','128, Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-JAL33-PM0077','Old Jail Site, Jalandhar','PUNJAB URBAN PLANNING AND DEVELOPMENT AUTHORITY','ca@puda.gov.in',0,0,'PUDA BHAWAN SECTOR- 62','SAS NAGAR MOHALI',28,507,'160062','1','PUDA BHAWAN SECTOR- 62','SAS NAGAR MOHAL',28,507,'160062','1','<p>\r\n		\r\n	\r\n	\r\n		</p><div class=\"page\" title=\"Page 2\">\r\n			<div class=\"layoutArea\">\r\n				<div class=\"column\">\r\n					<p><font face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">I purchased plot number 65C at Old Jail site (As known as PUDA SPORTS ENCLAVE), Jalandhar on 22/04/2016 via PUDA auction.</span><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\">&nbsp;The price of the plot was Rs 1,14,02,358 excluding the cess. The size of the plot is 222.92 sq. mtrs.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">On 17/08/2016\r\nI received the allotment letter (Annexure A)&nbsp; in which it was mentioned that the possession shall be handed over within 1\r\nyear of the Auction. I paid&nbsp; The possession has been delayed by over 2 years. I was offered possession on\r\n26/06/2018.&nbsp;</span></font></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</div>\r\n		</div>','<p>\r\n		\r\n	\r\n	\r\n		</p><div class=\"page\" title=\"Page 2\">\r\n			<div class=\"layoutArea\">\r\n				<div class=\"column\">\r\n					<p><span style=\"font-size: 11.000000pt; font-family: \'Helvetica\'\">PUDA should pay me penalty for delaying the possession @18% PA on the\r\nmonthly compounding basis. This had put me in significant financial constraints and mental stress. PUDA should be\r\npenalised with mental harassment fee of 5 Lakhs.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</div>\r\n		</div>',11402358.00,11406647.61,'2017-04-22 00:00:00.000','2018-06-26 00:00:00.000','','1','','2016-08-17 00:00:00','2016-04-22 00:00:00','65C Old Jail Site, Jalandhar.','','',2,0,0,0,'nikhil_sp1','2018-09-27 11:20:05.000','nikhil_sp1','2018-09-27 11:20:05.000'),(94,1031,'1031',1022,'33a0ed60-04ed-4ddd-b47a-6c6e5113bf37','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Nikhil Juneja','nikhil_sp1@yahoo.com',8699499940,0,0,'128, Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','1','128, Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-JAL33-PM0077','Old Jail Site, Jalandhar','PUNJAB URBAN PLANNING AND DEVELOPMENT AUTHORITY','ca@puda.gov.in',0,0,'PUDA BHAWAN SECTOR- 62','SAS NAGAR MOHALI',28,507,'160062','1','PUDA BHAWAN SECTOR- 62','SAS NAGAR MOHAL',28,507,'160062','1','<p>\r\n		\r\n	\r\n	\r\n		</p><div class=\"page\" title=\"Page 2\">\r\n			<div class=\"layoutArea\">\r\n				<div class=\"column\">\r\n					<p><font face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">I purchased plot number 65C at Old Jail site (As known as PUDA SPORTS ENCLAVE), Jalandhar on 22/04/2016 via PUDA auction.</span><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\">&nbsp;The price of the plot was Rs 1,14,02,358 excluding the cess. The cess amount was Rs 2,28,047. The size of the plot is 222.92 sq. mtrs.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">On 17/08/2016\r\nI received the allotment letter (Annexure A)&nbsp; in which it was mentioned that the possession shall be handed over within 1\r\nyear of the Auction. Details of the instalments are attached in Annexure B (Payment Schedule for Plot 65 C Old Jail Site Jalandhar). All the payments except TDS deposited on 14/04/2018 Annexcure C (Form 16B) are also shown in the Ledger download from PUDA/JDA website (Annexure D). The possession has been delayed by over 2 years. I was offered possession on\r\n26/06/2018.&nbsp;</span></font></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</div>\r\n		</div>','<p>\r\n		\r\n	\r\n	\r\n		</p><div class=\"page\" title=\"Page 2\">\r\n			<div class=\"layoutArea\">\r\n				<div class=\"column\">\r\n					<p><span style=\"font-size: 11.000000pt; font-family: \'Helvetica\'\">PUDA should pay me penalty for delaying the possession @18% PA on the\r\nmonthly compounding basis. This had put me in significant financial constraints and mental stress. PUDA should be\r\npenalised with mental harassment fee of 5 Lakhs.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</div>\r\n		</div>',11402358.00,11406647.61,'2017-04-22 00:00:00.000','2018-06-26 00:00:00.000','','1','','2016-08-17 00:00:00','2016-04-22 00:00:00','65C Old Jail Site, Jalandhar.','','',2,0,0,0,'nikhil_sp1','2018-09-27 11:38:25.000','nikhil_sp1','2018-09-27 11:38:25.000'),(95,1031,'1031',1022,'33a0ed60-04ed-4ddd-b47a-6c6e5113bf37','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Nikhil Juneja','nikhil_sp1@yahoo.com',8699499940,0,0,'128, Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','1','128, Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-JAL33-PM0077','Old Jail Site, Jalandhar','PUNJAB URBAN PLANNING AND DEVELOPMENT AUTHORITY','ca@puda.gov.in',0,0,'PUDA BHAWAN SECTOR- 62','SAS NAGAR MOHALI',28,507,'160062','1','PUDA BHAWAN SECTOR- 62','SAS NAGAR MOHALI',28,507,'160062','1','<p>\r\n		\r\n	\r\n	\r\n		</p><div class=\"page\" title=\"Page 2\">\r\n			<div class=\"layoutArea\">\r\n				<div class=\"column\">\r\n					<p><font face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">I purchased plot number 65C at Old Jail site (As known as PUDA SPORTS ENCLAVE), Jalandhar on 22/04/2016 via PUDA auction.</span><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\">&nbsp;The price of the plot was Rs 1,14,02,358 excluding the cess. The cess amount was Rs 2,28,047. The size of the plot is 222.92 sq. mtrs.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">On 17/08/2016\r\nI received the allotment letter (Annexure A) in which it was mentioned that the possession shall be handed over within 1\r\nyear of the Auction. Details of the instalments are attached in Annexure B (Payment Schedule for Plot 65 C Old Jail Site Jalandhar). All the payments except TDS deposited on 14/04/2018 Annexure C (Form 16B) are also shown in the Ledger download from PUDA/JDA website (Annexure D). The possession was delayed by over 2 years. I was offered possession on\r\n26/06/2018. I would like to keep the plot and not withdraw from the project.</span></font></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</div>\r\n		</div>','<p>\r\n		\r\n	\r\n	\r\n		</p><div class=\"page\" title=\"Page 2\">\r\n			<div class=\"layoutArea\">\r\n				<div class=\"column\">\r\n					<p><font face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">I seek relief of interest on principal amount paid by me for delay the possession @18% PA on the\r\nmonthly compounding basis. This has put me in significant financial constraints, physical and mental stress. I also seek compensation of Rs 5 Lakh for Physical and metal stress for being dragged in the litigation to seek relief through this </span><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\">complaint</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">.&nbsp;</span></font></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</div>\r\n		</div>',11402358.00,11406647.61,'2017-04-22 00:00:00.000','2018-06-26 00:00:00.000','','1','','2016-08-17 00:00:00','2016-04-22 00:00:00','65C Old Jail Site, Jalandhar.','','',2,0,0,0,'nikhil_sp1','2018-09-27 12:17:07.000','nikhil_sp1','2018-09-27 12:17:07.000'),(96,1049,'1049',1128,'a4ac97e3-07e5-4f6d-b74a-357542a284dd','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Harpreet Gill','gill.harpreet2809@gmail.com',9815998858,0,0,'H.No. 65','Sector - 05, Chandigarh.',6,128,'160015','1','H.No. 65','Sector - 05, Chandigarh.',6,128,'160015','Advocate Varun Luthra','advocate_varunl@hotmail.com',9815998858,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0119','THE VIEWS, MOHALI HILLS, Sector - 105, MOHALI.','Through Rajesh Gupta, EMAAR MGF Land Ltd., Mohali.','mohalihills@emaarmgf.com',0,0,'EMAAR MGF Land Ltd., Office No. 40, Central Plaza, ','Mohali Hills, Sector - 105, SAS Nagar Mohali.',28,507,'140603','1','EMAAR MGF Land Ltd., Office No. 40, Central Plaza, ','Mohali Hills, Sector - 105, SAS Nagar Mohali.',28,507,'140603','1','<p>That the above said unit was purchased by the father of the complaint namely Sh. S.S.Gill and the complainant himself in the year January, 2008. That the complainant being NRI, invested in this project, keeping in view the goodwill of the company.&nbsp; The complainant and his father paid 95% of the consideration amountto the tune of Rs. 4840807/- (Fourty Eight Lakhs Fourty Thousand Eight Hundred and Seven Rupees only) as down payment . The total consideration was Rs. 5118516/- (Fifty one Lakh Eighteen Thousand Five Hundred and Sixteen only). That thereafter a provisional allotment dated 31-01-2008 was issued by the respondent company and soon after and agreement dated 28-0 2-2008 was executed through the authorized signatory. That the agreement, as per clause 21, clearly stated about the possession of the unit. that the father of the complainant, who was of an old age, died in April, 2012, but till then the company was not able to hand over the physical possession of the unit as per the terms and conditions envisaged in the agreement.</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; The complainant&nbsp;&nbsp;as and when visited to India. used to visit the project and always found that no work is being carried out qua the unit. The respondent also did not take appropriate steps to complete the project and hand over the unit within a stipulated period. As a result over a period of time the project lost its sheen and trust over the investors. It was early this year, when the complainant visited the project and found no one to give a concrete answer in terms of the delay of the project, not only this, the material applied in the unit is of sub-standard quality and not upto mark. The complainant then decided to withdraw his and his father\'s hard earned money from the project and hence the present complaint is being filed. That great prejudice has been caused to the complainant, not only in terms of Interest on money Invested, but in terms of&nbsp; Return on Investment for period of last ten years till date.&nbsp;</p>','<p>That the complainant prays for refund of the amount with interest @18% from the date of deposit till realisation along with additional compensation of Rs. 10,00,000/- (Rs.Ten Lakhs), and litigation charges to the tune of Rs. 55000/- (Rs. Fifty Five Thousand) and any other relief which this Ho\'nble Court deems fit for the complainant as per the facts of the complaint stated therein. That the complainant is seeking the refund till date, not only prejudice has been caused to the complainant in terms of the interest on the Investment, if it would have been invested somewhere else, where it would have fetched a handsome amount, but also a handsome Return on Investment, which is blocked with the respondent company for the last Ten Years, as it seems that no Law is applicable on such type of respondents, who not only make lame excuses, but also try to keep their investors in dark, meaning thereby it seems that the investors have not only made a wrong decision in terms of investment, but also have been cheated on account of negligence and deficiency in service on part of the respondent.<br><br></p>',5118516.00,4840807.00,'2011-01-30 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2008-01-31 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','H1-F09-903, Tower H, The Views,  Mohali Hills, Sector-105, SAS Nagar Mohali - 140306.\r\n','','',2,0,0,0,'GILL.Harpreet2809','2018-09-28 20:16:26.000','GILL.Harpreet2809','2018-09-28 20:16:26.000'