blocked with the respondent company for the last Ten Years, as it seems that no Law is applicable on such type of respondents, who not only make lame excuses, but also try to keep their investors in dark, meaning thereby it seems that the investors have not only made a wrong decision in terms of investment, but also have been cheated on account of negligence and deficiency in service on part of the respondent.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;mso-bidi-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>',5118516.00,4840807.00,'2011-01-30 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2008-01-31 00:00:00','2008-01-31 00:00:00','K3-F07-701, The View, Mohali Hills, Sector 105, SAS Nagar Mohali.\r\n','','',1,1,0,0,'gill.barjinderpaulsingh0110','2018-10-01 19:40:08.000','gill.barjinderpaulsingh0110','2018-10-01 19:40:08.000'),(101,1031,'1031',1022,'33a0ed60-04ed-4ddd-b47a-6c6e5113bf37','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Nikhil Juneja','nikhil_sp1@yahoo.com',8699499940,0,0,'128, Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','1','128, Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-JAL33-PM0077','Old Jail Site, Jalandhar','PUNJAB URBAN PLANNING AND DEVELOPMENT AUTHORITY','ca@puda.gov.in',0,0,'PUDA BHAWAN SECTOR- 62','SAS NAGAR MOHALI',28,507,'160062','1','PUDA BHAWAN SECTOR- 62','SAS NAGAR MOHALI',28,507,'160062','1','<p>\r\n		\r\n	\r\n	\r\n		</p><div class=\"page\" title=\"Page 2\">\r\n			<div class=\"layoutArea\">\r\n				<div class=\"column\">\r\n					<p><font face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">I purchased plot number 65C at Old Jail site (As known as PUDA SPORTS ENCLAVE), Jalandhar on 22/04/2016 via PUDA auction.</span><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\">&nbsp;The price of the plot was Rs 1,14,02,358 excluding the cess. The cess amount was Rs 2,28,047. The size of the plot is 222.92 sq. mtrs.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">On 17/08/2016\r\nI received the allotment letter (Annexure A) in which it was mentioned that the possession shall be handed over within 1\r\nyear of the Auction. Details of the instalments are attached in Annexure B (Payment Schedule for Plot 65 C Old Jail Site Jalandhar). All the payments except TDS deposited on 14/04/2018 Annexure C (Form 16B) are also shown in the Ledger download from PUDA/JDA website (Annexure D). The possession was delayed by over 2 years and 2 months. I was offered possession on\r\n26/06/2018. Attached is the possession letter (Annexure E). I would like to keep the plot and not withdraw from the project.</span></font></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</div>\r\n		</div>','<p>\r\n		\r\n	\r\n	\r\n		</p><div class=\"page\" title=\"Page 2\">\r\n			<div class=\"layoutArea\">\r\n				<div class=\"column\">\r\n					<p><font face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">I seek relief of interest on principal amount paid by me for delay the possession @18% PA on the\r\nmonthly compounding basis. This delay has put me in significant financial constraints, physical and mental stress. I also seek compensation of Rs 5 Lakh for Physical and metal stress for being dragged in the litigation to seek relief through this </span><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\">complaint</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">.&nbsp;</span></font></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</div>\r\n		</div>',11402358.00,11406647.61,'2017-04-22 00:00:00.000','2018-06-26 00:00:00.000','','1','','2016-08-17 00:00:00','2016-04-22 00:00:00','65C Old Jail Site, Jalandhar.','','',2,0,0,0,'nikhil_sp1','2018-10-03 12:09:29.000','nikhil_sp1','2018-10-03 12:09:29.000'),(102,1031,'1031',1022,'33a0ed60-04ed-4ddd-b47a-6c6e5113bf37','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Nikhil Juneja','nikhil_sp1@yahoo.com',8699499940,0,0,'128, Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','1','128, Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-JAL33-PM0077','Old Jail Site, Jalandhar','PUNJAB URBAN PLANNING AND DEVELOPMENT AUTHORITY','ca@puda.gov.in',