he possession letter (Annexure E). I would like to keep the plot and not withdraw from the project.</span></font></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</div>\r\n		</div>','<p>\r\n		\r\n	\r\n	\r\n		</p><div class=\"page\" title=\"Page 2\">\r\n			<div class=\"layoutArea\">\r\n				<div class=\"column\">\r\n					<p><font face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">I seek relief of interest on principal amount paid by me for delay the possession @18% PA on the\r\nmonthly compounding basis. This delay has put me in significant financial constraints, physical and mental stress. I also seek compensation of Rs 5 Lakh for Physical and metal stress for being dragged in the litigation to seek relief through this </span><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\">complaint</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">.&nbsp;</span></font></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</div>\r\n		</div>',11402358.00,11406647.61,'2017-04-22 00:00:00.000','2018-06-26 00:00:00.000','','1','','2016-08-17 00:00:00','2016-04-22 00:00:00','65C Old Jail Site, Jalandhar.','','',2,0,0,0,'nikhil_sp1','2018-10-03 12:45:33.000','nikhil_sp1','2018-10-03 12:45:33.000'),(104,1031,'1031',1022,'33a0ed60-04ed-4ddd-b47a-6c6e5113bf37','FormTypeN',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Nikhil Juneja','nikhil_sp1@yahoo.com',8699499940,0,0,'128, Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','1','128, Shakti Nagar','',28,261,'144001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-JAL33-PM0077','Old Jail Site, Jalandhar','PUNJAB URBAN PLANNING AND DEVELOPMENT AUTHORITY','ca@puda.gov.in',0,0,'PUDA BHAWAN SECTOR- 62','SAS NAGAR MOHALI',28,507,'160062','1','PUDA BHAWAN SECTOR- 62','SAS NAGAR MOHALI',28,507,'160062','1','<p>\r\n		\r\n	\r\n	\r\n		</p><div class=\"page\" title=\"Page 2\">\r\n			<div class=\"layoutArea\">\r\n				<div class=\"column\">\r\n					<p><font face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">I purchased plot number 65C at Old Jail site (As known as PUDA SPORTS ENCLAVE), Jalandhar on 22/04/2016 via PUDA auction.</span><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\">&n