'Punjabi Mohalla, Ambala Cantt.',13,1,'133001','1','5368-C, Nicholson Road','Punjabi Mohalla, Ambala Cantt.',13,1,'133001','Jarnail Singh Thakur, Advocate','jarnailthakur@yahoo.com',9815695783,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0010','FASHION TECHNOLOGY PARK','CHANDIGARH OVERSEAS PVT. LTD.SCO 196-197, TOP FLOOR, SECTOR 34, CHANDIGARH','chdoverseas@gmail.com',9999999999,0,'SCO 196-197, TOP FLOOR, SECTOR 34, CHANDIGARH','',6,128,'160022','0','SCO 196-197, TOP FLOOR, SECTOR 34, CHANDIGARH','',6,128,'160022','1','<p>The complainant booked 4 units of 100 sq. feet each on 02.09.2006 in Fashion Technology Park in sector 90, Mohali promoted by Chandigarh Overseas private Limited, SCO 196-197, Sector 34, Chandigarh.&nbsp; The 4 units were allotted on 08.12.2006 in Design Studio no. 6 Block A-2 on 5th floor in the project. The project was to be completed by 19.07.2009. The complainant paid a sum of Rs. 19.00 lacs out of total price of Rs. 20.00 lacs. Possession was to be delivered by 19.07.2009 but the same was not done. The respondents kept on assuring the complainant to deliver the possession soon. The respondents offered the buy back option to the complainant vide their letter dated 13.01.2010 whereby they offered to purchase the units @ 7.50 lac per unit. Accordingly the respondents paid a sum of rs.7.50 lac to complainant in respect of buy back of one unit. They assured to pay for the remaining 3 units very soon, which they never did.&nbsp; The respondents had agreed to pay Rs.50.00 per sq ft per month towards delay charges. They paid Rs. 48388/- vide&nbsp; cheque dated 31.03.2010 towards the delay charges but that was done only once and no payment was made thereafter. Thus the respondents have reneged on their contractual obligations and the complainant is being made to run from pillar to post. The complainant has filed this complaint through his power of attorney holder Sh. Sandeep Jain.</p>','<p>&nbsp;The complainant prays for:</p><p>1.a direction to the respondents to pay Rs. 22.50 lacs towards the buy back of remaining 3 units @ Rs. 7.50 lac per unit along with interest @18% p.a. from date of deposit till actual payment.</p><p>2. a direction to pay compensation in terms of section 18 of RERA and delayed compensation as per clause 28 of the builder buyer agreement @Rs.50.00 per sq ft per month till the payment is made.</p><p>3. a direction to pay a compensation of Rs. 10.00 lacs for causing mental harassment and agony to the complainant.</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;AND</p><p>Any other order in favour of the complainant as this Authority deems fit in the interest of justice.</p><p>Interim order prayed for:</p><p>It is most respectfully prayed that the respondents may please be directed not to cancel, transfer, mortgage, assign, , sell or alienate in any manner the unit 300 sq ft in Design Studio no. 6 in the fashion Technology Park, sector 90, Mohali</p><p><br></p>',2000000.00,1900000.00,'2009-07-19 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2016-12-08 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Design Studio no. 6 4 units of 100 sq ft each in fashion Technology Park, sector 90, Mohali','','',1,0,0,0,'jarnailthakur','2018-10-13 13:19:31.000','jarnailthakur','2018-10-13 13:19:31.000'),(116,1057,'1057',1152,'b523945f-6c84-4b60-989c-1c236269509d','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Raveena  Riar','raveena7riar@yahoo.com',8054055302,0,0,'ATS Golfmeadows Prelude, Apartment number 1412, Tower 14','Derabassi',28,507,'140507','1','ATS Golfmeadows Prelude, Apartment number 1412, Tower 14','Derabassi',28,507,'140507','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0086','CASA ESPANA','Getamber Anand','getamber@atsgreens.com',8288033311,0,'ATS Infrabuild Pvt. Ltd.','C-226 , Sector 44, Noida',33,216,'201301','1','ATS Infrabuild Pvt. Ltd.','C-226 , Sector 44, Noida',33,216,'201301','1','<p>abc</p>','<p>abc</p>',9125000.00,5526546.00,'2017-12-31 00:00:00.00