ot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">We paid an amount of&nbsp;<b>Rs.31,17,513/-</b>&nbsp;(Rupees Thirty One Lac Seventeen Thousands Five Hundred and Thirteen Only) towards part-payment of the total amount on 17.10.2015 before signing an Agreement to Sell (Apartment Buyer Agreement) was duly entered into between the parties and thereafter Allotment letter was issued by the respondents.</li><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">That as per the agreement dated 17.10.2015, the completion of the construction of the apartment has to be completed by December 2017 and the possession of the said apartment was to be delivered to us thereafter i.e. in December, 2017 but till date we have not been offered the possession.<span class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">That after the execution of agreement, we have been duly depositing the demanded instalments of amount with the respondents to the tune of Rs. 55,26,546 out of the total BSP of Rs. 91,25,000. But, still till date the possession of the aforesaid apartment has not been given to them as per the terms of agreement sell dated 17/10/2015.&nbsp;</li></ol>','<p>abc</p>',9125000.00,5526546.00,'2017-12-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2015-01-21 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Apartment No. 05082, 8th Floor, Tower No. 5, ATS Casa Espana','','',2,0,0,0,'RaveenaRiar','2018-10-15 11:12:22.000','RaveenaRiar','2018-10-15 11:12:22.000'),(118,1057,'1057',1152,'b523945f-6c84-4b60-989c-1c236269509d','FormTypeN',1,0,0,