and thereafter Allotment letter was issued by the respondents.</li><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">That as per the agreement dated 17.10.2015, the completion of the construction of the apartment has to be completed by December 2017 and the possession of the said apartment was to be delivered to us thereafter i.e. in December, 2017 but till date we have not been offered the possession.<span class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">That after the execution of agreement, we have been duly depositing the demanded instalments of amount with the respondents to the tune of Rs. 55,26,546 out of the total BSP of Rs. 91,25,000. But, still till date the possession of the aforesaid apartment has not been given to them as per the terms of agreement sell dated 17/10/2015.&nbsp;</li></ol>','<ol class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-ol1\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">Compensation/Interest: That as per the provision of the aforesaid Act and rules made thereunder, we are entitled to claim interest @ 18% per annum from the date of the respective payments till December 2017 and @ 12% p.a. thereafter till the actual date of possession of the said apartment.&nbsp;</li><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">Home Loan:&nbsp;State Bank of India, Branch Panchkula had sanctioned the home loan of Rs 39,14,000/-. A tripartite agreement was duly executed on 24/02/2018. Total disbursement of&nbsp;<b>Rs. 23,12,702 /-</b>&nbsp;to the respondent(s) till date out of their total sanctioned loan.&nbsp;We&nbsp;have been continuously paying an amount of&nbsp;<b>Rs 11,503/-</b>as Interest incurred on the disbursed amount of Rs. 13,38,171/- out of the sanctioned loan. Therefore, the complainant(s)/applicant(s) are also entitled to recover the Interest amount @ Rs 11,503/- from the respondents till date and onwards along with interest amount for the further respective partial payments made to the builder out of the total sanctioned loan as of today the amount which is in the tune of&nbsp;<b>Rs. 9,74,531/-</b>&nbsp;for which the interest will be starting in future.&nbsp;Therefore we&nbsp;are entitled to recover compensation&nbsp;&nbsp;EMI per month paid to the bank.</li><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">HouseRent: Due to non-completion of the construction of the aforesaid apartment, we&nbsp;have been forced to take a flat on rent at above mentioned address and have been paying Rs. 16,500 per month.&nbsp;Therefore we&nbsp;are entitled to recover compensation to the tune of&nbsp;Rs. 16,500 per month</li><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">Mental agony/Legal Fee\'s: We haver&nbsp;suffered severe mental agony and harassment and further had to incur the litigation expenses to pursue the present complaint. Therefore we&nbsp;are entitled to recover compensation to the tune of Rs.5,00,000/- towards mental agony and litigation expenses.</li><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">Contractual Provision: As per Clause 6.3 of Buyer seller agreement i.e&nbsp; Rs 5 per month/per square feet of the Super Built-up Area (2400sqft.)</li></ol>',9125000.00,5526546.00,'2017-12-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2015-01-21 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Apartment No. 05082, 8th Floor, Tower No. 5, ATS Casa Espana','','',2,0,0,0,'RaveenaRiar','2018-10-15 11:12:56.000','RaveenaRiar','2018-10-15 11:12:56.000'),(119,1057,'1057',1152,'b523945f-6c84-4b60-989c-1c236269509d','FormTypeN',1,1,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Raveena  Riar','raveena7riar@yahoo.com',8054055302,0,995421239517,'ATS Golfmeadows Prelude, Apartment number 1412, Tower 14','Derabassi',28,507,'140507','1','ATS Golfmeadows Prelude, Apartment number 1412, Tower 14','Derabassi',28,507,'140507','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0086','CASA ESPANA','Getamber Anand','getamber@atsgreens.com',8288033311,0,'ATS Infrabuild Pvt. Ltd.','C-226 , Sector 44, Noida',33,216,'201301','1','ATS Infrabuild Pvt. Ltd.','C-226 , Sector 44, Noida',33,216,'201301','1','<ol class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-ol1\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helv