gal notice was also served to them in his context on 15.07.2018. The\r\nrespondents had shown no interest to our complaint and have adopted a very\r\nindifferent attitude.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">That due to the deficiency in service\r\non the part of the&nbsp;respondents&nbsp;resulting into a\r\nbig&nbsp;harassment,&nbsp;tension&nbsp;and&nbsp;apprehension&nbsp;as well as monetary\r\nloss, the complainants are entitled to the&nbsp;following&nbsp;reliefs from\r\nthe&nbsp;respondents:</span><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;line-height:normal;tab-stops:14.2pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Immediate&nbsp;possession\r\nof the fully developed&nbsp;apartment&nbsp;as promised by the&nbsp;respondents</span><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">.</span><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;line-height:normal;tab-stops:14.2pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">1. Interest&nbsp;minimum\r\n@12%&nbsp;on the&nbsp;entire amount deposited by the complainants on the date\r\nof deposit till the date of offer of possession. The&nbsp;respondents&nbsp;had\r\ncharged interest @24% PA for the period of delay in the payment of installments\r\nof the consideration price of the&nbsp;apartment</span><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;line-height:normal;tab-stops:14.2pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">2. A\r\nsum of Rs. 5 lacs as compensation on account of harassment, tension and\r\napprehension caused to the complainant due to delay in possession of the\r\napartment</span><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;line-height:normal;tab-stops:14.2pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">3. Legal\r\nExpense to the tune of Rs. 75,000/- for forcing the complainant to enter into\r\nthis uncalled for litigation</span><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:normal;tab-stops:14.2pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">4. Rs. 78,180/- on\r\naccount of loss of rebate on the interest paid on the&nbsp;housing&nbsp;loan\r\ndue to non-delivery of&nbsp;possession&nbsp;by the&nbsp;respondents&nbsp;for\r\nthe years 2016-17 and&nbsp;2017-18 as well as for the period till the date of\r\noffering of&nbsp;possession&nbsp;of the&nbsp;apartment.</span><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:normal;tab-stops:14.2pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">5. Amount of rent\r\nand&nbsp;maintenance&nbsp;charges paid / to be paid by the complaint in respect\r\nof the rented flat where they are presently residing from 01.05.2018, till the\r\ndate of handing over the possession of the&nbsp;apartment.</span><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:normal;tab-stops:14.2pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">6. The&nbsp;respondents&nbsp;to\r\nbe asked to pay the difference of the amount of Service tax &amp; the GST\r\npayable on the&nbsp;balance&nbsp;consideration&nbsp;amount.</span><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">It is therefore prayed that\r\nthe&nbsp;respondents&nbsp;be directed to give the above mention reliefs to the\r\ncomplainants as the&nbsp;complaints&nbsp;are entitled to the above said relief\r\nin&nbsp;lieu&nbsp;of the facts and circumstances explained.</span><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>',6850000.00,6360329.00,'2015-10-05 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2012-08-06 00:00:00','2012-08-06 00:00:00','Flat No H101, Tower H\r\n1st Floor, Sushma Chandigarh Grande, Zirakpur','','',2,0,0,0,'manjit305','2018-10-25 12:52:26.000','manjit305','2018-10-25 12:52:26.000'),(148,1064,'1064',1175,'fdc30a3a-7552-4e5c-8f07-8c6e1d95cb8c','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-13 22:28:17.000','Manjit Singh Chimni','amangr@gmail.com',9855999111,8873092885,409690247527,'Flat No 201, HEWO Apartments','MDC, Sector 6',13,15,'134114','1','Flat No 201, HEWO Apartments','MDC, Sector 6',13,15,'134114','Vaneesh Khanna','vaneeshkhanna@yahoo.co.in',9814301225,7973088659,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0085','SUSHMA CHANDIGARH GRANDE, BY SUSHMA BUILDTECH LTD','SUSHMA BUILDTECH LTD','info@sushmabuildtech.com',7307980092,1724610092,'Unit No B 107, Business Complex at Elante Mall','1st Floor, Industrial Area, Phase 1',6,128,'160002','1','Unit No B 107, Business Complex at Elante Mall','1st Floor, Industrial Area, Phase 1',6,128,'160002','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\