:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;line-height:normal;tab-stops:14.2pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">2. A\r\nsum of Rs. 5 lacs as compensation on account of harassment, tension and\r\napprehension caused to the complainant due to delay in possession of the\r\napartment</span><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;line-height:normal;tab-stops:14.2pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">3. Legal\r\nExpense to the tune of Rs. 75,000/- for forcing the complainant to enter into\r\nthis uncalled for litigation</span><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:normal;tab-stops:14.2pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">4. Rs. 78,180/- on\r\naccount of loss of rebate on the interest paid on the&nbsp;housing&nbsp;loan\r\ndue to non-delivery of&nbsp;possession&nbsp;by the&nbsp;respondents&nbsp;for\r\nthe years 2016-17 and&nbsp;2017-18 as well as for the period till the date of\r\noffering of&nbsp;possession&nbsp;of the&nbsp;apartment.</span><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:normal;tab-stops:14.2pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">5. Amount of rent\r\nand&nbsp;maintenance&nbsp;charges paid / to be paid by the complaint in respect\r\nof the rented flat where they are presently residing from 01.05.2018, till the\r\ndate of handing over the possession of the&nbsp;apartment.</span><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:normal;tab-stops:14.2pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">6. The&nbsp;respondents&nbsp;to\r\nbe asked to pay the difference of the amount of Service tax &amp; the GST\r\npayable on the&nbsp;balance&nbsp;consideration&nbsp;amount.</span><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">It is therefore prayed that\r\nthe&nbsp;respondents&nbsp;be directed to give the above mention reliefs to the\r\ncomplainants as the&nbsp;complaints&nbsp;are entitled to the above said relief\r\nin&nbsp;lieu&nbsp;of the facts and circumstances explained.</span><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>',6850000.00,6360329.00,'2015-10-05 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2012-08-06 00:00:00','2012-08-06 00:00:00','Flat No H101, Tower H\r\n1st Floor, Sushma Chandigarh Grande, Zirakpur','','',2,0,0,0,'manjit305','2018-10-25 12:53:16.000','manjit305','2018-10-25 12:53:16.000'),(149,1057,'1057',1152,'b523945f-6c84-4b60-989c-1c236269509d','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-10-15 17:03:33.000','Raveena  Riar','raveena7riar@yahoo.com',8054055302,0,995421239517,'ATS Golfmeadows Prelude, Apartment number 1412, Tower 14','Derabassi',28,507,'140507','1','ATS Golfmeadows Prelude, Apartment number 1412, Tower 14','Derabassi',28,507,'140507','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0086','CASA ESPANA','Getamber Anand','getamber@atsgreens.com',8288033311,0,'ATS Infrabuild Pvt. Ltd.','C-226 , Sector 44, Noida',33,216,'201301','1','ATS Infrabuild Pvt. Ltd.','C-226 , Sector 44, Noida',33,216,'201301','1','<ol class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-ol1\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">We have booked a 3+1 BHK Residential Apartment No. 05082, 8<sup>th</sup>&nbsp;Floor, Tower No. 5 having Super-built up Area of 2400 sq. ft., Built-up Area of 2087 sq. ft. in the project, Type-B with car-parking space in the project known as&nbsp;<b><i>‘ATS Casa Espana’&nbsp;</i></b>for the basic sale price of Rs. 91,25,000 (Rs. ninty one&nbsp; Lac twenty-Five Thousand Only)<b>&nbsp;</b>developed by the respondents/ developer vide application dated 07.05.2014, situated in village Budmajra, Sector 121 Mohali-160055, SAS Nagar, Punjab.</li><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">We paid an amount of&nbsp;<b>Rs.31,17,513/-</b>&nbsp;(Rupees Thirty One Lac Seventeen Thousands Five Hundred and Thirteen Only) towards part-payment of the total amount on 17.10.2015 before signing an Agreement to Sell (Apartment Buyer Agreement) was duly entered into between the parties and thereafter Allotment letter was issued by the respondents.</li><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">That as per the agreement dated 17.10.2015, the completion of the construction of the apartment has to be completed by December 2017 and the possession of the said apartment was to be delivered to us thereafter i.e. in December 2017 but till date, we have not been offered the possession.<span class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">That after the execution of the agreement, we have been duly depositing the demanded installments of the amount with the respondents to the tune of Rs. 55,26,546 out of the total BSP of Rs. 91,25,000. But still, till date the possession of the aforesaid apartment has not been given to us as per the terms of agreement sell dated 17/10/2015.&nbsp;</li></ol>','<ol class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-ol1\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">Section 18: That as per the provision of the aforesaid Act and rules made thereunder, we are entitled to claim interest @ 18% per annum from the date of the respective payments till December 2017 and @ 18% p.a. thereafter until the actual date of possession of the said apartment.&nbsp;</li><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">Home Loan:&nbsp;State Bank of India, Branch Panchkula has sanctioned the home loan of Rs 39,14,000/-. A tripartite agreement was duly executed on 24/02/2018. Total disbursement of&nbsp;<b>Rs. 23,12,702 /-</b>&nbsp;to the respondent(s) till date out of our total sanctioned loan.&nbsp;We&nbsp;have been continuously paying an amount of&nbsp;<b>Rs 11,503/-</b>as Interest incurred on the disbursed amount of Rs. 13,38,171/-. Therefore, we are also entitled to recover the Interest amount @ Rs 11,503/- from the respondents till date and onwards along with interest amount for the further respective partial payments made to the builder out of the total sanctioned loan as of today that amount is in the tune of&nbsp;<b>Rs. 9,74,531/-</b>&nbsp;for which the interest will be starting in future.&nbsp;Therefore we&nbsp;are entitled to recover compensation&nbsp;&nbsp;EMI per month paid to the bank.</li><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">HouseRent: Due to non-completion of the construction of the aforesaid apartment, we&nbsp;have been forced to take a flat on rent at above-mentioned address and have been paying Rs. 16,500 per month along with maintenance.&nbsp;Therefore we&nbsp;are also entitled to recover compensation to the tune of&nbsp;Rs. 16,500 per month</li><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">Mental agony/Legal Fee\'s: We have&nbsp;suffered severe mental agony and harassment and further had to incur the litigation expenses to pursue the present complaint. Therefore we&nbsp;are entitled to recover compensation to the tune of Rs.5,00,000/- towards mental agony and litigation expenses.</li><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">Contractual Provision: As per Clause 6.3 of Buyer-seller agreement i.e&nbsp; Rs 5 per month/per square feet of the Super Built-up Area (2400sqft.)</li></ol>',9125000.00,5526546.00,'2017-12-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2015-01-21 00:00:00','2015-10-17 00:00:00','Apartment No. 05082, 8th Floor, Tower No. 5, ATS Casa Espana','','',2,0,0,0,'RaveenaRiar','2018-10-25 13:56:41.000','RaveenaRiar','2018-10-25 13:56:41.000'),(150,1057,'1057',1152,'b523945f-6c84-4b60-989c-1c236269509d','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-10-15 17:03:33.000','Raveena  Riar','raveena7riar@yahoo.com',8054055302,0,995421239517,'ATS Golfmeadows Prelude, Apartment number 1412, Tower 14','Derabassi',28,507,'140507','1','ATS Golfmeadows Prelude, Apartment number 1412, Tower 14','Derabassi',28,507,'140507','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0086','CASA ESPANA','Getamber Anand','getamber@atsgreens.com',8288033311,0,'ATS Infrabuild Pvt. Ltd.','C-226 , Sector 44, Noida',33,216,'201301','1','ATS Infrabuild Pvt. Ltd.','C-226 , Sector 44, Noida',33,216,'201301','1','<ol class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-ol1\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">We have booked a 3+1 BHK Residential Apartment No. 05082, 8<sup>th</sup>&nbsp;Floor, Tower No. 5 having Super-built up Area of 2400 sq. ft., Built-up Area of 2087 sq. ft. in the project, Type-B with car-parking space in the project known as&nbsp;<b><i>‘ATS Casa Espana’&nbsp;</i></b>for the basic sale price of Rs. 91,25,000 (Rs. ninty one&nbsp; Lac twenty-Five Thousand Only)<b>&nbsp;</b>developed by the respondents/ developer vide application dated 07.05.2014, situated in village Budmajra, Sector 121 Mohali-160055, SAS Nagar, Punjab.</li><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">We paid an amount of&nbsp;<b>Rs.31,17,513/-</b>&nbsp;(Rupees Thirty One Lac Seventeen Thousands Five Hundred and Thirteen Only) towards part-payment of the total amount on 17.10.2015 before signing an Agreement to Sell (Apartment Buyer Agreement) was duly entered into between the parties and thereafter Allotment letter was issued by the respondents.</li><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">That as per the agreement dated 17.10.2015, the completion of the construction of the apartment has to be completed by December 2017 and the possession of the said apartment was to be delivered to us thereafter i.e. in December 2017 but till date, we have not been offered the possession.<span class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">That after the execution of the agreement, we have been duly depositing the demanded installments of the amount with the respondents to the tune of Rs. 55,26,546 out of the total BSP of Rs. 91,25,000. But still, till date the possession of the aforesaid apartment has not been given to us as per the terms of agreement sell dated 17/10/2015.&nbsp;</li></ol>','<ol class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-ol1\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<style type=\"text/css\"> p.p1 {margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; text-align: justify; font: 12.0px \'Helvetica Neue\'; color: #454545} </style>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p class=\"p1\">That as per the provision of the aforesaid Act and rules made thereunder, we are entitled for interest on the amount which we have paid to the respondents as the respondents have been utilizing the amount and the project has been delayed beyond the contractual agreed period. Therefore, the respondents, who are enjoying the benefit of the amount so paid by us are bound to pay interest on the total paid amount till the actual date of possession of the said apartment. The respondents have not paid any amount towards interest to us regarding the total amount, which we have paid to the respondents i.e Rs. 55,26,546.</p></li><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">Home Loan:&nbsp;State Bank of India, Branch Panchkula has sanctioned the home loan of Rs 39,14,000/- out of which total disbursement of&nbsp;Rs. 23,12,702 /-&nbsp;have been paid to the respondent(s) till date towards our unit.&nbsp;Therefore we&nbsp;are entitled to recover per month&nbsp;EMI paid to the bank till date and further till the possession of the said apartment.</li><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">House Rent: Due to non-completion of the construction of the aforesaid apartment, we&nbsp;have been forced to take a flat on rent at above-mentioned address and have been paying Rs. 16,500 per month along with maintenance.&nbsp;Therefore we&nbsp;are also entitled to recover compensation to the tune of&nbsp;Rs. 16,500 per month</li><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">Mental agony/Legal Fee\'s: We have&nbsp;suffered severe mental agony and harassment and further had to incur the litigation expenses to pursue the present complaint. Therefore we&nbsp;are entitled to recover compensation to the tune of Rs.5,00,000/- towards mental agony and litigation expenses.</li><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">Contractual Provision: As per Clause 6.3 of Buyer-seller agreement i.e&nbsp; Rs 5 per month/per square feet of the Super Built-up Area (2400sqft.)</li></ol><style type=\"text/css\"> li.li1 {margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'Helvetica Neue\'; color: #454545} ol.ol1 {list-style-type: decimal} </style>',9125000.00,5526546.00,'2017-12-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2015-01-21 00:00:00','2015-10-17 00:00:00','Apartment No. 05082, 8th Floor, Tower No. 5, ATS Casa Espana','','',2,0,0,0,'RaveenaRiar','2018-10-25 14:48:29.000','RaveenaRiar','2018-10-25 14:48:29.000'),(151,1057,'1057',1152,'b523945f-6c84-4b60-989c-1c236269509d','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-10-15 17:03:33.000','Raveena  Riar','raveena7riar@yahoo.com',8054055302,0,995421239517,'ATS Golfmeadows Prelude, Apartment number 1412, Tower 14','Derabassi',28,507,'140507','1','ATS Golfmeadows Prelude, Apartment number 1412, Tower 14','Derabassi',28,507,'140507','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0086','CASA ESPANA','Getamber Anand','getamber@atsgreens.com',8288033311,0,'ATS Infrabuild Pvt. Ltd.','C-226 , Sector 44, Noida',33,216,'201301','1','ATS Infrabuild Pvt. Ltd.','C-226 , Sector 44, Noida',33,216,'201301','1','<ol class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-ol1\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">We have booked a 3+1 BHK Residential Apartment No. 05082, 8<sup>th</sup>&nbsp;Floor, Tower No. 5 having Super-built up Area of 2400 sq. ft., Built-up Area of 2087 sq. ft. in the project, Type-B with car-parking space in the project known as&nbsp;<b><i>‘ATS Casa Espana’&nbsp;</i></b>for the basic sale price of Rs. 91,25,000 (Rs. ninty one&nbsp; Lac twenty-Five Thousand Only)<b>&nbsp;</b>developed by the respondents/ developer vide application dated 07.05.2014, situated in village Budmajra, Sector 121 Mohali-160055, SAS Nagar, Punjab.</li><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">We paid an amount of&nbsp;<b>Rs.31,17,513/-</b>&nbsp;(Rupees Thirty One Lac Seventeen Thousands Five Hundred and Thirteen Only) towards part-payment of the total amount on 17.10.2015 before signing an Agreement to Sell (Apartment Buyer Agreement) was duly entered into between the parties and thereafter Allotment letter was issued by the respondents.</li><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">That as per the agreement dated 17.10.2015, the completion of the construction of the apartment has to be completed by December 2017 and the possession of the said apartment was to be delivered to us thereafter i.e. in December 2017 but till date, we have not been offered the possession.<span class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">That after the execution of the agreement, we have been duly depositing the demanded installments of the amount with the respondents to the tune of Rs. 55,26,546 out of the total BSP of Rs. 91,25,000. But still, till date the possession of the aforesaid apartment has not been given to us as per the terms of agreement sell dated 17/10/2015.&nbsp;</li></ol>','<ol class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-ol1\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<style type=\"text/css\"> p.p1 {margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; text-align: justify; font: 12.0px \'Helvetica Neue\'; color: #454545} </style>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p class=\"p1\">That as per the provision of the aforesaid Act and rules made thereunder, we are entitled for interest on the amount i.e Rs. 55,26,546, which we have paid to the respondents as the respondents have been utilizing the amount and the project has been delayed beyond the contractually agreed period as per the terms of agreement sell dated 17/10/2015. Therefore, the respondents, who are enjoying the benefit of the amount so paid by us are bound to pay interest on the total paid amount till date and further onwards till the actual date of possession of the said apartment. The respondents have not paid any amount towards interest to us regarding the total amount, which we have paid to the respondents i.e Rs. 55,26,546.</p></li><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">Home Loan:&nbsp;State Bank of India, Branch Panchkula has sanctioned the home loan of Rs 39,14,000/- out of which total disbursement of&nbsp;Rs. 23,12,702 /-&nbsp;have been paid to the respondent(s) till date towards our unit.&nbsp;Therefore we&nbsp;are entitled to recover per month&nbsp;EMI paid to the bank till date and further till the possession of the said apartment.</li><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">House Rent: Due to non-completion of the construction of the aforesaid apartment, we&nbsp;have been forced to take a flat on rent at above-mentioned address and have been paying Rs. 16,500 per month along with maintenance.&nbsp;Therefore we&nbsp;are also entitled to recover compensation to the tune of&nbsp;Rs. 16,500 per month</li><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">Mental agony/Legal Fee\'s: We have&nbsp;suffered severe mental agony and harassment and further had to incur the litigation expenses to pursue the present complaint. Therefore we&nbsp;are entitled to recover compensation to the tune of Rs.5,00,000/- towards mental agony and litigation expenses.</li><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">Contractual Provision: As per Clause 6.3 of Buyer-seller agreement i.e&nbsp; Rs 5 per month/per square feet of the Super Built-up Area (2400sqft.)</li></ol><style type=\"text/css\"> li.li1 {margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'Helvetica Neue\'; color: #454545} ol.ol1 {list-style-type: decimal} </style>',9125000.00,5526546.00,'2017-12-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2015-01-21 00:00:00','2015-10-17 00:00:00','Apartment No. 05082, 8th Floor, Tower No. 5, ATS Casa Espana','','',2,0,0,0,'RaveenaRiar','2018-10-25 14:53:44.000','RaveenaRiar','2018-10-25 14:53:44.000'),(152,1057,'1057',1152,'b523945f-6c84-4b60-989c-1c236269509d','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-10-15 17:03:33.000','Raveena  Riar','raveena7riar@yahoo.com',8054055302,0,995421239517,'ATS Golfmeadows Prelude, Apartment number 1412, Tower 14','Derabassi',28,507,'140507','1','ATS Golfmeadows Prelude, Apartment number 1412, Tower 14','Derabassi',28,507,'140507','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0086','CASA ESPANA','Getamber Anand','getamber@atsgreens.com',8288033311,0,'ATS Infrabuild Pvt. Ltd.','C-226 , Sector 44, Noida',33,216,'201301','1','ATS Infrabuild Pvt. Ltd.','C-226 , Sector 44, Noida',33,216,'201301','1','<ol class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-ol1\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">We have booked a 3+1 BHK Residential Apartment No. 05