ssion was\r\nto be given within 42 months maximum which expired on 08.12.2016.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Construction\r\nhas been stopped in between. Possession not offered till date.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Assured\r\nReturns stopped after JULY, 2016 violating the terms of the agreement as well\r\nas provisions of RERA Act.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Respondents\r\nare in arrears of Rs.9,94,588/- (01.07.2016 to 31.10.2018) as ASSURED RETURN\r\nand they may be directed to deposit the said amount as interim measure.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">Present\r\napplication filed seeking possession of the Unit No.04SF alongwith assured\r\nreturns till actual possession of unit.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">SEEKING POSSESSION OF THE UNIT NO.\r\n04SF, CITI&nbsp; CENTRE PROJECT, SECTOR 115 MOHALI<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">ASSURED RETURN AMOUNTING TO\r\nRS.9,94,588/- DUE W.E.F. 01.07.2016 TILL 31.08.2018<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">FUTURE ASSURED RETURNS TILL ACTUAL\r\nPOSSESSION OF SHOWROOM No.04SF.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">COMPENSATION OF RS.15,00,000/- AND\r\nRS,1,10,000/- AS COST OF LITIGATION.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>',2500000.00,2430890.00,'2015-06-08 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2012-06-08 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','SF-04, CITY CENTRE SECTOR 115 MOHALI','','',2,0,0,0,'advravinder','2018-11-13 23:50:51.000','advravinder','2018-11-13 23:50:51.000'),(169,1069,'1069',1214,'236d33c7-52c2-47c2-9d91-8289ee07ebac','FormTypeN',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Mukesh Gupta','mukeshgupta.31@gmail.com',9417217902,0,0,'B-3, 302, Nirmal Chayya Towers','VIP road, Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','B-3, 302, Nirmal Chayya Towers','VIP road, Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PC0019','M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','rera@waveestate.in',0,0,' M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','Sector-85, SAS Nagar (Mohali).',28,507,'140308','1',' M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','Sector-85, SAS Nagar (Mohali).',28,507,'140308','0','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">I had booked independent first floor in Wave\r\nEstate, Sector-99 under subvention scheme in Feb’2013 by making initial payment\r\nof Rs. 3,00,000/- vide cheque no. 60113 dated 08.02.2013. Next payment was made\r\nvide cheque no. 60117 dated 19.04.2013 amounting Rs. 3,18,540/-. It was\r\ncommitted to make delivery within 2 years.&nbsp;However, M/s Country Colonisers\r\nPvt. Ltd. executed the agreement on 07.02.2015 as per which possession was to\r\nbe offered within 24 months along with an extended grace period of 6 months.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Accordingly, I arranged for accommodation on\r\nrent in Apr’2017 and have been paying both rent and EMIs as the subvention\r\nperiod had lapsed. Due to inordinate delay I lost faith in the project and\r\nrequested the developers through e-mails to refund my deposits. However there\r\nwas no response from their end as they continued to defer possession and\r\nprogress on site was very slow. After a lot of follow-up developer agreed to settle\r\nonly pre-EMI interest from Aug’17 (24+6 months from date of agreement) onwards against\r\nbalance sale consideration and offered to deliver possession in Mar’18.\r\nDeveloper even failed to meet that deadline and possession has not been offered\r\ntill date.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">After so much of agony, I do not want to remain\r\nassociated with the developer and request for return of all deposits (including\r\nEMIs) with interest.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">In\r\nlight of the case facts brought out hereinabove, association with the project has not only been loss of\r\ntime, money and effort but has caused a lot of mental harassment.&nbsp; It is therefore requested to refund entire\r\ndeposits including EMIs paid to bank with interest. It is also requested to\r\ncompensate on account of mental harassment.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>',4000000.00,3000000.00,'2017-08-07 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2015-02-07 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','40, First floor, Sector-99, Mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'mukesh013128','2018-11-15 12:30:51.000','mukesh013128','2018-11-15 12:30:51.000'),(170,1069,'1069',1214,'236d33c7-52c2-47c2-9d91-8289ee07ebac','FormTypeN',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Mukesh Gupta','mukeshgupta.31@gmail.com',9417217902,0,0,'B-3, 302, Nirmal Chayya Towers','VIP road, Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','B-3, 302, Nirmal Chayya Towers','VIP road, Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PC0019','M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','rera@waveestate.in',0,0,' M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','Sector-85, SAS Nagar (Mohali).',28,507,'140308','1',' M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','Sector-85, SAS Nagar (Mohali).',28,507,'140308','0','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">I had booked independent first floor in Wave\r\nEstate, Sector-99 under subvention scheme in Feb’2013 by making initial payment\r\nof Rs. 3,00,000/- vide cheque no. 60113 dated 08.02.2013. Next payment was made\r\nvide cheque no. 60117 dated 19.04.2013 amounting Rs. 3,18,540/-. It was\r\ncommitted to make delivery within 2 years.&nbsp;However, M/s Country Colonisers\r\nPvt. Ltd. executed the agreement on 07.02.2015 as per which possession was to\r\