 money and effort but has caused a lot of mental harassment.&nbsp; It is therefore requested to refund entire\r\ndeposits including EMIs paid to bank with interest. It is also requested to\r\ncompensate on account of mental harassment.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 115%; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Time\r\nis of essence in such contracts and complainants cannot be expected to wait indefinitely\r\nfor the respondent to</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> complete the proj</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">ect and hand over its possession\r\nat its free will. As such I waited for 6 years and there is enough ground for\r\nclaiming compensation.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><o:p><br></o:p></span></p>',4000000.00,3000000.00,'2017-08-07 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2015-02-07 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','40, First floor, Sector-99, Mohali','','',1,0,0,0,'mukesh013128','2018-11-15 12:55:38.000','mukesh013128','2018-11-15 12:55:38.000'),(171,1070,'1070',1214,'236d33c7-52c2-47c2-9d91-8289ee07ebac','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Mukesh Gupta','mukeshgupta.31@gmail.com',9417217902,0,0,'B-3, 302, Nirmal Chayya Towers','VIP road, Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','B-3, 302, Nirmal Chayya Towers','VIP road, Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PC0019','M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','rera@waveestate.in',0,0,' M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','Sector-85, SAS Nagar (Mohali).',28,507,'140308','1',' M/s Country Co