012 vide which the\r\nrespondents endorsed the plot in favour of applicants No.1 to 3 is attached as <b><u>Annexure\r\nA-1</u>. </b>That the name of applicant\r\nno.4 was added in the booked plot vide Request Form dated 08.05.2013 which is\r\nattached as<b> <u>Annexure A-2</u>.<o:p></o:p></b></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">3.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">That\r\nTill date, the applicants have paid Rs.61,91,214/- against the demand of\r\nRs.61,80,000/-. However, the respondents never executed any buyer’s agreement\r\nagainst booking of plot. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">4.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">That\r\nthe applicants had been diligently and in good faith made payments to the\r\nrespondents towards booked plot and the payments has been duly acknowledged by\r\nthe respondents. The copy of payment receipts are attached as <b><u>Annexure A-3 (Collectively)</u></b>\r\n&amp; Statement is attached as <b><u>Annexure\r\nA- 4.</u></b><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:-.25in;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">5.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">That\r\nthe said plot was booked by the applicants in January 2012 and entire &nbsp;demanded payment was completed as per demands\r\nof the respondents in March 2014. Still in 2018 i.e after more than 6 years\r\nfrom the date of booking the respondents are not able to complete / develop the\r\nproject, obtain the requisite approvals from concerned authorities. The\r\nrespondents are issuing false demand letters and false possession to the\r\napplicants. Hence due to inordinate delay by respondents, the applicants are\r\nnot supposed to wait and watch further and to stay in the respondents project\r\nand therefore applicants seeking refund of total amount paid along with\r\ninterest from the date of respective payments. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:-.25in;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:-.25in;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level2 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">a.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Allow\r\nthe present application and direct the Respondents to refund the sum of Rs.61,91,214/-\r\n(Rs. Sixty One&nbsp; lacs Eighty Seven\r\nthousand five hundred fourteen only) to the applicants along with interest from\r\nthe date of respective payments till its realization in accordance with section\r\n18 of the Real Estate (Regulation and development) Act 2016;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:-.25in;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level2 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">b.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Allow\r\nthe present Application and direct the Respondent to make the payment of the\r\nsum of <b>Rs. 10,00,000/-</b> as lump sum\r\ncompensation for causing Mental &amp; Physical Harassment and Agony to the\r\napplicants and Punitive Damages for Unfair Trade Practice.;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:-.25in;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level2 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">c.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Allow\r\nthe present Application and direct the Respondent to make the payment of the\r\nsum of <b>Rs. 1,50,000/-</b> as Costs of\r\nLitigation to the applicants;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:-.25in;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level2 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">d.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Necessary\r\nactions may be taken against the respondents as provided under RERA Act.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:-.25in;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level2 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">e.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Any\r\nother relief as deemed fit &amp; proper in the peculiar circumstances of the\r\npresent lis may also be granted to the applicants; in the interest of justice,\r\nfair play &amp; equity.<o:p></o:p></span></p>',7227499.00,6191214.00,'2015-05-08 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2013-05-08 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','OCE/P3/290','','',1,0,0,0,'complaint','2018-11-19 14:54:19.000','complaint','2018-11-19 14:54:19.000'),(179,1075,'1075',1221,'371492c6-7a9d-4ed1-b340-1b73bc92dac4','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','AMRINDER KAUR','charanjitpsegs@gmail.com',9888793050,0,0,'2321 C Block 29','Housing Board Flats Sector 63',6,128,'160062','1','House No 1577','Sector 70 Mohali',28,507,'160071','CHARANJIT SINGH','charanjitcan@gmail.com',9888793050,0,'Allottee','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0197','UNIWORLD CITY/\r\nUNITECH LIMITED','UNITECH LIMITED','sanctions_hry@unitechgroup.com',9821227005,1244835300,'M/S UNITECH LIMITED','UNITECH HOUSE , L-BLOCK , SOUTH CITY-1',13,5,'122001','1','M/S UNITECH LIMITED','UNITECH HOUSE , L-BLOCK , SOUTH CITY-1',13,5,'122001','1','<p>1. The possession of the flat was to be offered by the respondents within 36 months by 11.11.2012 from the date of signing the agreement i.e. 12.11.2009.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></p><p>2. The claimant is offered possession on 13.11.2018    . There is delay of 72 months in offering the possession by respondents and claimant is entitled for the compensation to the tune of Rs 5050/- per month (1010*Rs5 per sq ft/per month) as per agreement. The compensation&nbsp; comes to Rs 363600/- and that was to be adjusted by the respondents at the time of offer of possession as per the conditions of the allotment and agreement.</p><p>3.<span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">The respondents issued a demand notice amounting to </span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;R</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">s 6, 64,288 to the claimant along\r\nwith the offer of possession without adjusting the amount of compensation to\r\nthe tune of Rs 363600/- against the provisions of the agreement .</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">4.</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 18.6667px;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nCalibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-CA;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;cost of the unit is increased to the tune of Rs 93000/- on a/c of revised super\r\narea in aforesaid demand notice</span><b><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">. </span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">This\r\namount is falsely claimed by the respondents as this revision was applicable to\r\nthe “Unihomes” consisting of three rooms (1077 sq. ft.) in the same block not\r\nto the claimants-“Singleton Floors” consisting of two rooms (1010 sq. ft).</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><br></span><span style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt; line-height: 115%;\">The revision of area and price in the same block B was\r\neffective from 28.07.2009 for the Unihomes well before the booking of Unit by\r\nthe claimant. The respondents are now trying to cheat the claimant and charging over payment&nbsp;at the time of possession.<span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">﻿6.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt;\">The\r\nfinal demand notice includes a sum of Rs 60000/- club charges whereas no such\r\nclub is constructed or exists in the aforesaid project.</span></p><p><span style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt; line-height: 115%;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nCalibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-CA;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 115%;\">7. The\r\nclaimant and her family have already suffered huge mental agony and financial\r\nloss more than Rs 12 lacs in terms of interest and house rent in this delayed period of 72 months due to the\r\nnon-delivery of the unit in time by the respondents.</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">8.the claimant requested Sh. Robin Singh (contact person in possession notice) to adjust compensation&nbsp; as per agreement who refused to do so .</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:\r\n0cm;margin-left:72.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;mso-add-space:auto;text-align:\r\njustify;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-CA\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>','<p><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nCalibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-CA;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">1.</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 115%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">That\r\nthe claimant should be given immediate possession after paying the external\r\nelectrification charges&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; i.e Rs 19136/- and water &amp; sewer connection charges\r\ni.e 10000 as per letter of offer for possession.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt;\">2. </span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 14px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt;\">That claimant should be given compensation in terms of\r\ninterest @ 18% P.A compounded quarterly to cover the financial loss more than\r\n12 lacs by the claimant and her family. In case of delayed payment by claimant,\r\nthis interest was chargeable by the respondents as per clause 6</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt;\">&nbsp;of the application for allotment of unitech ltd.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt;\">3.</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt;\">That false increased cost of unit to the tune of Rs\r\n93000/- should be waived off.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt;\">4.</span>&nbsp; &nbsp; T<span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">hat club charges to the tune of Rs. 60000/- should\r\nnot be payable as the respondents have failed to start construction of club\r\neven after a span of 10 years. The claimant has doubt on the integrity of the\r\nrespondents. However the claimant agrees to pay this amount</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">Rs 60000/- to the respondents after\r\nthe starting of the club.</span></p>',2458727.00,1978144.00,'2012-11-11 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2009-08-26 00:00:00','2009-11-12 00:00:00','UNIT NO. 15 BLOCK B GROUND FLOOR , SINGLETON FLOORS , SECTOR 107 , UNIWORLD CITY MOHALI','','',1,0,0,0,'lovely','2018-11-19 19:18:43.000','lovely','2018-11-19 19:18:43.000'),(180,1076,'1076',1221,'371492c6-7a9d-4ed1-b340-1b73bc92dac4','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-11-20 08:38:39.000','AMRINDER KAUR','charanjitpsegs@gmail.com',9888793050,0,0,'2321 C Block 29','Housing Board Flats Sector 63',6,128,'160062','1','House No 1577','Sector 70 Mohali',28,507,'160071','CHARANJIT SINGH','charanjitcan@gmail.com',9888793050,0,'Allottee','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0197','UNIWORLD CITY/\r\nUNITECH LIMITED','UNITECH LIMITED','sanctions_hry@unitechgroup.com',9821227005,1244835300,'M/S UNITECH LIMITED','UNITECH HOUSE , L- BLOCK , SOUTH CITY-1',13,5,'122001','1','M/S UNITECH LIMITED','UNITECH HOUSE , L- BLOCK , SOUTH CITY-1',13,5,'122001','1','<p>A.&nbsp;That the possession of the flat was to be offered by the respondents within 36 months by 11.11.2012 from the date of signing the agreement i.e. 12.11.2009. In case of Delay in offering possession, the claimant is entitled for compensation @ 5/- sq ft per month of the Sale-able Area of the floor. \r\n</p><p>B.	That the claimant was to be offered possession on 13.11.2018    .There is delay of 72 months in offering the possession by respondents and claimant is entitled for the compensation to the tune of Rs363600/- ( 1010*Rs5 per sq ft/=5050 per month).\r\n</p><p>C.	That the compensation was to be adjusted by the respondents at the time of offer of possession as per the conditions of the allotment and agreement.\r\n</p><p>D.	That the respondents issued a demand notice amounting to              Rs 6, 64,288 to the claimant along with the offer of possession without adjusting the amount of compensation.\r\n</p><p>E.	That cost of the unit is increased to the tune of Rs 93000/- on a/c of revised super area in aforesaid demand notice. This amount is falsely claimed by the respondents as this revision was applicable to the “Unihomes” consisting of three rooms (1077 sq. ft.) in the same block not to the claimants-“Singleton Floors” consisting of two rooms (1010 sq. ft). The fact is that project Singleton Floor was renamed as Unihomes by the respondent M/s Unitech Ltd for their own interest.  \r\n</p><p>F.	That the final demand notice includes a sum of Rs 60000/- club charges whereas no such club is constructed or exists in the aforesaid project. \r\n</p><p>G.	That liability of complainant towards Service Tax/ GST increased due to non-delivery of Unit on time by the respondents.  \r\n</p><p>H.	That the claimant and her family have already suffered huge mental agony and financial loss more than Rs 12 lacs in this delayed period on a/c of interest and house rent. \r\n</p><p>I.	The representative of respondents Sh. Robin Singh (Mentioned in final notice of possession for contact) refused to adjust any compensation evn as per agreement.</p>','<p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;\r\nmargin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:70.9pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">1.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-CA\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">That the claimant should be given immediate possession\r\nafter paying the external electrification charges i.e Rs19136/- and water &amp;\r\nsewer connection charges i.e 10000/- only as per final notice for&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-CA\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">possession letter.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;\r\nmargin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:70.9pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-CA\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">2.</span></span>&nbsp; <span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-CA\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">That claimant\r\nshould be given compensation in terms of interest @ 18% P.A compounded\r\nquarterly to cover the financial loss more than 12 lacs by the claimant and her\r\nfamily. In case of delayed </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-CA\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">payment by claimant, this interest was chargeable by\r\nthe respondents to the claimant .</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\r\n\r\n</span><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;\r\nmargin-bottom: