&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">10 years. The</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">claimant has doubt on the integrity of\r\nthe respondents. </span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">How</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">ever</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;the claimant agrees to pay this amount</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">Rs 60000/- to the </span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">respondents after\r\nthe </span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">tarting of the club.</span></p>',2458727.00,1978144.00,'2012-11-11 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2009-08-26 00:00:00','2009-11-12 00:00:00','UNIT NO.15, BLOCK B, SINGLETON FLOOR SECTOR 107 UNIWORLD CITY MOHALI','','',2,0,0,0,'lovely','2018-11-19 20:02:55.000','lovely','2018-11-19 20:02:55.000'),(181,1077,'1077',1203,'1cc7ee4f-bdbb-4adc-aaba-bf2382465ef3','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Ajit  Singh','ajitsinghin@rediffmail.com',9814711221,0,0,'2004, Verka Enclave','Sector 49',6,128,'160047','1','2004, Verka Enclave','Sector 49',6,128,'160047','Vipin Kumar','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0086','Casa Espana','ATS Infrabuild Pvt. Ltd','email@atsgreens.com',0,0,'711/92, Deepal