ipt no. CSAMR/03150 dt. 13<sup><font size=\"2\">th</font></sup> April,\r\n2017) FOR Rs. 98,78,000/-</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10.66px; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><u><span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\'>Execution of Agreement</span></u><span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\'>: the 30 (Thirty) page apartment buyer agreement\r\nwas duly executed on dated 11<sup><font size=\"2\">th</font></sup> May, 2017, wherein date of\r\nCompletion of Construction was described as December 2017 with a grace period\r\nof 3 Months. (Refer para 6.2 on page 12 of said agreement).</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10.66px; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><u><span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\'>Payments made till date</span></u><span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\'>: Total amount till date was paid against Basic\r\nCost is Rs. 85,71,866/- along with service tax of Rs. 385734/-</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10.66px; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\'>Possession not handed over:-<span style=\"margin: 0px;\">&nbsp; </span>Even after passing of Eleven (11) Months from\r\nthe date of completion mentioned in agreement the completion of property is\r\nstill under construction and possession letter is not offered. </span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10.66px; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><u><span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\'>GROUND OF CLAIMS:</span></u></b></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 48px; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">1.<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\'>Even after passing of Eleven (11) Months from the\r\ndate as mentioned in agreement to sell, the promoters are failed to handover\r\nthe possession.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 48px; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">2.<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\'>We had paid Rs. 8571866 (against Unit Price) +\r\n385734( against service tax) till date yet no possession.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 48px; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">3.<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\'>We had taken a housing loan of Rs. 7528040/-and we\r\nare paying monthly instalment of Rs. 65000/-</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10.66px 48px; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">4.<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\'>We are still living in rental accommodation and\r\npaying an amount of Rs. 24200/-per month as rent.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n<span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 107%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\'>We\r\nare facing great mental agony along with financial loss due to failure of\r\npromoters</span><b></b><i></i><u></u><sub></sub><sup></sup><strike></strike><br></p>','<p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10.66px; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; color: black; line-height: 150%; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10pt;\">COMPENSATION/ RELIEF SOUGHTS </span></b><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\'></span></b></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:36.0pt;&#10;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; color: black; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">1.<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span></span></b><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; color: black; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10pt;\">LUMPSUM INTEREST U/S\r\n18(1) FROM JANUARY 2018 TILL DECISION OF CASE:&nbsp;</span></b></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:7.5pt;marg