awatra and Ranjani G\r\n&nbsp;Vs. Mr. Kulwant Singh M.D. M/s Janta Land Promoters Private Limited.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:36.0pt;&#10;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:150%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; color: black; line-height: 150%; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">3.<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span></span></b><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; color: black; line-height: 150%; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10pt;\">COMPENSATION\r\nOF RS. 20,00,000 IN LIEU OF MENTAL AND FINANCIAL AGONY </span></b><span style=\'margin: 0px; color: black; line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\'>U/s 18(1) of&nbsp;THE REAL ESTATE (REGULATION AND DEVELOPMENT)\r\nACT, 2016</span><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; color: black; line-height: 150%; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10pt;\"></span></b></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:36.0pt;&#10;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:150%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; color: black; line-height: 150%; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">4.<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span></span></b><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; color: black; line-height: 150%; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10pt;\">ANY\r\nOTHER RELEIF AS FEEL THINKS FIT BY HON’BLE AUTHORITY</span></b></p><p>\r\n\r\n<b></b><i></i><u></u><sub></sub><sup></su