\r\n&nbsp;Vs. Mr. Kulwant Singh M.D. M/s Janta Land Promoters Private Limited.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:36.0pt;&#10;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:150%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; color: black; line-height: 150%; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">3.<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span></span></b><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; color: black; line-height: 150%; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10pt;\">COMPENSATION\r\nOF RS. 20,00,000 IN LIEU OF MENTAL AND FINANCIAL AGONY </span></b><span style=\'margin: 0px; color: black; line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\'>U/s 18(1) of&nbsp;THE REAL ESTATE (REGULATION AND DEVELOPMENT)\r\nACT, 2016</span><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; color: black; line-height: 150%; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10pt;\"></span></b></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:7.5pt;margin-left:36.0pt;&#10;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:150%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; color: black; line-height: 150%; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">4.<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span></span></b><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; color: black; line-height: 150%; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10pt;\">ANY\r\nOTHER RELEIF AS FEEL THINKS FIT BY HON’BLE AUTHORITY</span></b></p><p>\r\n\r\n<b></b><i></i><u></u><sub></sub><sup></sup><strike></strike><font face=\"Times New Roman\"></font><br></p>',9878000.00,8571866.00,'2017-12-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2017-05-17 00:00:00','2017-05-17 00:00:00','FLAT NO 7032, 3RD FLOOR, 7TH TOWE, ATS CASA ESPANA, SECTOR 121 NEAR VERKA MILK PLANT, MOHALI','','',2,0,0,0,'deepsgargi','2018-11-25 09:18:13.000','deepsgargi','2018-11-25 09:18:13.000'),(184,1073,'1073',1053,'4b6cce0d-cb7b-46c0-9cff-6656bf5776c2','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Jasbir Singh','gaurav88g@gmail.com',9888139269,0,0,'H.No.181, Village:-Ghel','',13,1,'134003','1','H.No.181, Village:-Ghel','',13,1,'134003','NITIN GUPTA & GAURAV GUPTA','gaurav69g@gmail.com',9888139269,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0033','OMAXE CHANDIGARH EXTENSION,PHASE-3','M/S OMAXE CHANDIGARH EXTENSION DEVELOPMENT PVT. LTD','customerrelations_chandigarh@omaxe.com',0,0,'INDIA TRADE TOWER,IST FLOOR, MADHYAMARG EXTENSION ROAD, NEW CHANDIGARH','',28,507,'140901','1','INDIA TRADE TOWER,IST FLOOR, MADHYAMARG EXTENSION ROAD, NEW CHANDIGARH','',28,507,'140901','1','<ol><li style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 200%;\"><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 200%;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">That\r\nthe applicants are family members / relatives and bonafide resident of above\r\ngiven addresses. The respondents are private real estate developer and engaged\r\nin the business of selling plots, built-up plots, town house, flats, kothis and\r\nother commercial and non-commercial properties in Omaxe Chandigarh Extension at\r\nMullapur. <b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 200%;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">2.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></b><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">That\r\napplicants fell into the trap of respondents and purchased a residential plot\r\nof area 301.38 Sq yard from the opposite parties in January 2012 at Phase-3, Omaxe\r\nNew Chandigarh Extension. Copy of request form dated 10.01.2012 vide which the\r\nrespondents endorsed the plot in favour of applicants No.1 to 3 is attached as <b><u>Annexure\r\nA-1</u>. </b>That the name of applicant\r\nno.4 was added in the booked plot vide Request Form dated 08.05.2013 is\r\nattached as<b> <u>Annexure A-2</u>.<o:p></o:p></b></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 200%;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">3.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">That\r\nTill date, the applicants have paid Rs.61,91,214/- against the demand of\r\nRs.61,80,000/-. However, the respondents never executed buyer’s agreement\r\nagainst booking of plot. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 200%;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">4.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">That\r\nthe applicants had been diligently and in good faith made payments to respondents towards booked plot and the payments has been duly acknowledged by\r\nthe respondents. The copy of payment receipts are attached as <b><u>Annexure A-3 (Collectively)</u></b>\r\n&amp; Statement is attached as <b><u>Annexure\r\nA- 4.</u></b><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 200%;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">5.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">That\r\nthe said plot was booked by applicants in January 2012 and entire &nbsp;demanded payment was completed as per demands\r\nof the respondents in March 2014. Still in 2018 i.e after more than 6 years\r\nfrom the date of booking the respondents are not able to complete / develop the\r\nproject, obtain the requisite approvals from concerned authorities. The\r\nrespondents are issuing false demand letters and false possession to the\r\napplicants, despite no development at site. Hence due to inordinate delay by respondents, the applicants are\r\nnot supposed to wait and watch further and to stay in the respondents project\r\nand therefore applicants seeking refund of total amount paid along with\r\ninterest as per RERA Act. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p></li><li style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></li></ol>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:-.25in;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level2 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">a.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Allow\r\nthe present application and direct the Respondents to refund the sum of Rs.61,91,214/-\r\n(Rs. Sixty One&nbsp; lacs Eighty Seven\r\nthousand five hundred fourteen only) to the applicants along with interest from\r\nthe date of respective payments till its realization in accordance with section\r\n18 of the Real Estate (Regulation and development) Act 2016;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:-.25in;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level2 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">b.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Allow\r\nthe present Application and direct the Respondent to make the payment of the\r\nsum of <b>Rs. 10,00,000/-</b> as lump sum\r\ncompensation for causing Mental &amp; Physical Harassment and Agony to the\r\napplicants and Punitive Damages for Unfair Trade Practice.;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:-.25in;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level2 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">c.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Allow\r\nthe present Application and direct the Respondent to make the payment of the\r\nsum of <b>Rs. 1,50,000/-</b> as Costs of\r\nLitigation to the applicants;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:-.25in;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level2 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">d.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Necessary\r\nactions may be taken against the respondents as provided under RERA Act.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;\r\nmargin-left:1.0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:-.25in;line-height:200%;mso-list:l0 level2 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">e.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Any\r\nother relief as deemed fit &amp; proper in the peculiar circumstances of the\r\npresent lis may also be granted to the applicants; in the interest of justice,\r\nfair play &amp; equity.<o:p></o:p></span></p>',7227499.00,6191214.00,'2014-01-10 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2012-01-10 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','OCE/P3/290','','',1,0,0,0,'complaint','2018-11-27 17:00:36.000','complaint','2018-11-27 17:00:36.000'),(185,1076,'1076',1221,'371492c6-7a9d-4ed1-b340-1b73bc92dac4','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-11-20 08:38:39.000','AMRINDER KAUR','charanjitpsegs@gmail.com',9888793050,0,0,'2321 C Block 29','Housing Board Flats Sector 63',6,128,'160062','1','House No 1577','Sector 70 Mohali',28,507,'160071','CHARANJIT SINGH','charanjitcan@gmail.com',9888793050,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0367','UNIWORLD CITY/\r\nUNITECH LIMITED','UNITECH LIMITED','sanctions_hry@unitechgroup.com',9821227005,1244835300,'M/S UNITECH LIMITED','UNITECH HOUSE , L- BLOCK , SOUTH CITY-1',13,5,'122001','1','M/S UNITECH LIMITED','UNITECH HOUSE , L- BLOCK , SOUTH CITY-1',13,5,'122001','1','<ol><li style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt 54pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-CA\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The complainant purchased a two bedroom flat jointly\r\nwith her mother in law named Kuldeep Kaur from respondent Unitech Ltd in their\r\nproject Singleton Floors, Uniworld City Mohali on 26.08.09.The name of my\r\nmother in law was deleted on 26.12.11(P 11).</span><o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt 54pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-CA\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The agreement was signed with the respondent’s Unitech\r\nLtd. and the Alice developers private Ltd on 12.11.2009(P 12 to P 32).</span><o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt 54pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-CA\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">That the possession of the flat was to be offered by\r\nthe respondents within 36 months by 11.11.2012(P20, agreement clause 4a.) . </span><o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt 54pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span>That in case of\r\nDelay in offering possession, the claimant is entitled for compensation @ 5/-\r\nsq ft per month of the Salable&nbsp;Area of the floor. This compensation amount is\r\nto be adjusted at the time of offer of possession of the floor (P21, clause 4c)<b style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.</span></b></li><li style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt 54pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\">That the claimant was\r\nto be offered possession on 13.11.2018<span style=\"text-indent: 36pt;\">&nbsp;(offer of possession p 33-p 40)&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br></li><li style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt 54pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-CA\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">That there is delay of 72 months in offering the possession\r\nby respondents and claimant is entitled for the compensation to the tune of Rs\r\n5050/- per month (1010*Rs5 per sq ft/per month), as per above F, for the\r\ndelayed period of 72 months.</span><o:p></o:p></span></li><li style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt 54pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-CA\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">That the respondents was issued a demand notice\r\namounting to</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;6, 64,288<b>/- (p36)</b></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;to the claimant along with the offer of possession without\r\nadjusting the amount of compensation.</span></span></li><li style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt 54pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\">The claimant is paying an installment&nbsp;of Rs 4600/- P.M\r\nto HDFC on a/c of availed loan that includes Rs 42000/- as interest component .</li><li style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt 54pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\">The claimant is middle class salaried person having no property.</li><li style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt 54pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\">The family paid house rent Rs 13500/ to <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Rs 18000/- P.M during the period of delay by the respondents. Thus the\r\nclaimant has suffered financial loss of more than 12 lacs due to delay in\r\npossession.</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></li></ol>','The claimant should be given compensation covering financial loss and loss on a/c of mental agony due to delay in offering possession as per the provisions of the rera.',2458727.00,1978144.00,'2012-11-11 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2009-08-26 00:00:00','2009-11-12 00:00:00','UNIT NO.15, BLOCK B, SINGLETON FLOOR SECTOR 107 UNIWORLD CITY MOHALI','','',2,0,0,0,'lovely','2018-12-03 11:15:30.000','lovely','2018-12-03 11:15:30.000'),(186,1076,'1076',1221,'371492c6-7a9d-4ed1-b340-1b73bc92dac4','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-03 11:31:02.000','AMRINDER KAUR','charanjitpsegs@gmail.com',9888793050,0,0,'2321 C Block 29','Housing Board Flats Sector 63',6,128,'160062','1','House No 1577','Sector 70 Mohali',28,507,'160071','CHARANJIT SINGH','charanjitcan@gmail.com',9888793050,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0367','UNIWORLD CITY/\r\nUNITECH LIMITED','UNITECH LIMITED','sanctions_hry@unitechgroup.com',9821227005,1244835300,'M/S UNITECH LIMITED','UNITECH HOUSE , L- BLOCK , SOUTH CITY-1',13,5,'122001','1','M/S UNITECH LIMITED','UNITECH HOUSE , L- BLOCK , SOUTH CITY-1',13,5,'122001','1','<ol><li style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt 54pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-CA\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The complainant purchased a two bedroom flat jointly\r\nwith her mother in law named Kuldeep Kaur from respondent Unitech Ltd in their\r\nproject Singleton Floors, Uniworld City Mohali on 26.08.09.The name of my\r\nmother in law was deleted on 26.12.11(P 11).</span><o:p></o:p></s