: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">3.<span style=\'font: 7pt/normal \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\'>We had taken a housing loan of Rs. 7528040/-and we\r\nare paying monthly instalment of Rs. 65000/-</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10.66px 48px; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">4.<span style=\'font: 7pt/normal \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\'>We are still living in rental accommodation and\r\npaying an amount of Rs. 24200/-per month as rent.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n<span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 107%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\'>We\r\nare facing great mental agony along with financial loss due to failure of\r\npromoters</span><b></b><i></i><u></u><sub></sub><sup></sup><strike></strike><br></p>','<p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10.66px; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; color: black; line-height: 150%; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10pt;\">COMPENSATION/ RELIEF SOUGHTS </span></b><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 150%; font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\'></span></b></p><p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 7.5pt 36pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 7.5pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"