c','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-10 10:36:43.000','Col. Jagjit Singh Randhawa','jagjit1919@gmail.com',7597383970,0,0,'House no. 818, Phase 7, Sector 61','',28,507,'160062','0','House no. 333, Sector 4, Mansa Devi Complex (MDC)','',13,15,'134114','Adv. Livleen SIngh/Raj Narang','livleen.singh@legacylawoffices.com',9914533339,1722559332,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0143','Parkwood Glade Tower A, B, C, D and G','Parkwood Developers Pvt. Limited through its Managing Director/Authorized Representative','mail@parkwoodgroup.in',0,1130824952,'Parkwood Developers Private Limited, 10th Floor, Hemkunt Chambers','89, Nehru Place',10,429,'110019','0','Parkwood Developers Private Limited, 10th Floor, Hemkunt Chambers','89, Nehru Place',10,429,'110019','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Applicants applied for\r\nallotment of the Flat vide application dt. 07.01.2012 and paid Rs.5,63,150 alongwith\r\nthe application. Total cost of said Flat was Rs.39,95,500 &amp; Flat no. D-202\r\nwas allotted on 07.01.2012. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Applicants had already\r\npaid Rs.39,47,721 by availing Home Loan of Rs.30,00,000. The Applicants,\r\nDeveloper and Bank entered into a Tripartite Agreement dt.27.01.2012.\r\nApplicants are regularly paying EMIs to the Bank and have already paid Rs.14,12,216\r\nas Interest towards the repayment of this loan. Applicant, being an Army\r\nOfficer and posted at Assam and Jaipur, visited the site intermittently and\r\nkept believing the false assurances of the Builder and made last payment on23.03.2017\r\nto the Developer.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">The Respondent failed to\r\nhand over the possession of Flat on31.07.2014 as per clause 19 of the Agreement\r\nafter the timely payments by the Applicants. Even after the expiry of such\r\nperiod the project is a structure of bricks. The Applicants served legal\r\nnotices dt.22.06.2017 &amp; 05.07.2017 and demanded termination of the\r\nAgreement along with compensation. However no reply was received from the\r\nRespondent. The Applicants had filed before State Consumer Commission,\r\nChandigarh and withdrawn on 27.03.2018 with liberty to take other legal remedy.\r\nThereafter the Applicants filed a complaint for refund in Form M and an\r\napplication for compensation in Form N before RERA, Punjab. The complaint under\r\nForm M was decided on16.10.2018 in favor of the Applicants &nbsp;awarding refund of the amount paid by Applicants\r\nwith Interest whereas, the Form N application was dismissed as withdrawn with\r\nliberty to file afresh vide order dt.05.06.2018. Therefore, the Applicants are\r\nfiling the present Application seeking compensation on account of the failure\r\nof the Respondent to hand over the possession of the Flat even after a delay of\r\nmore than 4 years as cause of action still subsist. The various documents are annexed\r\nherewith in support and to elucidate the above facts.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">The\r\nHon’ble Chairman, RERA allowed the complaint of the Applicant under Section 31 with\r\ndirection to</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"> the\r\nRespondent to refund of the amount paid by Applicants along with interest</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">\r\nand further observed that “<i>the\r\nComplainants have also sought compensation for harassment caused to them in\r\nvarious ways. However, the compensation cannot be allowed by this Authority,\r\nand they may choose to pursue this remedy before the Adjudicating Officer, if\r\nso advised.”</i> The Applicants are entitled to file present Application before\r\nAdjudication Officer in the view of his order dt. 05.06.2018.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">That\r\nt</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN\">he Respondent has committed\r\ndefault as per Sections 18 and 19 of the RERA Act and is liable to pay\r\ncompensation in terms of the provisions of the RERA Act. On account of default\r\nof Respondent in handing over the possession of the Flat, the Applicants pray\r\nfor the following compensation:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n6.0pt;margin-left:45.0pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:-.5in;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">1. (a) Compensation for harassment,\r\nmental and physical agony amounting to Rs.5,00,000 (Rs. Five Lacs Only)<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:45.0pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:\r\n-.5in;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n(b) Compensation for expenses for visiting the site and out of pocket\r\nexpenses amounting to Rs.1,00,000/- (Rs. One Lac Only)<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n6.0pt;margin-left:45.0pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:-.5in;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n(c) Compensation for the loss of opportunity to buy the Flat with any\r\nother builder and escalation of the cost of fitments and furnishings in the\r\nlast 4 years amounting to Rs 3,00,000/- (Rs. Three Lakhs only)<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n6.0pt;margin-left:45.0pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:-.5in;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n(d) Compensation for the costs of litigation and notices amounting to\r\nRs. 1,00,000/- (Rs. One Lac only)<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0in;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">2.&nbsp; Compensation for the payment of Rs.\r\n14,12,216/- (Rs. Fourteen Lacs Twelve Thousand Two Hundred and Sixteen only) as\r\nInterest paid by the Applicants towards repayment of the Home Loan taken for\r\nthe Flat. The Applicants had to pay an exorbitant amount of money as interest\r\nand are entitled to be compensated for the losses suffered by them on account\r\nof delay by the Respondents.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0in;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:\r\n150%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">3.\r\nInterest on all amounts payable by the Respondent to the Applicants at the rate\r\nof 18% p.a. in accordance with section 2(za) of the RERA Act.&nbsp;&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>',3995500.00,3947721.00,'2014-07-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2012-01-07 00:00:00','2012-01-07 00:00:00','Flat No. D-202, Block-D, Parkwood Glade, Sector 116, Kharar Landran Road, Mohali','','',1,1,0,0,'JagjitSingh','2018-12-10 10:34:36.000','JagjitSingh','2018-12-10 10:34:36.000'),(212,1057,'1057',1152,'b523945f-6c84-4b60-989c-1c236269509d','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-10-25 14:55:51.000','Raveena  Riar','raveena7riar@yahoo.com',8054055302,0,995421239517,'ATS Golfmeadows Prelude, Apartment number 1412, Tower 14','Derabassi',28,507,'140507','1','ATS Golfmeadows Prelude, Apartment number 1412, Tower 14','Derabassi',28,507,'140507','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0086','CASA ESPANA','Getamber Anand','getamber@atsgreens.com',8288033311,0,'ATS Infrabuild Pvt. Ltd.','C-226 , Sector 44, Noida',33,216,'201301','1','ATS Infrabuild Pvt. Ltd.','C-226 , Sector 44, Noida',33,216,'201301','1','<ol class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-ol1\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">We have booked a 3+1 BHK Residential Apartment No. 05082, 8<sup>th</sup>&nbsp;Floor, Tower No. 5 having Super-built up Area of 2400 sq. ft., Built-up Area of 2087 sq. ft. in the project, Type-B with car-parking space in the project known as&nbsp;<b><i>‘ATS Casa Espana’&nbsp;</i></b>for the basic sale price of Rs. 91,25,000 (Rs. ninty one&nbsp; Lac twenty-Five Thousand Only)<b>&nbsp;</b>developed by the respondents/ developer vide application dated 07.05.2014, situated in village Budmajra, Sector 121 Mohali-160055, SAS Nagar, Punjab.</li><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">We paid an amount of&nbsp;<b>Rs.31,17,513/-</b>&nbsp;(Rupees Thirty One Lac Seventeen Thousands Five Hundred and Thirteen Only) towards part-payment of the total amount on 17.10.2015 before signing an Agreement to Sell (Apartment Buyer Agreement) was duly entered into between the parties and thereafter Allotment letter was issued by the respondents.</li><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">That as per the agreement dated 17.10.2015, the completion of the construction of the apartment has to be completed by December 2017 and the possession of the said apartment was to be delivered to us thereafter i.e. in December 2017 but till date, we have not been offered the possession.<span class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">That after the execution of the agreement, we have been duly depositing the demanded installments of the amount with the respondents to the tune of Rs. 55,26,546 out of the total BSP of Rs. 91,25,000. But still, till date the possession of the aforesaid apartment has not been given to us as per the terms of agreement sell dated 17/10/2015.&nbsp;</li></ol>','<ol class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-ol1\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<style type=\"text/css\"> p.p1 {margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; text-align: justify; font: 12.0px \'Helvetica Neue\'; color: #454545} </style>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 40, 42); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444px; text-align: left;\">As I’m a retired Pb. govt. employee and had planned my retirement place accordingly to shift from my present rental accommodation after my retirement to the apartment purchased from the respondent but all my plans dashed into the water and apart from paying the monthly rent of Rs 16,500 to my landlord. Which amount was supposed to be deposited in my home installment and now I have to pay the same regularly in addition to my monthly installment</span><span class=\"yiv6823444327ydpda990107Apple-converted-space\" style=\"color: rgb(38, 40, 42); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444px; text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 40, 42); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444px; text-align: left;\">of repayment of the disbursed loan amount of Rs. Rs. 23,12,702 out of the total sanctioned loan of Rs. 39,14,000 raised by us from SBI Bank, Panchkula. Further causing me a financial loss on payment of interest the respondents are liable to compensate me in addition to that of Rs. 5,00,000 towards mental agony, harassment, and mental tension. Along with all this I am also suffering</span><span class=\"yiv6823444327ydpda990107Apple-converted-space\" style=\"color: rgb(38, 40, 42); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444px; text-align: left;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 40, 42); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444px; text-align: left;\">from mental tension and harassment as I promised to my landlord that I will vacate the rented premises with the hope that we will move within a short span after taking our possession of the said apartment and now the landlord is also feeling perturbed to get rental accommodation vacated by us. I have to run pillar and post to locate a new rental accommodation and this harassment is all due to the acts of the respondents which are required to be compensated.</span><span class=\"yiv6823444327ydpda990107Apple-converted-space\" style=\"color: rgb(38, 40, 42); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444px; text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</span><br></p></li></ol><style type=\"text/css\"> li.li1 {margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'Helvetica Neue\'; color: #454545} ol.ol1 {list-style-type: decimal} </style>',9125000.00,5526546.00,'2017-12-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2015-01-21 00:00:00','2015-10-17 00:00:00','Apartment No. 05082, 8th Floor, Tower No. 5, ATS Casa Espana','','',2,0,0,0,'RaveenaRiar','2018-12-10 11:43:26.000','RaveenaRiar','2018-12-10 11:43:26.000'),(213,1057,'1057',1152,'b523945f-6c84-4b60-989c-1c236269509d','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-10-25 14:55:51.000','Raveena  Riar','raveena7riar@yahoo.com',8054055302,0,995421239517,'ATS Golfmeadows Prelude, Apartment number 1412, Tower 14','Derabassi',28,507,'140507','1','ATS Golfmeadows Prelude, Apartment number 1412, Tower 14','Derabassi',28,507,'140507','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0086','CASA ESPANA','Getamber Anand','getamber@atsgreens.com',8288033311,0,'ATS Infrabuild Pvt. Ltd.','C-226 , Sector 44, Noida',33,216,'201301','1','ATS Infrabuild Pvt. Ltd.','C-226 , Sector 44, Noida',33,216,'201301','1','<ol class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-ol1\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">We have booked a 3+1 BHK Residential Apartment No. 05082, 8<sup>th</sup>&nbsp;Floor, Tower No. 5 having Super-built up Area of 2400 sq. ft., Built-up Area of 2087 sq. ft. in the project, Type-B with car-parking space in the project known as&nbsp;<b><i>‘ATS Casa Espana’&nbsp;</i></b>for the basic sale price of Rs. 91,25,000 (Rs. ninty one&nbsp; Lac twenty-Five Thousand Only)<b>&nbsp;</b>developed by the respondents/ developer vide application dated 07.05.2014, situated in village Budmajra, Sector 121 Mohali-160055, SAS Nagar, Punjab.</li><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">We paid an amount of&nbsp;<b>Rs.31,17,513/-</b>&nbsp;(Rupees Thirty One Lac Seventeen Thousands Five Hundred and Thirteen Only) towards part-payment of the total amount on 17.10.2015 before signing an Agreement to Sell (Apartment Buyer Agreement) was duly entered into between the parties and thereafter Allotment letter was issued by the respondents.</li><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\