t of Rs 16,500 to my landlord. Which amount was supposed to be deposited in my home installment and now I have to pay the same regularly in addition to my monthly installment</span><span class=\"yiv6823444327ydpda990107Apple-converted-space\" style=\"color: rgb(38, 40, 42); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444px; text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 40, 42); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444px; text-align: left;\">of repayment of the disbursed loan amount of Rs. Rs. 23,12,702 out of the total sanctioned loan of Rs. 39,14,000 raised by us from SBI Bank, Panchkula. Further causing me a financial loss on payment of interest the respondents are liable to compensate me in addition to that of Rs. 5,00,000 towards mental agony, harassment, and mental tension. Along with all this I am also suffering</span><span class=\"yiv6823444327ydpda990107Apple-converted-space\" style=\"color: rgb(38, 40, 42); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444px; text-align: left;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 40, 42); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444px; text-align: left;\">from mental tension and harassment as I promised to my landlord that I will vacate the rented premises with the hope that we will move within a short span after taking our possession of the said apartment and now the landlord is also feeling perturbed to get rental accommodation vacated by us. I have to run pillar and post to locate a new rental accommodation and this harassment is all due to the acts of the respondents which are required to be compensated.</span><span class=\"yiv6823444327ydpda990107Apple-converted-space\" style=\"color: rgb(38, 40, 42); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444px; text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</span><br></p></li></ol><style type=\"text/css\"> li.li1 {margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'Helvetica Neue\'; color: #454545} ol.ol1 {list-style-type: decimal} </style>',9125000.00,5526546.00,'2017-12-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2015-01-21 00:00:00','2015-10-17 00:00:00','Apartment No. 05082, 8th Floor, Tower No. 5, ATS Casa Espana','','',2,0,0,0,'RaveenaRiar','2018-12-10 11:45:07.000','RaveenaRiar','2018-12-10 11:45:07.000'),(214,1057,'1057',1152,'b523945f-6c84-4b60-989c-1c236269509d','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-10 11:46:11.000','Raveena  Riar','raveena7riar@yahoo.com',8054055302,0,995421239517,'ATS Golfmeadows Prelude, Apartment number 1412, Tower 14','Derabassi',28,507,'140507','1','ATS Golfmeadows Prelude, Apartment number 1412, Tower 14','Derabassi',28,507,'140507','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0086','CASA ESPANA','Getamber Anand','getamber@atsgreens.com',8288033311,0,'ATS Infrabuild Pvt. Ltd.','C-226 , Sector 44, Noida',33,216,'201301','1','ATS Infrabuild Pvt. Ltd.','C-226 , Sector 44, Noida',33,216,'201301','1','<ol class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-ol1\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">We have booked a 3+1 BHK Residential Apartment No. 05082, 8<sup>th</sup>&nbsp;Floor, Tower No. 5 having Super-built up Area of 2400 sq. ft., Built-up Area of 2087 sq. ft. in the project, Type-B with car-parking space in the project known as&nbsp;<b><i>‘ATS Casa Espana’&nbsp;</i></b>for the basic sale price of Rs. 91,25,000 (Rs. ninty one&nbsp; Lac twenty-Five Thousand Only)<b>&nbsp;</b>developed by the respondents/ developer vide application dated 07.05.2014, situated in village Budmajra, Sector 121 Mohali-160055, SAS Nagar, Punjab.</li><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">We paid an amount of&nbsp;<b>Rs.31,17,513/-</b>&nbsp;(Rupees Thirty One Lac Seventeen Thousands Five Hundred and Thirteen Only) towards part-payment of the total amount on 17.10.2015 before signing an Agreement to Sell (Apartment Buyer Agreement) was duly entered into between the parties and thereafter Allotment letter was issued by the respondents.</li><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">That as per the agreement dated 17.10.2015, the completion of the construction of the apartment has to be completed by December 2017 and the possession of the said apartment was to be delivered to us thereafter i.e. in December 2017 but till date, we have not been offered the possession.<span class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">That after the execution of the agreement, we have been duly depositing the demanded installments of the amount with the respondents to the tune of Rs. 55,26,546 out of the total BSP of Rs. 91,25,000. But still, till date the possession of the aforesaid apartment has not been given to us as per the terms of agreement sell dated 17/10/2015.&nbsp;</li></ol>','<ol class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-ol1\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><li class=\"m_5142867886888198341gmail-li1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<style type=\"text/css\"> p.p1 {margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; text-align: justify; font: 12.0px \'Helvetica Neue\'; color: #454545} </style>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 40, 42); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444px; text-align: left;\">As I’m a retired Pb. govt. employee and had planned my retirement place accordingly to shift from my present rental accommodation after my retirement to the apartment purchased from the respondent but all my plans dashed into the water and apart from paying the monthly rent of Rs 16,500 to my landlord. Which amount was supposed to be deposited in my home installment and now I have to pay the same regularly in addition to my monthly installment</span><span class=\"yiv6823444327ydpda990107Apple-converted-space\" style=\"color: rgb(38, 40, 42); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444px; text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 40, 42); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444px; text-align: left;\">of repayment of the disbursed loan amount of Rs. Rs. 23,12,702 out of the total sanctioned loan of Rs. 39,14,000 raised by us from SBI Bank, Panchkula. Further causing me a financial loss on payment of interest the respondents are liable to compensate me in addition to that of Rs. 5,00,000 towards mental agony, harassment, and mental tension. Along with all this I am also suffering</span><span class=\"yiv6823444327ydpda990107Apple-converted-space\" style=\"color: rgb(38, 40, 42); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444px; text-align: left;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 40, 42); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444px; text-align: left;\">from mental tension and harassment as I promised to my landlord that I will vacate the rented premises with the hope that we will move within a short span after taking our possession of the said apartment and now the landlord is also feeling perturbed to get rental accommodation vacated by us. I have to run pillar and post to locate a new rental accommodation and this harassment is all due to the acts of the respondents which are required to be compensated.</span><span class=\"yiv6823444327ydpda990107Apple-converted-space\" style=\"color: rgb(38, 40, 42); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444px; text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</span><br></p></li></ol><style type=\"text/css\"> li.li1 {margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'Helvetica Neue\'; color: #454545} ol.ol1 {list-style-type: decimal} </style>',9125000.00,5526546.00,'2017-12-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2015-01-21 00:00:00','2015-10-17 00:00:00','Apartment No. 05082, 8th Floor, Tower No. 5, ATS Casa Espana','','',1,1,0,0,'RaveenaRiar','2018-12-10 11:46:06.000','RaveenaRiar','2018-12-10 11:46:06.000');
INSERT INTO `verified_table_tbl_rera_complaint_formn_details` VALUES (215,1070,'1070',1214,'236d33c7-52c2-47c2-9d91-8289ee07ebac','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-11-15 15:23:32.000','Mukesh Gupta','mukeshgupta.31@gmail.com',9417217902,0,0,'B-3, 302, Nirmal Chayya Towers','VIP road, Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','B-3, 302, Nirmal Chayya Towers','VIP road, Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PC0019','M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','rera@waveestate.in',0,0,' M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','Sector-85, SAS Nagar (Mohali).',28,507,'140308','1',' M/s Country Colonisers Pvt. Ltd. ','Sector-85, SAS Nagar (Mohali).',28,507,'140308','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">I had booked independent first floor in Wave\r\nEstate, Sector-99 under subvention scheme in Feb’2013 by making initial payment\r\nof Rs. 3,00,000/- vide cheque no. 60113 dated 08.02.2013. Next payment was made\r\nvide cheque no. 60117 dated 19.04.2013 amounting Rs. 3,18,540/-. It was\r\ncommitted to make delivery within 2 years.&nbsp;However, M/s Country Colonisers\r\nPvt. Ltd. executed the agreement on 07.02.2015 as per which possession was to\r\nbe offered within 24 months along with an extended grace period of 6 months.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Accordingly, I arranged for accommodation on\r\nrent in Apr’2017 and have been paying both rent and EMIs as the subvention\r\nperiod had lapsed. Due to inordinate delay I lost faith in the project and\r\nrequested the developers through e-mails to refund my deposits. However there\r\nwas no response from their end as they continued to defer possession and\r\nprogress on site was very slow. After a lot of follow-up developer agreed to settle\r\nonly pre-EMI interest from Aug’17 (24+6 months from date of agreement) onwards against\r\nbalance sale consideration and offered to deliver possession in Mar’18.\r\nDeveloper even failed to meet that deadline and possession has not been offered\r\ntill date.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">After so much of agony, I do not want to remain\r\nassociated with the developer.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">In\r\nlight of the case facts association with the project has not only been loss of\r\ntime, money and effort but has caused a lot of mental harassment.&nbsp; I therefore request to\r\ncompensate on account of mental harassment. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Time\r\nis of essence in such contracts and complainants cannot be expected to wait indefinitely\r\nfor the respondent to</span> complete the project and hand over its possession\r\nat its free will. As such I waited for 6 years and there is enough ground for\r\nclaiming compensation.<o:p></o:p></p>',4000000.00,3000000.00,'2017-08-07 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2015-02-07 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','40, First Floor, Wave Esatte, Sector-99, Mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'mukesh013128','2018-12-10 15:41:42.000','mukesh013128','2018-12-10 15:41:42.000'),(216,1086,'1086',1256,'d72e4c4b-b5ec-4480-ad45-a996edad35da','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-13 16:20:53.000','SANJAY NEGI','sanket.dhall@gmail.com',9876252581,0,822537351691,'HOUSE NO 630,PANCHKULA HEIGHTS','PEER MUCHALLA ROAD DHAKAULI ZIRAKPUR',28,507,'140603','1','HOUSE NO 630,PANCHKULA HEIGHTS','PEER MUCHALLA ROAD DHAKAULI ZIRAKPUR',28,507,'140603','SANKET DHALL','sanketdhall@gmail.com',9888159159,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0242','FUTURE CITY DEVELOPERS','BHOLA RAM GOYAL','casahomes2016@gmail.com',8128881288,0,'FUTURE CITY DEVELOPERS PVT LTD,AMARI HEIGHTS','SECTOR-115,KHARAR LANDRAN ROAD,MOHALI',28,507,'160055','1','FUTURE CITY DEVELOPERS PVT LTD,AMARI HEIGHTS','SECTOR-115,KHARAR LANDRAN ROAD,MOHALI',28,507,'160055','1','<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">﻿THAT THE COMPLAINANT BOOKED AN APARTMENT AT CASA HOMES WITH FUTURE CITY DEVELOPERS AT SECTOR 115 MOHALI VIDE AGREEMENT TO SELL DATED 23-12-2017 AND ALLOTMENT LETTER DATED 5-4-2018 IN WHICH THE RESPONDENT HAS PROMISED THE COMPLAINANT THAT HE WILL DELIVER THE POSSESSION OF THE FLAT IN JUNE 2018 AND IF NOT POSSIBLE IN JUNE DUE TO NATURAL CALAMINITY THEN THE POSSESSION WILL BE GIVEN TILL OCTOBER 2018,BUT TIL DATE RESPONDENT HAS NOT HANDED OVER THE POSSESSION TO THE COMPLAINANT AND THE WORK IN THE CASA HOMES PROJECT HAS EVEN NOT BEEN COMPLETED AS YET,TO SEE THE DEVELOPMENT WORK THERE PHOTOGRAPHS OF THE PROJECT AND MY APARTMENT HAS BEEN ANNEXED WITH THE COMPLAINT.THE TOTAL COST OF THE APARTMENT IS 31,80,800/- AND THE COMPLAINANT HAS PAID RUPEES 190,8480/- LAKHS TILL DATE TO THE RESPONDENT VIDE RECEIPT NOS 232 AND 257 DATED 21-4-18 AND 14-5-18.THAT THE COMPLAINANT IS READY TO PAY THE PENDING AMOUNT ALSO BUT THE PROJECT IS NOT READY AND THE MONEY THE COMPLAINANT HAS ALREADY PAID IS ALL WASTED AS IT IS THE HARD EARNED MONEY OF THE COMPLAINANT AS HE IS DOING A PRIVATE JOB AND HAS TAKEN LOAN AMOUNTING TO RS 31,00,000/-,BUT TILL DATE RESPONDENT IS PLAYING WITH THE HARD EARNED MONEY OF THE COMPLAINANT AND DID NOT DELIVER THE POSSESSION TILL DATE.</span><br></p>','<p>I- THAT TO REFUND THE AMOUNT RS 190,8480/- ALONG WITH 24% INTEREST PER ANNUM.</p><p>II- THAT FOR GRANT OF COMPENSATION ON ACCOUNT OF DEFICIENCY IN SERVICES BY THE RESPONDENT AMOUNTING TO RUPEES 10 LAKHS.</p><p>III- THAT TO PAY THE MENTAL HARRASSEMENT ,AGONY TO THE COMPLAINANT TO THE TUNE OF RS 1 LAKHS.</p><p>IIII- THAT TO PAY THE LITIGATION EXPENSES TO THE TUNE OF RS 50,000/-</p>',3180800.00,1908480.00,'2018-06-30 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2018-04-05 00:00:00','2017-12-23 00:00:00','CASA HOMES,F-4,TOWER-F,SECTOR-115 KHARAR LANDRAN ROAD KHARAR','','',2,0,0,0,'sanket.dhall','2018-12-10 16:15:20.000','sanket.dhall','2018-12-10 16:15:20.000'),(217,1087,'1087',1256,'d72e4c4b-b5ec-4480-ad45-a996edad35da','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','SANJAY NEGI','sanket.dhall@gmail.com',9888159159,0,822537351691,'HOUSE NO 630,PANCHKULA HEIGHTS','PEER MUCHALLA ROAD DHAKAULI ZIRAKPUR',28,507,'140603','1','163 SUNNY ENCLAVE ','ZIRAKPUR',28,507,'140603','SANKET DHALL','sanket.dhall@gmail.com',9888159159,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0242','CASA HOMES,FUTURE CITY DEVELOPERS','BHOLA RAM GOYAL','casahomes2016@gmail.com',8128881282,0,'future city developers pvt ltd,amari heights,sector-115','kharaa landran road mohali',28,507,'160055','1','future city developers pvt ltd,amari heights,sector-115','kharaa landran road mohali',28,507,'160055','1','<p>THAT THE COMPLAINANT PURCHASED A FLAT AT KHARAR LANDRAN ROAD THROUGH FUTURE CITY DEVELOPERS ,PROJECT NAMED AS CASA HOMES AT TOWER-F,BLOCK-F,GROUND FLOOR VIDE AGREEMENT TO SELL DATED 23-12-2018 AND IN THE TOTAL CONSIDERATION AMOUNT OF RS 31,80,800/- LAKHS.</p><p>THAT THE COMPLAINANT PAID RS 19,8480/- RUPEES IN TOTAL TO THE RESPONDENT VIDE RECEIPT NOS 257 AND 232.</p><p>THAT THE RESPONDENT HAS PROMISED TO DELIVER THE POSSESSION OF THE SAID FLAT IN JUNE 2018 AND OCTOBER 2018 IF EXTENDED DUE TO NATURAL CALAMITY&nbsp; IF ANY,THAT BOTH THE DATES HAVE BEEN MISSED BY THE RESPONDENT TO DELIVER THE POSSESSION OF THE FLAT TO THE COMPLAINANT.</p><p>THAT THE COMPLAINANT VISITED THE SITE IN DECEMBER 2018 AND TILL DATE THE PROJECT HAS NOT BEEN COMPLETED AS YET AS THERE ARE NO ROADS ,NO SEWERAGE,NO WATER SUPPLY,NO ELECTRICITY,THEN HOW THE RESPONDENT HAS PROMISED TO DELIVER THE FLAT IN JUNE AS TILL DATE NOTHING HAS BEEN DONE SO FAR.</p><p>THAT THE RESPONDENT IS DOING A PRIVATE JOB AND IS ALSO READY TO PAY THE PENDING AMOUNT TO THE RESPONDENT BUT THE WORK THERE HAS NOT BEEN COMPLETED AS YET.</p><p>THAT THE COMPLAINANT IS PAYING INTEREST ON THE LOAN TAKEN BY HIM BUT THE RESPONDENT IS PLAYING WITH THE HARD EARNED MONEY OF THE COMPLAINANT</p>','<p>1- THAT AMOUNT OF RS 1908480/-LAKHS ALONG WITH 24% INTEREST PER ANNUM FROM THE DATE OF DEPOSIT BEFORE THE RESPONDENT.</p><p>2-THAT TO PAY THE COMPENSATION ON ACCOUNT OF HARASSEMENT AND MENTAL AGONY TO THE TUNE OF RS 10,00,000/-.</p><p>3- THAT TO PAY THE LITIGATION EXPENSES TO THE COMPLAINANT TO THE TUNE OF RS 50,000/-</p>',3180800.00,1908480.00,'2018-06-30 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2018-04-05 00:00:00','2018-12-23 00:00:00','CASA HOMES,FLAT NO-F-4,TOWER-F,GROUND FLOOR,SECTOR-115,KHARAR LANDRAN ROAD,MOHALI','','',1,0,0,0,'sanket.dhall','2018-12-10 17:14:11.000','sanket.dhall','2018-12-10 17:14:11.000'),(218,1070,'1070',1214,'236d33c7-52c2-47c2-9d91-8289ee07ebac','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-11-15 15:23:32.000','Mukesh Gupta','mukeshgupta.31@gmail.com',9417217902,0,0,'B-3, 302, Nirmal Chayya Towers','VIP road, Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','B-3, 302, Nirmal Chayya Towers','VIP road, Zirakpur',28,50