t-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Accordingly, I arranged for accommodation on\r\nrent in Apr’2017 and have been paying both rent and EMIs as the subvention\r\nperiod had lapsed. Due to inordinate delay I lost faith in the project and\r\nrequested the developers through e-mails to refund my deposits. However there\r\nwas no response from their end as they continued to defer possession and\r\nprogress on site was very slow. After a lot of follow-up developer agreed to settle\r\nonly pre-EMI interest from Aug’17 (24+6 months from date of agreement) onwards against\r\nbalance sale consideration and offered to deliver possession in Mar’18.\r\nDeveloper even failed to meet that deadline and possession has not been offered\r\ntill date.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">After so much of agony, I do not want to remain\r\nassociated with the developer.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">In\r\nlight of the case facts association with the project has not only been loss of\r\ntime, money and effort but has caused a lot of mental harassment.&nbsp; I therefore request to\r\ncompensate on account of mental harassment. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Time\r\nis of essence in such contracts and complainants cannot be expected to wait indefinitely\r\nfor the respondent to</span> complete the project and hand over its possession\r\nat its free will. As such I waited for 6 years and there is enough ground for\r\nclaiming compensation.<o:p></o:p></p>',4000000.00,3000000.00,'2017-08-07 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2015-02-07 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','40, First Floor, Wave Esatte, Sector-99, Mohali','','',1,1,0,0,'mukesh013128','2018-12-11 14:32:00.000','mukesh013128','2018-12-11 14:32:00.000'),(221,1063,'1063',1172,'fe8a123a-24f0-4e44-a8e1-3e154d6acf61','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-10-24 19:09:44.000','Ramesh Mittal','rameshmittal69@gmail.com',9934787251,0,0,'Mittal House, Main Road','Near Pankaj Cinema, Raxaul',5,188,'845305','1','House No.253','Sector 4, Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0093','Palm Spring','M/s Manohar Infrastructure & Constructions Pvt Ltd','nbs@manoharrealty.com',1725033524,0,'SCO 139-142','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','SCO 139-142','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','<p>Applicant, on 21.10.2013 booked a (C1) 250 sq yards plot @RS. 20000 per sq yd from the respondent in Palm Spring.Respondent assured that it has all approvals except layout which will be obtained within 2-3months and possession will be delivered in 2 years.A broacher (C2) was also provided to applicant before booking. Applicant paid Rs. 1500000 i.e 30% of sale consideration vide two cheques (C3)dated 21.10.13 &amp; 19.12.13. Insipte of repeated requests,respondent did not issue any allotment letter and execute the agreement.Respondent had even concealed that it was not having CLU and it was in September,2014(C4)it informed the applicant that it has received the CLU now and allotment shall be made in Dec,2014.The applicant was shocked after knowing that as he was under impression that it was having all the approvals.Since the respondent assured to make allotment in Dec, 2014 the applicant chose to have the plot since substantial amount was already paid by him.But the respondent did not issue any allotment letter even by the said date.The respondent even failed to start any development.Inspite of number of visits,repeated requests and assurances, the respondent did not issue any allotment letter and execute the agreement during year 2014 to 2018.Email was also sent to respondent on 17.08.18(C5)requesting the respondent to refund the amount since the respondent failed to issue any allotment letter &amp; execute agreement.Then the respondent telephonically informed the applicant that it will sell the plot at premium of Rs. 2000 per sq yd and refund the amount to him, And for that purpose also asked the bank detail,which was duly sent by the applicant vide email dated 21.08.18(C6).The respondent has misrepresented the applicant since beginning and never informed him about the true picture of the approvals and development.It had not even applied the necessary permissions when the plot was sold to applicant.A list of dates of approvals C7 and some important approvals as C8 &amp; C9 \r\n</p><p><br></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">Directing the respondent to pay the compensation of Rs. 10 lacs\r\nfor deficiency in services, unfair trade practices and harassment caused to the\r\napplicant and for using the hard earned money of the applicant for such a long\r\nperiod. Inspite of repeated requests visits by the applicant the respondent did\r\nnot issue any allotment letter and execute the buyer\'s agreement till date. The\r\nrespondent was not having approval when the plot was sold to the applicant. As\r\nper the approvals and sanctions, the respondent was barred from collecting the\r\nmoney from public till exemption u/s 44 is received, which was infact received\r\non 25.01.2017.&nbsp;That the&nbsp; conduct of the opposite party in not\r\ndelivering the possession of the plot in a time bound manner, not doing\r\ndevelopment on the site, booking the plot in question without obtaining any\r\napproval and permissions, not issuing any allotment letter to the applicant,\r\nnot executing the buyer’s agreement&nbsp;&nbsp;even after receiving about 30%\r\nof the total cost of plot, misrepresented the applicant during all these years\r\nabout the approvals and sanctions and also about the development, demanding\r\nmore money in the shape of IDC which it cannot do, has caused and is causing\r\nmental harassment and the applicant is suffering huge financial loss due to\r\nnon-allotment and non-delivery of possession of the said plot.The respondent is\r\nliable to pay Rs. 10 lacs&nbsp;for causing financial loss, escalation in prices\r\nand on account of mental and physical harassment and agony besides litigation\r\nexpenses to the tune of Rs. 50000/-.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><br clear=\"all\">\r\n&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:200%;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:200%;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><br></p>',5000000.00,1500000.00,'2015-10-20 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2013-10-21 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','no allotment & Agreement yet','','',2,0,0,0,'rerafilingformn','2018-12-11 22:13:43.000','rerafilingformn','2018-12-11 22:13:43.000'),(222,1063,'1063',1172,'fe8a123a-24f0-4e44-a8e1-3e154d6acf61','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-10-24 19:09:44.000','Ramesh Mittal','rameshmittal69@gmail.com',9934787251,0,0,'Mittal House, Main Road','Near Pankaj Cinema, Raxaul',5,188,'845305','1','House No.253','Sector 4, Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0093','Palm Spring','M/s Manohar Infrastructure & Constructions Pvt Ltd','nbs@manoharrealty.com',1725033524,0,'SCO 139-142','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','SCO 139-142','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','<p>Applicant, on 21.10.2013 booked a (C1) 250 sq yards plot @RS. 20000 per sq yd from the respondent in Palm Spring.Respondent assured that it has all approvals except layout which will be obtained within 2-3months and possession will be delivered in 2 years.A broacher (C2) was also provided to applicant before booking. Applicant paid Rs. 1500000 i.e 30% of sale consideration vide two cheques (C3)dated 21.10.13 &amp; 19.12.13. Insipte of repeated requests,respondent did not issue any allotment letter and execute the agreement.Respondent had even concealed that it was not having CLU and it was in September,2014(C4)it informed the applicant that it has received the CLU now and allotment shall be made in Dec,2014.The applicant was shocked after knowing that as he was under impression that it was having all the approvals.Since the respondent assured to make allotment in Dec, 2014 the applicant chose to have the plot since substantial amount was alread