l possession of the Allotted Unit, complete in all respects, is handed over to the Complainant;</p><p>iii) to pay the promised amount for delay in possession to be paid by the respondent i.e. Rs.1,32,000/- including interest @ 18% on the said amount.</p><p>iv) to compensate the Complainant for deficiency in service rendered to the tune of Rs.2,00,000/-.</p><p>v) to direct the Respondent to compensate the Complainant for the rental money of Rs. 80,000/- per month paid by them for occupying the rented accommodation along with interest at the rate of 12% per annum from the proposed date of possession till its actual realization;&nbsp;</p><p>vi) to direct the Respondent to pay compensation to the Complainant to the tune of Rs. 8 lacs on account of mental agony and harassment caused to the Complainant;</p><p>vii) to pay Rs. 1,50,000/- as litigation costs.&nbsp;</p>',9950000.00,9950000.00,'2018-03-20 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2014-06-20 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','apartment no 09062 tower no 9 ','','',2,0,0,0,'amit.heman@gmail.com','2018-12-16 19:22:43.000','amit.heman@gmail.com','2018-12-16 19:22:43.000'),(233,1081,'1081',1247,'79ebe07e-2dcd-4db9-b9bf-d83f90187768','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Dhiraj Gurvinder Singh','gurdhiraj@yahoo.co.in',9855578712,0,0,'house no 1083','Phase 9',28,507,'160062','1','house no 1083','Phase 9',28,507,'160062','Amit Sharma','amit@lawyer.com',9878222444,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0086','ATS Casa Espana ','ATS Infrabuild Private Limited','pradeep.rathee@atsgreens.com',0,0,'ATS Casa Espana Street, sector 121','NH 21',28,507,'160055','1','ATS Casa Espana Street, sector 121','NH 21',28,507,'160055','1','<p>1.That the Respondents in the first instance, had launched a Group Housing Project in Mohali, Sector 121, Punjab, under the name and style of “ATS Casa Espana”.  The complainant booked an apartment on 28.02.2014.  In the interregnum, the Respondents had issued an Allotment Letter dated 20-06-2