le Authority may be pleased to allow the above mentioned complaint as under:-&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>i) to direct the respondent to complete the Allotted Unit in all respects by providing the requisite amenities and facilities as per the terms and conditions of the Allotment Letter dated 20.06.2014 and the specifications of the Allotted Unit as appended therewith and thereafter handover its actual physical possession to the Complainant;&nbsp;</p><p>ii) to pay compensation to the Complainant for the inordinate delay in offering the actual physical possession of the Allotted Unit, complete in all respects, beyond the stipulated time period which expired on 20.03.2018 in the form of interest @ 24% per annum payable on the amount of Rs. 99,50,000/- till such time the actual physical possession of the Allotted Unit, complete in all respects, is handed over to the Complainant;</p><p>iii) to pay the promised amount for delay in possession to be paid by the respondent i.e. Rs.1,32,000/- including interest @ 18% on the said amount.</p><p>iv) to compensate the Complainant for deficiency in service rendered to the tune of Rs.2,00,000/-.</p><p>v) to direct the Respondent to compensate the Complainant for the rental money of Rs. 80,000/- per month paid by them for occupying the rented accommodation along with interest at the rate of 12% per annum from the proposed date of possession till its actual realization;&nbsp;</p><p>vi) to direct the Respondent to pay compensation to the Complainant to the tune of Rs. 8 lacs on account of mental agony and harassment caused to the Complainant;</p><p>vii) to pay Rs. 1,50,000/- as litigation costs.&nbsp;</p>',9950000.00,9950000.00,'2018-03-20 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2014-06-20 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','apartment no 09062 tower no 9 ','','',2,0,0,0,'amit.heman@gmail.com','2018-12-16 19:29:46.000','amit.heman@gmail.com','2018-12-16 19:29:46.000'),(234,1081,'1081',1247,'79ebe07e-2dcd-4db9-b9bf-d83f90187768','FormTyp