of Agreement i.e.\r\n05.10.2015.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">The respondents have failed to deliver the\r\npossession till date. The Complaints on assurance of respondents had sold their\r\nhouse property in home town – Chirkunda, Jharkhand on 24.05.2018 and have\r\nshifted permanently in a rental accomodation at Flat No: 201, HEWO Apartments,\r\nSector 6, Mansa Devi Complex, Panchkula.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">The complaints are aggrieved party. The respondents\r\nhave failed to address their grievances for delay in possession for more than 3\r\nyears. A Legal notice was also served to them in his context on 15.07.2018. The\r\nrespondents had shown no interest to our complaint and have adopted a very\r\nindifferent attitude.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">That due to the deficiency in service\r\non the part of the&nbsp;respondents&nbsp;resulting into a\r\nbig&nbsp;harassment,&nbsp;tension&nbsp;and&nbsp;apprehension&nbsp;as well as monetary\r\nloss, the complainants are entitled to the&nbsp;following&nbsp;reliefs from\r\nthe&nbsp;respondents:</span><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;line-height:normal;tab-stops:14.2pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">1. Immediate&nbsp;possession\r\nof the fully developed&nbsp;apartment&nbsp;as promised by the&nbsp;respondents</span><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">.</span><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;line-height:normal;tab-stops:14.2pt\"><span style=\"font-family: roboto, serif; font-size: 8pt;\">2. A\r\nsum of Rs. 5 lacs as compensation on account of harassment, tension and\r\napprehension caused to the complainant due to delay in possession of the\r\napartment</span><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;line-height:normal;tab-stops:14.2pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">3. Legal\r\nExpense to the tune of Rs. 75,000/- for forcing the complainant to enter into\r\nthis uncalled for litigation</span><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:normal;tab-stops:14.2pt\"><span style=\"font-family: roboto, serif; font-size: 8pt;\">4. Amount of rent\r\nand&nbsp;maintenance&nbsp;charges paid / to be paid by the complaint in respect\r\nof the rented flat where they are presently residing from 01.05.2018, till the\r\ndate of handing over the possession of the&nbsp;apartment.</span><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:normal;tab-stops:14.2pt\"><span style=\"font-family: roboto, serif; font-size: 8pt; text-align: justify;\">It is therefore prayed that\r\nthe&nbsp;respondents&nbsp;be directed to give the above mention reliefs to the\r\ncomplainants as the&nbsp;complaints&nbsp;are entitled to the above said relief\r\nin&nbsp;lieu&nbsp;of the facts and circumstances explained.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:normal;tab-stops:14.2pt\"><span style=\"font-family: roboto, serif; font-size: 8pt; text-align: justify;\">NOTE: WE HAVE ALSO APPLIED FOR RELIEFS UNDER FORM - M - AS PER NEW RERA RULES<br></span><br></p>',6850000.00,6360329.00,'2015-10-05 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2012-08-06 00:00:00','2012-08-06 00:00:00','Flat No H101, Tower H\r\n1st Floor, Sushma Chandigarh Grande, Zirakpur','','',2,0,0,0,'manjit305','2018-12-17 13:57:43.000','manjit305','2018-12-17 13:57:43.000'),(240,1089,'1089',1172,'fe8a123a-24f0-4e44-a8e1-3e154d6acf61','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Bhupinder Dogra','adv.ashish1087@gmail.com',9418066670,0,0,'village Dasoli','Tehsil Chopal',14,533,'171211','1','Sector 4, Mansa Devi Complex','Sector 4, Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0093','PALM GARDEN','M/s Manohar Infrastructure & Constructions Pvt Ltd','nbs@manoharrealty.com',0,1725033524,'SCO 139-142','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','SCO 139-142','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','0','<p>abc</p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:15.75pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">Directing the respondent\r\nto pay the compensation of Rs. 10 lacs for deficiency in services, unfair trade\r\npractices and harassment caused to the applicants and for using their hard\r\nearned money for such a long period. Inspite of repeated requests visits by the\r\napplicants the respondent did not issue any allotment letter and execute the\r\nbuyer\'s agreement till date. The respondent was not having approval when the\r\nplot was sold to the applicants. As per the approvals and sanctions, the\r\nrespondent was barred from collecting the money from public till exemption u/s\r\n44 is received, which was infact received on 25.01.2017.&nbsp;That the&nbsp;\r\nconduct of the opposite party in not delivering the possession of the plot in a\r\ntime bound manner, not doing development on the site, booking the plot in\r\nquestion without obtaining any approval and permissions, not issuing any\r\nallotment letter to the applicant, not executing the buyer’s\r\nagreement&nbsp;&nbsp;even after receiving about 30% of the total cost of plot,\r\nmisrepresented the applicants during all these years about the approvals and\r\nsanctions and also about the development, demanding more money in the shape of\r\nIDC which it cannot do, has caused and is causing mental harassment and the\r\napplicants are suffering huge financial loss due to non-allotment and\r\nnon-delivery of possession of the said plot.The respondent is liable to pay Rs.\r\n10 lacs&nbsp;for causing financial loss, escalation in prices and on account of\r\nmental and physical harassment and agony besides litigation expenses to the\r\ntune of Rs. 50000/-.&nbsp;The respondent be also directed to compensate the\r\napplicants towards the escalation in construction cost, to the tune of Rs. 10\r\nlacs. The construction cost at present is about 3 times the cost in 2013. The\r\nopposite party had assured to deliver the possession within 2 years i.e. by\r\n2013. The applicants cannot be made to suffer due to the misdeeds of the\r\nrespondent.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:15.75pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><br clear=\"all\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>',4625000.00,1387500.00,'2013-10-18 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2011-10-18 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','not allotted yet','','',2,0,0,0,'rerafilingformn','2018-12-23 22:50:17.000','rerafilingformn','2018-12-23 22:50:17.000'),(241,1089,'1089',1172,'fe8a123a-24f0-4e44-a8e1-3e154d6acf61','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Bhupinder Dogra','adv.ashish1087@gmail.com',9418066670,0,0,'village Dasoli','Tehsil Chopal',14,533,'171211','1','Sector 4, Mansa Devi Complex','Sector 4, Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0093','PALM GARDEN','M/s Manohar Infrastructure & Constructions Pvt Ltd','nbs@manoharrealty.com',0,1725033524,'SCO 139-142','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','SCO 139-142','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','0','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:150%;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Applicants\r\non 18.10.2011 booked a (C1)250 sq yards plot @RS. 18500 per sq yd from the\r\nrespondent in Palm Garden. Before booking of said plot, respondent had assured\r\nthe applicants that the development would be started very soon and possession\r\nwill be delivered in 2 years. Applicants paid Rs. 1387500 i.e. 30% of sale\r\nconsideration vide cheque (C2)dated 18.10.11. Insipte of repeated requests, respondent\r\ndid not issue any allotment letter and execute the agreement. Respondent had\r\neven concealed that it was not having CLU. Infact the respondent had not even\r\napplied the necessary permissions when the plot was sold.The respondent vide\r\nits letter(C3),which was received by the applicants in Sept,2014,had assured to\r\nallot the plot by Dec,2014 but it failed to do so. After that the applicants,many\r\ntimes requested the respondent to issue the allotment letter and execute the agreement,but\r\nthe respondent did not pay any heed to their request.Instead it started\r\ndemanding more money for issuing allotment letter &amp; executing the\r\nagreement.The applicants visited the office of respondent many times during the\r\nyear 2015, 2016, 2017 &amp; 2018 for redressal of their grievances but to no\r\navail.A letter dated 3.7.17(C4)was also received by the applicants vide which\r\nthe respondent invited the complainants to visit the project site.Accordingly\r\nthe applicants visited the project site in Oct,2017 but the respondent started\r\ndemanding more money for issuing the plot number and executing the agreement.The\r\napplicants again visited the office of respondent in Dec,2017 and Mar,2018 for\r\ngetting the allotment letter and agreement but to no avail.The respondent\r\nalways kept the applicants in dark about the approvals and development.It has\r\nfailed to develop the project.It had not even applied the necessary permissions\r\nwhen the plot was sold to applicants.A list of dates of approvals (C5) and some\r\nimportant approval as (C6&amp;C7).Complaint for registration of FIR to\r\nvigilance 1.10.18 as C8<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:15.75pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">Directing the respondent\r\nto pay the compensation of Rs. 10 lacs for deficiency in services, unfair trade\r\npractices and harassment caused to the applicants and for using their hard\r\nearned money for such a long period. Inspite of repeated requests visits by the\r\napplicants the respondent did not issue any allotment letter and execute the\r\nbuyer\'s agreement till date. The respondent was not having approval when the\r\nplot was sold to the applicants. As per the approvals and sanctions, the\r\nrespondent was barred from collecting the money from public till exemption u/s\r\n44 is received, which was infact received on 25.01.2017.&nbsp;That the&nbsp;\r\nconduct of the opposite party in not delivering the possession of the plot in a\r\ntime bound manner, not doing development on the site, booking the plot in\r\nquestion without obtaining any approval and permissions, not issuing any\r\nallotment letter to the applicant, not executing the buyer’s\r\nagreement&nbsp;&nbsp;even after receiving about 30% of the total cost of plot,\r\nmisrepresented the applicants during all these years about the approvals and\r\nsanctions and also about the development, demanding more money in the shape of\r\nIDC which it cannot do, has caused and is causing mental harassment and the\r\napplicants are suffering huge financial loss due to non-allotment and\r\nnon-delivery of possession of the said plot.The respondent is liable to pay Rs.\r\n10 lacs&nbsp;for causing financial loss, escalation in prices and on account of\r\nmental and physical harassment and agony besides litigation expenses to the\r\ntune of Rs. 50000/-.&nbsp;The respondent be also directed to compensate the\r\napplicants towards the escalation in construction cost, to the tune of Rs. 10\r\nlacs. The construction cost at present is about 3 times the cost in 2013. The\r\nopposite party had assured to deliver the possession within 2 years i.e. by\r\n2013. The applicants cannot be made to suffer due to the misdeeds of the\r\nrespondent.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:15.75pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><br clear=\"all\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>',4625000.00,1387500.00,'2013-10-18 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2011-10-18 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','not allotted yet','','',2,0,0,0,'rerafilingformn','2018-12-23 22:53:47.000','rerafilingformn','2018-12-23 22:53:47.000'),(242,1089,'1089',1172,'fe8a123a-24f0-4e44-a8e1-3e154d6acf61','FormTypeN',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Bhupinder Dogra','adv.ashish1087@gmail.com',9418066670,0,0,'village Dasoli','Tehsil Chopal',14,533,'171211','1','Sector 4, Mansa Devi Complex','Sector 4, Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','P