',0,1725033524,'SCO 139-142','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','1','SCO 139-142','Sector-17C',6,128,'160017','0','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:150%;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Applicants\r\non 18.10.2011 booked a (C1)250 sq yards plot @RS. 18500 per sq yd from the\r\nrespondent in Palm Garden. Before booking of said plot, respondent had assured\r\nthe applicants that the development would be started very soon and possession\r\nwill be delivered in 2 years. Applicants paid Rs. 1387500 i.e. 30% of sale\r\nconsideration vide cheque (C2)dated 18.10.11. Insipte of repeated requests, respondent\r\ndid not issue any allotment letter and execute the agreement. Respondent had\r\neven concealed that it was not having CLU. Infact the respondent had not even\r\napplied the necessary permissions when the plot was sold.The respondent vide\r\nits letter(C3),which was received by the applicants in Sept,2014,had assured to\r\nallot the plot by Dec,2014 but it failed to do so. After that the applicants,many\r\ntimes requested the respondent to issue the allotment letter and execute the agreement,but\r\nthe respondent did not pay any heed to their request.Instead it started\r\ndemanding more money for issuing allotment letter &amp; executing the\r\nagreement.The applicants visited the office of respondent many times during the\r\nyear 2015, 2016, 2017 &amp; 2018 for redressal of their grievances but to no\r\navail.A letter dated 3.7.17(C4)was also received by the applicants vide which\r\nthe respondent invited the complainants to visit the project site.Accordingly\r\nthe applicants visited the project site in Oct,2017 but the respondent started\r\ndemanding more money for issuing the plot number and executing the agreement.The\r\napplicants again visited the office of respondent in Dec,2017 and Mar,2018 for\r\ngetting the allotment letter and agreement but to no avail.The respondent\r\nalways kept the applicants in dark about the approvals and development.It has\r\nfailed to develop the project.It had not even applied the necessary permissions\r\nwhen the plot was sold to applicants.A list of dates of approvals (C5) and some\r\nimportant approval as (C6&amp;C7).Complaint for registration of FIR to\r\nvigilance 1.10.18 as C8<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<ol><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 15.75pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">Directing the respondent\r\nto pay the compensation of Rs. 10 lacs for deficiency in services, unfair trade\r\npractices and harassment caused to the applicants and for using their hard\r\nearned money for such a long period. Inspite of repeated requests visits by the\r\napplicants the respondent did not issue any allotment letter and execute the\r\nbuyer\'s agreement till date. The respondent was not having approval when the\r\nplot was sold to the applicants. As per the approvals and sanctions, the\r\nrespondent was barred from collecting the money from public till exemption u/s\r\n44 is received, which was infact received on 25.01.2017.&nbsp;That the&nbsp;\r\nconduct of the opposite party in not delivering the possession of the plot in a\r\ntime bound manner, not doing development on the site, booking the plot in\r\nquestion without obtaining any approval and permissions, not issuing any\r\nallotment letter to the applicant, not executing the buyer’s\r\nagreement&nbsp;&nbsp;even after receiving about 30% of the total cost of plot,\r\nmisrepresented the applicants during all these years about the approvals and\r\nsanctions and also about the development, demanding more money in the shape of\r\nIDC which it cannot do, has caused and is causing mental harassment and the\r\napplicants are suffering huge financial loss due to non-allotment and\r\nnon-delivery of possession of the said plot.The respondent is liable to pay Rs.\r\n10 lacs&nbsp;for causing financial loss, and on account of\r\nmental and physical harassment and agony besides litigation expenses to the\r\ntune of Rs. 50000/-.&nbsp;</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 15.75pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">The respondent be also directed to compensate the\r\napplicants towards the escalation in construction cost, to the tune of Rs. 10\r\nlacs. The construction cost at present is about 3 times the cost in 2013. The\r\nopposite party had assured to deliver the possession within 2 years i.e. by\r\n2013. The applicants cannot be made to suffer due to the misdeeds of the\r\nrespondent.</span></li></ol><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:15.75pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><br clear=\"all\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>',4625000.00,1387500.00,'2013-10-18 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2011-10-18 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','not allotted yet','','',1,1,0,0,'rerafilingformn','2018-12-23 23:19:07.000','rerafilingformn','2018-12-23 23:19:07.000'),(244,1088,'1088',1246,'96086989-2e6b-40cc-800e-d883e1db44eb','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-24 11:51:32.000','Sushil Kumari','ravi.choudhary@yahoo.co.in',9878988441,0,0,'Flat No.505, 5th Floor, Tower-1','SBP North Valley, Kharar-Landran road, Santemajra, Kharar Mohali ',28,507,'140307','1','Flat No.505, 5th Floor, Tower-1','SBP North Valley, Kharar-Landran road, Santemajra, Kharar Mohali ',28,507,'140307','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0242','CASA Homes','Bhola Ram Goyal','casahomes2016@gmail.com',0,0,'Future City developers pvt. ltd, Sector 115, Kharar-Landran highway, SAS Nagar 140307','',28,507,'140307','1','Future City developers pvt. ltd, Sector 115, Kharar-Landran highway, SAS Nagar 140307','',28,507,'140307','1','<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->4)	That as per clause 7 of the agreement, the possession of the flat was to be handed over to the allottee by 31st March 2018 after obtaining OC, but the OC is still to be produced to us for taking possession of the flat which is clearly an event of default by promoter.&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span style=\"text-indent: -0.25in;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Casa Homes have charged us GST @12% which has\r\nincreased the cost of our flat. As per the government notification, the cost of\r\nflat should come down even after levying the GST and that extra burden should\r\nnot be passed on the buyers. As we have already paid the GST@12% on approx. 90%\r\nof the cost of Flat, please provide us the receipt of GST paid to the\r\ngovernment so that we can take up the matter separately with the department\r\nconcerned for pursuing our case of GST</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->3)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><!--[endif]-->Casa Homes have sold this flat on the pretext of\r\ngiving Subvention benefit. The same however has been started in July 2018 but stopped\r\nwef 1<sup>st</sup> Sept 2018 whereas the possession of flat is still not given\r\nto us without assigning any reason thereof</p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->4)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><!--[endif]-->That as per the clause ( G ) of the agreement,\r\nCarpet area of the Flat is 1350 SqFt , type 2 BHK on second floor in block D.\r\nFurther Clause 1.2 states that that “the total price for the apartment based on\r\nthe carpet area is 2893340 “and having per sqft rate of INR 2143.21. Further\r\nclause 1.7 states that the promoter shall furnish the details of the carpet\r\narea to ascertain the total price of the apartment. Please furnish the required\r\ndetails so that the final price of the flat can be arrived based on the carpet\r\narea.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\">1)&nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><o:p><br></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><o:p><br></o:p></p>','<p>1. Compensation on account of delayed possession from 1st April 2018 till the date of producing the occupation certificate as per the Rera rules.</p><p>2. Compensation on account of subvention scheme till the time possession has not been accepted , for which payment has been made by promoter till 31st August 2018 but stopped after that.</p><p>3. Actual carpet area to be measured jointly by promoter and allotee and accordingly refund / demand balance payment. The carpet area mentioned in the agreement is 1350 Sqft and the same to be handed over to allotee.</p><p>4. Current state of flat portrays substandard quality and workmanship. All substandard material to be replaced like wooden doors/ Tiles/ etc or compensation to be paid.</p><p>5. Decision of GST demanded by promoter.</p>',2893340.00,2602139.00,'2018-03-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2018-10-08 00:00:00','2017-12-23 00:00:00','DDD-3 , Second Foor ,CASA Homes, Sector 115, Kharar-Landran highway, SAS Nagar 140307','','',2,0,0,0,'Ravikant','2018-12-24 11:37:58.000','Ravikant','2018-12-24 11:37:58.000'),(245,1079,'1079',1216,'11d722ae-bbbb-479b-bed1-c40adf90f1de','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-03 12:47:45.000','Jaswant  Singh','sjaswants803@gmail.com',9466694194,0,0,'85 SCC Area Nilokheri Dist karnal','',13,10,'132117','1','85 SCC Area Nilokheri Dist karnal','',13,10,'132117','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0316','Green Valley Heights','Harbans Lal Singla','greenvalleyheights2010@yahoo.co.in',9876718666,0,'M/s Green Valley Heights,Village Kishanpura,Behind sector 20 Panchkula','MC Zirakpur, SAS Nagar Mohali Punjab',28,507,'140603','1','M/s Green Valley Heights,Village Kishanpura,Behind sector 20 Panchkula','MC Zirakpur, SAS Nagar Mohali Punjab',28,507,'140603','1','<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin-left:49.5pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Thorndale AMT&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Thorndale AMT&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Thorndale AMT&quot;\">(i)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Thorndale AMT&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">I booked a 2 BHK residential Flat of <st1:metricconverter productid=\"1285 sq. ft\" w:st=\"on\">1285 sq. ft</st1:metricconverter>. area in\r\ngreen valley heights for rupees 28,50,000/- on 11.7,2011 by paying 10% i.e. Rs.\r\n2,85,000/- and provisionally allotted with flat No. 512 vide application /\r\ninitial agreement dated 28-09-2011 and subsequently on 15-10- 2011, I was\r\nallotted with flat No. <st1:metricconverter productid=\"512 in\" w:st=\"on\">512 in</st1:metricconverter>\r\nGreen Valley Heights dated 15-10-2011. As per the allotment letter I was\r\npromised the delivery of semi-furnished flat within three years from the date\r\nof booking/allotment. On <st1:date year=\"2013\" day=\"2\" month=\"8\" ls=\"trans\" w:st=\"on\">8-2-2013</st1:date> respondent(s) handed over a printed Buyer’s\r\napartment agreement after the delay of 19 months from date of booking. The\r\ndelay in providing this agreement letter was deliberate and a tactics on the\r\npart of respondents as this document should have been executed within\r\nreasonable time along with allotment. This is unfair trade practice.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:49.5pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Thorndale AMT&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left:49.5pt;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Thorndale AMT&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Thorndale AMT&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Thorndale AMT&quot;\">(ii)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Thorndale AMT&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">On 30-4-2016 respondents issued me a\r\nletter in haste for offer of possession without completing it &amp; without\r\nobtaining CC and OC but actual physical possession was given on 13-07-2018. I\r\nhad cleared all dues on 09-05-2017 and obtained “No dues certificate”. My\r\nrequest letters and Emails dated 23-0516, 27-03-17,30-08-17 and all other\r\nefforts were neglected by the respondents for delay compensation and other\r\nreliefs along with possession. Thus on 15-4-2017 I served the respondents legal\r\nnotice through my attorney to substantiate my claims.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Thorndale AMT&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">The\r\n</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Thorndale AMT&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">following</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%;font-family:&quot;Thorndale AMT&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"> reliefs and compensations may be\r\nawarded:-<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:13.5pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Thorndale AMT&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">(i) Cost of litigation Rs 50,000/- as the\r\ncomplaint has paid Rs.5500/- for legal notice and incurred expenditure on legal\r\nconsultation &amp; processing. (ii)Rs. 50,000/- to attend cases in RERA\r\nfrom26-09-2017 when the case was initially filled to till 13-11-2018 at least\r\n15 attendance so far.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:13.5pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Thorndale AMT&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">(iii)Rs 2,50,000/- for mental agony and\r\nharassment as the respondent kept on toes the complainant without any fault of\r\nhim for more than seven years from 11-07-2011 to 13-07-2018. (iv) Compensation\r\nof Rs. 50,000/-for visiting the site at least for two dozen of times.(v)\r\nCompensation for unfair trade practices of Rs 50,000/- for delay of 19 months\r\nin executing agreement and not providing cc,oc before offer of possession and\r\nall other relevant documents. (vi) Interest on the compensation due as on\r\n13-07-2018 date of physical possession to till the decision of the case.(vii) The\r\nrespondents charged 141946/-additional illegally, unreasonable and without\r\napproval of appropriate authority without my consent for 64 sq. ft.&nbsp; (viii) The\r\nrespondents modified/altered the project without the proper permission or authority.\r\nNo break up of flat area provided, in case it is deficient may be compensated.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left:13.5pt;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Thorndale AMT&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Thorndale AMT&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">(v) Interim order may\r\nkindly be passed in favor of complainant for any other reliefs hon’ble\r\nauthority deem fit.</span><br></p>',2850000.00,3046384.00,'2015-01-14 00:00:00.000','2018-07-13 00:00:00.000','','1','','2011-10-15 00:00:00','2013-02-08 00:00:00','512,fifth floor, tower xii, green valley heights, zirakpur','','',2,0,0,0,'jaswantsingh2','2018-12-26 11:30:09.000','jaswantsingh2','2018-12-26 11:30:09.000'),(246,1079,'1079',1216,'11d722ae-bbbb-479b-bed1-c40adf90f1de','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2018-12-03 12:47:45.000','Jaswant  Singh','sjaswants803@gmail.com',9466694194,0,0,'85 SCC Area Nilokheri Dist karnal','',13,10,'132117','1','85 SCC Area Nilokheri Dist karnal','',13,10,'132117','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0316','Green Valley Heights','Harbans Lal Singla','greenvalleyheights2010@yahoo.co.in',9876718666,0,'M/s Green Valley Heights,Village Kishanpura,Behind sector 20 Panchkula','MC Zirakpur, SAS Nagar Mohali Punjab',28,507,'140603','1','M/s Green Valley Heights,Village Kishanpura,Behind sector 20 Panchkula','MC Zirakpur, SAS Nagar Mohali Punjab',28,507,'140603','1','<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin-left:49.5pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Thorndale AMT&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Thorndale AMT&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Thorndale AMT&quot;\">(i)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Thorndale AMT&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">I booked a 2 BHK residential Flat of <st1:metricconverter productid=\"1285 sq. ft\" w:st=\"on\">1285 sq. ft</st1:metricconverter>. area in\r\ngreen valley heights for rupees 28,50,000/- on 11.7,2011 by paying 10% i.e. Rs.\r\n2,85,000/- and provisionally allotted with flat No. 512 vide application /\r\ninitial agreement dated 28-09-2011 and subsequently on 15-10- 2011, I was\r\nallotted with flat No. <st1:metricconverter productid=\"512 in\" w:st=\"on\">512 in</st1:metricconverter>\r\nGreen Valley Heights dated 15-10-2011. As per the allotment letter I was\r\npromised the delivery of semi-furnished flat within three years from the date\r\nof booking/allotment. On <st1:date year=\"2013\" day=\"2\" month=\"8\" ls=\"trans\" w:st=\"on\">8-2-2013</st1:date> respondent(s) handed over a printed Buyer’s\r\napartment agreement after the delay of 19 months from date of booking. The\r\ndelay in providing this agreement letter was deliberate and a tactics on the\r\npart of respondents as this document should have been executed within\r\nreasonable time along with allotment. This is unfair trade practice.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:49.5pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Thorndale AMT&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left:49.5pt;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Thorndale AMT&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Thorndale AMT&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Thorndale AMT&quot;\">(ii)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Thorndale AMT&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">On 30-4-2016 respondents issued me a\r\nletter in haste for offer of possession without completing it &amp; without\r\nobtaining CC and OC but actual physical possession was given on 13-07-2018. I\r\nhad cleared all dues on 09-05-2017 and obtained “No dues certificate”. My\r\nrequest letters and Emails dated 23-0516, 27-03-17,30-08-17 and all other\r\nefforts were neglected by the respondents for delay compensation and other\r\nreliefs along with possession. Thus on 15-4-2017 I served the respondents legal\r\nnotice through my attorney to substantiate my claims.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Thorndale AMT&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">The\r\n</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Thorndale AMT&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">following</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%;font-family:&quot;Thorndale AMT&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"> reliefs and compensations may be\r\nawarded:-<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:13.5pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Thorndale AMT&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">(i) Cost of litigation Rs 50,000/- as the\r\ncomplaint has paid Rs.5500/- for legal notice and incurred expenditure on legal\r\nconsultation &amp; processing. (ii)Rs. 50,000/- to attend cases in RERA\r\nfrom26-09-2017 when the case was initially filled to till 13-11-2018 at least\r\n15 attendance so far.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:13.5pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Thorndale AMT&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">(iii)Rs 2,50,000/- for mental agony and\r\nharassment as the respondent kept on toes the complainant without any fault of\r\nhim for more than seven years from 11-07-2011 to 13-07-2018. (iv) Compensation\r\nof Rs. 50,000/-for visiting the site at least for two dozen of times.(v)\r\nCompensation for unfair trade practices of Rs 50,000/- for delay of 19 months\r\nin executing agreement and not providing cc,oc before offer of possession and\r\nall other relevant documents.(vi) The\r\nrespondents charged 141946/-additional illegally, unreasonable and without\r\napproval of appropriate authority without my consent for 64 sq. ft.&nbsp; (vii) The\r\nrespondents modified/altered the project without the proper permission or authority.\r\nNo break up of flat area provided, in case it is deficient may be compensated.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left:13.5pt;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Thorndale AMT&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Thorndale AMT&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">(v) Interim order may\r\nkindly be passed in favor of complainant for any other reliefs hon’ble\r\nauthority deem fit.</span><br></p>',2850000.00,3046384.00,'2015-01-14 00:00:00.000','2018-07-13 00:00:00.000','','1','','2011-10-15 00:00:00','2013-02-08 00:00:00','512,fifth floor, tower xii, green valley heights, zirakpur','','',2,