g cc,oc before offer of possession and\r\nall other relevant documents.(vi) The\r\nrespondents modified/altered the project without the proper permission or authority.\r\nNo break up of flat area provided, in case it is deficient may be compensated.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left:13.5pt;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Thorndale AMT&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Thorndale AMT&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">(v) Interim order may\r\nkindly be passed in favor of complainant for any other reliefs hon’ble\r\nauthority deem fit.</span><br></p>',2850000.00,3046384.00,'2015-01-14 00:00:00.000','2018-07-13 00:00:00.000','','1','','2011-10-15 00:00:00','2013-02-08 00:00:00','512,fifth floor, tower xii, green valley heights, zirakpur','','',1,1,0,0,'jaswantsingh2','2018-12-26 11:36:12.000','jaswantsingh2','2018-12-26 11:36:12.000'),(248,1090,'1090',1191,'16dedd0c-2e6f-4eb1-85bb-f16106f43c42','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','NITIN Jindal','Nitin.email2me@gmail.com',8800669083,0,0,'D2 065 DLF NEW TOWN','Westend heights begur',17,67,'560068','1','D2 065 DLF NEW TOWN','Westend heights begur',17,67,'560068','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0084','Sushma Buildtech Limited','Bharat Mittal','Bharat@sushmabuildtech.com',0,0,'B 107, First Floor, Business Complex','Elante Mall, Industrial Area 1',6,128,'160002','1','B 107, First Floor, Business Complex','Elante Mall, Industrial Area 1',6,128,'160002','1','<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><b>1. Delay in Possession\r\n(Section 16 and 17)</b>: My possession date as per agreement is 31-Mar, 2015\r\nand had paid about 85% of amount till Jul, 2014 (Rs 42,32,843).\r\nThis year builder had further demand – one in September (for flooring work) and\r\nfinal demand on offer the possession on 11 Dec, 2018. </p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->2.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><b>2. Multiple\r\nchanges in Specification without information</b>: Under section 19 – Rights and\r\nDuties of Allottees, Builder had changes the layout and specification without\r\nany notification and also not ready to share the details (moreover provided\r\nincorrect information that they have not made any changes). One example is the\r\nchange in location of the swimming pool, now constructed in front of my tower\r\n(instead originally not proposed at that location). This is unacceptable.</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->3.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </span><b>3. Not\r\nsharing information</b>: Builder is not ready to share the specification\r\ndetails and also partial occupancy certificate. But forcing me to pay the final\r\ndemand for offer of possession (applies 24% interest penalty).</p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->4.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </span><b>4. Covered\r\ncar parking</b>: Builder promised Covered car parking, but now offering open\r\ncar parking.</p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>1. As per Section 16 &amp; 17, in case of delay the\r\npromoter has to pay the interest (State bank of India highest marginal cost of\r\nlending rate plus two percent). I have raised this point with builder, but they\r\nare not ready to pay the penalty.</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->2.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>2. As per Section 19, Builder must provide the\r\ndetails of any changes and penalty should be applied considering wrong\r\ninformation was shared. Promoter should return the complete amount paid with\r\ninterest.</p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->3.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>3. Harassment, mental agony compensation and other\r\nexpenses to be paid by promoter.&nbsp;</p>',5053900.00,5006075.00,'2015-03-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2011-11-05 00:00:00','2012-03-21 00:00:00','704, Tower F, Sushma Crescent, Sushma Tower','','',2,0,0,0,'Nitinjindal0505','2018-12-28 16:33:06.000','Nitinjindal0505','2018-12-28 16:33:06.000'),(249,1090,'1090',1191,'16dedd0c-2e6f-4eb1-85bb-f16106f43c42','FormTypeN',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','NITIN Jindal','Nitin.email2me@gmail.com',8800669083,0,0,'D2 065 DLF NEW TOWN','Westend heights begur',17,67,'560068','1','D2 065 DLF NEW TOWN','Westend heights begur',17,67,'560068','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0084','Sushma Buildtech Limited','Bharat Mittal','Bharat@sushmabuildtech.com',0,0,'B 107, First Floor, Business Complex','Elante Mall, Industrial Area 1',6,128,'160002','1','B 107, First Floor, Business Complex','Elante Mall, Industrial Area 1',6,128,'160002','1','<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><b>1. Delay in Possession\r\n(Section 16 and 17)</b>: My possession date as per agreement is 31-Mar, 2015\r\nand had paid about 85% of amount till Jul, 2014 (Rs 42,32,843).\r\nThis year builder had further demand – one in September (for flooring work) and\r\nfinal demand on offer the possession on 11 Dec, 2018. </p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->2.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><b>2. Multiple\r\nchanges in Specification without information</b>: Under section 19 – Rights and\r\nDuties of Allottees, Builder had changes the layout and specification without\r\nany notification and also not ready to share the details (moreover provided\r\nincorrect information that they have not made any changes). One example is the\r\nchange in location of the swimming pool, now constructed in front of my tower\r\n(instead originally not proposed at that location). This is unacceptable.</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->3.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </span><b>3. Not\r\nsharing information</b>: Builder is not ready to share the specification\r\ndetails and also partial occupancy certificate. But forcing me to pay the final\r\ndemand for offer of possession (applies 24% interest penalty).</p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->4.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </span><b>4. Covered\r\ncar parking</b>: Builder promised Covered car parking, but now offering open\r\ncar parking.</p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>1. As per Section 16 &amp; 17, in case of delay the\r\npromoter has to pay the interest (State bank of India highest marginal cost of\r\nlending rate plus two percent). I have raised this point with builder, but they\r\nare not ready to pay the penalty.</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->2.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>2. As per Section 19, Builder must provide the\r\ndetails of any changes and penalty should be applied considering wrong\r\ninformation was shared. Promoter should return the complete amount paid with\r\ninterest.</p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->3.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>3. Harassment, mental agony compensation and other\r\nexpenses to be paid by promoter.&nbsp;</p>',5053900.00,5006075.00,'2015-03-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2011-11-05 00:00:00','2012-03-21 00:00:00','704, Tower F, Sushma Crescent, Sushma Tower','','',2,0,0,0,'Nitinjindal0505','2018-12-28 16:41:50.000','Nitinjindal0505','2018-12-28 16:41:50.000'),(250,1090,'1090',1191,'16dedd0c-2e6f-4eb1-85bb-f16106f43c42','FormTypeN',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','NITIN Jindal','Nitin.email2me@gmail.com',8800669083,0,0,'D2 065 DLF NEW TOWN','Westend heights begur',17,67,'560068','1','D2 065 DLF NEW TOWN','Westend heights begur',17,67,'560068','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0084','Sushma Buildtech Limited','Bharat Mittal','Bharat@sushmabuildtech.com',0,0,'B 107, First Floor, Business Complex','Elante Mall, Industrial Area 1',6,128,'160002','1','B 107, First Floor, Business Complex','Elante Mall, Industrial Area 1',6,128,'160002','1','<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-