nt, mental agony compensation and other\r\nexpenses to be paid by promoter.&nbsp;</p>',5053900.00,5006075.00,'2015-03-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2011-11-05 00:00:00','2012-03-21 00:00:00','704, Tower F, Sushma Crescent, Sushma Tower','','',2,0,0,0,'Nitinjindal0505','2018-12-28 16:52:36.000','Nitinjindal0505','2018-12-28 16:52:36.000'),(251,1090,'1090',1191,'16dedd0c-2e6f-4eb1-85bb-f16106f43c42','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2019-01-16 16:02:12.000','NITIN Jindal','Nitin.email2me@gmail.com',8800669083,0,0,'D2 065 DLF NEW TOWN','Westend heights begur',17,67,'560068','1','D2 065 DLF NEW TOWN','Westend heights begur',17,67,'560068','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0084','Sushma Buildtech Limited','Bharat Mittal','Bharat@sushmabuildtech.com',0,0,'B 107, First Floor, Business Complex','Elante Mall, Industrial Area 1',6,128,'160002','1','B 107, First Floor, Business Complex','Elante Mall, Industrial Area 1',6,128,'160002','1','<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><b>1. Delay in Possession\r\n(Section 16 and 17)</b>: My possession date as per agreement is 31-Mar, 2015\r\nand had paid about 85% of amount till Jul, 2014 (Rs 42,32,843).\r\nThis year builder had further demand – one in September (for flooring work) and\r\nfinal demand on offer the possession on 11 Dec, 2018. </p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->2.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><b>2. Multiple\r\nchanges in Specification without information</b>: Under section 19 – Rights and\r\nDuties of Allottees, Builder had changes the layout and specification without\r\nany notification and also not ready to share the details (moreover provided\r\nincorrect information that they have not made any changes). One example is the\r\nchange in location of the swimming pool, now constructed in front of my tower\r\n(instead originally not proposed at that location). This is unacceptable.</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->3.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </span><b>3. Not\r\nsharing information</b>: Builder is not ready to share the specification\r\ndetails and also partial occupancy certificate. But forcing me to pay the final\r\ndemand for offer of possession (applies 24% interest penalty).</p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->4.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </span><b>4. Covered\r\ncar parking</b>: Builder promised Covered car parking, but now offering open\r\ncar parking.</p>','<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>1. As per Section 16 &amp; 17, in case of delay the\r\npromoter has to pay the interest (State bank of India highest marginal cost of\r\nlending rate plus two percent). I have raised this point with builder, but they\r\nare not ready to pay the penalty.</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->2.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>2. As per Section 19, Builder must provide the\r\ndetails of any changes and penalty should be applied considering wrong\r\ninformation was shared. Promoter should return the complete amount paid with\r\ninterest.</p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->3.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>3. Harassment, mental agony compensation and other\r\nexpenses to be paid by promoter.&nbsp;</p>',5053900.00,5006075.00,'2015-03-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2011-11-05 00:00:00','2012-03-21 00:00:00','704, Tower F, Sushma Crescent, Sushma Tower','','',2,0,0,0,'Nitinjindal0505','2018-12-28 16:54:38.000','Nitinjindal0505','2018-12-28 16:54:38.000'),(252,1064,'1064',1175,'fdc30a3a-7552-4e5c-8f07-8c6e1d95cb8c','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2019-01-02 11:27:46.000','Manjit Singh Chimni','amangr@gmail.com',9855999111,8873092885,409690247527,'Flat No 201, HEWO Apartments','MDC, Sector 6',13,15,'134114','1','Flat No 201, HEWO Apartments','MDC, Sector 6',13,15,'134114','Vaneesh Khanna','vaneeshkhanna@yahoo.co.in',9814301225,7973088659,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0085','SUSHMA CHANDIGARH GRANDE, BY SUSHMA BUILDTECH LTD','SUSHMA BUILDTECH LTD','info@sushmabuildtech.com',7307980092,1724610092,'Unit No B 107, Business Complex at Elante Mall','1st Floor, Industrial Area, Phase 1',6,128,'160002','1','Unit No B 107, Business Complex at Elante Mall','1st Floor, Industrial Area, Phase 1',6,128,'160002','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">The complaints are senior citizens Husband &amp;\r\nWife resident of Chirkunda, Jharkhand wanting to shift to chandigarh booked a\r\nflat with SUSHMA BUILDTECH LTD in their project SUSHMA CHANDIGARH GRANDE,\r\nZirakpur, Distt: SAS Nagar, Mohali – Flat No: H-101 (Measuring 2085 sq ft), Ist\r\nFloor, Tower-H.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">The Flat was booked via Allotment Letter Dated:\r\n06.08.2012 and subsequently executed Apartment Buyers Agreement on 06.08.2012.\r\nAs per agreement total consideration price was Rs.&nbsp;&nbsp;68,50,000/- and\r\nthe complainants have paid Rs. 61,65,000/- + Service tax Rs. 1,95,329/-. Balance\r\nRemaining to be paid Rs. 6,85,000/- + Taxes.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.8pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">As per Agreement Dated: 06.08.2012, Clause 14 the\r\npossession date was 38 months from the date of execution of Agreement i.e.\r\n05.10.2015.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">The respondents have failed to deliver the\r\npossession till date. The Complaints on assurance of respondents had sold their\r\nhouse property in home town – Chirkunda, Jharkhand on 24.05.2018 and have\r\nshifted permanently in a rental accomodation at Flat No: 201, HEWO Apartments,\r\nSector 6, Mansa Devi Complex, Panchkula.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.8pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">The complaints are aggrieved party. The respondents\r\nhave failed to address their grievances for delay in possession for more than 3\r\nyears. A Legal notice was also served to them in his context on 15.07.2018. The\r\nrespondents had shown no interest to our complaint and have adopted a very\r\nindifferent attitude.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">That due to the deficiency in service\r\non the part of the&nbsp;respondents&nbsp;resulting into a\r\nbig&nbsp;harassment,&nbsp;tension&nbsp;and&nbsp;apprehension&nbsp;as well as monetary\r\nloss, the complainants are entitled to the&nbsp;following&nbsp;reliefs from\r\nthe&nbsp;respondents:</span><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;line-height:normal;tab-stops:14.2pt\"><span style=\"font-family: roboto, serif; font-size: 8pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;line-height:normal;tab-stops:14.2pt\"><span style=\"font-family: roboto, serif; font-size: 8pt;\">1. A\r\nsum of Rs. 5 lacs as compensation on account of harassment, tension and\r\napprehension caused to the complainant due to delay in possession of the\r\napartment</span><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;line-height:normal;tab-stops:14.2pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\">2. Legal\r\nExpense to the tune of Rs. 75,000/- for forcing the complainant to enter into\r\nthis uncalled for litigation</span><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: roboto, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:normal;tab-stops:14.2pt\"><span style=\"font-family: roboto, serif; font-size: 8pt;\">3. Amount of rent\r\nand&nbsp;maintenance&nbsp;charges paid / to be paid by the complaint in respect\r\nof the rented flat where they are presently residing from 01.05.2018, till the\r\ndate of handing over the possession of the&nbsp;apartment.</span><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:normal;tab-stops:14.2pt\"><span style=\"font-family: roboto, serif; font-size: 8pt; text-align: justify;\">It is therefore prayed that\r\nthe&nbsp;respondents&nbsp;be directed to give the above mention reliefs to the\r\ncomplainants as the&nbsp;complaints&nbsp;are entitled to the above said relief\r\nin&nbsp;lieu&nbsp;of the facts and circumstances explained.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:normal;tab-stops:14.2pt\"><span style=\"font-family: roboto, serif; font-size: 8pt; text-align: justify;\">NOTE: WE HAVE ALSO APPLIED FOR RELIEFS UNDER FORM - M - AS PER NEW RERA RULES<br></span><br></p>',6850000.00,6360329.00,'2015-10-05 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2012-08-06 00:00:00','2012-08-06 00:00:00','Flat No H101, Tower H\r\n1st Floor, Sushma Chandigarh Grande, Zirakpur','','',2,0,0,0,'manjit305','2019-01-02 11:27:39.000','manjit305','2019-01-02 11:27:39.000'),(253,1091,'1091',1315,'d8d72285-af2f-45de-9a3b-30822f4ae46f','FormTypeN',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Aman  Sunda','kulwindersinghadvocate@gmail.com',9872903100,0,0,'HI-102','Maya Garden City',28,507,'140603','1','HI-102','Maya Garden City',28,507,'140603','Kulwinder Singh','ksvarun513@gmail.com',9915772513,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0192','Maya Garden City','Maya Garden City','barnalabuilders@ymail.com',9216910335,0,'Opposite McDonalds, Chandigarh-Ambala Highway','Zirakpur, Punjab',28,507,'140603','1','Opposite McDonald\'s, Chandigarh-Ambala Highway','Zirakpur, Punjab',28,507,'140603','1','<p>1.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;That applicants booked 5BHK flat for their own residence in the project of respondent no. 1 vide application dated 30.12.2011 and the respondent issued allotment of flat no. 102 measuring 2850 Sq. Ft. in H1 block at first floor vide letter dated 24.07.2012. The applicants entered into agreement to sell with respondent, as per which total consideration of flat was Rs. 57,00,000/-. As per clause 5 of agreement the date of sale deed was fixed on or before 30th November, 2015. The applicants paid Rs. 66,87,479/- with the respondent against total consideration of Rs. 57,00,000/- which includes maintenance, late payment charges and service tax etc.</p><p>2.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That as per brochure, respondents are liable to provide club facility and swimming pool etc which were also not provided by respondents till date. The possession was handed over to applicants but the sale deed was not made in favor of applicants as respondents failed to get completion certificate from competent authority and the partial completion certificate issued to respondent was conditional &amp; due to non fulfilment of conditions the pollution control board has already written letter to competent authority to cancel the partial completion certificate.</p><p>3.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That respondent issued offer of possession letter and No Due Certificate on 15.05.2016. Thereafter, applicant requested number of times to respondent to provide facilities as per brochure but failed resolve the issues raised by applicants and to provide occupation/completion certificate even after receiving legal notice.</p><p>4.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That the applicants requested number to times to respondent through letter and emails regarding deficiencies/anomalies and other issues but the respondent failed to revert the any of letter/email sent by applicants.</p><p><br></p>','<p>1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To pay Rs. 803000 as per valuation report to make the flat in the position as promised by the respondent.</p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>2<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>TO pay Rs. 200000 as per clause 9 of the agreement.</p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>3<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To pay a compensation of rs. 1000000 to the applicant for causing mental agony, harassment and humiliation as the OP were deficient in rendering service and are indulged in unfair trade practices, in the interest of justice.</p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>4<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To remove all the encroachment made by the respondents for making parkings etc and to put the same as per plan i.e. greenery/park.</p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>5<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To refund the amount received as service tax from the applicant alongwith interest @18% since the same were not deposited by the respondents with the concerned department.</p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>6<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To refund the amount for giving less carpet area.</p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>7<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To give NEC and get the sale deed done in favour of the applicant.</p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>8<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>TO pay interest @18% on the amount of Rs. 5700000 from the due date of possession i.e. 30 Nov 2014 till the date of sale deed/ issuance of completion certificate.</p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>9<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To provide club/swimming pool etc. alongwith all facilities as per promise made in brochure.</p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>10<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To provide all other facilities which are promised by not provided like provision of DTH, Broadband, Intercom Facility, approach from Highway.</p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>11<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To pay an amount of Rs. 100000 as litigation expenses.</p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre\">		</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre\">		</span>Or any other order as the Honble Officer may deem fit and proper in the facts and circumstances in favour of the applicant be passed in the interest of justice.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>',5700000.00,6687479.00,'2015-11-30 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2015-11-30 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','H1-102, Maya Garden City, Zirakpur, District Mohali','','',1,0,0,0,'amansunda','2019-01-02 16:15:20.000','amansunda','2019-01-02 16:15:20.000'),(254,1092,'1092',1318,'4b6e8884-5d03-401d-a0d6-887e7b4d02be','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Vishal Anand','anandvishal20@gmail.com',8289075420,0,0,'Building H1, Flat - 103','Maya Garden City, Nagla Road, Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','Building H1, Flat - 103','Maya Garden City, Nagla Road, Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','Kulwinder Singh','kulwindersinghadvocate@gmail.com',9915772513,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0192','Maya Garden City','Barnala Builders','dummymail@gmail.com',9216910335,0,'opposite McDonalds','Chandigarh Ambala Highway',28,507,'140603','1','opposite McDonalds','Chandigarh Ambala Highway',28,507,'140603','1','<p>Just testing the website</p>','<p>Just testing the website</p>',6300000.00,6300000.00,'2016-04-29 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2016-04-26 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Building H1, Flat 103, Maya Garden City, Nagla Road, Zirakpur 140603','','',1,0,0,0,'vishalanand','2019-01-03 17:38:38.000','vishalanand','2019-01-03 17:38:38.000'),(255,1093,'1093',1318,'4b6e8884-5d03-401d-a0d6-887e7b4d02be','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Vishal Anand','anandvishal20@gmail.com',8289075420,