t letter dated 06th April 2007 Annexure P3 but till date 99 months has passed no possession is ready</p>','<p>In view of the facts mentioned in paragraph 4 above the applicant prays for the following compensation</p><p>Compensation under Section of the Act Promoter given incorrect and false statement to handover the possession within 36 months from the date of allotment hence I am entitled for compensation in the manner provided under RERA act</p><p>The promoter fails to complete or unable to give possession of the apartment plot or building fails to discharge any other obligations imposed on him under this act or the rules or regulations made thereunder or in accordance with the terms and conditions of the agreement for sale He shall be liable to pay such compensation to the allottee in the manner as provided under RERA Act</p><p>The builder failed to discharge their obligation as provided in the act and failed to handover the physical possession of the apartment</p><p>The complainant shall be entitled to claim compensation in the manner as provided under this act from the promoter</p><p>Direct the respondent to pay Rs 100000 as compensation to the complainant for causing mental agony<br></p><p>Direct the respondent to pay Rs 400000 cost of litigation expenses and physical harassment and other relief</p>',4727150.00,4132278.00,'2010-04-06 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2007-04-06 00:00:00','2008-03-14 00:00:00','UNIT NO F3 502 THE VIEWS MOHALI HILL DISTRICT MOHALI PUNJAB','','',1,1,0,0,'SANDEEPBANSAL','2019-01-22 13:05:54.000','SANDEEPBANSAL','2019-01-22 13:05:54.000'),(281,1068,'1068',1098,'81775a1c-ad46-40a6-b51a-c95cca91809d','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2019-01-20 00:41:52.000','Rachna Vinayak','abhi.vinayak@yahoo.co.in',9992015557,0,0,'44-45 SHIVAJI PARK','MODEL TOWN',13,21,'135001','1','T-1, 301, BESTECH PARK VIEW RESIDENCES','SECTOR 66',28,507,'160062','Abhimanyu Singh Vinayak','abhi.vinayak@yahoo.co.in',9992015557,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR00