">The\r\nCompany, executed Agreement and issued Provisional Allotment of\r\nthe flat in question, on 9</span><sup><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">th</span></sup><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"> February, 2017. </span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">The builder/company\r\npromised to complete construction &amp; handover the apartment by December 2017. Unfortunately,\r\ndespite having paid 95% of the total amount, and January of 2019 underway, the company has failed to deliver\r\nthe possession of the flat.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;Here it is also pertinent to mention that I have taken a HOME LOAN from HDFC Ltd and I’m paying\r\nhuge amount to the bank, every month. Here it is also relevant to mention that since I have taken home loan from HDFC, all the documents like allotment letter, apartment buyer agreement, payment receipts&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">pertaining to the flat unit in question</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">were handed over by the builder company directly to the bank/financier. The builder company only handed over photocopies of very limited documents to me, which i am enclosing herewith this complaint.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\r\n\r\n</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">I\'ve been visiting the builder / company office and contacting\r\nthe officials of the company/builder regularly, seeking compensation and seeking information regarding the actual date of possession,&nbsp; but to no avail though.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">I keep visiting the site regularly, to be disappointed at the progress of&nbsp; my flat, whereas, in contrast,&nbsp; i witness very good speed of work at newly launched towers.</span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">﻿</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">﻿</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">﻿</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">That I’ve paid more than 95%\r\nof the total sale consideration amount, i.e. Rs. 88,30,492/- out of Rs.</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18.6667px;\">9158000&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">to the company since last almost two years.\r\nHowever, the builder/company has delayed the possession of the apartment, for\r\nno rhyme or reason. The builder has not paid\r\nany COMPENSATION AS PER THE PROVISIONS OF RERA.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Here it also worth mentioning that during\r\nthis entire period of inordinate delay, the company kept on launching newer towers and apartments and kept selling them. It is also pertinent to mention that the work at the newly launched towers/apartments is going on uninterrupted and&nbsp; at very good pace. Thus there has not been any force majure or\r\ncircumstances beyond the control of the developers, behind which the company\r\nmight try to hide &amp; wriggle out from discharge of their lawful liability. </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><b><u><br></u></b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><b><u>RELIEF SOUGHT IN THE PRESENT COMPLAINT :</u></b>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;I SEEK COMPENSATION OF RS.10 LACS&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18.6667px;\">FOR : *(1) Physical Harassment, *(2) Mental Harassment and Agony, *(3) Emotional Distress, *(4) Site Visit Expenses, *(5) Financial and Professional Loss suffered due to loss of precious time *(6) Legal Expenses&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&amp; / OR any other amount that this Hon\'ble Authority deems appropriate, proper and just.&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p>',9158000.00,8830492.00,'2018-03-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2017-02-09 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Flat No.4022, Tower-4, Second Floor, ATS Casa Espana, Sector 121, Mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'rachnabhi','2019-01-24 14:21:39.000','rachnabhi','2019-01-24 14:21:39.000'),(282,1068,'1068',1098,'81775a1c-ad46-40a6-b51a-c95cca91809d','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2019-01-20 00:41:52.000','Rachna Vinayak','abhi.vinayak@yahoo.co.in',9992015557,0,0,'44-45 SHIVAJI PARK','MODEL TOWN',13,21,'135001','1','T-1, 301, BESTECH PARK VIEW RESIDENCES','SECTOR 66',28,507,'160062','Abhimanyu Singh Vinayak','abhi.vinayak@yahoo.co.in',9992015557,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0086','ATS CASA ESPANA\r\nVillage Budmajra,\r\nKharar, Sector 121,\r\nS.A.S. Nagar, 