.75in; text-align: justify; line-height: 12.65pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\ncolor:#222222;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">On 20<sup>th</sup>&nbsp;January 2013\r\nthe undersigned underwent an agreement (Copy enclosed) with the said builder &nbsp;for purchase of apartment for &nbsp;approximately 1130 sq feet in the complex\r\ncalled SBP Housing Park for a total value of Rs.25,50,000/-. All the payment\r\nhas been made (down payment + home loan) except for Rs.1, 27,499/- , which is\r\nthe last instalment due <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt 0.75in; text-align: justify; line-height: 12.65pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\ncolor:#222222;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt 56.7pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\ncolor:#222222;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">In Dec18 and Jan19, 3 numbers of\r\nlegal notices were received from their advocate. The first 2 notices (copy\r\nenclosed) demanded the payment of the last instalment. Despite our response to\r\nfirst 2 notices (copy enclosed) and earlier communication, another legal notice\r\nhas been received from their advocate which says our allotment has been\r\ncancelled and that we should now proceed for refund of amount paid by us&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt 56.7pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\ncolor:#222222;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">As per article 4(possession) <b>(copy enclosed)</b> of the agreement, the\r\nflat should have been handed over on or before 31<sup>st</sup>&nbsp;December\r\n2014.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt 56.7pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\ncolor:#222222;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">As a compensation for non-compliance\r\nof the same, simple interest at the rate equivalent to rate of fixed deposit\r\noffered by SBI would be charged for the gap period (for the amount paid).&nbsp;\r\n<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt 56.7pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\ncolor:#222222;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt 56.7pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\ncolor:#222222;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">Assuming the work is now over &amp;\r\nthe flat is ready for possession in Jan 19, there is &nbsp;&nbsp;a gap of approximately 48 months (Dec 2014 to\r\nJan 19) and current rate of interest offered by SBI is approximately 7.00%.\r\nTotal amount paid till date is 24.22 Lakhs. After taking all the factors into\r\nconsideration the interest amount for 48 months comes down to Rs. 6.78 Lakhs. The\r\nagreement also suggests that possession can only be taken after &nbsp;&nbsp;clearance of account. Balance amount now payable\r\nis Rs. -5.51 Lakhs (1.27 lakhs - 6.78 lakhs). <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt 56.7pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\ncolor:#222222;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt 56.7pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\ncolor:#222222;mso-fareast-language:EN-IN\">In view of the facts mentioned in\r\npara 4,I, Suman Dhaundiyal, prays for the compensation of Rs.<b>6.78 Lakhs<o:p></o:p></b></span></p>',2550000.00,2422000.00,'2014-12-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2013-01-20 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','FLAT NO-950, FLOOR NO-09 TOWER-04, SBP HOUSING PARK AT VILLAGE RAUNI,TEHSIL DERABASSI,DISTT. MOHALI PUNJAB','','',1,0,0,0,'sumandhaundiyal','2019-02-05 09:31:20.000','sumandhaundiyal','2019-02-05 09:31:20.000'),(300,1109,'1109',1375,'2bb731fd-edd3-4d30-948a-538313b3276e','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','VANEET BHATIA','vaneetbhatia1989@gmail.com',9463360588,0,310209650281,'221-A Nijatam Nagar, St. No. 6, Basti Nau, Jalandhar','',28,261,'144001','1','221-A Nijatam Nagar, St. No. 6, Basti Nau, Jalandhar','',28,261,'144001','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0096','SINGLA BUILDERS & PROMOTORS LTD.','MS. RITU','ritu@sbpgroup.in',7087106002,0,'Singla Builders & Promoters Ltd.','SCO 146-148 1st Floor Sec. 43B, Chandigarh - 160042',6,128,'160042','1','Singla Builders & Promoters Ltd.','SCO 146-148 1st Floor Sec. 43B, Chandigarh - 160042',6,128,'160042','1','<p>Sir,&nbsp;</p><p>I had booked a flat in May - 2018, at SBP Housing Park Derabassi society on the name of my wife Mrs. Kanica Bhatia. They had given the time to deliver it before 31 October 2018. Till now the construction work is going on. They had sent me a offer letter in the month of Oct-18 but the tower is under construction. So i stopped giving them final payment. &nbsp;Now they are delayed by 4 months. and I requested them to give then delay penalty because bank is putting 14000/month interest on my bank loan. Also i have stay on rent basis. Which i could not afford being a Pvt. Employee.&nbsp;</p><p>I have given them 90% payment very timely through bank loan.&nbsp;</p><p>My request is to give me delay penalty interest. Because they are late to give the possession. But they are taking shed of offer letter which they had send me before the possession date. But it was not acceptable since the construction was going on.&nbsp;</p><p>I am Pvt. employee having 45000 salery. Me and my wife 1st time planned a house under PM Awas Yojna. and these builders are playing with our emotions.</p><p>My request is to give us compensation. &nbsp;</p>','<p>The Builder is flailed to give the possession on time. Hence they are late by Appox. 4 months. I have given 90% payment on time through bank loan. So my request is to give the compensation of 4 months. Because till the tower is not ready. &nbsp;</p>',2450000.00,2260000.00,'2018-10-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2018-05-30 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Flat 9105, 9th Floor, Ananda Tower D, SBP Housing Park, Derabassi. ','','',1,0,0,0,'VANEETBHATIA','2019-02-05 09:47:56.000','VANEETBHATIA','2019-02-05 09:47:56.000'),(301,1110,'1110',1361,'a52599d4-e47a-4877-8e30-d95c9ef9cf7f','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2019-02-25 14:48:18.000','SUMAN DHAUNDIYAL','kailashicwai@gmail.com',9818401409,0,0,'D-102,ARYA SAMAJ ROAD','UTTAM NAGAR',10,628,'110059','1','D-102,ARYA SAMAJ ROAD','UTTAM NAGAR',10,628,'110059','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0096','SINGLA BUILDERS & PROMOTERS LTD','AMAN SINGLA','info@sbpgroup.in',9316004240,0,'SCO146-148','1st floor ,sector-43B',6,128,'160043','1','SCO146-148','1st floor ,sector-43B',6,128,'16