g less carpet area.</p><p>f.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To give NEC and get the sale deed done as per RERA with clear carpet area in favour of the applicant.</p><p>g.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To pay interest @ 18% on the amount of Rs. 63,00,000 from the due date of possession i.e. 30 Nov 2014 till the date of sale deed/issuance of completion certificate.</p><p>h.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To provide club/swimming pool etc alongwith all facilities as per promise made in brochure.</p><p>i.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To provide all other facilities which are promised by not provided like provision of DTH, Broadband, Intercom Facility, approach from Highway.</p><p>j.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To pay an amount of Rs. 1,00,000/- as litigation expenses.</p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Or Any other order as the Hon’ble Adalat may deem fit and proper in the facts and circumstances in favour of the Applicant be passed, in the interest of justice.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p>',6300000.00,6841850.00,'2014-11-30 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2012-12-14 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','H1-103, Maya Garden City, Zirakpur, District Mohali','','',1,0,0,0,'govindkumar','2019-02-18 11:24:30.000','govindkumar','2019-02-18 11:24:30.000'),(315,1119,'1119',1404,'248ffdd0-76be-409f-9384-3187c1aaa82d','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Ramashish Byaut','ramashishbyahut@gmail.com',9855744754,0,0,'H.N 128','Village- Barmajra',28,507,'160055','1','SCO-35 FF','phase-2',28,507,'160055','kulwinder Singh ','kulwindersinghadvocate@gmail.com',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0192','Maya Garden City','Maya Garden City','barnalabuilders@ymail.com',0,0,'Opposite McDonald\'s','Chandigarh Delhi National Highway',28,507,'160055','1','Opposite McDonald\'s','Chandigarh Delhi National Highway',28,507,'160055','1','<p><br></p><p>1.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That applicant booked 5BHK flat for her 