/swimming pool etc alongwith all facilities as per promise made in brochure.</p><p>i.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To provide all other facilities which are promised by not provided like provision of DTH, Broadband, Intercom Facility, approach from Highway.</p><p>j.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To pay an amount of Rs. 1,00,000/- as litigation expenses.</p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Or Any other order as the Hon’ble Adalat may deem fit and proper in the facts and circumstances in favour of the Applicant be passed, in the interest of justice.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p>',6300000.00,6841850.00,'2014-11-30 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2012-12-14 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','H1-103, Maya Garden City, Zirakpur, District Mohali','','',1,0,0,0,'govindkumar','2019-02-18 12:56:16.000','govindkumar','2019-02-18 12:56:16.000'),(317,1121,'1121',1404,'248ffdd0-76be-409f-9384-3187c1aaa82d','FormTypeN',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Ramashish Byaut','ramashishbyahut@gmail.com',9855744754,0,0,'H.N 128','Village- Barmajra',28,507,'160055','1','SCO-35 FF','phase-2',28,507,'160055','kulwinder singh','kulwindersinghadvocate@gmail.com',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0192','Maya Garden City','Maya Garden City','barnalabuilders@ymail.com',0,0,'Opposite McDonald\'s, Chandigarh-Ambala Highway','Zirakpur',28,507,'160055','1','Opposite McDonald\'s, Chandigarh-Ambala Highway','Zirakpur',28,507,'160055','1','<p><br></p><p>1.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>That applicant booked 5BHK flat for her own residence in the project of respondent no. 1 vide application dated 08.12.2012 and the respondent issued allotment of flat no. 103 measuring 2850 Sq. Ft. in H1 block at first floor vide letter dated 14.12.2012. The applicant entered into agreement to sell with respondent, as per which total consideration of flat was Rs. 63,00,000/-. As per clause 5 of agreement the date of sale deed was fixed on or before 30th November, 2014. The appli