lear carpet area in favour of the applicant.</p><p>g.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To pay interest @ 18% on the amount of Rs. 66,87,479 from the due date of possession i.e. 16-Apr-2014 till the date of sale deed/issuance of&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>completion certificate.</p><p>h.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To provide club/swimming pool etc alongwith all facilities as per promise made in brochure.</p><p>i.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To provide all other facilities which are promised by not provided like provision of DTH, Broadband, Intercom Facility, approach from Highway.</p><p>j.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>To pay an amount of Rs. 1,00,000/- as litigation expenses.</p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Or Any other order as the Hon’ble Adalat may deem fit and proper in the facts and circumstances in favour of the Applicant be passed, in the&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>interest of justice.&nbsp;</p><div><br></div>',5700000.00,6687479.00,'2014-04-16 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2012-07-24 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','H1-102, Maya Garden City, Zirakpur, District Mohali Punjab- Pin-140603','','',1,0,0,0,'amansunda1','2019-02-19 11:52:33.000','amansunda1','2019-02-19 11:52:33.000'),(319,1123,'1123',1407,'4af5a203-a586-4c8d-b135-80e86f4acbb9','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Aman  SUnda','ramashishbyahut@gmail.com',9915772513,0,0,'H.N- H1-102 Maya Garden City','Zirakhpur',28,507,'140603','1','H. N-132 New Green City, Behind Radha Swami Satsang Bhawan','Hambhra Road, Ludhiana',28,366,'141008','Kulwinder Singh','kulwindersinghadvocate@gmail.com',9872903100,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0192','Maya Garden City','Maya Garden City','info@mayagardengroup.com',0,0,'Opposite McDonald\'s, Chandigarh-Ambala Highway','Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','Opposite McDonald\'s, Chandigarh-Ambala Highway','Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','<p>1. that a