back ,the builder was not agreeing on it at all.&nbsp;</p><p>\r\nIn total they took around 22.5 lakhs including the initial payment of 615000 and bank loan&nbsp;cheques from ICICI bank.</p><p>I was asked&nbsp; to exchange it with one in Savitry Greens on VIP road but it has more area and i was required to pay an additional 8 lacs which was beyond my budget.</p>','<p>In this process which started since Feb 2013 when i booked the flat till now i have paid close to Rs 550000/- as interest to ICICI bank on the home loan and also lost interest money on the initial deposit of 615000 which i could have earned if i would have kept it with me for more than 5 years.</p><p>My parents had to sit in builder office for so many days from morning till evening to request them to pay the money back to us and to the bank so that i can close the loan account.<br></p><p>So after so many deliberation with builder over more than a year , i got them to close the loan&nbsp; and they returned down payment money of 615000/- lacs to me.<br></p><p>Still they owe me around more than 1.5 lacs as the principal amount paid by me on the home loan to the bank, i also want them to be liable to pay&nbsp; as per RERA rules and regulations the interest amount which is close to 5.5 lacs that i had to pay to the bank during the loan tenure which is a loss to me without any fault of mine .<br></p><p>Also as per the agreement they were supposed to pay me every month based on flat sqft area if they didn\'t complete&nbsp; the possession by&nbsp; 36 months which they never did at all.<br></p><p>I was told by the builder do whatever you want to do ,we will not give you money back, we don\'t owe you anything and we have closed the case at our end.If you want to approach RERA,you can go we are not scared of RERA at all.<br></p><p>I still have the TPA with me which was signed between buyer,builder and bank.<br></p><p>In nutshell i want builder to be held responsible/accountable for the loss that i have incurred monetarily, harassing us mentally, not&nbsp; being fair with customer, fooling the buyers and not abiding by the agreement rules. I want RERA to provide me relief by asking the builder to pay me the loan principal plus the interest that i have paid to the bank which comes around to 7 lakh Rupees.<br></p>',4239000.00,2244092.00,'2017-08-04 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2014-08-04 00:00:00','2014-08-04 00:00:00','Flat #206,Tower 7,Savitry Greens 2,Gazipur,Zirakpur,Mohali(PB)','','',1,0,0,0,'AmitPaul','2019-02-24 13:08:56.000','AmitPaul','2019-02-24 13:08:56.000'),(335,1130,'1130',1394,'0f106413-e873-4fe7-ab68-54447b90873e','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','PARDEEP KUMAR','pardeeppunia@hotmail.com',9017590176,0,0,'213FF','SECTOR 46A',6,128,'160047','1','213FF','SECTOR 46A',6,128,'160047','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0067','ALOK KAPOOR\r\nCREDO ASSETS PRIVATE LIMITED','ALOK KAPOOR','parveen@sbpgroup.in',7087004209,0,'credo assests private limited','SCO 146-148, 1ST FLOOR, SECTOR 43B',6,128,'160042','1','credo assests private limited','SCO 146-148, 1ST FLOOR, SECTOR 43B',6,128,'160042','1','<p>Dear Sir,</p><p>I have purchased a flat in Elina Floors, City of Dreams of SBP Group on 31st March 2018, I have been assured for delivery before 31st August 2018. I have clearly told them that i will not be able to bear home rent and Home loan together, but hey assured that before starting home loan i will get possession. My home loan started in August 2018 and additionally i have to pay my home rent too due to which i am suffering a lot. I have to kids and I am staying in a rented home at Sector 46. Mt total take home salary is Rs 57000, out of which 15800 is my house rent and 18500 is my home loan EMI.&nbsp;</p><p>I have been regularly following up with SBP group persons and every time they are giving me next delivery schedule but till now i am waiting for possession and suffering from financial crisis. Even i have to take gold loan against my wife\'s ornaments. But the builder assured me that i will get 9% penalty on total paid amount when i get possession.</p><p>Now the builder is asking for more payments, failing which they have added RS 1.67 lacs as penalty to me.which is not bearable for me. So i request you for the followings:</p><p>1. Immediately waive off this penalty amount.</p><p>2. Complete the project and give me my flat at earliest, at least let me know in writing that when i will&nbsp; get flat keys.</p><p>3. Compensate me for my financial crisis.</p><p><br></p><p>Kindly let me know in case any further clarification is required from my end.</p><p><br></p><p>Regards</p><p><br></p><p>Pardeep Kumar</p><p>House No. 213 First Floor</p><p>Sector 46A, Chandigarh</p><p>160047</p><p>Mobile: 90175-90176</p>','<p>1. Rs 3 lacs for financial and mental harassment.</p><p>2. Immediate offer of possession of my Flat 1066, Elina Floors</p><p>3. Waive off penalty imposed.</p>',3358200.00,2990461.00,'2018-08-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2018-03-30 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Flat No. 1066,\r\nElina Floors, City of Dreams\r\nSBP, Sector 116, Mohali','','',1,0,0,0,'pardeeppunia','2019-02-26 21:46:52.000','pardeeppunia','2019-02-26 21:46:52.000'),(336,1127,'1127',1412,'eac1bbd1-41a7-401c-b5c4-7978e6951783','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2019-02-24 21:43:35.000','Damanjit Singh','daman_3344@yahoo.com',9814108763,0,0,'H no 3344','Sector 23 D',6,128,'160023','1','H no 3344','Sector 23 D',6,128,'160023','CA. Deepak Garg','cadeepakgarg@gmail.com',9855519149,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0086','ATS INFRABUILD PVT LTD CASA ESPANA','ATS INFRABUILD PVT LTD','EMAIL@ATSGREENS.COM',0,0,'ATS INFRABUILD PRIVATE LIMITED','711/92 DEEPALI, NEHRU PLACE',10,429,'110019','1','ATS INFRABUILD PRIVATE LIMITED','711/92 DEEPALI, NEHRU PLACE',10,429,'110019','1','<p>BOOKING</p><p>ON 25 OCTOBER 2017&nbsp; DAMANJIT SINGH, HEREINAFTER REFERRED AS COMPLAINANT HAD BOOKED A RESIDENTIAL APARTMENT NO 4PH2, HAVING CARPET AREA 247.58 SQ. MT, TYPE B, ON 26TH FLOOR IN TOWER NO 4 BY GIVING AN ADVANCE OF RS 7500000 (NO RECEIPT IS ISSUED TILL DATE) THE SAID CHEQUE WAS ENCASHED BY ATS INFRABUILD PVT LTD, HEREIN AFTER REFERRED AS RESPONDENT.&nbsp;</p><p>EXECUTION OF AGREEMENT</p><p>THE THIRTY TWO PAGE AGREEMENT TO SELL WAS EXECUTED ON DATED 28 OCTOBER 2017, WHEREIN DATE OF POSSESSION OF APARTMENT WAS MENTIONED AS 31 DECEMBER&nbsp; 2017 WITH A GRACE PERIOD OF 3 MONTHS. KINDLY REFER PARA NO 7.1 AT PAGE 10 OF AGREEMENT TO SELL</p><p>PAYMENTS MADE TILL DATE</p><p>TOTAL AMOUNT TILL DATE WAS PAID AGAINST BASIC COST OF RS. 10491073 ALONG WITH GST OF RS 1258928</p><p>POSSESSION LATE BY MORE THAN ONE YEAR</p><p>AS PER AGREEMENT POSSESSION HAS TO BE HANDOVER BY 31 DECEMBER 2017 BUT EVEN AFTER PASSING OF MORE THAN ONE YEAR NO PHYSICAL POSSESSION WAS HANDOVER TILL DATE</p><p><br></p><p>GROUNDS OF APPEAL</p><p>1 EVEN AFTER&nbsp; PASSING OF MORE THAN ONE YEAR&nbsp; FROM THE DATE OF POSSESSION AS MENTIONED IN AGREEMENT TO SELL, THE RESPONDENT FAILED TO HANDOVER THE ACTUAL PHYSICAL POSSESSION.</p><p>2 COMPLAINANT HAD PAID RS. 10491073 AGAINST BASIC COST ALONG WITH 1258928 AGAINST GST.</p><p>3 COMPLAINANT HAD TAKEN A HOUSING LOAN OF RS. 4145090 AND PAYING MONTHLY INSTALLMENT&nbsp; OF RS. 40819</p><p>4 COMPLAINANT AND HIS FAMILY IS FACING A HUGE MENTAL AND FINANCIAL AGONY DUE TO FAILURE OF RESPONDENT.&nbsp;</p>','<p>RELIEF SOUGHT</p><p>1. LUMPSUM INTEREST U/S 18(1) FROM JANUARY 2018 TILL THE DATE OF ACTUAL POSSESSION INTEREST U/S 18(1) OF THE REAL ESTATE (REGULATION AND DEVELOPMENT) ACT 2016 ON AMOUNT PAID OF RS 10491073 AT THE RATE SPECIFIED IN CLAUSE 16 AND 17 OF REAL ESTATE (REGULATION AND DEVELOPMENT) RULES PUNJAB. ALSO IN REFERENCE TO SETTLED LAW BY HONBLE AUTHORITY PUNJAB IN CASE OF NIKHIL KAWATRA AND RANJINI G VS MR. KULWANT SINGH MD OF JANTA LAND PROMOTERS PVT LTD.</p><p>2. COMPENSATION OF RS. 1000000 IN LIEU OF MENTAL AND FINANCIAL AGONY U/S 18(1) OF THE REAL ESTATE (REGULATION AND DEVELOPMENT) ACT 2016