00,000/-  to TDI noticees till dates.\r\n</p><p>4.	That, as per the conditions and stipulations of the agreement dated 29/06/2016, the possession of the furnished flat was to be handed over to us in the month  of June 2018 alongwith grace/extended period of 6 months i.e. Upto 28 December 2018. It is also pertinent to mention here that there is also one stipulation in the agreement with regard to the delayed/default of payment in that eventuality, the buyer has to bear the penalty clause of Rs. 21% inte</p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">&nbsp;we request you to kindly&nbsp; direct &nbsp;TDI to return/refund the hard earned money Rs.\r\n56,42,861/- (Rupees Fifty Six Lakh, Forty Two Thousand, Eight Hundred Sixty One\r\nOnly) as in installments received by TDI alongwith interest @ 21% per annum i.e.\r\nRs. 23,67,733/- (Twenty Three Lakhs Sixty Seven Thousand Seven Hundred Thirty\r\nThree Only) upto. 18-02-2019, as accrued on every installment received by you.\r\nalongwith Rs. 19,000/- per month from January 2019 till finalization and Rs.\r\n5,00,000/- on account of physical harassment, mental agony distress.<o:p></o:p></span></p>',5327168.00,5642861.00,'2019-02-28 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2016-06-29 00:00:00','2016-06-29 00:00:00','Block M,Flat No. 201, Wellington Height Extension ,TDI City Mohali','','',1,0,0,0,'BHAWNATHAKUR','2019-02-28 21:03:11.000','BHAWNATHAKUR','2019-02-28 21:03:11.000'),(341,1132,'1132',1172,'fe8a123a-24f0-4e44-a8e1-3e154d6acf61','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Amar Chand','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9988247548,0,0,'House No. 1185','Sector-35 B',6,128,'160035','1','253','Sector 4, Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0091','Posh City','BABA BANDA SINGH BAHADUR ENTERPRISE','bbsbikpmohali@gmail.com',9915322330,0