019-03-05 19:46:11.000','rerafilingformn','2019-03-05 19:46:11.000'),(345,1132,'1132',1172,'fe8a123a-24f0-4e44-a8e1-3e154d6acf61','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Amar Chand','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9988247548,0,0,'House No. 1185','Sector-35 B, D.A.D Colony',6,128,'160035','1','253','Sector 4, Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','Sanjeev Gupta','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PM0091','Posh City','BABA BANDA SINGH BAHADUR ENTERPRISE','bbsbikpmohali@gmail.com',9915322330,0,'Village Chaper Chiri Kalan','SECTOR 91-92',28,507,'160056','1','Village Chaper Chiri Kalan','SECTOR 91-92',28,507,'160056','0','<p>The complainants booked a residential plot measuring 112.5 sq yards vide application form&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (C-1)dated 29.12.2017. It was assured by the respondent that it has all the approvals and license for the development of project and further assured that the possession will be delivered within 1 year.A total of Rs. 472000/- was paid by the complainants by January, 2018.Copy of receipt is attached as C-2. The location of the plot which was initially shown by the respondent was later on changed by the respondent. There was no high tension wires over the plot when the location of the said plot was shown by the respondent. When the complainants visited the office of respondent in the month of June,018, it was informed to them that there are high tension wires over the plot. The complainant then asked the respondent to change the location of the plot but the respondent refused to change the plot.&nbsp; When the plot was sold to the complainants, the respondent was not registered under RERA and also it was not having any license for the development of colony.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></