vals and license for the development of project and further assured that the possession will be delivered within 1 year.A total of Rs. 472000/- was paid by the complainants by January, 2018.Copy of receipt is attached as C-2. The location of the plot which was initially shown by the respondent was later on changed by the respondent. There was no high tension wires over the plot when the location of the said plot was shown by the respondent. When the complainants visited the office of respondent for signing the agreement on 16.7.2018, it was informed to them that there are high tension wires over the plot and the layout is still not final. The complainant then asked the respondent to change the location of the plot but the respondent refused to change the plot. Moreover the copy of the agreement given to complainant was not as per RERA. The complainant asked the respondent to refund the amount along with interest. But the respondent only refunded the principal amount vide draft dated 22.11.18 Inspite of number of visits and requests, the respondent has not paid any interest on the refunded amount. Also, the respondent is liable to pay compensation to the complainants. When the plot was sold to the complainants, the respondent was not registered under RERA and also it was not having any license for the development of colony.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>ABC</p>','<ol><li>To direct the respondent to pay interest&nbsp; as prescribed under Rule 16 of Punjab RERA Rules, 2017 , on the refunded amount of Rs. 100000/- w.e.f. 29.12.2017 upto 22.11.2018</li><li>To direct the respondent to pay interest&nbsp; as prescribed under Rule 16 of Punjab RERA Rules, 2017 , on the refunded amount of Rs. 136000/- w.e.f. 02.01.2018 upto 22.11.2018.</li><li>To direct the respondent to pay interest&nbsp; as prescribed under Rule 16 of Punjab RERA Rules, 2017 , on the refunded amount of Rs. 236000/- w.e.f. 10.02.2018 upto 22.11.2018</li><li>&nbsp;To direct the respondent to pay compensation of Rs. 50000/- to the complainants.</li><li>To direct the respondent to pay litigation charges to the tune of Rs. 20000/-</li></ol><p><br></p>',2360000.00,472000.00,'2018-12-28 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2018-01-05 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','plot no. 210','','',2,0,0,0,'rerafilingformn','2019-03-05 20:15:37.000','rerafilingformn','2019-03-05 20:15:37.000'),(347,1133,'1133',1424,'bda4574d-d32a-4e50-b1e1-0a49894d58b1','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2019-03-06 16:15:33.000','Anjana Anand','kulwindersinghadvocate@gmail.com',9872903100,0,0,'H.N- H1-103, Maya garden City','Zirakpur,',28,507,'140603','1','H.N- H1-103, Maya garden City','Zirakpur,',28,507,'140603','Kulwinder Singh','ksvarun513@gmail.com',9915772513,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0192','Maya Garden City','Maya Garden City','barnalabuilders@ymail.com',0,0,'Opposite McDonald\'s, Chandigarh- Ambala Highway','Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','Opposite McDonald\'s, Chandigarh- Ambala Highway','Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','<p class=\"ListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;</span>That complainants booked 5BHK flat for their own\r\nresidence in the project of respondent no. 1 vide applicationdated 08.12.2012\r\nand the respondent issued allotment letter of flat no. 103 measuring 2850 Sq.\r\nFt. in H1 block at first floor vide letter dated 14.12.2012 for the\r\nconsideration of 63,00,000/&nbsp; however\r\ncomplainant paid the total amount of Rs. 68,41,850/-including maintenance, service\r\nand late charges and no dues certificate was issued by respondent dated\r\n29.04.2016. </p><p class=\"ListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->2.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><!--[endif]-->That the possession was to be delivered on or\r\nbefore 30.11.2014 but offer of possession issued by respondent on 15.04.2016\r\nwhich was 17 months delayed.</p><p class=\"ListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->3.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><!--[endif]-->That as per agreement total area of flat was\r\n2850 sq. ft however respondent delivered the 2050. Sq. Ft but respondent have\r\nusurped a sum of Rs. 21,93,262/ towards the extra area of 797.55 sq. ft.</p><p class=\"ListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->4.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><!--[endif]-->That the respondent taken the hefty amount on\r\nthe name of service tax but unable to show the receipt after many request by\r\nthe complainant.</p><p class=\"ListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->5.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><!--[endif]-->That as per brochure and allurement by the\r\nrespondent are liable to provide already fitted amenities like geysers, spilt\r\nACs in all rooms, and Club housing facilities, anti skid tiles as per\r\nagreement, 5KVA power back up etc. but respondent failed to provide such\r\nfacilities even no proper roads are available to approach to highway.&nbsp; </p><p class=\"ListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->6.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><!--[endif]-->That respondent failed to get completion\r\ncertificate from competent authority further respondent has mortgaged the land\r\non which flat constructed to bank which is a serious issue.</p><p class=\"ListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->7.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><!--[endif]-->That the material used in construction is very\r\nlow quality, dump occurred after maintenance.</p><p class=\"ListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->8.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><!--[endif]-->The complainant approached several times and also sent a legal notice on 23.03.2017 to the respondent but all in vain.</p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"ListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->9.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><!--[endif]-->That earlier case was filed before PLA and State\r\nconsumer dispute redressal commission <st1:place w:st=\"on\">Punjab</st1:place>\r\nbut same was withdrawn for want of jurisdiction.</p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">To\r\npay Rs. 8,02,000 as per valuation report to make the flat in the position as\r\npromised by the respondent. </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">b.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To pay a compensation of Rs.\r\n10,00,000 (Rupees Ten Lac) to the Applicant for causing mental agony,\r\nharassment and humiliation as the OP were deficient in rendering service and are\r\nindulged in unfair trade practices, in the interest of justice.&nbsp; </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">c.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To remove all the encroachments made\r\nby the respondents for making parking etc and to put the same as per plan i.e.\r\ngreenery/park.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">d.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To refund the amount received as\r\nservice tax from the applicant since the same were not deposited by the\r\nrespondents with the concerned department.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">e.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To refund the amount Rs. 21,93,262/&nbsp; for giving 797.55 sq. ft. less area than\r\nagreed&nbsp; i.e.&nbsp; 2850 sq. ft.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">f.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To give NEC and get the sale deed done as per RERA with\r\nclear carpet area in favour of the applicant.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">g.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To pay interest @ 18% on the amount\r\nof Rs. 63,00,000/ from the due date of possession i.e. 30 Nov 2014 till the\r\ndate of sale deed/issuance of completion certificate.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">h.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To provide club/swimming pool etc along with all\r\nfacilities as per promise made in brochure.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">i.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To provide all other facilities\r\nwhich are promised but not provided like provision of DTH, Broadband, Intercom\r\nFacility, approach from Highway.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">j.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To pay an amount of Rs. 1,00,000/- as litigation\r\nexpenses.</p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Or any other order as the <st1:sn w:st=\"on\">Hon’ble</st1:sn>&nbsp;adjudicating authority may deem fit&nbsp; in the interest of justice.</span><br></p>',6300000.00,6841850.00,'2014-11-30 00:00:00.000','2016-04-15 00:00:00.000','','1','','2012-12-14 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','H.N- H1-103, Maya garden City, Zirakpur,  140603','','',2,0,0,0,'anjanaanand2','2019-03-06 15:06:37.000','anjanaanand2','2019-03-06 15:06:37.000'),(348,1134,'1134',1416,'da091fa1-bfc1-4e6e-b814-69ed2e771dc6','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2019-03-07 13:13:56.000','JAGDEEP SINGH','bhupinderb06@gmail.com',7589186556,0,0,'PUNJAB  POLICE HQ, #1111, SECTOR 70, NEAR GURU THE NAHADUR COMPLEX, MOHALI-160062','',28,507,'160062','1','3060, SECTOR 20D','',6,128,'160020','Mansur Ali','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0047','m/s Emerging India Housing Corporation Pvt Ltd','m/s Emerging India Housing Corporation Pvt Ltd','info@emergingindia.in',1725042900,0,'SCO-46-47, First Floor, Sector-9 D, Near Mattka Chowk, ','',6,128,'160009','1','SCO-46-47, First Floor, Sector-9 D, Near Mattka Chowk, ','',6,128,'160009','1','<p>That the applicant has entered into an agreement with the present respondent.The respondent has given the assurance that he is developing the project namely Emerging Heights 3 situated at Sector 115 Kharar Landran Road Mohali and an allotment letter has been issued by the said respondent, copy of the allotment letter is annexed as Annexure A1.That as per the allotment letter the basic sale price of the flat is Rs.34 lacs and the net sale price is Rs.31 lac and including the club membership and preferential location charges the applicant has to pay a total sum of Rs.34 lacs.&nbsp; That the applicant has booked the flat on dated 4 May 2010 and the respondent has issued a letter dated 10th of May2016 of flat no. H403 Cat B Block 4 TowerH 2BHK in the emerging heights 3.Copy of the same is annexed as Annexure A2. That on 10th of May the applicant has paid initially amount of Rs620000.That on the asking of the present respondent loan of Rs.2490000 has been sanctioned by the indiabull copy of the sanction letter is annexed as Annexure A3.&nbsp; That the applicant is regularly paying the EMIs of loan amount of the above said flat.Copy of certificate issued by bank dated 26.07.2018 for the period of 01.04.2017 to 31.03.2018 of the loan account is annexed as Annexure A4.That as per the assurance of the respondent the possession of the flat has to be delivered within one year that is till mid of 2017 but the construction is not completed within time and the applicant approached the respondent to deliver the possession or to refund the amount with the interest on the various requests of the applicant the respondent entered into an agreement dated 10112017.Copy of the same is annexed as Annexure A5.&nbsp; As per the agreement the amount of Rs.1838000 which is deposited by the applicant is agreed to return within three instalments by dated 31032018 30062018 30092018 and the respondent has also issued a cheque of PNB having no 157037 of Rs.200000.But the same has been written same can be produce</p>','<p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">That the respondent\r\nis now delaying to return despite settlement intentionally.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Prayer</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;&#10;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'mso-fareast-font-family:\"Courier New\";mso-bidi-font-family:\"Courier New\"\'><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">1.<span style=\'font:7.0pt \"Times New Roman\"\'> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\">It is therefore respectfully prayed that respondent may kindly be\r\ndirected to returned the settled amount of Rs.18,38,000/- along with interest\r\nas per RERA ACT and return the loan due amount to the bank, in the interest of\r\njustice.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;&#10;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'mso-fareast-font-family:\"Courier New\";mso-bidi-font-family:\"Courier New\"\'><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">2.<span style=\'font:7.0pt \"Times New Roman\"\'> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Compensation on account of mental agony, harassment, litigation\r\ncost, unwanted personal visits amounting to Rs.5,00,000.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">And </span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Any other order\r\nwhich this Court deems fit may also be granted to the applicant as per\r\nprovisions of RERA ACT.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><span style=\"mso-tab-count:8\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>applicant</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n<b></b><i></i><u></u><sub></sub><sup></sup><strike></strike><br></p>',3400000.00,1838000.00,'2017-05-15 00:00:00.000','2017-05-15 00:00:00.000','','1','','2016-06-08 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','flat no. H403 Cat B, Block 4, Tower H, 2BHK in the emerging heights 3','','',2,0,0,0,'vikasgchd','2019-03-07 10:55:10.000','vikasgchd','2019-03-07 10:55:10.000'),(349,1125,'1125',1407,'4af5a203-a586-4c8d-b135-80e86f4acbb9','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2019-02-21 14:40:38.000','Aman  SUnda','ramashishbyahut@gmail.com',9915772513,0,0,'H.N- H1-102 Maya Garden City','Zirakhpur',28,507,'140603','1','H. N-132 New Green City, Behind Radha Swami Satsang Bhawan','Hambhra Road, Ludhiana',28,366,'141008','Kulwinder  Singh','kulwindersinghadvocate@gmail.com',9872903100,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0192','Maya Garden City','Maya Garden City','info@mayagardengroup.com',0,0,'Opposite McDonald\'s, Chandigarh-Ambala Highway','Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','Opposite McDonald\'s, Chandigarh-Ambala Highway','Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">1.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; That applicant booked 5 BHK flat for his own residence in the\r\nproject of respondent no. 1 vide application dated 30.12.2011 and the &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; respondent issued allotment of flat no.\r\n102 measuring 2850 Sq. Ft. in H1 block at first floor vide letter dated\r\n24.07.2012 for consideration Rs.57,00,000/ however complainant paid\r\nRs.66,87,479 including late fee , service tax and maintenance. And as per\r\nclause 5 of agreement the execution of sale deed was fixed on or before 30<sup>th</sup>\r\nNOV 2015 however respondent failed execute sale deed till date.</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">2.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; That as per brochure, respondents are liable to provide club\r\nhouse facility and swimming pool etc which were also not provided by\r\nrespondents &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; till date. The\r\npossession was to be handed over on or before 30.11.2015 but the same was\r\noffered to delivered on 15.05.2016. It is relevant to mention that respondent\r\nfailed to get completion certificate and PPCB issued a letter to cancel the\r\npartial certificate due to non-fulfillment of condition of completion certificate. it is\r\nfurther mentioned that the as per agreement the total area was to be handed\r\nover 2850 Sq ft but opposite party has handed over the 2052 sq ft area only, and\r\nopposite party had taken the hefty amount on the name of service tax but failed\r\nto produce any receipts after so many request by complainant.</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">3.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; That as per clause 9 of agreement registry to be executed\r\nwithin three month from the date of possession on failure respondents is liable\r\nto pay 2,00,000/ opposite party failed to sale deed registered due to non-\r\ncompletion certificate.</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">4.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; That applicant requested number of times to respondent to\r\nprovide facilities as per brochure and agreement but failed resolve the issues\r\nrose by applicant and further to get occupation/completion and certificate&nbsp;&nbsp; even after receiving legal notice.</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">5. That this case has already\r\nfilled before PLA, Mohali but same was withdrawn for want of jurisdiction.</p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">To\r\npay Rs.8,02,000 as per valuation report to make the flat in the position as\r\npromised by the respondent.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">b.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To refund the amount of the sale consideration\r\nof 21,93,262/ which has been received by the respondent for extra areas e.i 798 sq. ft but\r\nactual handed over area is 2052.45 sq. ft.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">c.\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To pay Rs.2, 00,000/ as per clause\r\n9 of agreement for not executed the sale deed within 3 months from the date of\r\npossession. </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">b.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To pay a compensation of Rs 5,00,000\r\n(Rupees five Lac) to the complainant for causing mental agony, harassment and\r\nhumiliation as the OP were &nbsp; &nbsp;deficient in rendering service and are\r\nindulged in unfair trade practices, in the interest of justice.&nbsp; </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">c.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To remove all the encroachments made by\r\nthe respondents for making parking etc and to put the same as per plan i.e.\r\ngreenery/park.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">d.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To refund the amount received as\r\nservice tax from the applicant since the same were not deposited by the\r\nrespondents with the concerned department along with&nbsp; Interest\r\n@18% P.A from the date of deposit till realization of amount.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">f.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To give NEC and get the sale deed done\r\nas per RERA with clear carpet area in favour of the applicant.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">g.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To pay interest @ 18% on the amount of\r\nRs.66,87,479 from the due date of possession i.e. 30 NOV 2015 till the date of\r\nsale deed/issuance of completion certificate.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">h.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To provide club/swimming pool etc along\r\nwith all facilities as per promise made in brochure.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">i.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To provide all other facilities which\r\nare promised by not provided like provision of DTH, Broadband, Intercom\r\nFacility, approach from Highway.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">j.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To pay an amount of Rs.1,00,000/- as litigation expenses.</p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify\">Or any other\r\norder as the Hon’ble adjudicating authority may deem fit and proper in the\r\ninterest of justice.</p>',5700000.00,6687479.00,'2014-04-16 00:00:00.000','2015-11-30 00:00:00.000','','1','','2012-07-24 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','H1-102, Maya Garden City, Zirakpur, District Mohali Punjab- Pin-140603','','',2,0,0,0,'amansunda1','2019-03-07 11:05:29.000','amansunda1','2019-03-07 11:05:29.000'),(350,1125,'1125',1407,'4af5a203-a586-4c8d-b135-80e86f4acbb9','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2019-03-07 11:27:51.000','Aman  SUnda','ramashishbyahut@gmail.com',9915772513,0,0,'H.N- H1-102 Maya Garden City','Zirakhpur',28,507,'140603','1','H. N-132 New Green City, Behind Radha Swami Satsang Bhawan','Hambhra Road, Ludhiana',28,366,'141008','Kulwinder  Singh','kulwindersinghadvocate@gmail.com',9872903100,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0192','Maya Garden City','Maya Garden City','info@mayagardengroup.com',0,0,'Opposite McDonald\'s, Chandigarh-Ambala Highway','Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','Opposite McDonald\'s, Chandigarh-Ambala Highway','Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">1.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; That applicant booked 5 BHK flat for his own residence in the\r\nproject of respondent no. 1 vide application dated 30.12.2011 and the &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; respondent issued allotment of flat no.\r\n102 measuring 2850 Sq. Ft. in H1 block at first floor vide letter dated\r\n24.07.2012 for consideration Rs.57,00,000/ however complainant paid\r\nRs.66,87,479 including late fee , service tax and maintenance. And as per\r\nclause 5 of agreement the execution of sale deed was fixed on or before 30<sup>th</sup>\r\nNOV 2015 however respondent failed execute sale deed till date.</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">2.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; That as per brochure, respondents are liable to provide club\r\nhouse facility and swimming pool etc which were also not provided by\r\nrespondents &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; till date. The\r\npossession was to be handed over on or before 30.11.2015 but the same was\r\noffered to delivered on 15.05.2016. It is relevant to mention that respondent\r\nfailed to get completion certificate and PPCB issued a letter to cancel the\r\npartial certificate due to non-fulfillment of condition of completion certificate. it is\r\nfurther mentioned that the as per agreement the total area was to be handed\r\nover 2850 Sq ft but opposite party has handed over the 2052 sq ft area only, and\r\nopposite party had taken the hefty amount on the name of service tax but failed\r\nto produce any receipts after so many request by complainant.</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">3.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; That as per clause 9 of agreement registry to be executed\r\nwithin three month from the date of possession on failure respondents is liable\r\nto pay 2,00,000/ opposite party failed to sale deed registered due to non-\r\ncompletion certificate.</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">4.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; That applicant requested number of times to respondent to\r\nprovide facilities as per brochure and agreement but failed resolve the issues\r\nrose by applicant and further to get occupation/completion and certificate&nbsp;&nbsp; even after receiving legal notice.</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">5. That this case has already\r\nfilled before PLA, Mohali but same was withdrawn for want of jurisdiction.</p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">To\r\npay Rs.8,02,000 as per valuation report to make the flat in the position as\r\npromised by the respondent.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">b.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To refund the amount of the sale consideration\r\nof 21,93,262/ which has been received by the respondent for extra areas e.i 798 sq. ft but\r\nactual handed over area is 2052.45 sq. ft.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">c.\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To pay Rs.2, 00,000/ as per clause\r\n9 of agreement for not executed the sale deed within 3 months from the date of\r\npossession. </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">b.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To pay a compensation of Rs 5,00,000\r\n(Rupees five Lac) to the complainant for causing mental agony, harassment and\r\nhumiliation as the OP were &nbsp; &nbsp;deficient in rendering service and are\r\nindulged in unfair trade practices, in the interest of justice.&nbsp; </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">c.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To remove all the encroachments made by\r\nthe respondents for making parking etc and to put the same as per plan i.e.\r\ngreenery/park.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">d.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To refund the amount received as\r\nservice tax from the applicant since the same were not deposited by the\r\nrespondents with the concerned department along with&nbsp; Interest\r\n@18% P.A from the date of deposit till realization of amount.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">f.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To give NEC and get the sale deed done\r\nas per RERA with clear carpet area in favour of the applicant.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">g.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To pay interest @ 18% on the amount of\r\nRs.66,87,479 from the due date of possession i.e. 30 NOV 2015 till the date of\r\nsale deed/issuance of completion certificate.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">h.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To provide club/swimming pool etc along\r\nwith all facilities as per promise made in brochure.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">i.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To provide all other facilities which\r\nare promised by not provided like provision of DTH, Broadband, Intercom\r\nFacility, approach from Highway.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">j.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To pay an amount of Rs.1,00,000/- as litigation expenses.</p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify\">Or any other\r\norder as the Hon’ble adjudicating authority may deem fit and proper in the\r\ninterest of justice.</p>',5700000.00,6687479.00,'2014-04-16 00:00:00.000','2015-11-30 00:00:00.000','','1','','2012-07-24 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','H1-102, Maya Garden City, Zirakpur, District Mohali Punjab- Pin-140603','','',2,0,0,0,'amansunda1','2019-03-07 11:06:58.000','amansunda1','2019-03-07 11:06:58.000'),(351,1133,'1133',1424,'bda4574d-d32a-4e50-b1e1-0a49894d58b1','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2019-03-07 12:20:59.000','Anjana Anand','kulwindersinghadvocate@gmail.com',9872903100,0,0,'H.N- H1-103, Maya garden City','Zirakpur,',28,507,'140603','1','H.N- H1-103, Maya garden City','Zirakpur,',28,507,'140603','Kulwinder Singh','ksvarun513@gmail.com',9915772513,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0192','Maya Garden City','Barnala Builders and Property Consultants','barnalabuilders@ymail.com',0,0,'M/s. Barnala Builders and Property Consultants, Maya Garden City, Zirakpur Ambala Highway','Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','M/s. Barnala Builders and Property Consultants, Maya Garden City, Zirakpur Ambala Highway','Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','<p class=\"ListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;</span>That complainants booked 5BHK flat for their own\r\nresidence in the project of respondent no. 1 vide applicationdated 08.12.2012\r\nand the respondent issued allotment letter of flat no. 103 measuring 2850 Sq.\r\nFt. in H1 block at first floor vide letter dated 14.12.2012 for the\r\nconsideration of 63,00,000/&nbsp; however\r\ncomplainant paid the total amount of Rs. 68,41,850/-including maintenance, service\r\nand late charges and no dues certificate was issued by respondent dated\r\n29.04.2016. </p><p class=\"ListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->2.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><!--[endif]-->That the possession was to be delivered on or\r\nbefore 30.11.2014 but offer of possession issued by respondent on 15.04.2016\r\nwhich was 17 months delayed.</p><p class=\"ListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->3.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><!--[endif]-->That as per agreement total area of flat was\r\n2850 sq. ft however respondent delivered the 2050. Sq. Ft but respondent have\r\nusurped a sum of Rs. 21,93,262/ towards the extra area of 797.55 sq. ft.</p><p class=\"ListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->4.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><!--[endif]-->That the respondent taken the hefty amount on\r\nthe name of service tax but unable to show the receipt after many request by\r\nthe complainant.</p><p class=\"ListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->5.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><!--[endif]-->That as per brochure and allurement by the\r\nrespondent are liable to provide already fitted amenities like geysers, spilt\r\nACs in all rooms, and Club housing facilities, anti skid tiles as per\r\nagreement, 5KVA power back up etc. but respondent failed to provide such\r\nfacilities even no proper roads are available to approach to highway.&nbsp; </p><p class=\"ListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->6.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><!--[endif]-->That respondent failed to get completion\r\ncertificate from competent authority further respondent has mortgaged the land\r\non which flat constructed to bank which is a serious issue.</p><p class=\"ListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->7.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><!--[endif]-->That the material used in construction is very\r\nlow quality, dump occurred after maintenance.</p><p class=\"ListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->8.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><!--[endif]-->The complainant approached several times and also sent a legal notice on 23.03.2017 to the respondent but all in vain.</p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"ListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->9.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span><!--[endif]-->That earlier case was filed before PLA and State\r\nconsumer dispute redressal commission <st1:place w:st=\"on\">Punjab</st1:place>\r\nbut same was withdrawn for want of jurisdiction.</p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">To\r\npay Rs. 8,02,000 as per valuation report to make the flat in the position as\r\npromised by the respondent. </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">b.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To pay a compensation of Rs.\r\n10,00,000 (Rupees Ten Lac) to the Applicant for causing mental agony,\r\nharassment and humiliation as the OP were deficient in rendering service and are\r\nindulged in unfair trade practices, in the interest of justice.&nbsp; </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">c.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To remove all the encroachments made\r\nby the respondents for making parking etc and to put the same as per plan i.e.\r\ngreenery/park.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">d.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To refund the amount received as\r\nservice tax from the applicant since the same were not deposited by the\r\nrespondents with the concerned department.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">e.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To refund the amount Rs. 21,93,262/&nbsp; for giving 797.55 sq. ft. less area than\r\nagreed&nbsp; i.e.&nbsp; 2850 sq. ft.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">f.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To give NEC and get the sale deed done as per RERA with\r\nclear carpet area in favour of the applicant.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">g.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To pay interest @ 18% on the amount\r\nof Rs. 63,00,000/ from the due date of possession i.e. 30 Nov 2014 till the\r\ndate of sale deed/issuance of completion certificate.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">h.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To provide club/swimming pool etc along with all\r\nfacilities as per promise made in brochure.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">i.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To provide all other facilities\r\nwhich are promised but not provided like provision of DTH, Broadband, Intercom\r\nFacility, approach from Highway.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">j.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To pay an amount of Rs. 1,00,000/- as litigation\r\nexpenses.</p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Or any other order as the <st1:sn w:st=\"on\">Hon’ble</st1:sn>&nbsp;adjudicating authority may deem fit&nbsp; in the interest of justice.</span><br></p>',6300000.00,6841850.00,'2014-11-30 00:00:00.000','2016-04-15 00:00:00.000','','1','','2012-12-14 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','H.N- H1-103, Maya garden City, Zirakpur,  140603','','',1,1,0,0,'anjanaanand2','2019-03-07 12:20:14.000','anjanaanand2','2019-03-07 12:20:14.000'),(352,1134,'1134',1416,'da091fa1-bfc1-4e6e-b814-69ed2e771dc6','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2019-03-07 13:13:56.000','JAGDEEP SINGH','bhupinderb06@gmail.com',7589186556,0,0,'PUNJAB  POLICE HQ, #1111, SECTOR 70, NEAR GURU THE NAHADUR COMPLEX, MOHALI-160062','',28,507,'160062','1','3060, SECTOR 20D','',6,128,'160020','Bhupinder Banga','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0047','m/s Emerging India Housing Corporation Pvt Ltd','m/s Emerging India Housing Corporation Pvt Ltd','info@emergingindia.in',1725042900,0,'SCO-46-47, First Floor, Sector-9 D, Near Mattka Chowk, ','',6,128,'160009','1','SCO-46-47, First Floor, Sector-9 D, Near Mattka Chowk, ','',6,128,'160009','1','<p>That the applicant has entered into an agreement with the present respondent.The respondent has given the assurance that he is developing the project namely Emerging Heights 3 situated at Sector 115 Kharar Landran Road Mohali and an allotment letter has been issued by the said respondent, copy of the allotment letter is annexed as Annexure A1.That as per the allotment letter the basic sale price of the flat is Rs.34 lacs and the net sale price is Rs.31 lac and including the club membership and preferential location charges the applicant has to pay a total sum of Rs.34 lacs.&nbsp; That the applicant has booked the flat on dated 4 May 2010 and the respondent has issued a letter dated 10th of May2016 of flat no. H403 Cat B Block 4 TowerH 2BHK in the emerging heights 3.Copy of the same is annexed as Annexure A2. That on 10th of May the applicant has paid initially amount of Rs620000.That on the asking of the present respondent loan of Rs.2490000 has been sanctioned by the indiabull copy of the sanction letter is annexed as Annexure A3.&nbsp; That the applicant is regularly paying the EMIs of loan amount of the above said flat.Copy of certificate issued by bank dated 26.07.2018 for the period of 01.04.2017 to 31.03.2018 of the loan account is annexed as Annexure A4.That as per the assurance of the respondent the possession of the flat has to be delivered within one year that is till mid of 2017 but the construction is not completed within time and the applicant approached the respondent to deliver the possession or to refund the amount with the interest on the various requests of the applicant the respondent entered into an agreement dated 10112017.Copy of the same is annexed as Annexure A5.&nbsp; As per the agreement the amount of Rs.1838000 which is deposited by the applicant is agreed to return within three instalments by dated 31032018 30062018 30092018 and the respondent has also issued a cheque of PNB having no 157037 of Rs.200000.But the same has been written same can be produce</p>','<p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">That the respondent\r\nis now delaying to return despite settlement intentionally.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Prayer</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;&#10;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'mso-fareast-font-family:\"Courier New\";mso-bidi-font-family:\"Courier New\"\'><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">1.<span style=\'font:7.0pt \"Times New Roman\"\'> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\">It is therefore respectfully prayed that respondent may kindly be\r\ndirected to returned the settled amount of Rs.18,38,000/- along with interest\r\nas per RERA ACT and return the loan due amount to the bank, in the interest of\r\njustice.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;&#10;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'mso-fareast-font-family:\"Courier New\";mso-bidi-font-family:\"Courier New\"\'><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">2.<span style=\'font:7.0pt \"Times New Roman\"\'> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Compensation on account of mental agony, harassment, litigation\r\ncost, unwanted personal visits amounting to Rs.5,00,000.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">And </span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Any other order\r\nwhich this Court deems fit may also be granted to the applicant as per\r\nprovisions of RERA ACT.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><span style=\"mso-tab-count:8\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>applicant</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n<b></b><i></i><u></u><sub></sub><sup></sup><strike></strike><br></p>',3400000.00,1838000.00,'2017-05-15 00:00:00.000','2017-05-15 00:00:00.000','','1','','2016-06-08 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','flat no. H403 Cat B, Block 4, Tower H, 2BHK in the emerging heights 3','','',2,0,0,0,'vikasgchd','2019-03-07 15:52:42.000','vikasgchd','2019-03-07 15:52:42.000'),(353,1134,'1134',1416,'da091fa1-bfc1-4e6e-b814-69ed2e771dc6','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2019-03-07 17:37:01.000','JAGDEEP SINGH','bhupinderb06@gmail.com',7589186556,0,0,'PUNJAB  POLICE HQ, #1111, SECTOR 70, NEAR GURU THE NAHADUR COMPLEX, MOHALI-160062','',28,507,'160062','1','3060, SECTOR 20D','',6,128,'160020','Bhupinder Banga','',9814297086,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0047','m/s Emerging India Housing Corporation Pvt Ltd','m/s Emerging India Housing Corporation Pvt Ltd','info@emergingindia.in',1725042900,0,'SCO-46-47, First Floor, Sector-9 D, Near Mattka Chowk, ','',6,128,'160009','1','SCO-46-47, First Floor, Sector-9 D, Near Mattka Chowk, ','',6,128,'160009','1','<p>That the applicant has entered into an agreement with the present respondent.The respondent has given the assurance that he is developing the project namely Emerging Heights 3 situated at Sector 115 Kharar Landran Road Mohali and an allotment letter has been issued by the said respondent, copy of the allotment letter is annexed as Annexure A1.That as per the allotment letter the basic sale price of the flat is Rs.34 lacs and the net sale price is Rs.31 lac and including the club membership and preferential location charges the applicant has to pay a total sum of Rs.34 lacs.&nbsp; That the applicant has booked the flat on dated 4 May 2010 and the respondent has issued a letter dated 10th of May2016 of flat no. H403 Cat B Block 4 TowerH 2BHK in the emerging heights 3.Copy of the same is annexed as Annexure A2. That on 10th of May the applicant has paid initially amount of Rs620000.That on the asking of the present respondent loan of Rs.2490000 has been sanctioned by the indiabull copy of the sanction letter is annexed as Annexure A3.&nbsp; That the applicant is regularly paying the EMIs of loan amount of the above said flat.Copy of certificate issued by bank dated 26.07.2018 for the period of 01.04.2017 to 31.03.2018 of the loan account is annexed as Annexure A4.That as per the assurance of the respondent the possession of the flat has to be delivered within one year that is till mid of 2017 but the construction is not completed within time and the applicant approached the respondent to deliver the possession or to refund the amount with the interest on the various requests of the applicant the respondent entered into an agreement dated 10112017.Copy of the same is annexed as Annexure A5.&nbsp; As per the agreement the amount of Rs.1838000 which is deposited by the applicant is agreed to return within three instalments by dated 31032018 30062018 30092018 and the respondent has also issued a cheque of PNB having no 157037 of Rs.200000.But the same has been written same can be produce</p>','<p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">That the respondent\r\nis now delaying to return despite settlement intentionally.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Prayer</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;&#10;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'mso-fareast-font-family:\"Courier New\";mso-bidi-font-family:\"Courier New\"\'><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">1.<span style=\'font:7.0pt \"Times New Roman\"\'> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\">It is therefore respectfully prayed that respondent may kindly be\r\ndirected to returned the settled amount of Rs.18,38,000/- along with interest\r\nas per RERA ACT and return the loan due amount to the bank, in the interest of\r\njustice.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;&#10;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'mso-fareast-font-family:\"Courier New\";mso-bidi-font-family:\"Courier New\"\'><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">2.<span style=\'font:7.0pt \"Times New Roman\"\'> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Compensation on account of mental agony, harassment, litigation\r\ncost, unwanted personal visits amounting to Rs.5,00,000.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">And </span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Any other order\r\nwhich this Court deems fit may also be granted to the applicant as per\r\nprovisions of RERA ACT.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><span style=\"mso-tab-count:8\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>applicant</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n<b></b><i></i><u></u><sub></sub><sup></sup><strike></strike><br></p>',3400000.00,1838000.00,'2017-05-15 00:00:00.000','2017-05-15 00:00:00.000','','1','','2016-06-08 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','flat no. H403 Cat B, Block 4, Tower H, 2BHK in the emerging heights 3','','',1,1,0,0,'vikasgchd','2019-03-07 16:17:48.000','vikasgchd','2019-03-07 16:17:48.000'),(354,1125,'1125',1407,'4af5a203-a586-4c8d-b135-80e86f4acbb9','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2019-03-08 10:12:50.000','Aman  SUnda','ramashishbyahut@gmail.com',9915772513,0,0,'H.N- H1-102 Maya Garden City','Zirakhpur',28,507,'140603','1','H. N-132 New Green City, Behind Radha Swami Satsang Bhawan','Hambhra Road, Ludhiana',28,366,'141008','Kulwinder  Singh','kulwindersinghadvocate@gmail.com',9872903100,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0192','Maya Garden City','Barnala Builders and Property Consultants','barnalabuilders@ymail.com',0,0,'M/s. Barnala Builders and Property Consultants, Maya Garden City, Zirakpur Ambala Highway','Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','M/s. Barnala Builders and Property Consultants, Maya Garden City, Zirakpur Ambala Highway','Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">1.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; That applicant booked 5 BHK flat for his own residence in the\r\nproject of respondent no. 1 vide application dated 30.12.2011 and the &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; respondent issued allotment of flat no.\r\n102 measuring 2850 Sq. Ft. in H1 block at first floor vide letter dated\r\n24.07.2012 for consideration Rs.57,00,000/ however complainant paid\r\nRs.66,87,479 including late fee , service tax and maintenance. And as per\r\nclause 5 of agreement the execution of sale deed was fixed on or before 30<sup>th</sup>\r\nNOV 2015 however respondent failed execute sale deed till date.</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">2.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; That as per brochure, respondents are liable to provide club\r\nhouse facility and swimming pool etc which were also not provided by\r\nrespondents &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; till date. The\r\npossession was to be handed over on or before 30.11.2014 but the same was\r\noffered to delivered on 15.05.2016. It is relevant to mention that respondent\r\nfailed to get completion certificate and PPCB issued a letter to cancel the\r\npartial certificate due to non-fulfillment of condition of completion certificate. it is\r\nfurther mentioned that the as per agreement the total area was to be handed\r\nover 2850 Sq ft but opposite party has handed over the 2052 sq ft area only, and\r\nopposite party had taken the hefty amount on the name of service tax but failed\r\nto produce any receipts after so many request by complainant.</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">3.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; That as per clause 9 of agreement registry to be executed\r\nwithin three month from the date of possession on failure respondents is liable\r\nto pay 2,00,000/ opposite party failed to sale deed registered due to non-\r\ncompletion certificate.</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">4.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; That applicant requested number of times to respondent to\r\nprovide facilities as per brochure and agreement but failed resolve the issues\r\nrose by applicant and further to get occupation/completion and certificate&nbsp;&nbsp; even after receiving legal notice.</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">5. That this case has already\r\nfilled before PLA, Mohali but same was withdrawn for want of jurisdiction.</p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">a.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;To\r\npay Rs.8,02,000 as per valuation report to make the flat in the position as\r\npromised by the respondent.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">b.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To refund the amount of the sale consideration\r\nof 21,93,262/ which has been received by the respondent for extra areas e.i 798 sq. ft but\r\nactual handed over area is 2052.45 sq. ft.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">c.\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To pay Rs.2, 00,000/ as per clause\r\n9 of agreement for not executed the sale deed within 3 months from the date of\r\npossession. </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">b.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To pay a compensation of Rs 5,00,000\r\n(Rupees five Lac) to the complainant for causing mental agony, harassment and\r\nhumiliation as the OP were &nbsp; &nbsp;deficient in rendering service and are\r\nindulged in unfair trade practices, in the interest of justice.&nbsp; </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">c.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To remove all the encroachments made by\r\nthe respondents for making parking etc and to put the same as per plan i.e.\r\ngreenery/park.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">d.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To refund the amount received as\r\nservice tax from the applicant since the same were not deposited by the\r\nrespondents with the concerned department along with&nbsp; Interest\r\n@18% P.A from the date of deposit till realization of amount.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">f.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To give NEC and get the sale deed done\r\nas per RERA with clear carpet area in favour of the applicant.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">g.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To pay interest @ 18% on the amount of\r\nRs.66,87,479 from the due date of possession i.e. 30 NOV 2015 till the date of\r\nsale deed/issuance of completion certificate.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">h.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To provide club/swimming pool etc along\r\nwith all facilities as per promise made in brochure.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">i.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To provide all other facilities which\r\nare promised by not provided like provision of DTH, Broadband, Intercom\r\nFacility, approach from Highway.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">j.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To pay an amount of Rs.1,00,000/- as litigation expenses.</p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify\">Or any other\r\norder as the Hon’ble adjudicating authority may deem fit and proper in the\r\ninterest of justice.</p>',5700000.00,6687479.00,'2014-04-16 00:00:00.000','2016-05-05 00:00:00.000','','1','','2012-07-24 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','H1-102, Maya Garden City, Zirakpur, District Mohali Punjab- Pin-140603','','',1,1,0,0,'amansunda1','2019-03-08 10:12:19.000','amansunda1','2019-03-08 10:12:19.000'),(355,1135,'1135',1420,'7befc797-fb73-47bf-b82f-055349e65c86','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000',' Nishant Seth','kulwindersinghadvocate@gmail.com',9915772513,0,0,'Flat No. H1- 101, Maya Garden City','Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','Flat No. H1- 101, Maya Garden City','Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','kulwinder singh','ksvarun513@gmail.com',9915772513,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0192','Maya Garden City ','Barnala Builders & Property Consultant ','barnalabuilders@ymail.com',0,0,'M/s. Barnala Builders and Property Consultants, Maya Garden City, Zirakpur Ambala Highway','Zirakpur',28,507,'141603','1','M/s. Barnala Builders and Property Consultants, Maya Garden City, Zirakpur Ambala Highway','Zirakpur',28,507,'141603','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Garamond, serif; font-size: 13.5pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Garamond, serif; font-size: 13.5pt;\">1.\r\nThat the complainants booked a 5BHK flat for their residence with respondent in\r\nproject namely \"Maya Garden City\" on 28.06.2011 for the total\r\nconsideration of flat was 75,81,000 however complaints paid the total amount of\r\nRs. 79,22,900 /including service tax, maintenance and late payment charges. Flat\r\nwas to be delivered on or before 30.04.2014 to complainant but offer of\r\npossession was issued by respondent on 15.04.2016 by the 23 month delayed.</span><br></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in;mso-add-space:auto;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">2.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;  That\r\nas per agreement total area of flat was 2850 sq. ft however respondent\r\ndelivered the 2050. Sq. Ft but respondent have usurped a sum of Rs. 21,93,262/\r\ntowards the extra area of 797.55 sq. ft.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">.</span><span style=\"font-family: Garamond, serif; font-size: 13.5pt;\">3. That as per brochure and allurement by the\r\nrespondent are liable to provide already fitted amenities like geysers, spilt\r\nACs in all rooms, and Club housing facilities, anti skid tiles as per\r\nagreement, 5KVA power back up etc. but respondent failed to deliver such\r\nfacilities even no proper roads are available to approach to highway.</span><span style=\"font-family: Garamond, serif; font-size: 13.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">5.&nbsp; That the respondent have&nbsp;&nbsp; charged&nbsp;\r\nhefty amount&nbsp; from complainants on\r\nthe name of service tax but failed to deposit the same with concerned\r\ndepartment and failed to show the receipt even after several request of complainants.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">6. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; That it is further mentioned that material\r\nused by the respondent was very low quality dump reoccurred after repair. It is\r\nfurther mentioned that respondent have\r\nreceived amount of Rs. 61,194/ access but failed to returned even after\r\napproaching many &nbsp;times by the complainants.\r\n<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">7.\r\nThat the respondent failed to get completion certificate from competent\r\nauthority and delivered the possession to the complainant and respondent has mortgaged project\r\nland to the bank which is serious issue. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">8.\r\nThat the complainant approached several times and sent a legal notice dated\r\n29.05.2017 but all in vain.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">9.\r\nThat this case was filed before PLA but same was withdraw for want of\r\njurisdiction.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">a. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To pay 7,92,000/ as per valuation report to make the flat in\r\nthe position to promised by respondent.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">b&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To\r\npay the compensation of Rs. 5,00,000/ to the complainants for causing mental\r\nagony and harassment.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">c.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To refund the amount Rs. 21,93,262/&nbsp; for giving 797.55 sq. ft. less area than\r\nagreed&nbsp; i.e.&nbsp; 2850 sq. ft.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">d&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To\r\nremove all the encroachment made by the opposite parties for making parking etc\r\nand to put the same as per plan i.e greenery park.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">c.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To refund the amount received as service tax from the\r\ncomplainants along with interest @12% which was not deposited by respondent to\r\nconcerned department.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">d.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To pay interest @12% on the amount of Rs. 75,81,000/ from\r\nthe due date of possession i.e. 30.04.2014 till the sale deed/ issuance of\r\ncompletion certificate.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">e.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To provide club/swimming pool etc along with all facilities\r\nas per promise made in brochure.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">f. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To provide all facilities which are promised by not provided\r\nlike provision of DTH, broadband, Intercom Facilities, approach from Highway.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">g.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To pay an amount of Rs. 1,00,000/ as litigation expenses.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">Or any other order as the Hon\'ble\r\nadjudicating authority dim fit in the interest of justice.</p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>',7581000.00,7922900.00,'2014-04-30 00:00:00.000','2016-04-04 00:00:00.000','','1','','2011-07-28 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Flat No. H1- 101, Maya Garden City, Zirakpur, District- S.A.S Nagar, Mohali, Punjab -140603 ','','',2,0,0,0,'advkulwindersingh','2019-03-08 12:48:25.000','advkulwindersingh','2019-03-08 12:48:25.000'),(356,1136,'1136',1141,'971b1ae7-f8bc-4323-80a7-088b81f8b7db','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','NAVDEEP SINGH ANAND','navee.anand@gmail.com',9814611997,0,0,'19-D, Raj Guru Nagar','LUDHIANA',28,366,'141002','1','253','Sector 4, Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','SANJEEV GUPTA','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-LDH45-PR0041','IREO WATERFRONT','M/S IREO WATERFRONT PVT LTD','Rera.Punjab@ireo.in',9810117993,0,'Sidhwan Canal Road opp Ferozepur Road','Village Dewatwal',28,366,'141002','1','Sidhwan Canal Road opp Ferozepur Road','Village Dewatwal',28,366,'141002','1','<p>ABC</p>','<p>ABC</p>',17000222.00,6001038.30,'2017-11-25 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2015-10-07 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Unit No. 104, Type B-2, Built Up Villa','','',2,0,0,0,'rerafilingformm','2019-03-08 12:55:53.000','rerafilingformm','2019-03-08 12:55:53.000'),(357,1136,'1136',1141,'971b1ae7-f8bc-4323-80a7-088b81f8b7db','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','NAVDEEP SINGH ANAND','navee.anand@gmail.com',9814611997,0,0,'19-D, Raj Guru Nagar','LUDHIANA',28,366,'141002','1','253','Sector 4, Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','SANJEEV GUPTA','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-LDH45-PR0041','IREO WATERFRONT','M/S IREO WATERFRONT PVT LTD','Rera.Punjab@ireo.in',9810117993,0,'Sidhwan Canal Road opp Ferozepur Road','Village Dewatwal',28,366,'141002','1','Sidhwan Canal Road opp Ferozepur Road','Village Dewatwal',28,366,'141002','1','<p>ABC</p>','<p>ABC</p>',17000222.00,6001038.30,'2017-05-25 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2015-10-07 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Unit No. 104, Type B-2, Built Up Villa','','',2,0,0,0,'rerafilingformm','2019-03-08 13:00:01.000','rerafilingformm','2019-03-08 13:00:01.000'),(358,1136,'1136',1141,'971b1ae7-f8bc-4323-80a7-088b81f8b7db','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','NAVDEEP SINGH ANAND','navee.anand@gmail.com',9814611997,0,0,'19-D, Raj Guru Nagar','LUDHIANA',28,366,'141002','1','253','Sector 4, Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','SANJEEV GUPTA','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-LDH45-PR0041','IREO WATERFRONT','M/S IREO WATERFRONT PVT LTD','Rera.Punjab@ireo.in',9810117993,0,'Sidhwan Canal Road opp Ferozepur Road','Village Dewatwal',28,366,'141002','1','Sidhwan Canal Road opp Ferozepur Road','Village Dewatwal',28,366,'141002','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: roboto, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">On 22.9.15,Complainants booked (brochure &amp;\r\napplication as C-1 &amp; C-2) a built-up villa,Type B2,Unit No 104,2844 sq ft\r\nof built area,to be constructed on 287.04 sq yd plot.Allotment letter was\r\nissued to them(C-3).Complainants opted for construction linked plan.Total sale\r\nconsideration including all charges &amp; taxes was fixed as Rs.17000222.Buyer\r\nagreement (C-4) was executed on 26.11.15.As per clause 11.3,respondent was\r\nbound to handover the possession within 18 months from the date of execution of\r\nagreement.Said period has already expired on 22.05.17.Respondent has only\r\ncompleted the plinth level.There is no default on the part of complainants in\r\nmaking the payments.The payments which were due on 28.9.15, 28.10.15 &amp;\r\n27.12.15 were paid by complainants on 22.9.15, 26/28.11.15, 18/25.5.16\r\nrespectively.There was no delay attributed to the complainants and thus, no\r\ndelayed interest was demanded from the complainants since they were not at\r\nfault.A communication in this regard is attached as C-5.Thereafter vide demand\r\nletter (C-5) dt 3.9.17,a sum of Rs. 1859828 was demanded, which was duly paid\r\non 30.10.17 &amp; 5.11.17,under protest,since there was dispute about charging\r\nof GST &amp; also vide letter dt 9.10.17 &amp; 30.10.17(C-5),it was duly\r\nconveyed to respondents but respondent did not reply satisfactorily vide letter\r\ndt 30.10.17(C-5).A sum of Rs. 6001038.30(receipts &amp; documents C-5 colly)has\r\nalready been paid by the complainants.The next installment was due on the\r\ncasting of GF roof slab which has not been done &amp; consequently there has\r\nbeen no demand raised by the respondent.Respondent has also stopped the\r\ndevelopment work at the site.A letter was also sent to respondent in this\r\nregard on 14.12.18 &amp;16.12.18(C-6) but no reply has been received.Since there\r\nhas been delay in construction &amp; the respondent was bound to deliver the\r\npossession by 22.11.17,the complainants wishes to withdraw &amp; thus are\r\nseeking refund of the amount paid by them along with interest &amp; Compensation</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p>ABC</p>',17000222.00,6001038.30,'2017-05-25 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2015-10-07 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Unit No. 104, Type B-2, Built Up Villa','','',2,0,0,0,'rerafilingformm','2019-03-08 13:17:13.000','rerafilingformm','2019-03-08 13:17:13.000'),(359,1136,'1136',1141,'971b1ae7-f8bc-4323-80a7-088b81f8b7db','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','NAVDEEP SINGH ANAND','navee.anand@gmail.com',9814611997,0,0,'19-D, Raj Guru Nagar','LUDHIANA',28,366,'141002','1','253','Sector 4, Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','SANJEEV GUPTA','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-LDH45-PR0041','IREO WATERFRONT','M/S IREO WATERFRONT PVT LTD','Rera.Punjab@ireo.in',9810117993,0,'Sidhwan Canal Road opp Ferozepur Road','Village Dewatwal',28,366,'141002','1','Sidhwan Canal Road opp Ferozepur Road','Village Dewatwal',28,366,'141002','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: roboto, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">On 22.9.15,Complainants booked (brochure &amp;\r\napplication as C-1 &amp; C-2) a built-up villa,Type B2,Unit No 104,2844 sq ft\r\nof built area,to be constructed on 287.04 sq yd plot.Allotment letter was\r\nissued to them(C-3).Complainants opted for construction linked plan.Total sale\r\nconsideration including all charges &amp; taxes was fixed as Rs.17000222.Buyer\r\nagreement (C-4) was executed on 26.11.15.As per clause 11.3,respondent was\r\nbound to handover the possession within 18 months from the date of execution of\r\nagreement.Said period has already expired on 22.05.17.Respondent has only\r\ncompleted the plinth level.There is no default on the part of complainants in\r\nmaking the payments.The payments which were due on 28.9.15, 28.10.15 &amp;\r\n27.12.15 were paid by complainants on 22.9.15, 26/28.11.15, 18/25.5.16\r\nrespectively.There was no delay attributed to the complainants and thus, no\r\ndelayed interest was demanded from the complainants since they were not at\r\nfault.A communication in this regard is attached as C-5.Thereafter vide demand\r\nletter (C-5) dt 3.9.17,a sum of Rs. 1859828 was demanded, which was duly paid\r\non 30.10.17 &amp; 5.11.17,under protest,since there was dispute about charging\r\nof GST &amp; also vide letter dt 9.10.17 &amp; 30.10.17(C-5),it was duly\r\nconveyed to respondents but respondent did not reply satisfactorily vide letter\r\ndt 30.10.17(C-5).A sum of Rs. 6001038.30(receipts &amp; documents C-5 colly)has\r\nalready been paid by the complainants.The next installment was due on the\r\ncasting of GF roof slab which has not been done &amp; consequently there has\r\nbeen no demand raised by the respondent.Respondent has also stopped the\r\ndevelopment work at the site.A letter was also sent to respondent in this\r\nregard on 14.12.18 &amp;16.12.18(C-6) but no reply has been received.Since there\r\nhas been delay in construction &amp; the respondent was bound to deliver the\r\npossession by 22.11.17,the complainants wishes to withdraw &amp; thus are\r\nseeking refund of the amount paid by them along with interest &amp; Compensation</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>','<ol><li><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Relying upon the provision of section 18 RERA, directing the respondent to refund the principle amount i.e. Rs. 6001038.30 along with interest as&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">contemplated under rule 16 of The Punjab RERA Rules, 2017, as the complainants wishes to withdraw from the project, since the respondent was bound to deliver the possession of the built up villa by 25.05.2017. The respondent has indulged into unfair trade practices by not delivering the possession till date, not doing any development on the project and further it has stopped the development works on the project site and the respondent did not even send any reply to the letters sent by the complainants. The respondent have failed to intimate any reason for the delay in development. The complainants does not wish to remain in the project since there has been a huge delay on the part of the respondent.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">To direct the respondent to pay compensation to the tune of Rs. 500000 lacs <span style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.5in; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 250%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">for causing mental and physical harassment\r\nand agony to the complainants on account of delay in possession, for not doing any development on the project site, keeping the hard earned money of the complainants for so many years. The complainant has also availed the loan for paying the installments to the respondent.</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.5in; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 250%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -48px; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 46.6667px;\">To pay litigation expenses to the tune of Rs. 50000/-<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><u><o:p></o:p></u></span></span><br></span><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;\r\nmargin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:1.0in;mso-add-space:auto;text-align:justify;\r\ntext-indent:-.5in;line-height:250%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:250%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></p></span></li></ol>',17000222.00,6001038.30,'2017-05-25 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2015-10-07 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Unit No. 104, Type B-2, Built Up Villa','','',2,0,0,0,'rerafilingformm','2019-03-08 13:24:04.000','rerafilingformm','2019-03-08 13:24:04.000'),(360,1136,'1136',1141,'971b1ae7-f8bc-4323-80a7-088b81f8b7db','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','NAVDEEP SINGH ANAND','navee.anand@gmail.com',9814611997,0,0,'19-D, Raj Guru Nagar','LUDHIANA',28,366,'141002','1','253','Sector 4, Mansa Devi Complex',13,15,'134114','SANJEEV GUPTA','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9501142800,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-LDH45-PR0041','IREO WATERFRONT','M/S IREO WATERFRONT PVT LTD','Rera.Punjab@ireo.in',9810117993,0,'Sidhwan Canal Road opp Ferozepur Road','Village Dewatwal',28,366,'141002','1','Sidhwan Canal Road opp Ferozepur Road','Village Dewatwal',28,366,'141002','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: roboto, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">On 22.9.15,Complainants booked (brochure &amp;\r\napplication as C-1 &amp; C-2) a built-up villa,Type B2,Unit No 104,2844 sq ft\r\nof built area,to be constructed on 287.04 sq yd plot.Allotment letter was\r\nissued to them(C-3).Complainants opted for construction linked plan.Total sale\r\nconsideration including all charges &amp; taxes was fixed as Rs.17000222.Buyer\r\nagreement (C-4) was executed on 26.11.15.As per clause 11.3,respondent was\r\nbound to handover the possession within 18 months from the date of execution of\r\nagreement.Said period has already expired on 22.05.17.Respondent has only\r\ncompleted the plinth level.There is no default on the part of complainants in\r\nmaking the payments.The payments which were due on 28.9.15, 28.10.15 &amp;\r\n27.12.15 were paid by complainants on 22.9.15, 26/28.11.15, 18/25.5.16\r\nrespectively.There was no delay attributed to the complainants and thus, no\r\ndelayed interest was demanded from the complainants since they were not at\r\nfault.A communication in this regard is attached as C-5.Thereafter vide demand\r\nletter (C-5) dt 3.9.17,a sum of Rs. 1859828 was demanded, which was duly paid\r\non 30.10.17 &amp; 5.11.17,under protest,since there was dispute about charging\r\nof GST &amp; also vide letter dt 9.10.17 &amp; 30.10.17(C-5),it was duly\r\nconveyed to respondents but respondent did not reply satisfactorily vide letter\r\ndt 30.10.17(C-5).A sum of Rs. 6001038.30(receipts &amp; documents C-5 colly)has\r\nalready been paid by the complainants.The next installment was due on the\r\ncasting of GF roof slab which has not been done &amp; consequently there has\r\nbeen no demand raised by the respondent.Respondent has also stopped the\r\ndevelopment work at the site.A letter was also sent to respondent in this\r\nregard on 14.12.18 &amp;16.12.18(C-6) but no reply has been received.Since there\r\nhas been delay in construction &amp; the respondent was bound to deliver the\r\npossession by 22.11.17,the complainants wishes to withdraw &amp; thus are\r\nseeking refund of the amount paid by them along with interest &amp; Compensation</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>','<ol><li><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Relying upon the provision of section 18 RERA, directing the respondent to refund the principle amount i.e. Rs. 6001038.30 along with interest as&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">contemplated under rule 16 of The Punjab RERA Rules, 2017, as the complainants wishes to withdraw from the project, since the respondent was bound to deliver the possession of the built up villa by 25.05.2017. The respondent has indulged into unfair trade practices by not delivering the possession till date, not doing any development on the project and further it has stopped the development works on the project site and the respondent did not even send any reply to the letters sent by the complainants. The respondent have failed to intimate any reason for the delay in development. The complainants does not wish to remain in the project since there has been a huge delay on the part of the respondent.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">To direct the respondent to pay compensation to the tune of Rs. 500000 lacs <span style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.5in; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 250%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">f<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">or causing mental and physical harassment\r\nand agony to the complainants on account of delay in possession, for not doing any development on the project site, keeping the hard earned money of the complainants for so many years. The complainant has also availed the loan for paying the installments to the respondent.</span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.5in; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 250%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 14px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -48px; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 46.6667px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">To pay litigation expenses to the tune of Rs. 50000/-</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><u><o:p></o:p></u></span></span><br></span><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;\r\nmargin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:1.0in;mso-add-space:auto;text-align:justify;\r\ntext-indent:-.5in;line-height:250%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:250%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></p></span></li></ol>',17000222.00,6001038.30,'2017-05-25 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2015-10-07 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Unit No. 104, Type B-2, Built Up Villa','','',2,0,0,0,'rerafilingformm','2019-03-08 13:24:38.000','rerafilingformm','2019-03-08 13:24:38.000'),(361,1135,'1135',1420,'7befc797-fb73-47bf-b82f-055349e65c86','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2019-03-08 17:13:54.000',' Nishant Seth','kulwindersinghadvocate@gmail.com',9915772513,0,0,'Flat No. H1- 101, Maya Garden City','Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','1','Flat No. H1- 101, Maya Garden City','Zirakpur',28,507,'140603','kulwinder singh','ksvarun513@gmail.com',9915772513,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PR0192','Maya Garden City ','Barnala Builders & Property Consultant ','barnalabuilders@ymail.com',0,0,'M/s. Barnala Builders and Property Consultants, Maya Garden City, Zirakpur Ambala Highway','Zirakpur',28,507,'141603','1','M/s. Barnala Builders and Property Consultants, Maya Garden City, Zirakpur Ambala Highway','Zirakpur',28,507,'141603','1','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Garamond, serif; font-size: 13.5pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Garamond, serif; font-size: 13.5pt;\">1.\r\nThat the complainants booked a 5BHK flat for their residence with respondent in\r\nproject namely \"Maya Garden City\" on 28.06.2011 for the total\r\nconsideration of flat was 75,81,000 however complaints paid the total amount of\r\nRs. 79,22,900 /including service tax, maintenance and late payment charges. Flat\r\nwas to be delivered on or before 30.04.2014 to complainant but offer of\r\npossession was issued by respondent on 15.04.2016 by the 23 month delayed.</span><br></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in;mso-add-space:auto;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">2.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;  That\r\nas per agreement total area of flat was 2850 sq. ft however respondent\r\ndelivered the 2050. Sq. Ft but respondent have usurped a sum of Rs. 21,93,262/\r\ntowards the extra area of 797.55 sq. ft.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">.</span><span style=\"font-family: Garamond, serif; font-size: 13.5pt;\">3. That as per brochure and allurement by the\r\nrespondent are liable to provide already fitted amenities like geysers, spilt\r\nACs in all rooms, and Club housing facilities, anti skid tiles as per\r\nagreement, 5KVA power back up etc. but respondent failed to deliver such\r\nfacilities even no proper roads are available to approach to highway.</span><span style=\"font-family: Garamond, serif; font-size: 13.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">5.&nbsp; That the respondent have&nbsp;&nbsp; charged&nbsp;\r\nhefty amount&nbsp; from complainants on\r\nthe name of service tax but failed to deposit the same with concerned\r\ndepartment and failed to show the receipt even after several request of complainants.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">6. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; That it is further mentioned that material\r\nused by the respondent was very low quality dump reoccurred after repair. It is\r\nfurther mentioned that respondent have\r\nreceived amount of Rs. 61,194/ access but failed to returned even after\r\napproaching many &nbsp;times by the complainants.\r\n<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">7.\r\nThat the respondent failed to get completion certificate from competent\r\nauthority and delivered the possession to the complainant and respondent has mortgaged project\r\nland to the bank which is serious issue. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">8.\r\nThat the complainant approached several times and sent a legal notice dated\r\n29.05.2017 but all in vain.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">9.\r\nThat this case was filed before PLA but same was withdraw for want of\r\njurisdiction.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">a. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To pay 7,92,000/ as per valuation report to make the flat in\r\nthe position to promised by respondent.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">b&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To\r\npay the compensation of Rs. 5,00,000/ to the complainants for causing mental\r\nagony and harassment.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in\">c.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To refund the amount Rs. 21,93,262/&nbsp; for giving 797.55 sq. ft. less area than\r\nagreed&nbsp; i.e.&nbsp; 2850 sq. ft.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">d&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To\r\nremove all the encroachment made by the opposite parties for making parking etc\r\nand to put the same as per plan i.e greenery park.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">c.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To refund the amount received as service tax from the\r\ncomplainants along with interest @12% which was not deposited by respondent to\r\nconcerned department.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">d.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To pay interest @12% on the amount of Rs. 75,81,000/ from\r\nthe due date of possession i.e. 30.04.2014 till the sale deed/ issuance of\r\ncompletion certificate.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">e.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To provide club/swimming pool etc along with all facilities\r\nas per promise made in brochure.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">f. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To provide all facilities which are promised by not provided\r\nlike provision of DTH, broadband, Intercom Facilities, approach from Highway.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">g.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To pay an amount of Rs. 1,00,000/ as litigation expenses.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">Or any other order as the Hon\'ble\r\nadjudicating authority dim fit in the interest of justice.</p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>',7581000.00,7922900.00,'2014-04-30 00:00:00.000','2016-04-04 00:00:00.000','','1','','2011-07-28 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Flat No. H1- 101, Maya Garden City, Zirakpur, District- S.A.S Nagar, Mohali, Punjab -140603 ','','',1,1,0,0,'advkulwindersingh','2019-03-08 14:43:23.000','advkulwindersingh','2019-03-08 14:43:23.000'),(362,1136,'1136',1141,'971b1ae7-f8bc-4323-80a7-088b81f8b7db','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2019-03-08 20:36:20.000','NAVDEEP SINGH ANAND','navee.anand@gmail.com',981