 reasons known to the respondent. \r\n</p><p>The applicant(s)\' money is being withheld by the respondent and used without any interest. That \r\n</p><p>keeping the track record of the respondent in view, the applicant seeks to withdraw from this project \r\n</p><p>in consonance with the Section 18 (1)(a) of RERA and the appeal number 53 of 2018 (along with other \r\n</p><p>appeals) decided by the Hon\'ble RERA Appellate Authority, Punjab on 27-Feb-2019 regarding the \r\n</p><p>jurisdiction and powers of Adjudicating Officer of RERA Punjab, The earlier application under form \'N\'\r\n</p><p>&nbsp;could not be decided as the appeals were pending before the Hon\'ble RERA Appellate Authority, Punjab. Now applicant(s) has refiled the present complaint seeking refund, compensation and interest on the money withheld by the respondent till realization as the developer has not been able to fulfil its part of promise as agreed in the agreement as well as any other relief that this forum deems</p>','<p>That the applicant seeks the compensation of of Rs. 500000/- (Rs. Five Lakh only) for monetary losses</p><p>apart from interest on the money withheld by the respondent without any sufficient reasons and justified</p><p>explanation. The applicant further prays for Rs. 50000/- (Rs. Fifty Thousand only) as litigation costs. that</p><p>the compensation as paid apart from interest is necessary to be imposed upon the respondent, as the</p><p>respondent has played a fraud upon the applicant by extracting money and use the same without</p><p>delivering the unit well in time as per the agreement.</p>',5118516.00,4840807.00,'2011-01-30 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2008-01-31 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','H1-F09-903, Tower H, The Veiws, Mohali Hills, Sec-105, SAS Nagar Mohali. 140306\r\n','','',2,0,0,0,'GILL.Harpreet2809','2019-03-21 21:01:15.000','GILL.Harpreet2809','2019-03-21 21:01:15.000'),(396,1145,'1145',1128,'a4ac97e3-07e5-4f6d-b74a-357542a284dd','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2019-03-22 19:19:11.000','Through Dalbir Singh Gill For Late Sh. S.S.Gill & Dalbir Singh Gill','gill.harpreet2809@gmail.com',9815998858,0,0,'H.No. 65','Sector - 05, Chandigarh.',6,128,'160015','1','F-1403, 14th Flr., Tower \"F\", Sushma Chandigarh Grande','Sector 15 C,',6,128,'160015','Advocate Varun Luthra','advocate_varunl@hotmail.com',9815998858,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0119','The Views, Mohali Hills','Through Rajesh Gupta, EMAAR MGF LAND LTD.','mohalihills@emaarmgf.com',0,1724688888,'SCO 120-122, 1st Floor','Sector 17C, ',6,128,'160017','1','SCO 120-122, 1st Floor','Sector 17C, ',6,128,'160017','1','<p>Respectfully showeth, That the present complaint is being filed by NRI allottee as co-applicant as the father of the co-applicant has expired.That the applicant (s) had applied for the allotment of a unit/apartment No.H1-F09-903,&nbsp; in the year 2008, in \'The Veiws\' in \"Mohali Hills, Sec-105, SAS Nagar Mohali. The applicant(s) were subsequently issued an allotment on 31-01-2008 of a residential&nbsp; unit measuring 1750 Sq. Ft. of Super Area. The total consideration amount of the unit was Rs.5118516/-(Rs. Fifty One Lakhh Eighteen Thousand Five Hundred and Sixteen only).  That the applicant had opted to pay 95% of the amount mentioned above and paid Rs.4840807/- (Rs. Forty Eight Lakh Forty Thousand Eight Hundred and Seven only) on 04-01-2008. That as per  clause 21.1 of agreement, the applicant(s) were to get the possession of the said unit within the maximum period of 39 months&nbsp; (inclusive of grace period) from date of agreement. The applicant(s) were to get the possession by 27-May-2011, but have not got the possession of the unit for the reasons known to the respondent. The applicant(s)\' money is being withheld by the respondent and used without any interest. That keeping the track record of the respondent in view, the applicant seeks to withdraw from this project in consonance with the Section 18 (1)(a) of RERA and the appeal number 53 of 2018 (along with other appeals) decided by the Hon\'ble RERA Appellate Authority, Punjab on 27-Feb-2019 regarding the jurisdiction and powers of Adjudicating Officer of RERA Punjab, The earlier application under form \'N\'&nbsp; could not be decided as the appeals were pending before the Hon\'ble RERA Appellate Authority, Punjab. Now applicant(s) has refiled the present complaint seeking refund, compensation and interest on the money withheld by the respondent till realization as the developer has not been able to fulfil its part of promise as agreed in the agreement as well as any other relief that this forum deems fit in the interest of justice.</p>','<p>That the applicant seeks the compensation of of Rs. 500000/- (Rs. Five Lakh only) for monetary losses</p><p>apart from interest on the money withheld by the respondent without any sufficient reasons and justified</p><p>explanation. The applicant further prays for Rs. 50000/- (Rs. Fifty Thousand only) as litigation costs. that</p><p>the compensation as paid apart from interest is necessary to be imposed upon the respondent, as the</p><p>respondent has played a fraud upon the applicant by extracting money and use the same without</p><p>delivering the unit well in time as per the agreement.</p>',5118516.00,4840807.00,'2011-01-30 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2008-01-31 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','H1-F09-903, Tower H, The Veiws, Mohali Hills, Sec-105, SAS Nagar Mohali. 140306\r\n','','',1,1,0,0,'GILL.Harpreet2809','2019-03-22 18:58:08.000','GILL.Harpreet2809','2019-03-22 18:58:08.000'),(397,1146,'1146',1453,'689d79ec-0187-4d4b-baf6-5ec5ac22de6f','FormTypeN',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','KRISHAN  KUMAR','skpatiala@gmail.com',9041500006,0,0,'HOUSE NO 125','BANK COLONY',28,454,'147001','1','HOUSE NO 125','BANK COLONY',28,454,'147001','J.P. SINGLA','jpsingladdld@gmail.com',9815482235,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0153','WAVE FLOORS-99\r\nWAVE ESTATE MOHALI','COUNTRY COLONISERS PVT. LTD.','rera@waveestate.in',7290015346,0,'COUNTRY COLONISERS PVT. LTD.','SECTOR 85',28,507,'160062','1','COUNTRY COLONISERS PVT. LTD.','SECTOR 85',28,507,'160062','1','<p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nCalibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">The\r\ncomplainant has booked a flat no WF/G/52 First Floor in project Wave Estate\r\nSector 99, Mohali and paid an amount of Rs.618540.00 (Rupee Six Lakh Eighteen\r\nThousand Five Hundred and Forty Only) by the way of Bank transfer to the\r\nrespondent developer. In lieu of the paid amount an provisional allotment\r\nletter was issued to the complainant on 05/02/2013. At the time of booking it\r\nwas said that the booking of the flat is under subvention scheme and the\r\ndeveloper himself will arrange for the loan for the complainant but later on\r\nthe bank denied the loan to the complainant by giving the plea of his old age\r\nas well as the meagre pension of the complainant. The complainant has brought\r\nthis matter into the notice of the developer and requested the respondent to\r\nrefund his booking amount but the developer has not refunded his money paid to\r\nhim as booking amount. The developer made the excuses every time for the\r\nrefund. In the mean time the wife of the complainant got serious heart problem\r\nand got bed ridden. The complainant being an senior citizen and because of the\r\nailment of his wife could not follow the developer for the refund of his booking\r\namount. In the mean time the developer smartly cancelled the booking without\r\nrefunding the money deposited by the complainant thus forcing the complainant\r\nto follow the legal procedure by way of sending a legal notice for the refund\r\nof his money through his advocate Sh. J.P. Singla on dated 15-06-2018 the copy\r\nof which is annexed as annexure P-1. The respondent developer has neither\r\nbothered to reply the same nor the booking amount has been refunded.&nbsp;</span><br></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">The complainant seek the refund\r\nof his booking amount along with the interest @18% per annum for not refunding\r\nhis booking amount along with Rs. One lakh as compensation for mental\r\nharassment and Rs.55000.00 as legal cost paid by him to his advocate.</p>',4000000.00,618540.00,'2015-02-05 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2013-02-05 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','WF/G/52 FIRST FLOOR\r\nWAVE FLOOR - 99\r\nWAVE ESTATE \r\nSECTOR 99\r\nMOHALI\r\n','','',2,0,0,0,'bgoel','2019-03-24 18:25:37.000','bgoel','2019-03-24 18:25:37.000'),(398,1146,'1146',1453,'689d79ec-0187-4d4b-baf6-5ec5ac22de6f','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2019-03-25 19:40:15.000','KRISHAN  KUMAR','skpatiala@gmail.com',9041500006,0,0,'HOUSE NO 125','BANK COLONY',28,454,'147001','1','HOUSE NO 125','BANK COLONY',28,454,'147001','J.P. SINGLA','jpsingladdld@gmail.com',9815482235,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0153','WAVE FLOORS-99\r\nWAVE ESTATE MOHALI','COUNTRY COLONISERS PVT. LTD.','rera@waveestate.in',7290015346,0,'COUNTRY COLONISERS PVT. LTD.','SECTOR 85',28,507,'160062','1','COUNTRY COLONISERS PVT. LTD.','SECTOR 85',28,507,'160062','1','<p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nCalibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">The\r\ncomplainant has booked a flat no WF/G/52 First Floor in project Wave Estate\r\nSector 99, Mohali and paid an amount of Rs.618540.00 (Rupee Six Lakh Eighteen\r\nThousand Five Hundred and Forty Only) by the way of Bank transfer to the\r\nrespondent developer. In lieu of the paid amount an provisional allotment\r\nletter was issued to the complainant on 05/02/2013. At the time of booking it\r\nwas said that the booking of the flat is under subvention scheme and the\r\ndeveloper himself will arrange for the loan for the complainant but later on\r\nthe bank denied the loan to the complainant by giving the plea of his old age\r\nas well as the meagre pension of the complainant. The complainant has brought\r\nthis matter into the notice of the developer and requested the respondent to\r\nrefund his booking amount but the developer has not refunded his money paid to\r\nhim as booking amount. The developer made the excuses every time for the\r\nrefund. In the mean time the wife of the complainant got serious heart problem\r\nand got bed ridden. The complainant being an senior citizen and because of the\r\nailment of his wife could not follow the developer for the refund of his booking\r\namount. In the mean time the developer smartly cancelled the booking without\r\nrefunding the money deposited by the complainant thus forcing the complainant\r\nto follow the legal procedure by way of sending a legal notice for the refund\r\nof his money through his advocate Sh. J.P. Singla on dated 15-06-2018 the copy\r\nof which is annexed as annexure P-1. The respondent developer has neither\r\nbothered to reply the same nor the booking amount has been refunded.&nbsp;</span><br></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">The complainant seek the refund\r\nof his booking amount along with the interest @18% per annum for not refunding\r\nhis booking amount along with Rs. One lakh as compensation for mental\r\nharassment and Rs.55000.00 as legal cost paid by him to his advocate.</p>',4000000.00,618540.00,'2015-02-05 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2013-02-05 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','WF/G/52 FIRST FLOOR\r\nWAVE FLOOR - 99\r\nWAVE ESTATE \r\nSECTOR 99\r\nMOHALI\r\n','','',2,0,0,0,'bgoel','2019-03-24 18:43:55.000','bgoel','2019-03-24 18:43:55.000'),(399,1147,'1147',1446,'9cd007eb-499d-49cd-ad24-954c4ee507d5','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2019-03-25 15:21:24.000','Ms Surinder  Chopra','choprasurinder39@yahoo.com',9988370789,1722582510,0,'510 sector 16 Panchkula','same',13,15,'134109','1','510 sector 16 Panchkula','same',13,15,'134109','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PC0010','CHANDIGARH CITI CENTER','Mr Pankaj Gupta,Managing Director CITI CENTRE DEVELOPRES','ccc.ritesh@gmail.com',0,0,'VIP ROAD ZIRAKPUR','SAME',28,507,'140603','1','VIP ROAD ZIRAKPUR','SAME',28,507,'140603','1','<p>&nbsp;That Mr. Rajeev Bhatt, Property Dealer of Vertical Heights Realtors approached me in the month of October 2018 with a Assured Lease Guarantee (For 9 years)Scheme.The place offered to me was Fully Furnished Office Suites (Block D &amp; E) (All A Block Facing Unit) at 11th Floor (Hereinafter referred as “Office Space”). Then I was thereafter taken to visit the property on 27.10.2018.Mr. Sachin Verma who is the General Manager met&nbsp; and offered Office Space No. 1108 at 11th Floor with Carpet area of 525 sq ft at the price of Rs. 7350 per sq. ft.The possession as promised by them was to be given on or before 31/12/2018 if the entire payment is made up front. Considering that I was making Full Payment of the above said Office Space, after much negotiations, agreed and finalized the final price for the carpet area of 525 sq.ft to be Rs. 5665.76 per sq. ft. Hence forth after making the calculations I was informed that the final amount which needs to be paid is Rs. 31,53,000/- inclusive of GST.On believing their representations as regards completion certificate and getting possession of the Office Space by 31/12/2018, I depoisted the amount of Rs. 31,53,000/- via RTGS from my PNB Account with UTR PUNBR52018102914135067 to the account of CITI CENTRE DEVELOPERS on dated 29.10.2018. That they have prepared the Allotment Letter and on being shown the said Allotment Letter which was dated 05.12.2018, I was perplexed to see that the full and final amount paid by me was mentioned as “earnest money” and that the carpet area was also reduced to 373.50 sq ft.I also learnt of the fraud being committed against me as there were no Office Spaces approved for 11th Floor but only SOHO suites.That I has been approaching them for refund of my entire amount being paid by me time and again since February 2019, they neither completed the formalities nor have refunded the amount in total to me.That till dae they have not given me the claimed amount even when I approached them time and again&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br></p>','<p>&nbsp;Inspite of giving false assurances that the amount will be repaid to me within a few days’ time, there is no refund which has been affected till date. This is humble request to the Regulatory authority to action on the above mentioned notices for to refund the entire money i.e. 31,53,000/-&nbsp; received by you along with up to date interest of 2.5% per month and Rs. 10,000,00/- towards mental harassment and torture.</p><div><br></div>',3153000.00,3153000.00,'2018-12-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2018-10-29 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','1108 ','','',2,0,0,0,'SURINDERCHOPRA','2019-03-25 15:08:48.000','SURINDERCHOPRA','2019-03-25 15:08:48.000'),(400,1148,'1148',1139,'a2526d36-a2b2-49be-8bb6-f70a1dcdfb83','FormTypeN',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Harpreet Singh Gill','gill.harpreet2809@gmail.com',9815998858,0,0,'H.No. 65','Sector 05, Chandigarh',6,128,'160015','1','F-1403, 14th Flr., Tower \"F\", Sushma Chandigarh Grande','Sector 05, Chandigarh',6,128,'160015','Advocate Varun Luthra','advocate_varunl@hotmail.com',9815998858,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0119','The Views at Mohali Hills, SAS Nagar Mohali.','Through Rajesh Gupta Emaar MGF Land Ltd.','mohalihills@emaarmgf.com',0,1724688888,'SCO 120-122, 