s agreed in the agreement as well as any other relief that this forum deems fit in the interest of justice.</p><div><br></div>','<p>That the applicant seeks the compensation of of Rs. 500000/- (Rs. Five Lakh only) for monetary losses apart from interest on the money withheld by the respondent without any sufficient reasons and justified explanation. The applicant further prays for Rs. 50000/- (Rs. Fifty Thousand only) as litigation costs. that the compensation as paid apart from interest is necessary to be imposed upon the respondent, as the respondent has played a fraud upon the applicant by extracting money and use the same without delivering the unit well in time as per the agreement.</p><div><br></div>',5118516.00,4840807.00,'2011-01-30 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2008-01-31 00:00:00','2008-01-31 00:00:00','K3,-F07-701, The Views at Mohali Hills, Sector 105, SAS Nagar Mohali\r\n','','',2,0,0,0,'harpreetvarun.gill','2019-03-25 20:00:17.000','harpreetvarun.gill','2019-03-25 20:00:17.000'),(401,1146,'1146',1453,'689d79ec-0187-4d4b-baf6-5ec5ac22de6f','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2019-03-26 14:25:50.000','KRISHAN  KUMAR','skpatiala@gmail.com',9041500006,0,0,'HOUSE NO 125','BANK COLONY',28,454,'147001','1','HOUSE NO 125','BANK COLONY',28,454,'147001','J.P. SINGLA','jpsingladdld@gmail.com',9815482240,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0153','WAVE FLOORS-99\r\nWAVE ESTATE MOHALI','COUNTRY COLONISERS PVT. LTD.','rera@waveestate.in',7290015346,0,'COUNTRY COLONISERS PVT. LTD.','SECTOR 85',28,507,'160062','1','COUNTRY COLONISERS PVT. LTD.','SECTOR 85',28,507,'160062','1','<p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nCalibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-IN;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">The\r\ncomplainant has booked a flat no WF/G/52 First Floor in project Wave Estate\r\nSector 99, Mohali and paid an amount of Rs.618540.00 (Rupee Six Lakh Eighteen\r\nThousand Five Hundred and Forty Only) by the way of Bank transfer to the\r\nrespondent developer. In lieu of the paid amount an provisional allotment\r\nletter was issued to the complainant on 05/02/2013. At the time of booking it\r\nwas said that the booking of the flat is under subvention scheme and the\r\ndeveloper himself will arrange for the loan for the complainant but later on\r\nthe bank denied the loan to the complainant by giving the plea of his old age\r\nas well as the meagre pension of the complainant. The complainant has brought\r\nthis matter into the notice of the developer and requested the respondent to\r\nrefund his booking amount but the developer has not refunded his money paid to\r\nhim as booking amount. The developer made the excuses every time for the\r\nrefund. In the mean time the wife of the complainant got serious heart problem\r\nand got bed ridden. The complainant being an senior citizen and because of the\r\nailment of his wife could not follow the developer for the refund of his booking\r\namount. In the mean time the developer smartly cancelled the booking without\r\nrefunding the money deposited by the complainant thus forcing the complainant\r\nto follow the legal procedure by way of sending a legal notice for the refund\r\nof his money through his advocate Sh. J.P. Singla on dated 15-06-2018 the copy\r\nof which is annexed as annexure P-1. The respondent developer has neither\r\nbothered to reply the same nor the booking amount has been refunded.&nbsp;</span><br></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">The complainant seek the refund\r\nof his booking amount along with the interest @18% per annum for not refunding\r\nhis booking amount along with Rs. One lakh as compensation for mental\r\nharassment and Rs.55000.00 as legal cost paid by him to his advocate.</p>',4000000.00,618540.00,'2015-02-05 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2013-02-05 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','WF/G/52 FIRST FLOOR\r\nWAVE FLOOR - 99\r\nWAVE ESTATE \r\nSECTOR 99\r\nMOHALI\r\n','','',1,1,0,0,'bgoel','2019-03-26 14:25:45.000','bgoel','2019-03-26 14:25:45.000'),(402,1149,'1149',1447,'2575c5ff-b349-4eb9-9d11-d1069a0d780b','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Jaswinder  Kaur','jagtardhaliwal13477@gmail.com',8360380893,0,0,'#644 Ward No 6 Raman Cinema Road Mansa','Tehsil Mansa',28,386,'151505','1','Jagtar Singh Advocate Chamber No.41 District Courts  Complex  Mansa','',28,386,'151505','Jagtar Singh','jagtardhaliwal13477@gmail.com',9815092193,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-MNS50-PM0031','PUDA ENCLAVE MANSA','ESTATE OFFICER PUDA','cabdabti@gmail.com',0,0,'ESTATE OFFICER PUDA ','PUDA COMPLEX BHAGU ROAD BATHINDA',28,84,'151001','1','ESTATE OFFICER PUDA ','PUDA COMPLEX BHAGU ROAD BATHINDA',28,84,'151001','1','Abc','<p>Abc</p>',3675000.00,3417750.00,'2018-11-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2016-11-07 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','309','','',1,0,0,0,'punjab','2019-03-26 19:39:39.000','punjab','2019-03-26 19:39:39.000'),(403,1150,'1150',1447,'2575c5ff-b349-4eb9-9d11-d1069a0d780b','FormTypeN',1,0,0,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Jaswinder  Kaur','jagtardhaliwal13477@gmail.com',8360380893,0,0,'#644 Ward No 6 Raman Cinema Road Mansa','Tehsil Mansa',28,386,'151505','1','Jagtar Singh Advocate Chamber No.41 District Courts  Complex  Mansa','',28,386,'151505','Jagtar Singh','jagtardhaliwal13477@gmail.com',9815092193,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-MNS50-PM0031','PUDA ENCLAVE MANSA','ESTATE OFFICER PUDA','cabdabti@gmail.com',0,0,'ESTATE OFFICER PUDA ','PUDA COMPLEX BHAGU ROAD BATHINDA',28,84,'151001','1','ESTATE OFFICER PUDA ','PUDA COMPLEX BHAGU ROAD BATHINDA',28,84,'151001','1','<p>Abc</p>','<p>Abc</p>',3675000.00,3417750.00,'2018-11-01 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2016-11-07 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','309','','',1,0,0,0,'punjab','2019-03-26 20:16:30.000','punjab','2019-03-26 20:16:30.000'),(404,1148,'1148',1139,'a2526d36-a2b2-49be-8bb6-f70a1dcdfb83','FormTypeN',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Barjinder Paul Singh Gill','advocate_varunl@hotmail.com',9815998858,0,0,'H. No. 65','Sector 05, Chandigarh',6,128,'160015','1','H.No 65','Sector 05, Chandigarh',6,128,'160015','Advocate Varun Luthra','advocate_varunl@hotmail.com',9815998858,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0119','The Views at Mohali Hills, SAS Nagar Mohali.','Through Rajesh Gupta Emaar MGF Land Ltd.','mohalihills@emaarmgf.com',0,1724688888,'SCO 120-122, First Floor,','17C',6,128,'160017','1','SCO 120-122, First Floor,','17C',6,128,'160017','1','<p>Respectfully showeth, That the present complaint is being filed by NRI allotee as co-applicant, as the father of the co-applicant has expired.That the applicant (s) had applied for the allotment of a unit/apartment No.K3-F07-701,in the year 2008, in \'The Veiws\' in \"Mohali Hills,Sec-105,SAS Nagar Mohali. The applicant(s) were subsequently issued an allotment on 31-01-2008 of a residential unit measuring 1750 Sq. Ft. of Super Area.The total consideration amount of the unit was Rs.5118516/-(Rs. Fifty One Lakhh Eeighteen Thousand Five Hundred Sixteen only).&nbsp; That the applicant had opted pay 95% of the amount mentioned above and paid Rs.4840807/- (Rs.Forty Eight Lakh Forty Thousand Eight Hundred and Seven only) on 04-01-2008. That as per&nbsp; clause 21.1 of agreement, the applicant(s) were to get the possession of the said unit within the maximum period of 39 months (inclusive of grace period) from date of agreement. The applicant(s) were to get the possession by 30-Apr-2011, but have not got the possession of the unit for the reasons known to the respondent. The applicant(s)\' money is being withheld by the respondent and used without any interest. That keeping the track record of the respondent in view, the applicant seeks to withdraw from this project in consonance with the Section 18 (1)(a) of RERA and the appeal number 53 of 2018 (along with other appeals) decided by the Hon\'ble RERA Appellate Authority, Punjab on 27-Feb-2019 regarding the jurisdiction and powers of Adjudicating Officer of RERA Punjab, The earlier application under form \'N\'&nbsp; could not be decided as the appeals were pending before the Hon\'ble RERA Appellate Authority, Punjab. Now applicant(s) has refiled the present complaint seeking refund, compensation and interest on the money withheld by the respondent till realization as the developer has not been able to fulfil its part of promise as agreed in the agreement as well as any other relief that this forum deems fit in the interest of justice.</p><div><br></div>','<p>That the applicant seeks the compensation of of Rs. 500000/- (Rs. Five Lakh only) for monetary losses apart from interest on the money withheld by the respondent without any sufficient reasons and justified explanation. The applicant further prays for Rs. 50000/- (Rs. Fifty Thousand only) as litigation costs. that the compensation as paid apart from interest is necessary to be imposed upon the respondent, as the respondent has played a fraud upon the applicant by extracting money and use the same without delivering the unit well in time as per the agreement.</p><div><br></div>',5118516.00,4840807.00,'2011-04-30 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2008-01-31 00:00:00','2008-01-31 00:00:00','K3-F07-701, The Views at Mohali Hills, Sector 105, SAS Nagar Mohali\r\n','','',2,0,0,0,'harpreetvarun.gill','2019-03-26 20:32:26.000','harpreetvarun.gill','2019-03-26 20:32:26.000'),(405,1148,'1148',1139,'a2526d36-a2b2-49be-8bb6-f70a1dcdfb83','FormTypeN',1,0,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Barjinder Paul Singh Gill','advocate_varunl@hotmail.com',9815998858,0,0,'H. No. 65','Sector 05, Chandigarh',6,128,'160015','1','H.No 65','Sector 05, Chandigarh',6,128,'160015','Advocate Varun Luthra','advocate_varunl@hotmail.com