Refund of Rs. 25,000 towards legal expenses.</p><p>iv. Instructions to the OPS be directed keeping in mind the</p><p>safety of the complainant in the interest of justice.</p><p>v. Any other order or relief as this authority may feel</p><p>appropriate in the interest of justice.</p>',1696000.00,700000.00,'2016-09-07 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2017-12-27 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','plot no 53, sector 111 , mohali','','',2,0,0,0,'AdvSaksham','2019-04-02 15:23:21.000','AdvSaksham','2019-04-02 15:23:21.000'),(456,1153,'1153',1368,'06cc119c-147e-47df-9860-9a89e157b105','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2019-04-02 15:24:23.000','Suresh Kumar Rawal','jeetendracapricon@gmail.com',9814482802,0,0,'H.No.412,first floor, Phase 2','',28,507,'160055','1','726 sector 10','',13,15,'134113','Saksham Arora','advocatesaksham@gmail.com',9872628189,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS81-PR0125','RKM CITY','Kawaljit Singh Ahluwalia','rkmhousing@gmail.com',9876240145,0,'H. No. 1568 , Sector-34 D  Chandigarh , Chandigarh ','',6,128,'160012','1','H. No. 1568 , Sector-34 D  Chandigarh , Chandigarh ','',6,128,'160012','1','<p>The Owner of the land in dispute which measures 106 sq. yards had got the</p><p>Memorandum of understanding for their land on 7-oct-2016, stating the</p><p>various terms and conditions for the land. The complainant had purchased</p><p>this land through an Agent named Tapan Deewan. At the time of presentation</p><p>the ops had shown a different piece of land but at the time of Allotment</p><p>another location was allocated with no mark or number for identification. At</p><p>the time of purchasing the OP 1 and 2 made several promises but nothing</p><p>ever came into effect. The CEO Mr. Kanwal Ahluwalia met the complainant</p><p>during the time of payment and assured a safe investment. The complainant</p><p>did several correspondences, even in person but nothing concrete was ever</p><p>achieved. The OP’s barely replied and in which they gave some assurances in</p><p>regards to the refund but again nothing only disappointment was received. A</p><p>mail Dated 31.05.2018 also consists of the surrender letter given on the</p><p>advice of the CEO with an assurance of Refund. Like any other time this also</p><p>proved to be just another faulty claim. This inhuman treatment of the OP’S</p><p>has affected the family’s health both physically and mentally. This project</p><p>involves Manohar Group vide item 486 of RERA list.</p>','<p>i. Refund of Rs. 7,00,000 so paid with an interest of 18% of the cost</p><p>of plot per annum from the date of Memorandum of</p><p>Understanding till the date of pronouncing of final judgment.</p><p>ii. Compensation of Rs. 2,00,000 towards mental agony,</p><p>harassment, inconvenience and medical bills in the interest of</p><p>justice.</p><p>iii. Refund of Rs. 25,000 towards legal expenses.</p><p>iv. Instructions to the OPS be directed keeping in mind the</p><p>safety of the complainant in the interest of justice.</p><p>v. Any other order or relief as this authority may feel</p><p>appropriate in the interest of justice.</p>',1696000.00,700000.00,'2016-09-07 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2017-12-27 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','plot no 53, sector 111 , mohali','','',1,1,0,0,'AdvSaksham','2019-04-02 15:24:20.000','AdvSaksham','2019-04-02 15:24:20.000'),(457,1147,'1147',1446,'9cd007eb-499d-49cd-ad24-954c4ee507d5','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2019-03-25 15:21:24.000','Ms Surinder  Chopra','choprasurinder39@yahoo.com',9988370789,1722582510,0,'510 sector 16 Panchkula','same',13,15,'134109','1','510 sector 16 Panchkula','same',13,15,'134109','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PC0010','CHANDIGARH CITI CENTER','M/s Citi Center Developers VIP Road Zirakpur, Mr Pankaj Gupta,MD,Sachin Verma GM','ccc.ritesh@gmail.com',8288022203,0,'VIP ROAD ZIRAKPUR','SAME',28,507,'140603','1','VIP ROAD ZIRAKPUR','SAME',28,507,'140603','1','<p>&nbsp;That Mr. Rajeev Bhatt, Property Dealer of Vertical Heights Realtors approached me in the month of October 2018 with a Assured Lease Guarantee (For 9 years)Scheme.The place offered to me was Fully Furnished Office Suites (Block D &amp; E) (All A Block Facing Unit) at 11th Floor (Hereinafter referred as “Office Space”). Then I was thereafter taken to visit the property on 27.10.2018.Mr. Sachin Verma who is the General Manager met&nbsp; and offered Office Space No. 1108 at 11th Floor with Carpet area of 525 sq ft at the price of Rs. 7350 per sq. ft.The possession as promised by them was to be given on or before 31/12/2018 if the entire payment is made up front. Considering that I was making Full Payment of the above said Office Space, after much negotiations, agreed and finalized the final price for the carpet area of 525 sq.ft to be Rs. 5665.76 per sq. ft. Hence forth after making the calculations I was informed that the final amount which needs to be paid is Rs. 31,53,000/- inclusive of GST.On believing their representations as regards completion certificate and getting possession of the Office Space by 31/12/2018, I depoisted the amount of Rs. 31,53,000/- via RTGS from my PNB Account with UTR PUNBR52018102914135067 to the account of CITI CENTRE DEVELOPERS on dated 29.10.2018. That they have prepared the Allotment Letter and on being shown the said Allotment Letter which was dated 05.12.2018, I was perplexed to see that the full and final amount paid by me was mentioned as “earnest money” and that the carpet area was also reduced to 373.50 sq ft.I also learnt of the fraud being committed against me as there were no Office Spaces approved for 11th Floor but only SOHO suites.That I has been approaching them for refund of my entire amount being paid by me time and again since February 2019, they neither completed the formalities nor have refunded the amount in total to me.That till dae they have not given me the claimed amount even when I approached them time and again&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br></p>','<p>&nbsp;Inspite of giving false assurances that the amount will be repaid to me within a few days’ time, there is no refund which has been affected till date. This is humble request to the Regulatory authority to takeaction on the above mentioned notices for to refund the entire money i.e. 31,53,000/-&nbsp; received by them along with up to date interest of 2.5% per month and Rs. 10,000,00/- towards mental harassment and torture as compensation.</p><div><br></div>',3153000.00,3153000.00,'2018-12-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2018-10-29 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','1108 ','','',2,0,0,0,'SURINDERCHOPRA','2019-04-03 18:37:14.000','SURINDERCHOPRA','2019-04-03 18:37:14.000'),(458,1147,'1147',1446,'9cd007eb-499d-49cd-ad24-954c4ee507d5','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2019-04-03 18:55:54.000','Ms Surinder  Chopra','choprasurinder39@yahoo.com',9988370789,1722582510,0,'510 sector 16 Panchkula','same',13,15,'134109','1','510 sector 16 Panchkula','same',13,15,'134109','','',0,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS79-PC0010','CHANDIGARH CITI CENTER','M/s Citi Center Developers VIP Road Zirakpur, Mr Pankaj Gupta MD,Sachin Verma GM','ccc.ritesh@gmail.com',8288022203,0,'VIP ROAD ZIRAKPUR','SAME',28,507,'140603','1','VIP ROAD ZIRAKPUR','SAME',28,507,'140603','1','<p>&nbsp;That Mr. Rajeev Bhatt, Property Dealer of Vertical Heights Realtors approached me in the month of October 2018 with a Assured Lease Guarantee (For 9 years)Scheme.The place offered to me was Fully Furnished Office Suites (Block D &amp; E) (All A Block Facing Unit) at 11th Floor (Hereinafter referred as “Office Space”). Then I was thereafter taken to visit the property on 27.10.2018.Mr. Sachin Verma who is the General Manager met&nbsp; and offered Office Space No. 1108 at 11th Floor with Carpet area of 525 sq ft at the price of Rs. 7350 per sq. ft.The possession as promised by them was to be given on or before 31/12/2018 if the entire payment is made up front. Considering that I was making Full Payment of the above said Office Space, after much negotiations, agreed and finalized the final price for the carpet area of 525 sq.ft to be Rs. 5665.76 per sq. ft. Hence forth after making the calculations I was informed that the final amount which needs to be paid is Rs. 31,53,000/- inclusive of GST.On believing their representations as regards completion certificate and getting possession of the Office Space by 31/12/2018, I depoisted the amount of Rs. 31,53,000/- via RTGS from my PNB Account with UTR PUNBR52018102914135067 to the account of CITI CENTRE DEVELOPERS on dated 29.10.2018. That they have prepared the Allotment Letter and on being shown the said Allotment Letter which was dated 05.12.2018, I was perplexed to see that the full and final amount paid by me was mentioned as “earnest money” and that the carpet area was also reduced to 373.50 sq ft.I also learnt of the fraud being committed against me as there were no Office Spaces approved for 11th Floor but only SOHO suites.That I has been approaching them for refund of my entire amount being paid by me time and again since February 2019, they neither completed the formalities nor have refunded the amount in total to me.That till dae they have not given me the claimed amount even when I approached them time and again&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br></p>','<p>&nbsp;Inspite of giving false assurances that the amount will be repaid to me within a few days’ time, there is no refund which has been affected till date. This is humble request to the Regulatory authority to takeaction on the above mentioned notices for to refund the entire money i.e. 31,53,000/-&nbsp; received by them along with up to date interest of 2.5% per month and Rs. 10,000,00/- towards mental harassment and torture as compensation.</p><div><br></div>',3153000.00,3153000.00,'2018-12-31 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2018-10-29 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','1108 ','','',1,1,0,0,'SURINDERCHOPRA','2019-04-03 18:52:59.000','SURINDERCHOPRA','2019-04-03 18:52:59.000'),(459,1157,'1157',1462,'0b57ec60-3b91-4d1a-b21c-09b93c962eae','FormTypeN',1,1,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Anil  Kumar','csvedparkash@gmail.com',8989898989,0,0,'#2047, Sector-71, SAS Nagar, ','',28,507,'166071','1','#2047, Sector-71, SAS Nagar, ','',28,507,'166071','Ved Parkash','csvedparkash@gmail.com',7837223098,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS82-PR0022','Gateway City PUDA SAS Nagar','Estate Officer PUDA SAS Nagar','se@puda.gov.in',0,0,'PUDA Bhawan, Sector-62, SAS Nagar','',28,507,'160062','1','PUDA Bhawan, Sector-62, SAS Nagar','',28,507,'160062','1','<p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 137.4px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">1.<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'>That\r\nthe present complaint is against Project namely gateway city SAS Nagar Mohali\r\nwhich is registered with the present authority with registration number PBRERA-SAS81-PR0022\r\nand is an ongoing project. Therefore, the complainant has cause of action to\r\nfile this complaint before this Hon’ble Authority.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 137.4px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">2.<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'>That\r\nthe complainant applied for a residential plot of 150 Sq. Yard<span style=\"margin: 0px;\">&nbsp; </span>vide application No. 5909 and was successful\r\nin the draw of lots held on 19.03.2015 vide S.L No. 405 w.r.t. allotment of\r\nplots in the scheme known as gateway city, SAS Nagar, PUDA. The complainant was\r\ngiven letter of intent dated 27.05.2015 which is annexed herewith as annexure\r\nC/1. </span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 48px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'>&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 137.4px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">3.<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'>That\r\nas per the conditions of the letter of intent dated 27.05.2015, the complainant\r\nmade two payments of Rupees 10,71,000/- vide DD No. 60778 and 60779 of Rs.\r\n5,35,500/- each dated 22.06.2015 on account of instalment for allotment of plot\r\nin gateway city. Copy of receipt dated 22.06.2015<span style=\"margin: 0px;\">&nbsp; </span>issued by the PUDA is annexed herewith as\r\nAnnexure C/2.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 137.4px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">4.<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'>That\r\nan allotment letter dated 27.09.2016 was issued by the PUDA to the complainant\r\nwhich is annexed herewith as annexure C/3. As per the allotment letter clause\r\n4(I), it was agreed that the possession of the said plot shall be handed over\r\nto the allottee after the completion of the development works at site or 18\r\nmonths from the date of issuance of allotment letter whichever is earlier. </span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 137.4px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">5.<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'>It\r\nis humbly submitted that the project has not yet been completed. It is still\r\nregistered with RERA as an ongoing project. </span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10.66px 137.4px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">6.<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'>That\r\nthe status of the development works have not been updated by the PUDA and no\r\ninformation was given to the complainant regarding the work going on in the\r\nproject. Neither any demand letter has been issued by the respondent to the\r\ncomplainant. </span></p><p>\r\n\r\n<b></b><i></i><u></u><sub></sub><sup></sup><strike></strike><font face=\"Times New Roman\"></font><br></p>','<p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 137.4px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">7.<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'>That\r\nin the absence of any update on the progress of development works in the\r\nproject and non issue of demand letters as per payment plan mentioned in\r\nclause<span style=\"margin: 0px;\">&nbsp; </span>3 (III) of<span style=\"margin: 0px;\">&nbsp; </span>the allotment letter, the complainant could\r\nnot make balance payments.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 137.4px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><font face=\'\"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"\'>8</font><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">.<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'>That\r\nthe possession of the plot was to be handed over within 18 months as per the\r\nallotment letter i.e. March 27, 2018 which has not been communicated to the\r\ncomplainant till date. Therefore, delay of more than one year has already\r\noccurred in handing over the possession of the plot. </span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 137.4px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><font face=\'\"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"\'>9</font><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">.<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'>In\r\nview of the above facts and circumstances, the complainant wishes to withdraw\r\nfrom the project.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 48px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'>Prayer</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10.66px 48px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'>The\r\nrespondent has violated the provision u/s 18 of the Act. Therefore, it is most\r\nrespectfully prayed that the present complaint may be decided and respondent be\r\ndirected to refund of the amount paid to respondent along with interest as per\r\nRERA Act/Punjab RERA Rules, 2017.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10.66px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'>&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n<b></b><i></i><u></u><sub></sub><sup></sup><strike></strike><font face=\"Times New Roman\"></font><br></p>',3150000.00,1606500.00,'2018-03-27 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2016-09-27 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Residential plot-693  Park facing','','',2,0,0,0,'anilkumarc','2019-04-04 16:15:14.000','anilkumarc','2019-04-04 16:15:14.000'),(460,1157,'1157',1462,'0b57ec60-3b91-4d1a-b21c-09b93c962eae','FormTypeN',1,1,1,0,'0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','Anil  Kumar','csvedparkash@gmail.com',8989898989,0,0,'#2047, Sector-71, SAS Nagar, ','',28,507,'166071','1','#2047, Sector-71, SAS Nagar, ','',28,507,'166071','Ved Parkash','csvedparkash@gmail.com',7837223098,0,'Promoter','PBRERA-SAS82-PR0022','Gateway City PUDA SAS Nagar','Estate Officer PUDA SAS Nagar','se@puda.gov.in',0,0,'PUDA Bhawan, Sector-62, SAS Nagar','',28,507,'160062','1','PUDA Bhawan, Sector-62, SAS Nagar','',28,507,'160062','1','<p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 137.4px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">1.<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'>That\r\nthe present complaint is against Project namely gateway city SAS Nagar Mohali\r\nwhich is registered with the present authority with registration number PBRERA-SAS81-PR0022\r\nand is an ongoing project. Therefore, the complainant has cause of action to\r\nfile this complaint before this Hon’ble Authority.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 137.4px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">2.<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'>That\r\nthe complainant applied for a residential plot of 150 Sq. Yard<span style=\"margin: 0px;\">&nbsp; </span>vide application No. 5909 and was successful\r\nin the draw of lots held on 19.03.2015 vide S.L No. 405 w.r.t. allotment of\r\nplots in the scheme known as gateway city, SAS Nagar, PUDA. The complainant was\r\ngiven letter of intent dated 27.05.2015 which is annexed herewith as annexure\r\nC/1. </span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 48px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'>&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 137.4px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">3.<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'>That\r\nas per the conditions of the letter of intent dated 27.05.2015, the complainant\r\nmade two payments of Rupees 10,71,000/- vide DD No. 60778 and 60779 of Rs.\r\n5,35,500/- each dated 22.06.2015 on account of instalment for allotment of plot\r\nin gateway city. Copy of receipt dated 22.06.2015<span style=\"margin: 0px;\">&nbsp; </span>issued by the PUDA is annexed herewith as\r\nAnnexure C/2.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 137.4px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">4.<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'>That\r\nan allotment letter dated 27.09.2016 was issued by the PUDA to the complainant\r\nwhich is annexed herewith as annexure C/3. As per the allotment letter clause\r\n4(I), it was agreed that the possession of the said plot shall be handed over\r\nto the allottee after the completion of the development works at site or 18\r\nmonths from the date of issuance of allotment letter whichever is earlier. </span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 137.4px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">5.<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'>It\r\nis humbly submitted that the project has not yet been completed. It is still\r\nregistered with RERA as an ongoing project. </span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10.66px 137.4px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">6.<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'>That\r\nthe status of the development works have not been updated by the PUDA and no\r\ninformation was given to the complainant regarding the work going on in the\r\nproject. Neither any demand letter has been issued by the respondent to the\r\ncomplainant. </span></p><p>\r\n\r\n<b></b><i></i><u></u><sub></sub><sup></sup><strike></strike><font face=\"Times New Roman\"></font><br></p>','<p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 137.4px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">7.<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'>That\r\nin the absence of any update on the progress of development works in the\r\nproject and non issue of demand letters as per payment plan mentioned in\r\nclause<span style=\"margin: 0px;\">&nbsp; </span>3 (III) of<span style=\"margin: 0px;\">&nbsp; </span>the allotment letter, the complainant could\r\nnot make balance payments.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 137.4px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><font face=\'\"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"\'>8</font><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">.<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'>That\r\nthe possession of the plot was to be handed over within 18 months as per the\r\nallotment letter i.e. March 27, 2018 which has not been communicated to the\r\ncomplainant till date. Therefore, delay of more than one year has already\r\noccurred in handing over the possession of the plot. </span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 137.4px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><font face=\'\"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"\'>9</font><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'><span style=\"margin: 0px;\">.<span style=\'font: 7pt \"Times New Roman\"; margin: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;\'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'>In\r\nview of the above facts and circumstances, the complainant wishes to withdraw\r\nfrom the project.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 48px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'>Prayer</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10.66px 48px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'>The\r\nrespondent has violated the provision u/s 18 of the Act. Therefore, it is most\r\nrespectfully prayed that the present complaint may be decided and respondent be\r\ndirected to refund of the amount paid and compensation of Rs.1,00,000/-&nbsp; to respondent along with interest as per\r\nRERA Act/Punjab RERA Rules, 2017.</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10.66px; text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\'margin: 0px; line-height: 200%; font-family: \"Arial\",\"sans-serif\"; font-size: 12pt;\'>&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n<b></b><i></i><u></u><sub></sub><sup></sup><strike></strike><font face=\"Times New Roman\"></font><br></p>',3150000.00,1606500.00,'2018-03-27 00:00:00.000','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','1','','2016-09-27 00:00:00','0001-01-01 00:00:00','Residential plot-693  Park facing','','',2,0,0,0,'anilkumarc','2019-04-05 13:06:35.000','anilkumarc','2019-04-05 13:06:35.000'),(461,1157,'1157',1462,'0b57ec60-3b91-4d1a-b21c-09b93c962eae','FormTypeN',1,1,1,1,'2019-04-05 13:11:01.000','Anil  Kumar','12kumar.anil291@gmail.com',8396999045,0,0,'#2047, Sector-71, SAS Nagar, ','',2